window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_BLACK_TECH_INTERNET_CAFE_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":801,"title":"Chapter 801 - Origins and Laws? Journey to the West Is About to Be Released!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[TL Note: Journey to the West is a Chinese novel published in the 16th century during the Ming dynasty and attributed to Wu Cheng’en. It is one of the Four Great Classical Novels of Chinese literature.]","– Meanwhile, in the new shop at Canglan City –","Most saint-level masters had to squeeze some time from their busy schedules to play games, which was why many of them couldn’t be seen in the shop each day.","However, in the recent days after Mr. Fang announced the news about the League of Legends World Championship Series, the saint-level masters visited the shop more frequently.","“Huh? This old senior has been coming every day recently...?” This was a pinnacle stage saint-level master!","Sala glanced at the door and saw an old mage draped in a white mage’s robe with a weirdly dressed young man standing beside him.","Almost everything about this man appeared to be young, but Sala’s sharp elf intuition told her that this young man was more extraordinary than the old mage.","“Mr. Swein,” the old mage said, “I’ll go get two bottles of Coke.”","“Okay...!” The young man named Swein nodded mildly and said with a solemn expression, “I’ll go get two computers. Come and enter my lobby so that we can get to challenger!”","“We need more people, right?” The old mage lifted five fingers and said, “We need at least five people to form a team.”","“Don’t worry!” Swein said mildly, “I’ll summon masters who were once the most powerful figures in the world! Only we can form a team and become god-like figures!”","Sala watched them nearby and said, “Ha-?! How come they want to form a team too?!”","“Isn’t it just an entertainment tournament?!” Sala looked around. “Even Xuexue said that there were many such competitions in the past...”","Anyway, my Snow Pigeon Team will enter the competition!","Xuexue said that participation is important!","This game is so fun that people just can’t stop playing it. That is why even the saint-level masters are forming teams! She mumbled to herself silently, It’s so fun that I’ve been playing it all the time lately...","Unlike the difficult games such as Dark Souls, in this game, the characters projected by champions in Summoner’s Rift weren’t stronger than level 6, and even she could control them with ease.","...","At this moment, the old Mage Hematon returned with two bottles of Coke. While looking around alertly, he said in a low voice, “Now... I guess no one recognizes us, right?”","“On the whole continent,” the young man sat in his computer chair coldly and said while lifting one finger, “There are no more than ten people who are able to recognize us.”","“Hu...” Hematon exhaled and replied, “That’s great.”","He glanced around at the level 8, level 9, and saint-level masters in the shop.","“Don’t let anyone know about it.” Swein didn’t continue the topic. Instead, he asked, “Have you found the champion that is the most fitting for you?”","“I... have bought more than 60 champions with magic crystals...” Hematon sighed heavily. “I just can’t forsake the position of the Chronokeeper. After all, he controls the Law of Time...”","“After countless battles, I think it must have left some impressions in my mind. Don’t you think so?”","“When facing powerful enemies and using these skills in the fiercest battles, it’s true that your instincts would force you to obtain deeper impressions of these laws of nature,” the young man said, “But if you don’t have this kind of talent, all your efforts will be in vain. After all, the Law of Time is one of the most fundamental laws in the universe, and it is not something that anyone can master.”","“Even though these spells are greatly simplified so that even level 6 and level 7 people can cast them.”","“What should I do then...?” Hematon asked uneasily.","A tiny and extremely strange wind condensed in Swein’s palm. “This is the new power that I discovered after having hundreds of matches in League of Legends and studying most of the champions. It’s more elusive than laws of nature.”","“This is...?”","“The Origin of Wind,” Swein said, “It’s the power that I’m comprehending.”","He opened a character, and above the description was the picture of a phoenix condensed entirely from ice. The description said, “Anivia is as much a part of the Freljord as the never-ending frost. Long before mortals had ever set foot on the land’s frigid tundra, she had lived countless lifetimes and died as many deaths. The beginnings and ends of her eternal cycle always heralded great change, from the calming of raging storms to the ebb and flow of ice ages. It is said that when the cryophoenix dies, an era ends; and when she is reborn, a new era begins.”","“This is the power of origin.”","Then, he looked into the distant sky outside of the shop. “Our teammates will be here soon.”","...","The huge black stone castle north to Canglan City was one of the biggest dwarf settlements in a human city.","This huge castle was said to be a very ancient construction which could be traced back to the era before the Great Destruction in the prehistoric times.","Inside the library of the castle, an old dwarf who was wearing glasses was tidying up the books.","It was dark outside.","The muffled deep sounds of wind mingled with ear-grating thunder as if a violent storm was about to arrive.","Gusts howled into the windows, and the dwarf, caught off guard, stumbled under the force.","Then, a bookshelf crashed down.","Crack!","A thunder flashed outside the windows. After the pale lightning bolt flashed, the world was plunged into a deeper darkness.","It seemed like something was trying to crawl out of the abyss-like darkness.","Gusts blew at the books that had fallen on the ground. One moldy ancient book was blown open, and it was a book with the recording about the sealed ancient demon dragon named Catastrophe.","The dwarf bent over to pick up the books, and his gaze fell on this ancient book. It said that if the demon dragon came out, it meant a great catastrophe would come. According to the legends, before the dragon was sealed up in the distant ancient time, the bad luck that it brought made the whole continent experience a huge horrifying event which caused the world to fall apart. Even now, there were many small planes drifting outside the main continent.","“Oh... the ridiculous legends.” The dwarf shook his head and walked to the windows, intending to close them.","At this moment, an ear-grating scream came from the room.","He saw a golden pupil filling the darkness outside the windows!","“Au-!” Scared, he dropped onto the ground on his behind. Even the brave and straight-forward dwarf turned pale.","“Tell me, lowly bug. If you honestly answer the question of the Great Gulth, I’ll allow lowly beings like you to live for a few more weeks.” Low and deep roars came from outside the window. “Tell the Great Gulth how to get to the League of Legends World Championship Series!”","“Ah?!” The dwarf froze.","“You don’t know it?” The golden pupil glared at him.","“I do! I do!” The dwarf nodded repeatedly.","Then, the dwarf swallowed his saliva and said, “In... Canglan City in the south, there’s a shop called Origins Internet Club!”","Swoosh!","The violent gust shook the solid castle while stormy winds gushed in through the windows. After a long while, the winds began to settle down.","Gingerly, the dwarf walked toward the window.","Suddenly, the golden pupil appeared at the window again. “If the Great Gulth finds that you told a lie, I’ll come back and eat you all!”","“No! Absolutely not!” The dwarf wiped the cold sweat from his face.","...","At this moment, in the new shop at the East Continent.","A group of people stood behind Xiaoyao Ancestral Master and others, watching them play League of Legends.","The people in the back complained, “Ancestral Masters, you’ve played all night...”","Li Wuchen scolded, “Shut up!”","Everyone behind him fell silent in fear.","Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked at the people around him and said, “How about we form a team? It will be the most powerful team in the universe!”","“But...” Shang Jiuwen said mildly, “It’s not easy to choose champions...”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang suddenly received a prompt.","[System upgrading progress reached 20%.]","[Journey to the West is 50% completed, obtaining the trailer for Journey to the West.]","[The Monkey King prototype shard is obtained. League of Legends is updated. You can exchange for the privilege to sell the gift bag of the mysterious oriental champion.]","[Flying on and becoming one with swords – LOL Immortal Journey skin series are updated; the privilege to sell the skin series is granted.]","[Project skin series are updated; the privilege to sell this skin series is granted.]"]},{"number":802,"title":"Chapter 802 - The Beginning of the New Expansion","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Fang Qi glanced at the task for the release of Journey to the West again.","[New Task (Will be issued when 80% of Journey to the West is completed): Gods and Buddhas in Heaven","Task Target: average sales of each episode of Turbulent Homeland exceed 30,000","Task Reward: the privilege to publish the TV Series, Journey to the West]","Of course, after 20 percent of the System was upgraded, there was more content than this.","He continued to read the updates about new champions.","No tasks would be issued for the updates of the released games.","After the update, a new group of champions would join and fight in League of Legends.","There were corresponding cinematic trailers for different champions, so the players could learn more about them.","...","At this moment, the players in the Jiuhua City Shop were working on the video about their gaming experience. From Resident Evil to Diablo to the Legend of Sword and Fairy, they selected pictures and video clips and revisited the beautiful and prosperous lands.","They remembered the boisterous and prosperous streets in Hendon Myre and the beautiful port on the West Coast. They also recalled the amazement that they felt at the first sight of the Sky Tower which reached up into Empyrean.","In that place, there weren’t so many bloody killings as in the Legend of Mir 2. They experienced the novelty and enjoyment of their journey as adventurers.","At this moment, Lan Yan saw many old screenshots and video clips. “Look at this picture we took when we first boarded the magic zeppelin to the West Coast.”","In the virtual image on her communication jade, a group of young people stood on the magic zeppelin that was hovering in the sky. A puff of white clouds floated past, revealing the bright blue sky in the distance and the sapphire blue ocean below them. Looking up along the shore, they saw a prosperous port surrounded by jade-like lush forest. In the garden-like city, buildings spread out from the center like stars, presenting a pleasing scene from every angle.","“Huh? Look!” Lan Yao pointed at the two people from the Ultimate West Realm in the picture; they were Luo Piaoling and Sia.","Ye Xiaoye exclaimed, “I remember! This girl was once beaten witless by the shop owner.”","“I remember that they said they would guard this continent well. These Ultimate West Realm people are quite fun.” Lan Yan covered her smile with her palm. “I guess they are still playing the game.”","“They lived in the bitter cold big snow mountains and had never seen such a beautiful place before,” Nalan Mingxue said, “It’s natural that they were amazed by it.”","“Do you have a video? Let’s use it.”","“Okay. When we have time, should we go back and play it?” Lan Yan suggested, “Um... they seem to be in Empyrean now, right?”","Although in this game, they didn’t achieve any great deeds as in other games, the adventures and fights with stronger monsters were quite interesting.","“The new expansion has been released for a long time now, and I guess our items are outdated,” Song Qingfeng complained, “We’ll go back when the new expansion is released. By then, their items will be outdated too.”","...","Mr. Fang continued reading the information on the System Interface.","[The new chapter of Dungeon Fighter Online, Creation Century, is 70% completed.]","[Please post the update trailer on the official website.]","[Cinematics trailer of the second awakening is obtained. This update will be done online after the Creation Century is 100% completed. The players don’t have to log off.]","[After the update, the third class-advancement for all classes and the second awakening skills will be available.]","“Huh?” Mr. Fang froze and yelled in confusion, “Online update!!??”","“I’m afraid that we will be in the news on the next day with the title – tens of thousands of players suddenly died in Origins Internet Club. I warn you, don’t make trouble for me. It’s fine with other expansions, but how can you do this update online!?”","System replied, [System upgrading...]","Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","“F*ck!”","“You’re the boss!”","...","After calling the despicable System several times and receiving no response even when he gave it the middle finger, Mr. Fang had to give up. “If something happens, it’s all your fault. Don’t put the blame on me.”","Damn it!","He continued to read and finally saw the content about privilege upgrades.","Obviously, Mr. Fang, the somewhat fraudulent shop owner, was on his way to becoming a shop owner in the real sense after continuous privilege upgrades.","Mr. Fang saw that, after the System finished 20 percent of the upgrade, he received another privilege: prize vault.","[Elementary-Level System Prize Vault – you have obtained the right to organize any internet café activity besides the tasks given by the System. You have the right to set the number and content of the prizes.]","[The Elementary-Level System Prize Vault can produce five prizes per year. Among them, four will be randomly produced, and one will be custom-made. The level of the custom-made prize can’t exceed 80% of the highest-level system item that the host possesses.]","[Producing prizes will consume system energy.]","[The host will receive no rewards for self-organized activities.]","[All the content of this stage has been upgraded. Please manage the shops well and wait for the next stage of the upgrade.]","[The updated content is ready to be released Do you choose to release now?]","Mr. Fang answered, “Yes.”","...","At this moment, dark clouds covered the sky above Canglan City with flashing lightning bolts and booming thunder.","The world turned gloomy.","Containing deadly roars of fury, the chilly winds seemed to come from the ancient darkness.","The deep darkness contained the presence of death and corruption. From the horrifying darkness full of deadly presence, a huge head stuck out from the dark clouds.","“AH-! What’s that?!” The peaceful city was plunged into alarm and unprecedented fear. The countless pedestrians scrambled to run.","“Roar-!” A horrifying roar exploded like a thunder in the sky above the city. Screams and yells of alarm were everywhere in the city.","The elves who had just run out of the shop to check out the commotion were instantly shocked unconsciousness.","At this moment, people saw that a huge black demon dragon flapped its huge wings and slowly landed from the sky, causing a giant black tornado.","“Sir! Sir!” The employees of the shop called out to the shop owner frantically, “Some elves fainted in fear! Come!”","“Oh! Who fainted in fear?!” Furious, Rowling jumped up from the ground and said, “I just felt dizzy because of the shaking! We elves are not that faint-hearted!”","When she turned around, she suddenly saw a huge black dragon head and two golden eyes which were staring at her by the entrance.","“Ahhhh-!” Shrill screams sounded.","She tripped over another elf and bumped her head on the tea table, causing little stars to appear in her eyes.","“Thud!”","“Sir! Sir!” Merlin was frantic. “That elf was so scared that she fell unconscious again!!”","“Where are they!? Where are they?!” Having just finished browsing the upgraded content, Mr. Fang heard the yells and hurried over to check out the situation.","Sure enough, he saw some elves lying on the ground while a few of them had just gotten up.","“Hey-?!”","Then, he saw a black-faced young man with two wings on his back walking in and yelling, “Sir, Get me online!”","Boom!","Before he could finish, a huge sound resonated in the area, and he instantly flew out like a black shooting star.","“If you scare my customers again next time, you don’t have to come anymore!”","A vague figure with silver hair and in a blue windbreaker appeared on Fang Qi, making it seem like he turned into someone else. Half a second later, that figure vanished, and Fang Qi turned back to himself. It was so fast that everyone thought their eyes were playing tricks on them.","“Hu...” Mr. Fang exhaled deeply and thought, I practiced this for a few years already, but I’m still not fast enough...","– In the Black Stone Castle –","The dwarf had just put away the fallen books.","Boom!","A huge noise sounded, and a black figure crashed down from the ceiling, knocking the books everywhere!","“Ah-!” A frantic howl sounded, “How come you’re back again?!”","“...”"]},{"number":803,"title":"Chapter 803 - Water-Curtain Cave in Flower-Fruit Mountain, Stay Tuned?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After the magic spell was removed, Demon Dragon Gulth instantly changed back into the huge black dragon with a trace of confusion and puzzlement in its golden eyes.","It looked left and right and then abruptly widened its eyes. “How come the great Gulth is back?!”","“It seems like someone punched me...?","“No. No... how could a human defeat the great Gulth?!”","“No... the great Gulth was once defeated by a human. Who was that human...?” In its dragon form, Gulth scratched its head with its huge claws and mumbled to itself while spitting flames, “How come I can’t remember...?”","Slowly, it got up from the ruined castle and murmured, “Is it because too many years have passed...? Forget it. The great Gulth has League of Legends World Championship Series to attend, and there’s no time to waste on these weak humans... It’s not because I, the great Gulth, can’t defeat him, but I must attend the competition... Yeah, that’s it...”","It instantly flapped its huge wings and flew away.","The dwarf who had been knocked out got up dizzily and looked around the ruined library. “...”","“Our castle!”","“Damn it! This damn dragon! One day, we’ll make you into barbecued dragon meat!” The dwarves stomped their feet angrily.","...","– In the new shop at the East Continent –","At this moment, more and more customers came into the shop.","“You must have sensed it.” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master said in a low voice, “If I didn’t need teammates to enter the shop’s competition, I wouldn’t have told you about it.”","Li Wuchen stretched his arms with a deep look in his eyes. “You’re right. The skills that we can practice in the battles here are indeed not as simple as they look.”","“Very interesting.” The grey-robed middle-aged man named Dugu Yi said, “We can control champions who understand the laws of nature. Even the simplest move or skill contains the use of the laws of nature. It means that when we truly understand them in the real world, we will have gained proficiency with these skills in this mystical realm already.”","“But...” Dugu Yi said, “The problem remains that we can’t find proper champions.”","At this moment, they received a new message. [League of Legends’s online update is completed, and new champions and new skins are unlocked. To know more about the new content, enter the Summoner’s Lobby and read about it in the Update Channel.]","“Update Channel...?”","At this moment, there were many League of Legends players in the shop, and many of them had received this message.","...","Undoubtedly, the game streamers were the people who were most sensitive to the new messages. As a big streamer in the Canglan City Shop, Mr. Dirk was the first player to open the Update Channel.","In the West Continent, the players were not limited in the shop.","There were many cloud players who watched livestreams from other places.","Since not everyone could make the long journey to Canglan City just to play games, there had been hundreds of thousands of ‘cloud players’ watching Mr. Dirk’s Spiritual Spell Visual Projection.","[TL Note: Cloud players or cloud gamers in China refer to those only watch livestreams of games and various other content without purchasing hardware or software to play themselves.]","After the battle with the Shadow Legion, the number grew to almost one million.","The cloud players of ‘Dark Sword’ had grown to about one million as well, but today’s livestream wasn’t about the ‘Dark Sword’.","In the Canglan City Shop, a dog-headed man sitting in a corner opened the Update Channel.","“Which one should I watch...” Instantly, he saw a group of new champions and new skins with introduction videos.","As a streamer who usually played the dog-headed champion in the game, he soon turned his gaze to the champion standing in a vast yellow desert and wearing golden armor.","Above the figure were the words about this video, [Shurima: Rise of the Ascended.]","“We’ll watch this first.”","Previously in League of Legends, players had seen several ascendants who were the Magus Ascendant Xerath, the Curator of the Sands Nasus, and the Butcher of the Sands Renekton.","Of course, ‘ascendant’ was a translated word and was not the same as the cultivator’s ascendance, but they were somewhat similar.","The ascendants in League of Legends came from an ancient nation – Shurima.","Regretfully, Xerath stole this ascension ritual and took horrifying power from it, turning the whole nation into dust.","Their emperor, the Emperor of the Sands Azir, was also buried under the vast desert.","At this moment, Mr. Dirk was leading a group of people to watch the video.","They watched as the blood of Shurima’s descendants seeped deep into the ancient sands underground and freed a deep and ancient magic spell.","With consciousness and a physical body reborn from annihilation, Azir came back to life!","But at this moment, he didn’t consider the empire or the Ascension Ritual. The first thought after rebirth told him that Shurima’s descendants needed his help.","“He didn’t realize that he, the greatest emperor of Shurima, could finally ascend in the end. He only wanted to save Shurima’s descendants and revive all of them.”","At this instant, the viewers were watching the new champion’s trailer saw the sun disc deeply buried in the sand shooting out a radiant golden light. A miracle happened.","The Ascension Ritual is continuing?","Ruins, sands... as if it was controlled by a great godly force, the great ancient nation returned to its previous state. The huge golden desert city slowly rose from underground while the huge sun disc, like a blazing golden sun, illuminated the whole city in golden lights!","“Shurima, your emperor has returned!”","“My goodness!”","“Astonishing!”","“What champion is this?”","“Is the new champion a god?!”","Not only Mr. Dirk, but the large group of viewers watching his Spiritual Spell Visual Projection were staring at the scene in amazement.","On the other side...","The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master and others clicked open the new skin trailer.","“Immortal Journey. The mountaintop reaches skyward; the earth reaches for the heavens.”","“How come the Wuju Bladesman can use the sword control technique?!” A group of people stood behind and watched the video in which the Wuju Bladesman spread his arms, and seven golden energy swords shot up into the sky.","He turned around, and the seven energy swords flew back and became one before dropping beneath his feet. Then, he flew out while standing on the sword.","Behind him, the Storm’s Fury Janna flew on her unsheathed immortal sword as well.","“These skins...” They continued to watch with widened eyes.","[Immortal Journey Gift Bag for Eternal Sword Yi, Soaring Sword Fiora, and Sacred Sword Janna: 99 magic crystals each.]","[Immortal Journey Gift Bag (With the skins of the three champions): 288 magic crystals.]","“...” In the new shop at the East Continent, the people exchanged a look...","“Buy it! Buy the one with three champions. There’s a discount for it!”","“When we queue up as five, everyone must use Immortal Journey skins! Without the skin, they can’t join us!”","Then, they saw something else in the update channel...","“Gift bag of a mysterious oriental champion?”","“What’s this?!”","“There’s no trailer for it...?”","“It seems to be related to the new TV Series?”","“We can’t even see what this champion looks like?” Only a black figure was shown on the gift bag.","“Where’s the new TV series?” These people turned to the new TV Series, but they only found...","“Flower-Fruit Mountain?”","“Water-Curtain Cave?”","“And a big boulder?”","“Stay tuned?!”","[Sir!!] The old customers in the Jiuhua City Shop, the old Daoists in the Yuanyang City Shop, and the customers, like the elves, in the Canglan City Shop all sent messages to file their complaints.","[Sir!]","[A mountain, a cave, and a boulder; what kind of trailer is that?!]","[Is this boulder the main character?! 😠😠 Do you want us to watch this boulder?] Su Tianji was the most active in her complaints, and her expression showed that she felt like she was being treated as a fool. [If people want to watch this boulder, I’ll cut off my head and give it to you!]"]},{"number":804,"title":"Chapter 804 - Sir! Bad News! a Dragon Passed out in Fear!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","It wasn’t only Su Tianji, even Sala sent complaint messages, [Sir! Tell me that you posted a faked trailer!?]","[Sir-!] Jiang Xiaoyue also protested in anger. The so-called Flower-Fruit Mountain had a great scenery, but...","[In this new TV Series, are we going to the so-called Flower-Fruit Mountain to look at monkeys?!]","Mr. Fang replied in surprise. [Huh? How did you know it?!]","[I don’t want to see your damn monkeys!] Jiang Xiaoyue said in a huff, [I don’t want to see monkeys! Post a good trailer for us!]","In the past, the trailers all showed powerful figures, but there were no promotions for this TV Series?!","“The scummy shop owner refuses to promote it, which means that the new TV Series isn’t good!” In the Canglan City Shop, the knights led by people like Commander Elven and Helen protested as well.","“Anyway, we have so many new champions,” Kellybel raised her arms and called out to them, “We will just not watch it if it’s not good. Let’s check out the new champions.”","At this moment, a yell came from outside the Canglan City Shop, “League of Legends! The great Gulth is back!”","There was no response from the shop.","Previously, some elves came out to watch. But right now, the elves were all checking out the new champions and had no time for other stuff.","The being that entered the shop looked quite young, and he was dressed in black scale armor. However, his face was also covered in black dragon scales, which showed that he wasn’t human. His face was vicious as he glanced around the shop.","This figure spotted Mr. Fang who was making a cup of Cappuccino. At this moment, Fang Qi glanced back with a calm expression, but this newcomer knew that the shop owner would beat him if he did anything wrong.","He instantly shrugged and turned quiet.","“I’m here to enter the League of Legends World Championship Series, and I have no time to mind these tiny humans...” Then, this figure walked into the shop as if he was looking for someone. Although he seemed bold and brave, he was trembling in fear a little.","“Here! Here!” A mage holding a bottle of Coke beckoned at him amiably.","Gulth walked over in doubt, and his suspicion evaporated when he saw Swein beside the old mage.","Then, he bought a membership card.","“Sit,” Swein said mildly, “Choose some fitting champions and get yourself familiar with the game first.”","While pointing at the newly released Update Channel, he added, “These are newly released champions; see if you can find a fitting one.”","On Swein’s own screen, there was a wandering warrior who was playing a flute.","“Um...” Demon Dragon Gulth looked at Swein’s screen in confusion and then at his own screen. “Check out the new champions...?","“Let the great Gulth check them out...”","“Be careful,” Swein said with a faint smile, “The champions in the game are all powerful; don’t get scared.”","“Hahahaha!” Demon Dragon Gulth let out a thunderous laugh. “The great Gulth has seen everything in the world.”","He thought for a while and told himself that the human who was stronger than him in the shop just made him a bit more aware, and he wasn’t scared.","His voice became louder. “Don’t underestimate me! The great Gulth once even peed at the feet of the god of the Demon Dragon Clan...","Um... Realizing that he had said something he shouldn’t, Gulth immediately shut his mouth.","“The powerful champions whom you mentioned can’t be stronger than... gods.”","Then, he saw Aurelion Sol, the Star Forger, who was also a dragon.","“This one looks good. Let me see if it’s good enough to be picked by me.” He chose to watch the introduction trailer of this champion.","“Um... good.” Swein watched the trailer on his own screen and said indifferently, “It’s a good choice to have a champion that fits your species.”","“Of course!” Gulth said while he watched the trailer.","At this moment, the scene before him began to change.","The sky above the peak of the snow mountain should be dark and quiet.","However, the radiant river of stars turned the gloomy sky dark purple.","Heavy clouds reflected the star lights, turning the thin clouds to red and the thick clouds to pitch-black with a dim white tint at the edges.","Red, white, purple, and black decorated the sky full of stars like rainbows, looking as beautiful as a dream.","A deep and ancient voice that was even and mild seemed to engulf the entire starry sky and the earth.","“No matter what planet, no matter what galaxy, they always look up and wonder.”","In the dream-like starry sky, time seemed to be drifting and space was distorting when a vague dragon paw condensed in the universe.","The huge dragon claw seemed to block half of the sky while stars and a nebula gathered in its palm.","At this moment, Gulth seemed to forget to breathe with the illusion that the dragon claw could even crush gods to death as if they were ants.","With its huge dragon head, Gulth couldn’t imagine how majestic this dragon would be!","Countless blazing white flames gathered continuously in the vague dragon claw like a black hole sucking in lights for destruction. Gulth seemed to see that the flames condensed into a dark core in the dragon claw. Then, the dark core exploded and gave birth to an extremely radiant golden star!","At this moment, the vague shape of the dragon head appeared in the void while its body winded behind it like high mountains for more than tens of thousands of kilometers.","“Some fall to their knees and worship; others hide behind walls and towers...","“But the thing they do best is beg for mercy...","Gulth’s golden pupils bulged while his whole face looked like that of a fish out of water.","“It’s just adorable.”","As the huge claw tightened its grip, the star in the dragon king’s palm exploded again! It was crumbled!","It turned into a puff of radiant fireworks in the starry night.","“Have you found a fitting new champion?” Beside him, Swein was also looking for new champions for himself. Suddenly, he saw a huge champion – Cho’Gath, the Terror of the Void.","[TL Note: Cho’Gath’s nickname in China is Big Bug.]","“If you haven’t found one, this champion might fit you.”","His words were received by silence.","“??” Swein frowned and patted Gulth who was sitting beside him. “Stop watching. Check this champion out.”","There was still no response.","“Gulth?!” Feeling that something wasn’t right, Swein pushed harder.","Thud!","Immediately, the idle elves saw this scene and yelled, “Ah-! Sir! Bad news! A dragon passed out in fear!”","“What?! A dragon passed out in fear?!”","“Where?! Let me see!”","Many idle customers in the internet café walked up to watch."]},{"number":805,"title":"Chapter 805","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Wow! Look at that dragon!” The elves talked among themselves in the crowd.","“Isn’t he very powerful? When he came to the shop, the sky changed colors.” Rowling looked at the dragon and said curiously.","“We didn’t know that he is so cowardly!” Sala said, “I wonder where he came from... he pretended to be scary but in fact isn’t powerful at all!”","Beside them, Elder Sewell nodded and said, “I saw such dragons before. Usually, black dragons of this age have level 8 or level 9 strength. It probably hasn’t reached adulthood yet and is definitely not a powerful dragon.”","Obviously, Elder Sewell was knowledgeable, and her words were convincing. “At most, he is at the early stage saint-level; no higher.”","Lying on the ground, this black dragon twitched his ears and heard the people’s comments the moment he woke up.","“Cowardly?!”","“Not powerful at all...?”","“Perhaps he hasn’t reached adulthood?!”","“Do you know what a horrifying existence the great Gulth is?!” The black dragon got up from the ground and roared.","Sparks flew out from his mouth.","“If that great dragon king isn’t an existence greater than gods, the great Gulth wouldn’t have been overwhelmed by its presence! If you saw that great existence crush a sun with one hand, you would end up worse than me!” Demon Dragon Gulth yelled.","“Crushing a sun is no big deal!” Sala said with a snort, “When we played the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4, we saw an ancient god shooting down nine suns!”","“Yeah! We even used his Hou Yi Sun-Shooting Bow!” Beside her, Rowling yelled, “Humph! There’s nothing to be afraid of!”","“You... you!” Surrounded by a group of people, it seemed like Demon Dragon Gulth was going to argue with them to the end of time. While pointing at the elves, he accused angrily, “Yesterday, the great Gulth scared you unconscious. You have no right to judge me!”","“We were not scared unconscious!” one elf argued with a red face, “I was knocked unconscious. You fainted due to fear; we all saw it!”","“You cowardly elves!”","“You cowardly dragon!”","“Roar! Roar-!” Demon Dragon Gulth almost burst in rage.","“You could only use that god’s bow! It’s nothing to be proud of!” Demon Dragon Gulth roared, “Later, I will be able to control this great dragon king’s projected figure and learn its battle skills!”","Then, he glanced at the screen. [The Star Forger Champion Gift Bag – 99 crystals.]","“I’ll buy this champion gift bag right now!” Demon Dragon Gulth roared.","“We’ll buy it too!” the elves said together.","“You... how can you buy it too?!” Demon Dragon Gulth looked at the elves incredulously.","“Boss, the newcomer dragon is arguing with the elves! Go and check it out!”","At this moment, Mr. Fang walked up through the crowd.","Fang Qi heard that they were arguing about the purchase of gift bags, and he interjected. “You have to argue about the purchases of gift bags?!”","He waved his hand casually and said, “This gift bag is for sale permanently; anyone can buy it!”","Then, he pointed at the bottom of the screen. “This 288-crystal champion skin gift bag is for sale for only one month. If you want to buy it, you must act quickly.”","“There’s a 288-crystal champion skin gift bag?!”","“This looks more luxurious than the ordinary gift bag!”","“Then, I’ll buy this Star Forger Skin Gift Bag of 288 magic crystals!” Gulth yelled.","This will show the damn elves that the great Gulth is nobler than them.","“Oh, this 288-crystal gift bag is expensive...” Sala twisted her small hands in a dilemma. Although 288 magic crystals wasn’t unaffordable for the elves, they bought many things each day...","“I have my eyes on several new champions and new skins, and I want to buy them all... It will cost too much if I buy the Star Forger Skin Gift Bag too...”","“I think so too...” Beside her, Rowling also looked reluctant.","Obviously, they were reasonable with their spending.","“Haha! Surprised?!” Seeing their reluctance, Gulth looked satisfied.","As a great demon dragon lord, he couldn’t bear the disdain from these weak elves!","“Humph! This 288-crystal gift bag is no big deal. We will buy several champion skin gift bags and even the Project skin series!”","“I’ll buy them too!”","“The Elementalist Lux...”","“I’ll buy it too!” The great Gulth couldn’t allow the elves to look down on him!","“This Star Guardian...”","“I’ll buy it-!”","...","“Mr. Swein, have you told him... that the percentages of skills he can learn from the champions depend on the degree of compatibility to his own talents?” Seeing this scene, Hematon asked in a low voice.","Swein was at a loss for words.","Then, Hematon glanced at the elves, knowing that they didn’t know about this. They just used the game as a regular mystical realm to practice their battle skills and didn’t mind which champion they bought.","Playing a compatible champion would make the game easier to play, and they could unleash more power.","In fact, except for the pinnacle stage of saint-level masters, the others just bought all the champions they wanted and tried them out to find the ones that they liked. Then, they would mainly play these champions.","Therefore, regardless if they understood the considerations of the saint-level masters, the effects were the same.","Of course, right now, what Swein and Hematon were considering wasn’t this but...","“By the way, Gulth just broke out from the seal. Where did he get the money?” Hematon suddenly asked in a low voice, “Mr. Swein, do you have...”","“I just entered the world and don’t have much money with me...” Swein said mildly.","Hematon said after thinking for a while, “I’ve traveled on the continent for many years and always didn’t regard money as important; I never take more than I need...”","These two instantly got offline and stood up. “Oh, Mr. Gulth, we’ve used up the ten-hour limit for today. We’ll leave now.”","“Oh, okay!” Gulth, who was busy checking out the champions and skins with dizzy eyes and enjoying the gazes from others, waved his hand casually.","-Ten minutes later-","Gulth patted his money bag.","Then, he turned his head and saw hundreds of pairs of eyes staring at him.","His whole face turned stiff.","The boisterous shop instantly turned silent.","He looked around and couldn’t find Swein or Hematon. After a long while, with great embarrassment, he mustered the dignity of a demon dragon and said, “I’m a demon dragon from the prehistoric times, and I’m in urgent need of magic crystals to buy these gift bags in League of Legends. Anyone who lends me with over 20 magic crystals will get a share of my treasures when I find the treasures that I hid in the ancient times...”","“Get out-!”"]},{"number":806,"title":"Chapter 806 - Heaven Punishment, Qi Tiandi Descends!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Look at that dragon; he only knows how to brag,” Sala commented from the crowd.","At this moment, the earliest customers of the shop such as Joseph and Ron walked into the internet café accompanied by their parents. Their parents happened to see this scene and then instructed their sons, “Look at this dragon. Despite his young age, he has begun to show his evil ways. It’s hard to say what he will become when he grows up.”","“Don’t learn any bad habits from that dragon.”","“What are you talking about?!” A pair of golden dragon eyes instantly glared over.","“Aiyo! Let’s get away!” Joseph’s mother pulled her son from the crowd and whispered, “You see? That dragon obviously didn’t go online until today. If you don’t learn stuff online, you’ll end up as a good-for-nothing, just like that dragon.”","“Right! Right!” Beside them, Ron’s mother encouraged in a low voice, “Son, work hard online!”","Gulth’s vision dimmed, and he almost passed out in fury. “...”","...","Then, the youths, such as Joseph and Ron, got busy.","“Mom! I want to buy the Project Skin Series Gift Bag,” Ron said in a loud voice, “I want to learn saber techniques from Uncle Yasuo!”","“Then, we’ll buy this Project Skin Series Gift Bag.”","“Mom, Ron’s mom bought him the Project Skin Series Gift Bag. I want to buy the Project Zed Gift Bag!” Beside them, Joseph said.","“I want to buy the Blind Monk Gift Bag!” A young man about the same age as them said in a loud voice.","“I... I want to buy the new champion – Jhin; he is super cool with his gun thing!”","The parents smiled at them affectionately and encouragingly. “No problem. You can have them all!”","Ron’s dad even said, “Ron, if you can reach gold, I’ll buy you the latest model of the new communication jade!”","“...”","...","While League of Legends went popular in the shops, a TV Series was also warmly received by the viewers.","It was popular not only in the East Continent and the Continent of Immortal Relics but also in the new shop at Canglan City as well.","As the Turbulent Homeland 1 ended and the Turbulent Homeland 2 began, the war in the human world had just ended.","One after another, the ultimate human martial art masters engaged in top-level battles.","On the Sky Ethereal Peak, all the battles came to an end after the two techniques, Heaven’s Witness and the Snow-White Sword clashed into each other.","Behind the battle was the life of a warrior who had stunned an entire generation.","Countless heroic figures and exquisite martial art techniques had just begun to show their stunning radiance, adding magnificence and beauty to the arena of the mortal world.","However, at this moment, a true god with an ultimate lofty position and immortality turned his cold gaze toward the human world from the Heaven Realm that only existed in the legends.","Qi Tiandi was born in the Heaven Realm. Proud and self-disciplined, he was the most powerful martial god in the godly palaces of the Heaven Realm.","Like the sun bringing light to the land, he subdued all the demons and conflicts in the unknown universe space, bringing peace to the world.","With one thought, people could turn godly or demonic.","This lofty and emotionless immortal existence was tired of the fights for power and killings in the mortal world. Whenever he looked down on the mortal world from his palace, he always wondered why the heavenly gods tolerated these evil deeds. In his opinion, these filthy and selfish beings didn’t deserve defense from the heavenly gods.","So came the following story.","His robe as white as a lotus flower transformed into a battle robe as black as ink.","He turned into the most powerful demon god!","Finally, he decided to destroy the entire filthy mortal world!","Humans... wouldn’t know their insignificance and ignorance if they didn’t have a taste of the despair of doom.","No one could stop him, not even gods.","Then, heavenly punishment... came!","Having tried new skins and new champions, the customers in the Jiuhua City Shop, Yuanyang City Shop, and Canglan City Shop began to watch the new TV Series which had come to the end of the second season.","As the huge suspense became greater, the viewers sat down to watch the latest episodes as soon as they were released today.","Even the cloud viewers of the famous streamers such as Mr. Dirk and the ordinary streamers such as Dicas of the Magic Union were waiting for the livestream of the episodes shown on the big screens in the shops at night.","“Huh...? What’s it with everyone?” Gulth was playing his newly bought dragon king to gain League Points (LP) in ranked games.","During the process, he encountered a happy Yasuo who dashed around the minions for no reason, a Zed who fed the enemies non-stop, a Blind Monk who kept kicking away enemies with low HP, and a Jhin who was the enemies’ ATM. These players had all bought new skins.","“Aw-! I’m so furious!” The black dragon was so angry that he almost destroyed the keyboard. Glancing around with his golden eyes, he tried to see if anyone around him was playing any of these champions. If they did, he would go up and beat them.","At this moment, he found that the customers sitting around him had paused playing League of Legends and were doing something else.","From others’ screens, he could only see a poster saying that the new TV Series was only shown to paying customers before the public livestream at 8 PM.","Besides, they let out loud exclamations again and again, distracting him from playing League of Legends.","“Hey! You! Tell the great Gulth what is this thing that you are watching so fervently?” Harrison, one of the leaders of the Assassin Brotherhood, was watching the new TV Series. He turned his head and saw a black half-dragon and half-human face and a pair of chilly golden eyes staring at him coldly like a demon looking down on the human world.","Undoubtedly, any humans, even the saint-level masters, would shiver involuntarily when they saw these horrifying eyes since they seemed to symbolize a prehistoric catastrophe!","“Ahha... it is the Bragging Dragon!” Harrison said casually.","“Who’s the Bragging Dragon?!” Gulth roared fiercely.","“Then, have you found your treasures?” Other people looked at him with a funny expression on their faces.","“I... I found several hiding places for my treasures!” Gulth roared, “Those damn adventurers! All my treasures were stolen by those damn adventurers!”","“Are your treasure-hiding places called Gutuns’ Secret Vault?” A girl who appeared to be a young noble lady asked.","“How did you know?!”","The young noble lady took out a novel about knights and replied, “It’s written in the book! Bragging Dragon! Do you think that we never read this book before?!”","The surrounding people all looked at him and laughed.","Several aristocratic ladies passed him with their children and immediately instructed them, “When you grow up, remember never to act like this dragon. He is lazy online and doesn’t even know the most popular new TV Series.”","“What new TV Series?! How come I don’t know about it?!” Glancing at Harrison’s screen, he saw that the latter was watching the end of the 46th episode of the second season.","Instantly, he activated the 46th episode and shouted, “I... I’ve come to this episode too! The great Gulth is low-profiled. Unlike you, I don’t yell and scream while I watch it.”","Then, he began to watch as well."]},{"number":807,"title":"Chapter 807 - You Did Your Best, Small God in the Mortal World!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s so good about this TV Series?” Gulth mumbled while he watched.","When mentioning Qi Tiandi, another demon god had to be talked about as well.","Coming from the Sense Realm, it was the ruler of the world condensed by evil intentions and obsessions from the mortal world; its name was Xuan Mo.","The Alternate Dimensional Demon Realm created by Qi Tiandi made him want to descend in the mortal world and destroy it.","On the other hand, the ruler of the Sense Realm wanted to plant evil spirits of the Sense Realm into human bodies and occupy the mortal world.","Therefore, humans were stuck between the two forces which ruined the mortal world with endless disasters and horrifying catastrophes.","If the mortal world was destroyed, the Sense Realm wouldn’t be able to occupy it, so the two demon gods also fought each other.","“Godly power subdues all regions, and thunder and lightning must give way to it.” Lightning bolts shot down like beams, and flames poured down like rain. A big figure seemed to appear from the endless dark abyss. Evil lights appeared first, and five lightning bolts dropped. At the same time, an extremely grand voice echoed across the world. “Rule the land as a conqueror, and suppress all heroes as the pride of Heaven!”","“Hiss-! This being!?” Gulth widened his eyes as he looked at the demon god which seemed to come from the world of fierce ghosts. Emitting chilly and evil presence totally different from that of the mortal world, it appeared with an arrogance that stunned the world.","This was definitely not the presence of humans. With only one look, Gulth felt the horror of this presence, which only the evilest demon gods could possess.","When the booted feet landed on the ground, explosions appeared as if the land couldn’t bear this great force.","Boom!","Crack!","“My Demon Dragon God...” Demon Dragon Gulth exclaimed in a low voice, “The ground explodes with each step it takes...”","Immediately, he covered his mouth and looked around, seeing several people staring at him.","“Why are you staring at me?!” Demon Dragon Gulth said while sparks flew out of his mouth. “Look! The great Gulth feels nothing when watching the so-called gods and demons! You guys yelled so much when you watched it.”","“This demon god appeared, but I’m not afraid of it at all. I even want to eat a spicy stick. Roar! Roar!” After picking up a spicy stick, he waved it at the people who were staring at him as if he was showing them that the great Gulth wasn’t a cowardly dragon!","You guys slandered me!","Although Gulth couldn’t afford to buy all the skins for the time being, as a prehistoric demon dragon, he had enough money to buy spicy sticks.","...","Everyone turned their heads back and continued to watch the TV Series.","At this moment, above the endless void and at the end of space and time, there was a radiant golden godly palace which was as dazzling as the sun. With winding creeks running through, it had pillars as tall as the sky. From the radiant palace, the loftiest existence cast a gaze at the mortal world.","The homeland of humans sunk. With the sky pillars destroyed, the sky had collapsed.","The barrier between gods and humans had a huge crack in it.","A part of this being’s senses and strength descended to the mortal world.","Saint Demon Vital Embryo; it was the body that Qi Tiandi made for himself in the mortal world. Like an erupting volcano, he spat out a horrifying and destructive demonic force.","The sun and the moon vanished from the world as if everything had entered the complete dark chaos.","A grand demon god figure that was as huge as a great mountain was slowly injected into the vital embryo.","Dressed in a black robe that had unworldly magnificence, he looked dignified with the highest nobleness. While raising his hands as if embracing the rising sun, he looked at the filthy mortal world with disdain and cold solemnness.","This ultimate martial god had also descended in the mortal world!","Landing lightly on his toes, the moment that this demon god touched the world, the land couldn’t take its heavenly force and instantly lost balance!","Catastrophic storms swept up with vicious force!","Violent gusts blew up his long hair and revealed his face, so perfect that one would think it wasn’t supposed to be a part of this world.","Like shock waves of nuclear explosions, winds instantly devoured everything in the whole world, including the humans, demons, and beings from the Sense Realm... Regardless if they were masters or average mortals, no matter what cultivation strength they had, they all exploded into bloody foam!","The land under his feet cracked and then collapsed.","Crack-! An earth-shaking explosion came; it was the sound of earth breaking open!","Boom-! Seawater surged up for tens of thousands of meters with booming sounds; these were the roars of the ocean!","Meteorites fell on land, huge mountains collapsed, and lava gushed out from underground. Everything in the mortal world was being destroyed. This was the doomsday that no one could resist or escape!","At this moment, the viewers felt their minds turning blank.","Their minds were completely occupied by this horrifying sight and couldn’t contain anything else!","Even one glance of this sight gave them a deep sense of despair as if the endless darkness had devoured their bodies and souls.","This was the most shocking scene in the mortal world and the saddest elegy for humans!","Before such a power, no one had the slightest intention to resist.","However, facing such giant and destructive horror, the other demon god moved.","Thunderstorm condensed on the ancient and heavy halberd with forces of Yin-Yang and thunder. The lights from the halberd and lightning bolts tore open the darkness in the world, and the halberd shot out the moment that Qi Tiandi landed in the mortal world!","Evil lightning bolts exploded with a dazzling gloomy light, and then they bounced back abruptly.","At this moment, Qi Tiandi seemed to have just injected his awareness from the Heaven Realm into his vital embryo. He slowly opened his eyes.","He was motionless.","No wind could flutter his clothes. His gaze landed on the entire mortal world as if he spared no attention to the other demon god standing before him, and he said indifferently, “The mortal world got filthy again!”","The halberd waved in the sky, condensing blazing flames and flashing lightning bolts. Anything entered would be destroyed. Like a horrifying vortex, true lightning energy stirred ultimate blazing sun energy current into the halberd. The ultimately firm and bright essence was locked into one point in the halberd as soon as it was waved! It condensed into one!","At this moment, Qi Tiandi lightly launched a palm strike.","“You did your best, small god in the mortal world.”","The heavenly presence collapsed as if the sky was falling! In the next moment, everyone saw Xuan Mo, the demon god with unrivaled power, fly backward as its physical body was destroyed instantly!","It died without a fight!","At this moment, not only Gulth but all the other viewers opened their mouths wide as if they wanted to scream with great horror but couldn’t since their chests were squished by a huge mountain or a hand was strangling their throats.","They couldn’t let out even a whimper; they couldn’t even breath.","At this moment, all of them felt horrified and felt like they were tiny ants."]},{"number":808,"title":"Chapter 808 - Time Boils the Rain","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“As horrifying as that!” In the new shop at the East Continent, a demon dragon put down the virtual reality headset and pointed at the screen in a daze. He shouted, “Ah...! A god-level master! He is... so horrifying!”","The whole shop was silent except for the wild roars of the demon dragon, who was shivering uncontrollably.","At this moment, Mr. Fang walked up. “I say, what’s wrong with you, Dragon?! Look at the people around you; they are all watching quietly, and only you are screaming in fear!”","“As a dragon, how come you’re so cowardly?!”","Gulth immediately shut up and looked around cautiously.","Sure enough, everyone was watching the TV Series earnestly and motionlessly.","None of them screamed in fear.","Gulth turned silent.","Then, he glanced at Swein and Hematon who were sitting across from him. They were also silent.","Is the great Gulth the most cowardly one?!","“I... I’m going to the bathroom!” Demon Dragon Gulth yelled.","Then, with a hand on the chair to support his weight, he slowly stood up.","At this moment, Swein and Hematon, who were sitting across from Gulth exchanged a look. “...”","Their feet under the desks were making thudding sounds.","They shivered uncontrollably.","“Mr. Swein, can you get up...?”","Swein’s expression didn’t change. “Not... now!”","“...”","...","Fang Qi had only three-day access to the system’s new cultivation room which had been reopened.","In the cultivation room, the figures that he knew as well as his own hands gradually became alive and then dimmed out one by one.","Saber, sword, and other kinds of weapons shone brightly with their unique lights.","Then, a dignified and noble figure dressed in a luxurious black robe gradually solidified before him and waved his hands. “God’s Hand!”","“God’s Vortex!”","“God’s Thunder!”","“...” With a dark expression, Mr. Fang fell instantly.","The cultivation ended.","[Synchronization Rate: 0%","Technique Synchronization Rate: 0%","Experience Points Obtain: 0]","“Hu...” Mr. Fang exhaled deeply.","Lately, Fang Qi livestreamed and cultivated in the morning and continued cultivation in the afternoon and during the night almost every day.","Unlike before, he no longer used his free time on entertainment or leisure outings.","A pale blue crescent decorated the pitch-black nightly sky. It was late in the night.","While wiping sweat off his forehead, he took out a bottle of Coke and gulped it down.","In this late hour, Fang Qi’s communication beeped unexpectedly.","The message came from the shop in Jiuhua City.","Upon walking into the Jiuhua City Shop, he saw some young people soundly asleep with their heads on the computer desks. The high-level cultivators such as An Huwei walked over immediately when they saw Fang Qi.","“Why are they sleeping here?” Mr. Fang asked.","They were mostly disciples of Lingyun Academy, including Song Qingfeng and Xi Qi.","Xu Zixin and other girls were also here.","“Come here and check this out.” Nalan Mingxue beckoned at him. “Tell me what you think of this promotional video.”","With that said, she opened a newly made video on her computer. Since they could buy related programs and software in Qzone, it wasn’t impossible for them to make videos.","However, it wasn’t easy for them who thought of nothing but combat techniques and cultivation strength...","In fact, Mr. Fang was surprised since he had expected that they would give up after a while.","The first thing that he saw in the video was a pale blue butterfly flying by. The snow-white scene had a cleanness unique to girls.","Then, there were more colors. With the background music named ‘Time Boils the Rain’, the images and clips from every game appeared on the screen in some clumsy and bland manner.","“The wind blows, and the rain becomes flowers.”","In a calm and bland tone, the video told a story about their first encounter with Resident Evil that year.","Also, they had created many heroic stories of their own in Diablo.","Excitement flashed in their eyes at the first sight of the sword control technique, but the sadness and melancholy replaced the excitement at the end of the game.","The scenes of guilds gathering and battling in the Royal City in the Legend of Mir 2 were still fresh in their minds.","They felt like it was only yesterday when a group of people wildly slammed the buttons and swung the joysticks while playing the King of Fighters in the arcane game room in Mr. Fang’s Qzone.","They experienced the thrill when Dungeon Fighter Online opened the first server and the shock in the first PvP battle in the dojo.","For the first time, the second time, the third time... they met players from all over the world and became friends.","Then, in the world that was even bigger named World of Warcraft, they met so many friends from the West Continent for the first time.","Like stories in a long scroll, they recorded their joys, touching moments, coming of new friends, and parting of old ones. The stories ended with group photos imprinted in their memories.","If they looked carefully, they might be able to find one or two familiar faces and the pure and sincere smiles.","“Heavy snow, I beg you, please don’t erase the traces of our past.”","“The heavy snow can’t erase the memory that we left for each other.”","Looking at these immature people sleeping carelessly on the computer desks in the internet café...","No... time flew, and they could no longer be called immature people even though they were still young.","The young people in the past had shed their youthful clumsiness, and in its place was a maturity belonging to adults.","Perhaps they were tired.","With a smile, Mr. Fang realized that he had known these people for years without noticing it.","“What’s the hurry? We can have events anytime you want.”","“We can have events anytime we want, but if we miss a certain day, we’ll have to wait for another year.”","Mr. Fang looked baffled, “What day?”","Nalan Mingxue looked at him curiously, “You don’t know?”","“No...” Mr. Fang glanced at the familiar faces. “It’s just one year; it’s not like you have to wait for hundreds of years.”","He yawned and was obviously fatigued. “Go get some rest; there’re many extra rooms in my shop.”","He pointed at the young people who were sleeping on the desks and said, “Don’t sleep here; you will all catch colds.”","“By the way, what activities have you planned?”","“You’ll know when it’s time.” Nalan Mingxue looked at the dark sky outside the shop, and her bright eyes seemed to merge into the depths of the starry night.","She looked back at the screen, and an indescribable melancholy rose in her heart.","For one moment, she wished that the stories they had compiled could be longer. These were their stories of youth even though the people in the stories mostly began at high points and gradually turned average, just like her.”","However, no one said that they couldn’t praise and appreciate average people.","...","At this moment, together with Yu Zhiwei, Xiao Yulv, and other staff, Mr. Fang and these people carried these men and women, sleeping like logs, to the rooms.","Suddenly, Song Qingfeng jumped up from his chair and shouted, “Wow... Penta Kill!”","“Penta Kill? Where’s the Penta Kill?”","“Where?!” With a shiver, they all woke up and looked over with keen interest."]},{"number":809,"title":"Chapter 809 - Official Partnership, Secret Big Prizes Await You!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Without high intelligence and unusual talents, people couldn’t become cultivators or warriors. Even the worst warrior or cultivator was at the top level of all mortals.","Besides, there were some outstanding figures among them.","The younger generation led by Li Haoran in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had studied the new stuff for a long time.","The video wasn’t only completed, it had a high quality.","Apart from this, these cultivators also spent lots of time and energy on researching the new communication jade.","The current communication jade not only could connect with QQ and livestreams but also could access websites and the Post Bar. At least, people could easily use the simple functions on the communication jade.","Right now, they were studying how to use the array engravings in spiritual artifacts to copy the functions of the ‘smartphones’ in the games.","At this moment, Li Haoran held a small array disk with complicated engraved arrays in one hand and a program language book in another.","Then, a message popped up on his communication jade.","“The planning of the event is done?”","...","– In the Heavenly Faction at the East Continent –","“A new event?”","The most productive time of the day was the morning, and most factions in the Continent of the Immortal Village (East Continent) and the Continent of Immortal Relics had the tradition of doing morning cultivation.","The sun rose in the east, and the purple essence from the east was beneficial to the cultivators who were accumulating essence.","It was dawn. In the Heavenly Faction, Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin walked toward the faction square with a newly purchased communication jade in her hand. She was engrossed in the content in it.","“Oh, Senior Sister? You bought this new communication jade too?” Beside her, a junior sister who was about 15 years and had a bun asked in surprise.","“Yeah.” She touched the screen of the thin communication jade in her palm to browse the Post Bar. “I’m reading the top post.”","The junior sister also took out her communication jade. “Pinned post? Official partnership event? Memories of Bygone Years?”","“Huh? It’s posted in all the big post bars... I’ll check it out.”","...","At this moment, many players in the old shops such as the Half City Shop and Yuanyang City Shop also noticed this new event.","“Event time... 9 AM March 28th? Isn’t it today?” It was 6 AM, and Gu Tingyun was sitting in his courtyard. While sipping iced red tea, he read the message in the Post Bar on his communication jade. “Official partnership event?”","Until now, the shop hadn’t hosted many events. The only one that Gu Tingyun participated in was the StarCraft World Championship Series in which he had won a golden ‘spiritual boat’ that was called a Corsair, and it was now parked on the side of the cliff.","Gu Tingyun had been sipping tea leisurely. When he saw the message, he instantly sat up from his armchair. “An new event?!","“But what does official partnership event mean...?”","He continued to read. “This event is sponsored by the Origins Internet Club. The prizes are provided by Origins Internet Club and the organizer.”","“The event venue is the special virtual event venue in Qzone of the Origins Internet Club.”","“This event will be broadcasted live in the official livestream channel.”","“The players who can’t participate in this event may enter the activity quiz of this event through the new communication jade and win special prizes.”","“This event...” Gu Tingyun looked at his communication jade and murmured, “It seems bigger than the last in previous years...”","In the past events, the players who didn’t participate in the competitions were viewers, and they had to bring their own snacks and drinks. But in this event, the viewers would be able to participate in the so-called activity quiz and win good prizes?!","Then, he read on. “Participants of the event have the opportunity to draw red packets that contains membership cards with game time from 1 to 10 hours.”","...","Jiang Xiaoyue was also reading the post on the communication jade with widened-eyes. “The opportunity to win a big gift bag of snacks in the shop?!”","She covered her small mouth with her small hand while her eyes opened wide. “My goodness! A big snack gift bag!”","In the past, even when she obtain a good rank in the activities hosted by the shop owner, she used to get only a small bag of snacks.","It was infuriating!","But in this new event, even the people who didn’t win a good rank had the chance to get a big gift bag of snacks?!","“I’ll participate in the event!” Xiaoyue, who was still in the Heavenly Faction as an exchange student, exclaimed immediately.","“Then, what are the prizes for the winners...?”","Eagerly, she continued to read. “The winners will receive a ‘big mystery gift bag’ provided by Mr. Fang?!”","“The first place in the comprehensive ranking will get a mystery prize hand-picked by the shop owner!?”","It must be noted that the players in the new shops at the East Continent and the West Continent had never participated in the shop’s activities before!","The artifact masters of the Heavenly Faction in the East Continent and the mages and dwarven craftsmen in the West Continent were especially envious of the players in the old shops for their prizes, like the ‘Corsair’ spiritual boat, gauss gun, and runewords, etc.","When the East Continent cultivators, who were just getting into Jade Dynasty recently, heard that a female cultivator in the Jiuhua City Shop had gotten the Black Snow Immortal Sword, they were green with envy!","“Let’s see the contents of this event?!” Sitting cross-legged, Elder Xiao Yunhe of the Heavenly Faction was now doing his morning cultivation and deep breathing.","A streak of purple essence entered with the pale-golden morning sunlight that shined in.","He had a communication jade in his hands. “Inhale...!","“Exhale...?","“Let me check out the content of this event... Inhale...!","Without thinking, he read it out aloud, “The first activity... Ready Musician One.”","“Dungeon Fighter Online, the Legend of Sword and Fairy, World of Warcraft, League of Legends... Which piece of music in the games is your favorite? Do you practice singing or instruments privately? Please sing or play it.”","“The player with the highest points will receive Mr. Fang’s big mystery gift bag; the other participants with good ranks will each receive the latest model of communication jade which hasn’t been released in the market yet. This type of communication jades contains the Wuwei Alliance’s latest spiritual artifact technology which can break illusion spells and achieve facial recognition of the owners.”","“Hiss... there’s such a communication jade?”","But it seems like I’m not fit for this activity?","After a moment of consideration, Xiao Yunhe continued reading.","“The second activity... memories hidden in your heart.”","“Write down the incident that touched you the most in the games, and it is better if you have pictures to go with the writing. The winner will receive a big mystery gift bag provided by Mr. Fang; the other participants with good ranks will each receive a mimic of godly items, including the Tianya Godly Sword, Seven Tribulation Dragon-Slaying Sword, Sky River Sword. and Seven-Star Sword created by the Wuwei Alliance.”","“The third activity, Ready Player One.”","“It’s time to show off the true skills. Do you want to prove that you’re a true core player? Let’s search for the high-level skills or Easter eggs in the games!”","“Each player can choose only one game. The winners and the second place will receive the same prizes as above. Mr. Fang will provide two prizes for this activity and only one for the other activities. The other participants with good ranks will receive mimics of a classic item in the corresponding game or all skins for all champions in the new game – League of Legends.”","“The no.1 in the comprehensive ranking will get a mystery prize hand-picked by Mr. Fang.”","“Are you ready? Come and get the big mysterious gifts!”","“...” Xiao Yunhe looked at this event thoughtfully. “I’ll participate in the third activity!”"]},{"number":810,"title":"Chapter 810 - Getting Drunk and Dreaming of Immortal Nectar","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Although the announcement of the new event was posted quite late, the shops were bursting with people in the early morning.","Even the new shop at the East Continent had a full house.","Through Qzone, all the customers could enter the event zone which could accommodate over 100,000 people and give the viewers a seat number automatically. As for the people who couldn’t enter the event zone or couldn’t even get online due to the large number of customers, they could watch the event through the official livestream platform.","People could get 1,000 penguin beans by logging into the livestream platform, and they could win more penguin beans through betting on their favorite contestants. The penguin beans could be eventually used to redeem gifts.","Sala glanced at the gift shop and saw that some items were placed at the most prominent positions.","“The Sky Outfit, the rare outfit that no one can get anymore in Dungeon Fighter Online?”","“All skins of all champions in League of Legends?!”","“The Collector’s Edition Game Gift Bag that contains ten classic games?!”","There was a group of other dazzling gifts under them.","At the bottom was the consolation prize of one-hour game time which could be bought with only one penguin bean (limited to one for each player).","[TL Note: QQ’s logo is a penguin, and the currency that it uses is called penguin bean.]","The elves exchanged a look of excitement. “Is the shop owner giving away gifts at a great cost to himself?!”","“The shop owner always gives us discounts and free stuff. I’m a little uncomfortable taking them...” Rowling mumbled.","“What are you talking about?” Elina from the Assassin Brotherhood and some knights from the Golden Griffin Knight Legion had just acquired the tickets to the new event in Qzone, and they came over to buy instant noodles and beverages when they suddenly heard these comments. “What are you talking about?”","“We were saying that the shop owner had been giving us many gifts lately,” the elves said uneasily, “Seeing so many gifts from him this time, I think we should give him some gifts too in return.”","“You think so too?!” Helen said in surprise.","“I think so too!” Dicas said from nearby.","“What should we give him then...?” Since the event hadn’t begun yet, they took the time to discuss.","...","With many viewers coming to the event, the venue was bursting with people. The players who had registered for the activities thronged in the shops.","However, as the planner of this event, Nalan Mingxue wasn’t a careless person. Before the participants took seats, they received a questionnaire which had different questions for different shops.","Sala, still in the discussion, also received it.","“Participation Qualifier Questionnaire...?” Sala read the questionnaire in her communication jade. “The first question. In League of Legends, one champion is closely related to Assassin’s Creed. He likes to say...”","“Huh...? League of Legends? Assassin’s Creed?!” Sala looked at the questionnaire and read the question again before glancing the four answers.","“a) In carnage, I bloom, like a flower in the dawn.”","“b) Don’t you trust me?”","“c) Live and die by the blade..”","“d) You’d wish the world you know to end! Yeeeesssss....”","“Um... this question...” Sala thought for a second. “It’s not difficult for me!”","She quickly chose an answer and read the next question.","“In World of Warcraft, which of the following plays is correct? You may choose more than one answer).”","“a) When a warrior casta Taunt, shouting ‘Hey! Bastard!’”","“b) A mage casts Polymorph on a enemy with low HP.”","“c) When cornered, a paladin jumps off the cliff and casts Holy Shield on himself.”","“d) Sell Shining Silver Breastplate for five gold pieces.”","“Um... this...” Sala and other elves rubbed their foreheads. “Let me think...”","Before the event began, all the shops were quiet. Obviously, everyone was busy answering questions.","As the technical director, Li Haoran sat before a computer with a solemn expression.","As the producer, Mr. Fang sat next to him.","Li Haoran said, “This is the first automatic grading program made by our Wuwei Alliance. But we tested it many times, and I’m sure it will be fine.”","...","Soon, Sala received a prompt. “Oh! I got 87 points! I passed!”","“I got 91 points! I passed too!” Rowling said in pleasant surprise.","“I got 90!” Nearby, Elina was feeling smug.","Then, they exclaimed in joy, “Does it mean that we can enter the event that will grant us prizes?”","“Look! I think the event is beginning!” In pleasant surprise, Sala pointed at the huge stage in the center that looked dazzling under the illumination of lights.","In a series of passionate cheers, two figures floated down from the depths of the fireworks in the sky.","“Time is like a song.”","“Time flies.”","Dressed in a bright green long dress, the alluring and cute woman on the left said, “It has been years since we worked together last time.”","Standing beside her was an ethereal-looking woman dressed in snow-white clothes. Her beautiful eyes glanced around as she said, “Indeed. It has been years since we met last time. But we meet again today in another big venue with a big crowd.”","“We thank all the Daoist friends who squeezed out time from your busy schedules to attend this event.” Fairy Qing Yun slightly bowed.","“Fairy Qing Yun, are you thrilled now?” Ning Bi asked her teasingly.","Fairy Qing Yun patted her chest and said, “I’m excited. In fact, I didn’t expect that there would be so many people here.”","Ning Bi looked reminiscent. “I remember that the people in the last event was less than one-fourth of the current audience, right?”","“Right.” Fairy Qing Yun nodded and said, “I thought that it was a huge crowd. But from the looks of it, I was too naïve back then.”","“Of course, this event has even bigger prizes than before!” Ning Bi said, “But we can tell you that today’s event is extraordinary.”","“It has a special meaning!” Fairy Qing Yun said with a nod, “For now, we’ll keep this special meaning a secret.”","Then, she continued, “In fact, I’ve been envious of Daoist Friend Ning Bi. Do you know why?","“The Legend of Mir 2, Dungeon Fighter Online, the Legend of Sword and Fairy, World of Warcraft, League of Legends... Having played all of them, Daoist Friend Ning Bi must have experienced much more unforgettable moments than I did.”","“There are also many unforgettable songs.”","“Which is your favorite, Fairy Qing Yun?” Ning Bi asked.","“Um... I like the songs in the Legend of Sword and Fairy, especially Immortal Dream.”","“Oh, the next song is probably related to the Legend of Sword and Fairy,” Ning Bi said.","“Let’s welcome Elder Su Tianji up to the stage!”","Then, they left the stage gracefully.","“Huh? Elder Su?”","“I wonder if she will fall to the ground on her face when she lands...” People talked among themselves animatedly.","“Maybe a chest will appear and eat Elder Su...” a large group of haters brought up her shameful past.","At this moment, immortal clouds surged among the rising immortal mountains in the background of the stage while ethereal singing sounded.","Qionghua Heavenly Light suddenly appeared, and sword energies reached the heavens from Shu Mountain, showcasing the out-of-reach Human Dao and the vast Immortal Dao. For a moment, the viewers felt like they had returned to the immortal factions.","In the ocean of clouds, guzheng music floated out while a crisp voice sang the song. It sounded like pearls dropping on a jade plate. Sitting in the clouds, a fairy brushed the strings of the guzheng with her pretty fingers while she sang with a melodious voice.","“In a bamboo hat, I quietly wait for the light to come through the clouds in the mist and breeze.”","“Listening to the ethereal Sanqing ethereal’s teaching and hearing Buddha’s words.”","[TL Note: Sanqing is a deity in Daoism.]","“Changing fate with one hand and restoring the universe with the other.”","“Daoist or Monk, why bother with the difference?”"]},{"number":811,"title":"Chapter 811 - Faction Master, Please Listen to My Explaination!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“The Frost Flower Sword engraved with lonely persistence.”","“Walking through thousands of mountains to fight and eliminate demons and ghosts.”","“With youthful arrogance, a young man dares to accuse the heaven and the earth of unkindness.”","“Regardless if it’s a blessing of opportunities or a root of catastrophes...”","Accompanied by the crisp guzheng musical notes, the singing turned firmer and more passionate, bringing the audience back to the world in the mist. They seemed to see the stirring scene in which that young man flew on a sword and heard that shout from the depths of the clouds, “I’m in control of my destiny, not the Heavens!”","Yuhang Town, Immortal Spirit Island...","Yong’an Pawnshop, Ancient Jiang Nation...","Green Bird Peak, Rock Creek Cave...","The past scenes flashed in their minds. Perhaps... those young people had grown up, and the past stories grew old as time went by, just like the girls in their memories. When they looked back, they had aged, and the stories might have lost the previous colors under the corrosion of time.","However, when they carefully thought back, they still remembered the thrill and amazement that they had felt at the first sight of the game.","Time indeed could dim people’s defiance and smooth out their edges, but even when their hair turning grey with age, they would have tears in their eyes when they recalled their passionate deeds in their youthful years.","“Great! Excellent!” Elder Xiao Yunhe from the Heavenly Faction clapped his hands and said, “Well said! ‘With youthful arrogance, a young man dares to accuse the heaven and the earth of unkindness!”","He remembered that when they were young, they also had the audacity to compete with Heaven with their sharp swords.","“With higher cultivation strength, we’re less daring than before...” Xiao Yunhe lamented while shaking his head.","...","“Is she really Elder Su?!” Sitting in the back of the audience stand, the elves raised their heads and stared at the white-clothed woman who was playing guzheng on the stage. She looked as if she had walked out of a painting.","Obviously, the elves had watched Elder Su’s livestreams many times.","They had even watched her encounter with the treasure chest monster in Dark Souls.","“Did the shop owner secretly change the singer?!” one elf yelled in a low voice.","Isn’t she an entertainment streamer?!","“Singing seems to be a type of entertainment...” another elf reminded in a weak voice.","“Um... you’re right...”","“But it’s really pleasant!” The elves perked up their ears and listened in fascination.","Although the song was in another language, they could manage to understand the words now.","“Ya! This song is super good!” Sala exclaimed, “How come I’ve never heard it before!”","“They said that it’s in QQ Music in Qzone. There are many good songs on it.”","“Right! Right! I heard from Xuexue that the hostess in the green dress could even sing... Glorious Time. It’s super good!”","...","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","After the song, Su Tianji returned to her seat and put down her virtual reality headset with a sigh of relief. “Done!”","Nearby, Mr. Fang who was supervising the staffs looked at her dumbfoundedly. “You were good...”","“Of course! I know everything from Heaven to Earth...”","Song Qingfeng replied, “That’s Old Xiao’s line, Sister Su...”","“What? That brat learned it from me...” With a blush, Su Tianji immediately corrected herself, “I excel in zither, chess, calligraphy, and painting! It’s a piece of cake for me to sing a song and play the guzheng!”","She glanced around and said, “I’m starving; do you guys have food?”","“Didn’t you just have a bowl of instant noodles this morning?” Mr. Fang asked in surprise.","“How is a small bowl of instant noodles enough!” Su Tianji didn’t realize the growth of her appetite.","“Today, the staff have prepared special boxed meals from Wind and Moon Pavilion!”","“Good...” Su Tianji stood up immediately. “I’ll go and get a boxed meal then...”","...","– Meanwhile, on the stage in Qzone –","Both hostesses, Ning Bi and Fairy Qing Yun, landed on the stage again.","“Oh... I was thrilled when I listened to the song downstage.” Fairy Qing Yun took a deep breath and said feelingly.","“Fairy Qing Yun, I think you’ve played the Legend of Sword and Fairy, right?” With a small smile which revealed her small white canine tooth, Ning Bi turned her head to Fairy Qing Yun and asked.","“I’ve played all three games of the Legend of Sword and Fairy series.” With a knowing expression, Fairy Qing Yun said, “I liked them the moment that I began playing them.”","She continued, “At the end of each game, I especially wanted to mail a knife to the so-called Softstar but didn’t know how.”","“If you find out how to mail the knife,” Ning Bi joked, “You must add the knives for the players sitting in the audience stand.”","“Just kidding.” With a smile, Ning Bi looked around at the audience and said, “Now, it’s time to check out the participants...”","The two hostesses leaned their heads together to read the name list, and they said in surprise, “There are so many...”","“It seems like many people have passed the questionnaire compiled by our Ms. Nalan and proved that they are really high-level players.”","“However, it’s not enough to be a good player,” Ning Bi said with a charming smile, “Quite a lot of our players have many other talents. Then...”","“Let’s see how good they are!”","“Let’s welcome the first group of participants from the Jiuhua City Shop in the Continent of Immortal Relics. It’s said that this shop has many veteran players...” Ning Bi looked at the young man whose face had a trace of classic elegance.","He was followed by a group of people.","They included a girl dressed in black clothes, and she had jade-like exquisite facial features. She was Elder Senior Sister Mo Xian under Xichi Spiritual Master of the Nanhua Faction.","Standing beside her was the soft and gentle Junior Sister Yue Yan who was dressed in a pale yellow blouse.","There were a few other senior and junior brothers from their faction.","“What music are you planning to play today?” Ning Bi asked with a smile, “Which song left a deeper impression in your mind?”","“I think it should be Immortal Dream.” Fairy Qing Yun guessed cheerfully. “After all, it’s one of the most classic songs in the Legend of Sword and Fairy. See, they even brought erhu and guzheng...”","“No.” Mo Xian took over the microphone from her and said, “Today, we’ll perform a more difficult song.”","“Excellent!” Cheers came from the audience.","“Hehehahahaha...” In the seats for the Heavenly Faction, the elders commented in satisfaction, “They indeed have youthful arrogance. Good!”","In the seats for the cultivators of the Nanhua Faction.","The Faction Master looked at the Xichi Spiritual Master beside him and said in satisfaction, “Junior Sister, your disciples are all good...”","“Of course.” Xichi Spiritual Master smiled and then looked at Liu Ningyun who was sitting next to her, “Ningyun, why didn’t you go with them?”","“Um... This...”","At this moment, shouts came from the center of the stage, “I’m MT! I have an iron-like body!”","The Xichi Spiritual Master stared at the center of the stage dumbfoundedly.","With a guzheng in her arms, Mo Xian played it loudly.","Then, Yue Yan walked up to stand beside her with an erhu, and she began to sing and play with the beats, “I challenge! I dodge! I defend you with my body!”","They did it smoothly in one breath!","Looking at the stage and then at the Faction Master sitting next to her, Xichi Spiritual Master said, “...This... Senior Brother, please listen to my explanation!”"]},{"number":812,"title":"Chapter 812 - Love Games, Love Life","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Faction Chief sitting next to her had a dark expression, thinking, Is this the high-difficulty level that you mentioned?!","“Tomorrow...”","Before he could finish, cheers rose from the audience like ocean waves.","“Hua-!”","“This is awesome! This is awesome!”","“Don’t hesitate anymore! I haven’t fallen yet!”","Almost all the audience began to sing with them, instantly lighting up the atmosphere from the stage to the audience stands.","“Hiss... Huh?” The Nanhua Faction Master froze.","“Hehe... the young people nowadays are so passionate? Junior Sister Xichi... I think we’ll at least secure a good position at the top! Oh, you taught them well, Junior Sister...”","“Really...?” The Xichi Spiritual Master froze, thinking, I didn’t teach them that...","As the atmosphere on the stage turned warmer, the second activity started.","After all, the players needed time to write down their most unforgettable memories for the second activity.","...","“Ya-! They are singing ‘I’m MT’!” At this moment, Sala and the other elves looked amazed while sitting on the audience stand.","“We’ll sing in a moment as well!”","“What are you going to sing?” Beside them, Helen asked curiously.","“Now that they sang it, you can’t get a high point if you sing the same song.”","“Then, we’ll sing...” Sala said, “Seeking Love in Sword and Fairies!”","“Ay-! Right! Right!” Rowling exclaimed, “When I played the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4, I loved this song!”","“The problem is... no one can play guqin...” At this moment, Helen brought up a frustrating problem. “You guys can only play the harp.”","[TL Note: Guqin and guzheng are similar but different instruments.]","“I can play it!” At this moment, Elder Swell took out a guqin from somewhere. As an elf who loved music and arts passionately, she could play any musical instrument!","“Ya! We can sing Seeking Love in Sword and Fairies?!”","The nearby knights from the Golden Griffin Knight Legion looked envious, “Count us in!”","“Me too!”","“Um... Look! Isn’t he Mr. Harrison from the Brotherhood?”","At this moment, after the cultivators of the Nanhua Faction left the stage, a middle-aged man with a weathered face came up with an instrument looking like a flute in his hand.","The tunes that this instrument made were sad and deep with a trace of loneliness of a wanderer.","“Yasuo!” The music-loving elves immediately recognized this.","“Huh? Is that a flute?” Helen was also listening to the music.","“Hehe. You don’t know it, right? It’s called Shakuhachi,” Sala showed off her knowledge smugly, “It’s said to be an ancient musical instrument that was introduced from the Central Region to the Dongying Region.”","Regardless if they could play them or not, the elves obviously had knowledge on all kinds of musical instruments.","Then, she wondered curiously, “But... there’s also the Central Region in the Legend of Sword and Fairy, and the story of the Turbulent Homeland also happened in the Central Region. Are they the same place? How come the people in this place didn’t run into each other?”","“Oh, the Duel also happened in the Central Region!”","“Perhaps it is like the Continent of Immortal Relics and the Continent of the Immortal Village; they have similar names but are in fact totally different places,” Elder Sewell explained.","“Let’s go; it’s our turn.”","“Elder, you registered this early?”","According to the rules, they could enter the competition together, but one could only compete once in the same activity.","...","At this moment, Su Tianji returned with a box of food in her hands. While eating from the box, she watched the activities through her computer.","“Look! So many elves!” She suddenly heard an exclamation.","“Where?! Where?!” Su Tianji looked over while eating from the box and saw a large group of elves standing on the stage.","“What are they going to sing?!”","Then, she heard notes of guqin which flowed over like gurgling creek water.","The elves opened their mouths.","“Tiny raindrops flew in the breeze, just like unending love.”","“Snowflakes fall in the turbid Yellow River, just like the sadness in unfulfilled love.”","Although they didn’t prepare for it, the arts-loving elves sang as if they had rehearsed it countless times.","“Huh...!” Su Tianji stared at the screen and saw an elf playing the guqin.","“Yeah...!” Dong Qingli from the Wind and Moon pavilion who was responsible for staffs’ food stared at the screen in amazement. Her eyes rolled as if she was calculating the odds of stealing two elves.","There were so many elves, and she was sure the theft wouldn’t be noticed...","“They can even sing this song!” Song Qingfeng exclaimed, “F*ck! Their pronunciation is excellent! They sing so well...”","“These elves can even play guqin! I’m surprised!” In the Canglan City Shop, the dog-headed man stared at the stage dumbfoundedly.","“Awesome!”","“Excellent!”","Mr. Fang was also staring at them, looking stunned. “You guys are so talented?”","He thought sulkily, Hiss... it seems like only I don’t have other talents...","“Do you want to learn?” Beside him, Su Tianji said while eating her box meal, “I can teach you.”","“Aya...” Mr. Fang put his palm on his forehead, looking to be having a heartache.","[Sir! What do you think? Wasn’t our performance good?!] After the elves got off the stage, they even sent a message to Mr. Fang.","Mr. Fang replied, [How come you guys are so awesome?]","[Hehe... o(*≧▽≦)ツ]","...","Besides this song, participants also played the little tune from Lion Pride Inn in World of Warcraft and the harp music from Seria’s Tavern in Dungeon Fighter Online.","The fast and light or slow and soft music pieces brought them back to the moment when they first entered these miraculous and dreamy worlds.","They still remembered the lively scenes in which countless players set out from the newbie village and gathered in the first town.","The boisterous or soft sounds seemed to be lingering in the back of their minds.","At this moment, the two hostesses got onto the stage again. “Those performances are fantastic.”","“Perhaps... for many people here, they are not only games.”","“Perhaps we haven’t played them for long.","“But I think most of our Daoist friends have the same feeling. In less than ten years, which is quite short, our lives have been more fascinating than those dozens if not hundreds of years that we had lived.”","“Yes, in this colorful life, we understand that we’re not only being alive,” Ning Bi said in a loud voice, “We... live happily and colorfully with a passionate love for the world we live in.”","“We have killed demons while flying on swords, we have ventured into a grand continent that we had never seen before, we’ve seen demon gods who can destroy everything, and we’ve even become champions and heroes. These are our fascinating and glorious memories.","“We can tell everyone with a loud voice – we love games, and we love life.”","“We love this world with great passion!","“Then... I’d like to ask all the friends here, what’s the most unforgettable thing in the depths of your memory?!”"]},{"number":813,"title":"Chapter 813 - Once in the Dungeon, No Longer Love Anyone In the Real World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Hu...” St. Leidon was also sitting on the audience stand.","“Old Wilson.” Seeing the scenes before him, even though he was a saint-level master who had witnessed everything that could happen in the world, he was still emotional. He asked Sword Saint Wilson, who was sitting beside him, “Are you feeling regretful?”","“Regretful of what?” Sword Saint Wilson looked at the stage and asked.","“Regretful that we came to this prosperous world too late.” Looking at the players who were cheering thunderously all over the venue, St. Leidon sighed, “Looking at them, I’m a bit envious.”","“I’m not regretful.” Sword Saint Wilson’s vision seemed to have returned to that almost-collapsed battleground.","In the darkness, the warm light lit up the whole area. Without noticing it, his eyes turned blurry as if he was seeing that radiant light again.","“Arise, my champion!”","If there was a miracle, this was it. “It’s enough to hear this one sentence.”","“You’re right! Friend!” The dwarf king sitting nearby raised a cup of wine and said loudly, “We should write it down. This should be the most impressive sentence for us in World of Warcraft.”","Leidon shrugged and replied, “It’s a pity that I can’t abide by the extremely strict rules for paladins and priests, so I don’t think that I can master resurrection spells in my life. The most that I can achieve is healing spells.”","“I only hope that my son can master the rest.”","“Hahahaha...” Friendly laughter sounded from the people around him.","...","At this moment, the elves were still chatting and discussing, “Do you have any ideas? What should we give to the shop owner?”","“It seems like the shop owner doesn’t need anything...” Helen said.","“Of course, he needs something!” Sala said, “I think the games in his shop need to reach more people.","“The players of the Canglan City Shop are much fewer than those in the Continent of Immortal Relics. I think... we should do some promotions for the shop owner...”","Although that battle had indeed shocked the world, not many people knew how exactly they won the war.","“This shop owner doesn’t know how to do promotions himself,” Sala mumbled in a huff.","“How do we do it...?”","“I tell you...” Sala said in a low voice, “We have many elves. With each of us doing something, it would be enough.”","“Count us in!” The knights from the Golden Griffin Knight Legion and the group of mages and priests led by Dicas chimed in.","“Don’t forget us!” Elina, one of the leaders of the Assassin Brotherhood, leaned over.","Instantly, most players in Canglan City gathered together.","“There’s a saying ‘Over the sea has risen the bright moon, being far apart we share this moment.’” Sala said, “We must share good things with everyone and celebrate it with them.”","“Well said! Well said! We must share good things with everyone!” Elina’s eyes lit up as she agreed to this proposition.","Dicas said, “Maybe we can work together and buy out the time tonight in ‘Magic Night’, the most famous Magic Spell Visual Projection platform, to broadcast the event for us!”","“My goodness...” Elf Sala exclaimed, “I only thought of ‘Elf’s Music’, another Magic Spell Visual Projection platform...”","“We can also use the World Square Projection!” Beside them, Kellybel suggested.","“Ahh-!”","“You... you guys...”","Sala almost passed out, astonished by this suggestion.","If this continued, they would probably have a greater show than the one in which the Judgement Godly Palace showed off their military power.","I only suggested doing some promotions that the influence of our elves can achieve... and you guys...","“This way, we can show it to countless people who want to come but can’t! It’s a win-win situation!”","“We can add tens of millions of cloud players to the audience!” Dicas said firmly.","“Good! Good! Good! This idea is excellent!” They sounded more enthusiastic than the shareholder or even the shop owner while they planned for the future of Origins Internet Club.","...","“Everyone, please give points to the participants of the activities in Qzone. Meanwhile, the first part of the Penguin Bean Winner Guessing Activity will close soon. Please vote for your favorite participants and make your guesses.”","“Wu-! I haven’t bet on anyone yet!” Su Tianji had just finished her boxed meal and said with food in her mouth.","“Little Xue’er, whom did you bet on? Help me make the choice!” As the planner of the event, Nalan Mingxue couldn’t participate in the activities, but she still could join the Penguin Bean Winner Guessing Activity.","“I voted for Xiaoyue.”","“Huh? Xiaoyue participated in the activity?” Su Tianji asked in bafflement.","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue sat in the audience stand as an exchange student of the Heavenly Faction. She was calculating in her mind, Today, I participated the Ready Musician One; I wonder how many snacks I’ll win... hehe...","-In the Jiuhua City Shop-","“Yeah. What did Xiaoyue perform today...?” Dong Qingli also said in bafflement. “How come I don’t remember it...”","“It seems that she performed something...”","“It seems...?”","“Something...?”","“No! No! I can’t vote for her!” Su Tianji immediately turned to other options. “She can’t win.”","...","At this moment, they began to announce the points for the second activity on the stage.","Ning Bi was holding a jade tablet which looked like a communication jade. “Right now, the most popular one...","She glanced at it...","“It comes from Gabriel.”","She read the words on her jade tablet, “I come from the wealthy and aristocratic Black Dragon Family in the Ultimate West Realm. On my most unforgettable day, I came to the Yuanyang City Shop and secretly rescued the girl named Seria with the shop owner.”","“When I first came here, many people told me that this game was free of charge.”","“Many years have passed, and our Black Dragon Family has run out of minerals. Also, my brothers from other families have married and have had children.”","“But no one has offered any marriage proposal to me.”","“However, I’m not envious of them.”","“Whenever I come to the tavern and hear the girl named Seria say to me, ‘Forget me not!’, I know that my heart will never move for anyone else.”","“Gradually, I understood one thing: once in the Dungeon, you will no longer love anyone in the real world.”","Everyone froze for a moment.","– After a while –","“Um... This...” Ning Bi said with sweat on her forehead, “I also played as several characters, and one of them is a nanny (priest). In the game; please don’t tag every equipment with ‘Intelligence’ and try to sell them to the nannies. Nannies really don’t have money.”","“Hahaha! You guys only want to make money off nannies!”","“Amazing!”","“Once in the dungeon, no longer love anyone in the real world! Damn!”","“Hahaha! Another one went crazy!”","At this moment, Ning Bi looked down and said, “Let’s see the next.”","“The most unforgettable thing for me happened in World of Warcraft. Before that incident, I’d never imagined that our elder would act this way.”","It was accompanied by a picture.","An elf was lying on the ground in the picture the illustration showed, [Didn’t you tell me to sleep?]","“Ah! Who posted this picture?!” Elder Sewell glared at the large group of elves behind her.","Not only did they post the picture, the story was on the top list!","“Not me!”","“Not me!”","“Not me either!”","“...” Mr. Fang almost spasmed and choked with laughter in the shop. “This elf would be beaten to death once caught.”"]},{"number":814,"title":"Chapter 814 - Don’t Think That You Have No Friends on Your Journey, You Are Well Known in the World.","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Not all stories were about their journey. Some told funny and embarrassing stories in the games, and some told the memories that were engraved in their bones.","“About the most unforgettable thing in my memory...","“What I’m going to say might not be closely related to the games that much, but I feel like I have to say it.”","Most of the prior submissions were funny. When Ning Bi read this piece, the audience turned from happy to silent.","“This should be the last writing on the list and the one with the most votes,” Ning Bi said.","“What is a warrior? What is the Martial Dao that we’ve been pursuing?”","“We’ve spent all our lives on it but couldn’t find the answer.”","“However, when I saw the old man called the Sword Saint and the swordsman called No Name...”","“When I saw the magnificent duel on the top of the Forbidden City under the full-moon night sky, I suddenly understood it.”","“It represents an unbending spine!”","“It’s a presence that can merge with the sky and earth and can accommodate everything in the world.”","“It’s a will that makes us improve ourselves continuously and surpass our previous achievements.”","“This is the Martial Dao that we’ve been pursuing after.”","“Today, I’d like to thank you for teaching us that simple combat strength is nothing. Only with iron will and unbending spine can we become real warriors and pass down the Martial Dao to future generations.”","This piece was signed by Nalan Hongwu, Zong Wu, Liang Heihu... and all other warriors.","At this moment, everyone fell silent.","...","“Why do we cultivate?” Ning Bi continued.","“Eternity? Immortality? Perhaps. But even our ancestors couldn’t achieve it, how can we do it? In fact, from the very beginning, I felt like it is a ridiculous method for cultivators to fool others and themselves.”","“I only knew that in our cruel dog-eat-dog world, if you don’t cultivate and trample others, one day, others will trample you.”","“I happen to have this talent.”","“If I was asked about the purpose of cultivation, my answer would be trampling more people under my feet one day.”","“My mind changed when I saw those cultivators who fly on swords and ascend to the Immortal Realm and heard the shout, “I control my destiny, not the Heavens’!”","“I began to understand that our mission is searching for a way to go beyond this world... This is the Dao that our ancestors mentioned.","“Only at this moment did I truly feel that I don’t have to struggle and live under others’ threats. My life is mine; I’m a cultivator!”","All the cultivators fell silent in a daze.","A voice began to roar from the bottom of their hearts.","“Never give in to Heaven; never submit to fate. We’re this type of cultivator!”","– On Nanhua Square in the Nanhua Faction –","– In the Royal Courtyard in Dajin –","...","Every prosperous place was broadcasting this event live.","Memories flashed in their minds. Flying on swords... Sword 23...","“Perhaps one day, martial arts might be lost as time goes by, but the people who created the martial arts and their spirit will never lose their glory despite the erosion of time.”","“At this moment, perhaps we can proudly point at the world and yell, ‘We are cultivators!’”","“This is the spirit and presence in our minds!”","...","“I’m an assassin.”","“I once lived like a rat, hiding from people.”","“I hid in the filthiest places and did the filthiest business.”","“I felt lost since we had once lived in a nation full of sunshine.”","“We tried to stand under the sunshine again, but the situation went against our wishes.”","“I couldn’t even tell people my profession since I thought it was shameful.”","“But now, whenever I stood at a high point and looked down on the land like an eagle, I would want to dive down proudly and tell everyone that I’m an assassin!”","“Here, I’d like to salute to the master assassins again. By the way, we like Talon’s Assassin’s Creed skin very much!”","“May I ask all the assassins again; are you still lost? What’s your creed and faith?!” Ning Bi almost yelled out the last sentences.","“Nothing is true; everything is permitted!”","“Fight for freedom!”","Instantly, deafening roars came from the audience!","...","They didn’t settle down until a long while later.","– At this moment –","“I once thought that only people with supreme strength could be called saints. But when I reached this realm, I realized that it wasn’t true.”","“Now, I have changed my mind. I think that pure strength isn’t enough to be called a saint, but some people are the personification of true light; they deserve this word!”","“Humility, honor, sacrifice, courage... When I saw such existences, I began to understand what honor really means.”","“If someone asks me what miracles are and if I’ve seen one, I can proudly tell them that I saw one with my own eyes. It was a streak of light, a streak of light in the darkness.”","“I will tell them with great pride that this is a miracle!”","“If there’s a god that truly deserves our reverence, it’s here!”","At this moment, in both the West Continent and the Continent of the Immortal Village, all the busy squares and Spiritual Spell Visual Projections were broadcasting this scene live.","“In Holy Light we believe!”","Instantly, like thunder, the roars and yells seemed to devour everything in the world!","At this moment...","“After expressing our appreciation to many things, I think...” Qingyun Fairy said, “We need to thank a person the most since it’s he who brought us all this. Today is a special day because today is that person’s birthday.”","“Let’s give him our best wishes, okay?”","“Happy birthday-!”","“Ahh-! Today’s the shop owner’s birthday?!” The elves, the knights from the Golden Griffin Knight Legion, and all the other people were astonished.","Then, they yelled in surprise, “Happy birthday!”","Xiaoyue almost jumped up from her seat. “Aya! They didn’t tell me! You guys... I’m angry!”","Without thinking, she rushed toward the Jiuhua City Shop.","Not only the people on and off the stage and inside the shops, but the people before the livestream screens and Spiritual Spell Visual Projections yelled together. Like a tsunami, millions of people joined the chant.","Many people sat before the Spiritual Spell Visual Projections in big and small nations on the West Continent and watched the scene, not to mention those in the Continent of Immortal Relic.","At this moment, hearing the heart-felt wishes and seeing the huge cake that had suddenly appeared in the shop, Fang Qi felt like he wasn’t lonely in this otherworld.","“Here, we have one saying for Mr. Fang,” Ning Bi and Qingyun Fairy said together, “Don’t think that you have no friends on your journey; you are well known in the world!”","In a daze, Fang Qi watched the scene and the people before him.","It had always been him who brought these people endless surprises and pleasures.","But at this moment, his heart was truly stunned and stirred for the first time."]},{"number":815,"title":"Chapter 815 - The Easter Egg in Diablo 2, the Mysterious Cow Level, and True Forms of Demon Lords!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","As a traveler from another plane, Fang Qi looked back and remembered that he had felt quite uncomfortable with this world’s culture and way of thinking, which were totally different from that of Earth.","The poem ‘All alone in a foreign land, I am twice as homesick on holidays” was probably written in a similar setting.","However, just as they said, he had come a long way here. Looking ahead, he didn’t have to worry that he would have no friends.","Hearing the warm cheers, he looked dumbfoundedly at the big cake pushed over by Dong Qingli in the Jiuhua City Shop, and he asked, “Oh, you guys said... Whose birthday is it?”","They looked at him in bafflement, “Isn’t it yours!”","“My...? No...” Mr. Fang froze. “My birthday is...”","He suddenly froze in the middle of the sentence. “It seems that today is indeed my birthday...”","“What do you mean by it seems?!”","“It is, alright?”","“You are too busy to think clearly!”","The people around Mr. Fang looked at him in disdain.","“I guess the scummy shop owner has never eaten a cake before, and he is stunned by the sight of it.” A petite figure came in from outside.","“Xiaoyue?!” Mr. Fang said, “Little Girl, you’re supposed to be in school. How come you’re here?”","“Humph!” Jiang Xiaoyue said smugly, “I’m now a diamond master while the others are only gold. I’m so good, so it’s no big deal for me to ask for a leave of absence!”","“Besides, I’m not here to play.”","“Come and make a wish.” Then, they lit the candles for Mr. Fang.","While he sat in his chair, the livestream room broadcasted this scene, showing it to everyone watching.","“I wish... the internet café expands further, so more people can play our games. I wish everyone is as happy as today,” Mr. Fang said after a moment of consideration, “I wish that everyone walking out of the internet café will be dragons and god-like figures.”","Although the players in all the shops of the internet club were less than one percent or even one-thousandth of the population of the whole world, its reputation was great enough, and it was well-known.","All the viewers watching the livestream cheered.","It felt as if the whole world was celebrating.","After making the wishes, he blew out all the candles in one breath.","...","Looking at the pretty big multi-layer cake beside Mr. Fang, Jiang Xiaoyue widened her eyes. “Wow-!”","After blowing out the candles, Mr. Fang quickly pulled her back. “You’re almost in the cake. It’s just a cake. I used to eat several cakes each year and got tired of it.”","“Where did you get several cakes?!” Jiang Xiaoyue said in a huff, “How come I’ve never eaten them before?!”","“He’s just bragging!” Su Tianji said,","“Our cake is made with a special process! It’s super delicious!” Su Tianji said in a low voice.","Mr. Fang disagreed. “It’s just a birthday cake made with cream and egg! What special process?! It’s not like I’ve never eaten cakes before.”","Before I traveled through space and time, what kind of cakes didn’t I eat?","“Humph!” At this moment, Dong Qingli crossed her arms before her chest and lifted her exquisite chin while saying smugly, “This cake is not an average cake!”","“Is there anything special with the cakes made in your restaurant?” Mr. Fang asked.","“Of course!” Dong Qingli pointed at the cake before MR. Fang and said, “First, let’s talk about the cream. Based on the original cream production process, we used meticulous material selection and creation process. We obtained fresh milk from the immortal-grade cows that were fed with spiritual essence and spiritual herbs for years...”","“As for the eggs in the cake, we selected the top-quality spiritual eggs from the meticulously selected immortal-grade hens that were fed with Lanzhi Immortal Herb. As for the water that we used...”","Stupefied, Mr. Fang listened to Dong Qingli’s introduction. “You... You guys...!!”","He was stunned.","“Quickly try it!”","Immediately, Mr. Fang cut a small piece, forked up a small portion, and placed it on his tongue.","“Wow-!” He almost devoured his own tongue.","Dong Qingli leaned over with a smile and said, “What do you think, Sir? My restaurant’s cake is delicious, right?”","“Delicious...” Mr. Fang had never tasted such delicious birthday cake before.","In the past, the cakes were too big, and he had to struggle to finish the rest of the cake after the first few bites. But now, staring at the huge cake in front of him, he felt like he could eat it all even if it was twice this big!","At this moment, he heard Dong Qingli say, “Regretfully, regardless of how we tried, we could only achieve about 70 percent of the rich flavor of the cream produced in the shop... Regardless of how we tried, we couldn’t make it better. Sometimes, the result got worse...”","Mr. Fang’s face darkened, thinking, Although the System made the snacks casually, it would be outstanding if you can achieve 70 percent of the flavor!","“Ya-! I want to eat too!” Jiang Xiaoyue watched Mr. Fang eat the cake with an eager look on her face, looking as if she wanted to grab the cake from his hands.","While devouring the cake, Mr. Fang said blurrily, “Xiaoyue... people prepared birthday gifts for me, but you came without a gift and want to eat the cake. Humph...”","“Hey-!” Jiang Xiaoyue looked around and blushed. “I also brought a gift for you...”","Reluctantly, she took out a box of Dove Chocolate from her storage space. “This is the last snack in my treasured collection. There’s no more snacks after I give you this!”","“I’d hate to take it from you...” Mr. Fang took it and said solemnly at the same time.","“Hey! Slow down!” Jiang Xiaoyue yelled in alarm, “You almost ate it all!”","“Not at all! I saved one piece for everyone! This is for you!”","“It’s too small! I want yours!”","“You’re small, so you should eat the small piece!”","Each was louder than the last.","Looking at them, Dong Qingli and others exchanged a smile.","For one instant, they seemed to return to the small shop when it was just opened with a shop owner playing games and a loli keeping an eye on the shop.","The shop looked different now, but the people were still the same.","...","After celebrating Mr. Fang’s birthday, it came to the last stage of the event – hunting for Easter eggs.","Meanwhile, the viewers were busy giving points to the participants in the second activity.","Although Resident Evil was one of the earliest games, the hidden items such as the Unlimited Rocket Launcher that could allow the players to clear the stage within three hours had been discovered long ago.","Therefore, it had low points.","In fact, some players in the new shop would go and find prequels after playing the sequels or the games made by the same ‘studio’.","After Mr. Fang’s promotional activity of buying ten and getting one for free, more players entered the games.","For example, some of the World of Warcraft players in the new shop also played StarCraft and Diablo 2 which were also produced by Blizzard, let alone the players who went back to the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 and 1 after playing the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4.","Ning Bi said, “I see that many people are posting the Easter eggs they discovered. Soon, our Easter egg activity will end, and we’ll verify if these Easter eggs are truly in the games.”","After the time was up, the hostesses would announce these Easter eggs and verify them to see if they were true. After the time limit, the players who hadn’t posted their discoveries couldn’t participate in this activity anymore.","“The Easter eggs that have been found by many people don’t need verification. Now, let’s see the Easter eggs and hidden items that need verification.”","“The Secret Cow Level in Diablo 2.”","“This Easter egg is known to many players and doesn’t need verification.”","“The true forms of the demon lords in Diablo 2.”","Everyone knew that there were three difficulty levels in Diablo 2; Normal, Nightmare, and Hell. In reality, the true forms of the demon lords were still hidden in the deeper places.","“There are over ten players, including 13 players in the old shops in Jiuhua City, Half City, and Yuanyang City as well as two players in Canglan City, posted guides about related Easter eggs.”","“Three players posted relatively complete guides, including the six super bosses which are three Lesser Evils – Lilith (Andariel’s mother), Uber Izual, and Uber Duriel and the three prime evils – Uber Mephisto, Uber Diablo, and Uber Baal.”","“After clearing the stage in Hell Difficulty in Diablo 2, there is a very low probability for the boss to drop three different keys in Acts I, II, and IV in Hell Difficulty. The keys are the Key of Terror from the Countess, the Key of Hate from the Summoner, and the Key of Destruction from Nihlathak.”","“In the city in Act IV, the three keys can be transmuted through the Horadric Cube into a key leading to the real den of Lesser Evils.”","When Ning Bi read this, the audience gasped, “There are such bosses in Diablo 2?!”"]},{"number":816,"title":"Chapter 816 - These Memories Will Always Stay in Our Hearts","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Ning Bi continued to read, “After killing Lilith, Uber Izzual, and Uber Duriel, we can get Diablo’s Horn, Mephisto’s Brain, and Baal’s Eye. With these three items, we can go to the headquarters of the three prime evils – Chaos Tristram.”","“Where’s Mr. Fang?” Ning Bi called out to Mr. Fang, “Sir, do you think such bosses really exist?”","Behind Ning Bi, the camera for the big screen on the stage turned toward Mr. Fang.","Mr. Fang just smiled. “Let’s test it.”","Nalan Hongwu and the others were the most experienced Diablo 2 players.","Despite the new games released each year, these veteran players would never forsake the old games.","Obviously, Nalan Hongwu had gotten the Key of Terror, the Key of Hate, and the Key of Destruction ready.","Opening a portal with one key, the three keys could transmute into three portals in Horadric Cube. Each of these three portals led to a Lesser Evil’s residence.","At this moment, the viewers watched as Nalan Hongwu placed a set of keys into the Horadric Cube.","The ancient godly ‘Horadric Cube’ had miraculous powers and was one of the highest achievements of alchemy. It could simplify most spells and recipes and forge items.","When Nalan Hongwu activated the Horadric Cube, the viewers saw a streak of strange red light fall from the sky in the center of the city.","A red portal emitting a bloody smell was opened.","It seemed to lead to the entrance of Hell with extremely horrifying monsters hiding there!","Then, the second portal and the third portal were opened!","With Elder Fu and Nalan Hongwu stepping into the first portal, the magic map showed that it was a place named Matron’s Den.","Obviously, this wasn’t a place familiar to the players!","“It’s true!” All the players who had played or knew about Diablo 2 stared at the screen in a daze.","There really exists such a secret place, and evil demon lords are indeed hiding inside!","They felt the thick mist beginning to clear up before them, revealing the true forms of the bosses.","When the true forms of the three Lesser Evils were killed, Diablo’s Horn, Mephisto’s Brain, and Baal’s Eye merged into a new blood-colored portal which looked like the eye of doomsday.","It led to Chaos Tristram where countless demons lived!","Endless destruction and hellish horror filled this terrifying space.","This was the Tristram in a different dimension. It was the headquarters and home base of the three demon lords!","“My goodness... there are indeed true forms of those demon lords...”","“The three demon lords at Hell Difficulty are horrifying enough... I wonder how powerful these three existences are...!","Upon entering the portal, the players were struck with destructive storms and world-destroying meteorite strikes. Although it was only a quick glance, the scene left a deep impression on the viewers.","“I didn’t know that the terrifying true forms of these three demon lords are hiding in Diablo 2, and they are horrifyingly powerful!” Ning Bi said, “I’m afraid that not everyone can challenge them. Now, thank you for bringing us such a fascinating Easter egg!”","“Then, let’s see the next.”","“The mysterious small waterdrops in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4,” Ning Bi read, “After mastering the ability to fly on swords and returning to Rock Creek Cave in Green Bird Peak, you’ll find that it is totally different inside. There are no longer monsters but many mysterious small waterdrops in which we seem to see the dialogues between the creators of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4...”","“Huh-!? The creators of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4?!” Ning Bi said in surprise, “It is the god-like figure named Shanghai Softstar? Or is it an organization?!”","“Creators?!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Su Tianji said in surprise, “The creators of the Legend of Sword and Fairy...? Really?!”","“F*ck!” Song Qingfeng was also surprised. “What kind of god-like figures are they...?!”","After all, the creators of the games had always been mysterious!","“Let’s verify if this Easter egg really exists!”","In the system version, this Easter egg was harder to find than in the original version in which the waterdrops were big NPCs which could converse. In the system version, they looked the same as the small waterdrops in nature.","It was why not many players discovered them. At this moment, Elder Sewell and other elves who were fans of natural scenery were demonstrating this Easter egg.","They had gone to Rock Creek Cave many times to appreciate the views and thus found this detail.","Soon, the big screen behind Ning Bi showed these waterdrops.","Shining under the lights, the waterdrops in Rock Creek Cave emitted dreamy colors, making the dream-like cave even more fascinating.","They looked carefully and saw another world seemed to be hidden in the small radiant waterdrops.","Vaguely, they seemed to hear some voices.","“The Legend of Sword and Fairy 4 contains the hard work of many people who had worked day and night on it. Shanghai Softstar is only six years old... Thank you for your support, but we don’t dare to compare it to many other masterpieces.”","“Many players like the Legend of Sword and Fairy, and we must nurture it with sincerity instead of selfishness. Otherwise, how can the players be touched by the stories?”","“While you experience the world, remember to try all kinds of small delicacies in different places. As we mention food, I remember that I haven’t had barbecue for a long while...”","“Playing games appropriately is good for your mind. Remember to take a break when you’re fatigued...”","“Thank you for your support and love for the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4!!”","In reality, the players in this world never knew what the production teams looked like.","However, they felt the sincerity and gratitude contained in these words.","“From their conversations, we can tell that Shanghai Softstar is probably the youngest team and not very rich,” Ning Bi said in excitement, “Although I don’t know if these god-like figures are just being modest, I want to say, thank you for making the excellent Legend of Sword and Fairy under severe conditions. Thank you!”","At this moment, bullet comments flooded the screen, coming from players all over the world including those in the Continent of Immortal Relics as well as the elves and dwarves in the West Continent.","[Thank you!]","[Thank you for bringing us such an excellent story!]","[Hope we can see more excellent stories from you!]","Perhaps they didn’t know that before Fang Qi traveled through space time, the team named Softstar which had made the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 and 4 had disintegrated.","In the Canglan City Shop, the elves sent their sincere wish. [Regardless of how the world changes, these memories will always stay in our hearts.]"]},{"number":817,"title":"Chapter 817 - Godly Punishment!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","By now, the activities in the shops finally entered the final stage.","Ning Bi was announcing the list of winners, “In the Ready Musician One activity, the highest point goes to ‘I’m MT’ of World of Warcraft performed by the Nanhua Faction!”","“It’s us?!” On the seats for the Nanhua Faction, Mo Xian and her senior and junior sisters heard the result and just couldn’t believe it.","Then, Mo Xian pinched Yue Yan’s cheek. “Junior Sister, does it hurt? Is it real?!”","“Ahh-!” With her cheek pinched red, Yue Yan protested loudly.","“In the Most Unforgettable Memory, Believe in Holy Light from World of Warcraft won the highest point! The materials are provided by people like Wilson, Leidon, and Elven.”","“We...?! They mentioned our names?!” Cheers came from Canglan City.","“In Ready Player One – Easter Egg Hunting activity, Nalan Hongwu and his team’s hunt of the true forms of devil lords in Diablo 2 won the highest points!”","“The second place goes to the elf team led by Sewell who found the Easter egg in Rock Creek Cave in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4.”","“Ah-!” The elves were astonished. “We won a reward-!?”","“We won a reward?”","They looked at each other and exclaimed together.","...","“Let’s see what’s in the shop owner’s big gift bags!” the group yelled.","These elves had coveted Mr. Fang’s prizes for a long time!","...","The people in this world had only known very few skills and techniques, and they had had low strength. However, they were indeed talented.","Like pearls covered in dust, they revealed their beautiful colors after a few light brushes.","– Meanwhile, Mr. Fang’s tournament continued as planned –","– In the division in the Continent of Immortal Relics –","“Mid lane!”","“Come to Baron! Force a team fight with Baron!”","“Oh-! My goodness!” Xiao Yulv exclaimed at the caster stand, “Five attacks in one second! No! Five attacks in an instant! Participant Nalan Mingxue used this trump card and instantly killed the ADC from the Royal Clan Team! The Lingyun Team will win this match...!”","– In the division in the West Continent –","Assassin Elina tightened the grip on her throwing knife.","Her champion was Talon, and she was waiting for her prey like a cheetah.","A ring of blades flew out as if they were driven by an invisible force. The assassin champion that she controlled flew out, looking like a horrifying ghost.","When the enemy Xerath walked past, she instantly stabbed forward in stealth like a lightning flash!","Countless flying blades became one like a saber control technique!","“Instant kill! The enemy mid laner was instantly killed!”","...","“We control such great power... we make breakthroughs continuously in the mystical realm with their skills.” It was on a distant and remote high mountain far away from the shop.","“This horrifying snowstorm will destroy everything...” Swein stared at the sight before him as the energy of chilly ice, wind, and snowstorm continued to grow but was eventually controlled in a certain area by him.","“Swein, be careful!” World Mage Hematon warned him, “This is the best spell of the Ascendant. In the game, I could only use it with a strength less than level 7, but now I’ll use it with my strength as a pinnacle stage saint-level master...”","Restless energy instantly turned violent around him while an extremely horrifying and destructive energy beam shot out!","“Face the wind!” When the blade slashed out, a hurricane as huge as a natural barrier suddenly rose before him!","All the energy was destroyed!","...","Boom-!","A thunder tore open the sky.","No one had seen such a horrifying sky before. It looked as if the sky and the earth were enraged.","It even look like... the sky had been devoured.","The elves pushed open the door and walked out of the shop. Suddenly, they pointed at the sky.","“Look!”","The blazing sun looked as if it was being slowly devoured by something.","The sky turned dark.","In one instant, the day turned into the night.","Meanwhile, the Continent of Immortal Relics, which was in another plane, had the same phenomenon!","It seemed like a horrifying catastrophe was brewing!","It seemed like the heavens and the earth were enraged, and the gods were going to unleash the destructive godly punishment!","...","Amidst the bell chimes in the early morning, the old cultivator maintaining the Ancestor Master’s Shrine in the Heavenly Faction lit up incense sticks with great respect.","Above the portraits of all previous ancestral masters of each generation were some other portraits; only real gods and immortals were worshipped above the founding ancestral master.","It was the ancient tradition of the Heavenly Faction, and the Three Saint Factions in the Continent of Immortal Relics did the same.","These were the greatest existences they worshipped.","They represented the end of the Pursuit of Dao.","They were the holiest existences that all the cultivators since the ancient times had been worshipping.","According to the legends, these immortals existed from the very beginning of time and lived in grand immortal nations that were unimaginable for mortals.","Heaven-Supervising Immortal would watch the mortal world and choose the fortunate ones to enter the ethereal world of immortals.","...","– At the Gods’ Peak in the Radiant Light Godly Nation –","Radiant light shone on this land permanently. There were no nights in this place.","Lights shined brightly, and countless followers kneeled and worshipped with great devotion.","According to the legends, mortals could never ascend. Only the powerful and pious souls could be led into the realm where the gods lived after death.","Some legends even said that the nation named after the radiant light had inherited the radiant light from the gods in Heaven. The pure souls of the noble royal member came from the infinite distant nation where the gods lived.","St. Heinz who was in charge of the Judgement Godly Palace even said that he had served the God of Radiant Light Judgement.","They possessed the real ‘divinity’.","It was the god’s blessing that the followers craved for but couldn’t receive!","...","According to the old tales, they lived in the lofty realm beyond the clouds, and countless poems praised it and described its beauty which was unimaginable for humans. It was an impeccable and dreamy place.","The gods living there were elegant and noble, and no word in the world could describe their magnificence.","When the sun rose, the perfect golden lights were the blessings from the gods.","When the sun set, the radiant evening clouds were the silky robes that the gods wore.","The followers piously believed that, one day, these great existences would see their piety, pity them, and lead them up to the godly nation.","One day in the Immortal Realm was equal to one year on the Mortal Realm.","The immortality of the gods went beyond the imagination of mortals.","Chaotic ice and flames danced in the deepest place in the void and the universe.","The greatest sound was silent, and the greatest shape was formless. From the endless space, they looked down on the countless mortals who worshipped with lowered heads.","It seemed like the dark void was shined on by the light, and all darkness vanished.","It also seemed like lights were swallowed, with only empty darkness remained.","In the depths where light and darkness merged, there was a distant world unreachable by mortals.","The Innumerable-Immortal Sea, Gods’ Palace, and Godly Court came together and created the whole immortal nation beyond the void.","There lived the existences whom mortals admired, worshiped, and believed in.","...","Meanwhile, in the shrine in the back mountain of the Heavenly Faction.","The old cultivator who was putting up incense sticks rubbed his eyes.","He seemed to see one of the portraits above the portraits of the ancestral masters suddenly move!","It was one of the portraits of the loftiest existences!","In great astonishment, he actually saw a figure walking down from the painting!","The godly figure said, “You mortals have forgotten the covenant that you made years ago and committed such a crime! Shortly, a destructive catastrophe will come!","“But the Heavens are merciful. If you are willing to forget the past and all the things related to that shop to redeem yourself, you might have a chance to live!”","“I... Upper immortal, I don’t know what crime we’ve committed?!” the old cultivator asked immediately.","“The Martial Art Ban... Even if the other factions didn’t mention it, the ancestral master of your Heavenly Faction didn’t tell you that?!","“Where’s your faction master?”","“He’s in the internet café...” The old cultivator scratched his head and said, “We didn’t do anything forbidden...”"]},{"number":818,"title":"Chapter 818 - Mr. Fang’s Big Gift Bag Dropped the Heavenly Mirror?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Look! What’s inside the shop owner’s big gift bags!”","Let’s return to the time when the ‘Memories of Bygone Years’ activity had just ended.","In the Canglan City Shop, a group of elves sat around the big gift bag which was awarded to them by Mr. Fang.","They were so exhilarated.","People did the same in the Half City Shop and Jiuhua City Shop.","In the new shop at the East Continent, the newbies who had just begun playing games obviously were not as lucky as the veterans. Envious, they watched the livestream as others opened the treasure boxes.","“Don’t worry! This time, we won a complete set of champion skins and the latest model of communication jades!” The Heavenly Faction Master encouraged the disciples who were watching the opening of big gift bags. “Next time, we’ll do better!”","“We’ll open first! We’ll open first!” In the Canglan City Shop, the elves couldn’t wait anymore.","“Elder, you do it...” With some reluctance, the elves handed the exquisite gift bag to Elder Sewell.","“Heya...!” Elf Queen Kellybel watched them with envy. “It’s better to hand out the prize directly... why make it so mysterious...”","Of course, she was here with the identity of an elf wanderer.","Even Demon Dragon Gulth widened his golden eyes. “Will a horrifying monster jump out of it?! Be careful!”","“Hahahaha! The Cowardly Dragon is so scared!”","“It’s said that this dragon almost wet himself in fear. He almost couldn’t make it to the washroom. Hahaha!”","“Who’s cowardly! Who did you say is scared...!”","The shop was filled with a happy atmosphere again.","At this moment, Elder Sewell took the gift bag and opened it. Several items jumped out.","They even saw a streak of dazzling golden flash!","While their hearts lurched, they instinctively knew that good stuff came out.","“Wow-! So many!” Sala was almost dizzy as stars appeared in her eyes.","“My goodness...!”","“How come there are so many!”","The System was upgrading, and it seemed like the prizes and rewards were upgraded as well.","There were several things hovering before them in silence. There was an antique-looking bow, a set of silver blades, a machete, a crossbow and arrows, and a longsword that had a strange shape.","Like virtual images, words of descriptions hovered beside the items. Obviously, during the upgrading process, the System had added some new black technology.","Thori’dal, the Stars’ Fury (copy).","Since the worlds in the games were all virtual, the items in them couldn’t come out to the real world. There would only be copies made by the System.","“Ah-!” Seeing the first item, the elves froze as if they couldn’t believe their eyes.","Then, they jumped up and screamed as if they had won a lottery of millions.","“Ya-! Let me pinch you and see if we’re in a dream!” Sala looked at Rowling beside her and pinched the latter.","It must be noted that this was one of the most powerful godly weapons that could be acquired by the players in the current expansion of World of Warcraft. It was a weapon on the same level as the Twin Blades of Azzinoth, which was Illidan’s weapon!","“Ah-! Why pinch me?!” Rowling was displeased, but she was happy and thrilled to see this bow.","Then, they looked at the set of blades on the side.","[The weapon used by Talon, the Blade’s Shadow. It doesn’t have a name.]","“Ya! This is great too!”","“Look at this one!”","The description said. [Vayne’s heavy crossbow and silver bolts (copy).]","The last item was the longsword, and...","“Tianhe Sword (copy).”","“Ahahahaha-!” Even Elder Sewell almost jumped up in thrill.","“This big gift bag even contains the Tianhe Sword! Hahahaha!”","As huge fans of the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4, they were elated. After all, Murong Ziying forged the Tianhe Sword based on the Wangshu Sword, and it was only inferior to the Wangshu Sword in the game. Yun Tianhe had shot down the Qionghua Faction with the Hou Yi Sun Shooting Bow and the Tianhe Sword as the arrow.","“Ahyaya! So many good things. I’m almost too ashamed to take them all!” Sala said with hesitation.","“Should we see what other people have got?” Elder Sewell suggested.","“Okay! Okay!”","Immediately, they turned on the livestream from the Continent of Immortal Relics. At this moment, Nalan Hongwu, Elder Fu, An Huwei, and the others sat together and opened their big gift bag on the livestream.","When it was opened, items jumped out of the exquisite small box like water spraying out of a fountain.","Everyone saw a dazzling golden light flashing by!","Nalan Hongwu froze and then exclaimed, “It flashed! It flashed! Let’s see what it is!”","A strange flame was bathed in pale golden lights. Obviously, it wasn’t an ordinary item.","Beside that, they saw an ancient mirror made of neither gold nor jade, but it was covered in golden clouds. It was also bathed in golden lights.","Next to the mirror was a magnificent crystal sword engulfed in dazzling golden lights as well.","[Dragon’s Breath (copy)]","[Heavenly Mirror (copy)]","[Phase Blade: Last Wish (Runeword in Diablo) (copy)]","“Wow-!” The group of old people were shocked, and their mouths opened in O-shapes as they watched the sight with widened eyes.","“My goodness!” Bedlam broke out in the live show room!","“Their luck is...unrivaled!”","“With these three items, they are unrivaled...!”","“My goodness-!”","“With these items, they can even fight real immortals...”","Sala and the other elves saw the scene and widened their eyes again. “Their things seem to be better than ours...”","“We saw only one flash; they had three consecutive flashes...!”","...","“Quickly look at what’s in our big gift bag!” In the Half City Shop, Mo Xian and other disciples of the Nanhua Faction were excited.","In the Canglan City Shop, Wilson and the other holy-level masters were breathing rapidly as well. They also won a big gift bag.","It was a prize obtained together by the Golden Griffin Knight Legion and Dicas, the priest. They had collected the materials together.","“Who’s going to open it?” They exchanged a look.","“Let me do it!” Helen volunteered.","Immediately, she opened it as well.","“Flash! We got flashes too!”","“We seem to have two flashes!”","In the two golden light beams, a huge fiery-red sword, as if it was covered in lava, and a golden spell scroll hovered in the air silently.","“Firelink Greatsword...!?”","“Sunlight Spear?!”","Other things aside, the Sunlight Spear was the most powerful miracle in Dark Souls 3; it was also the strongest spell of Gwyn, a lord of cinder and the leader of gods!","In Dark Souls, the spells could be stored in the magic scrolls, which saved the trouble to learning them.","The players in the Canglan City Shop got more than these two treasures.","Next to the two gold-level treasures that were categorized by the System, there was a dancing purple flame and a sword."]},{"number":819,"title":"Chapter 819 - Saint!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","With a box of fried chicken bites in his hands, the dog-headed man looked over in astonishment and almost dropped his chicken.","He instantly recognized the sword. “Astonishing! The Breakdance Greatsword!?”","“And... Farron’s Undead Legion’s soul?!” In Dark Souls, players could obtain a small amount of soul power after killing a powerful opponent. With this small amount of souls, they could increase their own strength or use it as a currency.","“There’s such a thing?!”","...","By now, the overall ranking was released, and the winner was the Yuanyang City Shop’s Gu Tingyun, the Academy Master of the Heavenly Academy.","[Academy Master Gu, do you have a specific item that you’d like to have?] Mr. Fang sent him a message, [But I must tell you that I can’t give you anything too powerful 😏] After all, the System set the limit that the prizes couldn’t exceed 80 percent of the level of prizes that Mr. Fang had acquired.","“Um...” Gu Tingyun looked at the prizes that others had received. [Let me think about it...]","...","In the Half City Shop, Mo Xian and the others from the Nanhua Faction opened their big gift bag.","Suddenly, a dazzling golden light shot out of the gift bag and soared into the sky!","“What’s that?!”","Everyone realized that it was another great treasure!","Lights dimmed and revealed an antique-looking spotless sword with flowing lights.","“Ancient godly sword which can shatter the sky and the earth.”","“This... This is...!?”","“Wuchen Sword?!”","“Li Xiaoyao’s ultimate weapon in the Legend of Sword and Fairy-!”","“F*k!?”","Although the players of the game knew that Wuchen Sword wasn’t as powerful as the description said, it was still a godly sword.","“Quickly look at what else is in there?!” Despite the dazzling lights which could even blind them, the viewers immediately turned their eyes to the center of the golden light.","They seemed to see a palm-sized sapphire blue box; it looked very exquisite.","“What’s this...?!” The cultivators from factions of the East Continent, including the Heavenly Faction and the Xiaoyao Cave Abode, and the cultivators from Yuanyang City Shop were watching the unboxing.","“What’s this?” The cultivators exchanged a look. “Which Daoist friend has seen this treasure before?!”","Elder Xiao Yunhe from the Heavenly Faction leaned close to the screen and vaguely saw a strange-shaped silver word on the sapphire box.","Subconsciously, he read out loud, “Stride...?”","“Stride?!” The other elders all looked over. “What kind of treasure is this?!”","They said in a loud voice, “This treasure is strange!”","“What is this treasure for...?!”","“There’s the description on the bottom...”","“Check it out!”","On the sapphire blue box were written, [The delicious taste lingers longer than you can believe...]","[TL Note: This is the slogan for Stride gum in China.]","“...”","...","“Nonsense?!” In the blinding immortal light was the blurry shape of the ethereal figure. This figure reprimanded, “Do you know what disastrous consequences your behavior will bring to yourselves?! No one is allowed to break the rules made by the ancient saints, otherwise...”","The old cultivator stomped his foot while he said frantically, “Upper immortal... we... we only play games! We didn’t break any rules-!”","He quickly took out his communication jade which contained the video of him playing as the Hand of Noxus. “We just play League of Legends; we didn’t do anything that would anger the Heaven or anyone!”","“We’ve always abided by the laws. Why...?!”","“Humph!” The figure in the immortal light snorted. “I think your life in the peaceful world is a bit too comfortable!:","“Despite the clumsiness of these moves, do you really think we are so foolish that we can’t recognize them?!” The immortal figure looked at the communication jade that the old cultivator took out and said with a snicker, “But I don’t want to explain it to you. You only need to know that everything you’ve learned from this shop is forbidden according to the ban.”","Then, the voice turned even chillier. “Not to mention the talks about slaying gods and killing immortals! You’re reckless! Who do you think you are? You dare to play tricks on us!”","Instantly, this figure released a tiny bit of his presence, and it made the old cultivator feel like a giant and horrifying ancient mountain was crashing toward him.","The old cultivator was knocked down by the pressure, dropping the communication jade on the ground.","He spewed out a mouthful of blood while his face instantly turned deadly pale!","Even a tiny streak of the godly presence was too much for him!","“I’m Gui Ye from Connate Cliff.” Although the face of his figure was blurry, the voice was full of arrogance. Perhaps this speaker looked arrogant and overbearing at this moment.","“Gui...” The old cultivator froze and then looked horrified. “This surname...?!”","Suddenly, he remembered the short records in the ancient scrolls in the faction.","It was said that eight extremely ancient families once lived on this continent; they seemed to have existed as long as the human race.","Some even said that all the cultivation techniques on this continent came from these eight ancient families.","In that era, even the kids who kept eyes on the gates were saint-level masters, and they could stir up discussions in the whole world with one or half a move.","In that era, the saint-level masters in the West Continent didn’t dare to call themselves saints such there were eight ultimate saints from the eight families!","According to the ancient scrolls, at that time, there was no ascendance, and the immortals just lived as hermits in the spiritual mountains and rivers.","It was clearly recorded that the saint of the Gui Family had once struck the souls out from several immortals with one palm strike, and the latter died with their bodies and Dao destroyed!","Even the people who could ascend had to look up to them and could never imagine how high that realm was!","These saints were the most respected existences for the cultivators who tried to become immortals.","“Green Sky has some abilities but is still a foreigner.” The cold voice pulled the old cultivator back to reality. “Don’t think that I’m not aware of the overconfident person who thinks that everything is okay after escaping from her hand.”","The old cultivator froze, not understanding what he meant.","The figure continued, “Long, long ago, there was also an overconfident figure. However, this figure had fallen into this filthy mortal world and became the Divinity that these lowly ants fought over!”","“This is my warning,” the figure in the immortal lights said, “Think carefully before you make the decision!”","Then, the immortal light dimmed, and that portrait of the immortal in the shrine returned to its original form.","It looked as if nothing had happened.","With a horrified expression, the old cultivator looked around. His communication jade that fell on the floor was still showing the League of Legends video.","“Hurry...” He got up from the ground immediately, “I must report this to the Faction Master...","He ran out and then ran back to pick up his communication jade. “Right. Send a QQ message... QQ... I’m so forgetful... I almost forgot this function!”"]},{"number":820,"title":"Chapter 820 - Shatter Casually","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– At this moment, in the new shop at the East Continent –","Elder Xiao Yunhe and Elder Dugu Xiao were supervising the Heavenly Team in the regular season tournament in their region.","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue, with excellent talent and abundant experience from working with and playing games with Mr. Fang for years, had very good skills in the game.","Since this was only the first season, only a few masters could reach diamond.","In the system version, players needed their league points to reach a certain level to activate the Challenger rank. That was why there weren’t any challenger players right now.","On the other hand, since it was the first time that the players could compete in the ranking system, they continued to develop and expand their skills and strategies even though they were in diamond.","Reaching this level only showed that these players played better than others; it didn’t mean that the players could use any techniques freely.","On the screen, Xiaoyue played as the mid laner, Star Forger. Right now, she was level 5 and was going back to base to buy items. Her opponent was...","“Hehehehe...” Controlling the Wuju Bladesman with the Immortal Journey skin, Dugu Yi was wandering in the mid lane on a flying sword.","When he slashed, he always struck the weak points of the minions and killed them with one strike.","Restricted by the strength limit, he couldn’t fly too high but looked quite relaxed.","“Jungler, mid laner! Come to the mid lane for a gank!”","At this moment, the jungler of the Heavenly Team was the Grand Duelist controlled by Yue Bai. Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin had turned to the top lane after her ‘ATM’ Grand Duelist was mocked many times.","With Comet of Legend (E), Jiang Xiaoyue shot toward the mid lane swiftly like a surging wave in the river of stars. Meanwhile, Yue Bai’s Grand Duelist came up from behind the river.","The Star Forger shot toward the wandering Wuju Bladesman in the mid lane as swiftly as a sharp arrow while Starsurge (Q) transformed into a huge vortex of stars and shot out. Almost at the same time, a figure suddenly appeared behind the Wuju Bladesman. They attacked from both sides!","The Wuju Bladesman’s clothes were lit up by flames, and he couldn’t survive if they attacked him together.","The Starsurge was almost cast in front of his face. Even if they were lightly touched by this huge force, ordinary people would be dazzled and lose balance. If he was delayed for a split second, he wouldn’t be able to get out.","The attacks were too sudden for an average person to react.","But at this moment, the Wuji Bladesman controlled by Dugu Yi suddenly made a move to retreat.","“Want to dodge?” Humans couldn’t move as fast as the Starsurgem which traveled at the speed of a star core. Even though it was casted by a cultivator with a strength lower than level 7, it wasn’t easy to dodge.","But at this moment, the Bladesman suddenly changed into a sword shadow and vanished!","Then, a series of sword-clashing noises sounded. In the next moment, a shallow injury appeared on the Grand Duelist’s arm.","At this moment, the Wuju Bladesman had landed behind the Grand Duelist.","Taking two steps backward gave him enough distance to use Alpha Strike. If he had been a millisecond later, he would have been trapped. During the process, he didn’t make a tiny calculation mistake!","He dodged all the skills in this sudden sneak attack with Alpha Strike!","With his hands clasped behind his back, the Wuju Bladesman looked unruffled.","“Good!”","“So strong...!” Elder Xiao Yunhe who was watching the battle from behind yelled in a low voice, “No wonder they’re the strongest team in the East Continent Region...!”","“Yes!” Standing next to him, Faction Chief Feng Xuehe nodded slightly with an amiable expression. “These kids are still young and can’t compete with the seniors.","“But they are quite good.”","“Hahahaha!” Nothing was more enjoyable than seeing the growth of the disciples.","If the situation continued, maybe one day, even if he couldn’t do it, these disciples might be able to make the step forward.","While inhaling deeply, he looked at the sky outside the shop.","Perhaps the Heavenly Faction will expand and prosper under my guidance one day.","If I can do it, it’s well worth my efforts as the faction master!","At this moment, he suddenly heard a beep from his communication jade.","“Huh...?!” He took it out immediately and saw that it was from Elder Feng Yan.","[Faction Master! Bad news! We’re in big trouble!]","[What bad news?] Feng Xuehe was a little displeased. [Why are you so panicked? As a cultivator, where’s your calmness?!]","[Immortal! Immortal!?]","[What immortal?!] Feng Xuehe asked immediately.","At this moment, he seemed to realize the severity of the situation.","He looked up at the sky which had been always gloomy lately. Without a thread of sunshine, it looked like the atmosphere before a catastrophe.","[Huge catastrophe... a huge catastrophe is coming!]","[Our Heavenly Faction... is in danger!] In the Ancestor Master’s Shrine, the pale-faced old cultivator tried to get up, but he fell again after a few stumbling steps.","No... my essence is messy in my meridians, and I can’t activate cultivation strength to fly...","He quickly reported the strange phenomenon that happened in the back mountain.","[What...?!]","As if he had heard a loud thunder from the clear sky, Feng Xuehe’s face instantly paled.","[This... it’s not something that we can joke about! Elder Feng Yan, is it true?!]","Looking at the gloomy sky, he knew without a doubt that it was an omen.","“What’s happening...!?”","“Faction Master, what happened?!”","“Forbidden... godly punishment?! Hahahaha!” A pathetic and helpless laughter sounded in the shop.","Crack!","A roaring gust blew into the shop and messed up his Daoist hat.","Another horrifying lightning bolt flashed in the sky above the shop as if it was the fury from the Heaven.","“I was wondering about the strange phenomenon lately...” one elder said in a grave voice.","Meanwhile, the same news came from the Three Saint Factions in the distant Continent of Immortal Relic.","Even the West Continent had the same situation.","On the first day, a windstorm came and turned the world into darkness.","On the second day, a rainstorm came as ocean water poured onto land!","At this moment, the peaceful and serene Silver Moon Forest was engulfed in a heavy storm that the elves had never seen before.","Countless elves scrambled to seek shelter while the river broke through the banks. In the beautiful White Creek City, creek water poured into the streets, and the elves with low strength hid in their rooms and shivered.","While bringing hands together before their chests, they seemed to be praying for their god to take away the catastrophe.","The neighboring nation of the Morning Light Empire was the homeland of Merlin, a current employee of the Canglan City Shop.","This ancient nation of knights looked like a withered old tree.","It was late in the night, and two figures could be seen hurrying along the street in this ancient nation of knights.","The Radiant Light Godly Palace was still brightly lit.","“Get in line! Don’t push!”","“My Lord... will we have a chance to go up to the ultimate god nation to serve the gods so long as we’re pious enough?”","“Do you think anyone can serve that existence?!” The priest looked at the old man who was dressed in ragged clothes and mocked, “Of course, you must show your piety!”","Embarrassed, the old man dug out some silver coins with the heraldry of the Stan Empire. “This is all I have... can you show mercy...”","“You don’t even have any magic crystals?!” The priest looked cold.","“I beg you...” A little girl who was about five years old and had a ponytail pulled on his arm and said, “My grandpa...”","Pale-faced, the old man coughed in obvious physical discomfort and begged, “Can you make an exception...”","Impatient, the priest brushed him onto the ground and shouted, “Do you take me as a beggar?!”","“Grandpa... Grandpa!” The little held onto the old man and cried.","“Mr. Senior Priest,” a younger priest dressed in a priest’s robe said in a low voice, “The tribute that we collected today... hehe... is almost enough.","“The rest...”","“Continue!” The senior priest said with a snort, “Who said that it’s enough?”","He pointed at the long line behind them and said, “There are so many devoted followers; who said that it’s enough?”","“I can tell you clearly,” the priest said in a cold voice, “The humans in this world have angered the gods, and godly punishment will come soon. When it comes, none of you sinners can escape!”","The people standing in the back of the line all went crazy.","...","– In the Innumerable-Immortal Sea in the endless void –","On the cliff over the surging white clouds, a figure looked down on the world.","His gaze turned toward the world beyond the sky instead of the land beneath his feet.","“Mr. Gui Ye!” A figure behind him bowed with respect.","“You’re wondering... why I made such a big fuss out of this insignificant incident and some overconfident mortals?”","“I dare not.”","This figure waved his hand, and a streak of horrifying immortal lightning shot past a flying bird and crashed toward a huge golden roc in the sky.","In the next moment, the flying bird turned into dust!","He said with a snicker, “While we move forward in a huge ship, an ant happens to rest on our path. Do you think the ant will be shattered, or will this huge ship will be knocked over?”","“Do you understand now?”"]},{"number":821,"title":"Chapter 821","paragraphs":["Chapter 821: If I Could Hear Dao in the Morning, I May Die in the Evening Without Regret!","Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Faction Master... what should we do?!” Elder Xiao Yunhe looked at Faction Master Feng Xuehe and asked.","At this moment, the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master and people from other major factions also stood up.","“Seniors, what do you think?” Even the Heavenly Faction Master must show respect to seniors like the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master. Feng Xuehe bowed slightly and asked them.","Everyone looked grim.","“This isn’t a small issue.” They exchanged a look; they had never looked so grim before.","The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked at the people of Heavenly Faction and said, “Tell us what happened without omitting any details.”","Soon, these people told them the details of what happened to Elder Feng Yan who was guarding the back mountain and the Ancestral Master’s Shrine.","The black-robed Elder Dugu Xiao from the Heavenly Faction said angrily, “We’ve worshipped these immortals for generations in the past thousands of years with incense sticks. Our faction was in the danger of collapse several times and had to be on guard of the invasions from the godly palaces from the West Continent. However, we received no protection from these immortals. Despite the death of our elders and faction masters, we managed to survive! We just treated them as if they didn’t exist!”","“But now...” Elder Dugu Xiao sneered, “The moment that our Heavenly Faction obtained some progress, they begin to threaten us and give us pressure.”","“Yuck! They just don’t want us to progress!”","“But...” The white-robed Elder Xiao Yunhe sighed, “The thing is that we are no match for them. Fighting those existences is like hitting a rock with an egg. We must think carefully.”","The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master, Dugu Yi, and others exchanged a look and squinted their eyes.","...","– Meanwhile, in shops like the one in Jiuhua City and Half City –","The cultivators and warriors obviously had also received the same message.","The Taixi Faction Master, the leader of one of the Three Saint Factions, sat in the grand hall in the faction and felt dejected.","“It has been so many years...” The old Daoist dressed in a purple robe looked at the dark sky out of the hall with a lost expression. The dark sky looked as if a destructive catastrophe was brewing. He couldn’t help but wonder if the gods would get so angry that they would turn the mortal world upside-down.","“I had dreamed of seeing an immortal. Today, I finally got my wish, but...” He had never looked so melancholic and lost before.","Even he, a famous major faction master, sat on this couch in a daze with coldness in his heart.","“Stay away from them and forget the past. This is the only way that you can still live.”","These words were tossed out casually.","To forget certain things meant that they would return to their previous state.","“Faction Master...” Beside him, Elder Disciple Ling Wanyin tried to speak but didn’t know what to say.","Yes, in the shop, they were not as powerful as those experienced old players. Maybe they were just insignificant figures here.","At this moment, Ling Wanyin felt like an ant that would be turned to dust by one casual trample of the huge ancient ship full of immortals and gods.","Others might have a little bit more confidence with prizes from the shop.","Yes, facing such existences, these people only had a little bit of confidence.","However, people from other factions such as Ling Wanyin had no confidence at all.","Perhaps a small voice whispered from within, Let’s back off this time... after all, they are true immortals... not the weak demons or monsters that we had faced in the past. The place where these existences stand is the destination that we have dreamed about!","The only compromise that they needed to make was forgetting some unrealistic dreams they shouldn’t have harbored and living as they had lived before.","– In Connate Cliff –","“They will remain alive by paying such a small price. I think they know what to choose...” In the distant peak in the void, immortal clouds surged up in the Innumerable Immortal Sea while the clouds beyond the sky looked as radiant as silk.","There was an extremely magnificent immortal palace hovering high in the air. Standing in the great hall of the palace, Gui Ye told the immortals around him with conviction.","But...","This was the last memory that they wanted to lose.","“In here, I witnessed vast worlds that I’d never dared to imagine. In here, I realized the true meaning of being a cultivator. There are many other things here I’ve learned.”","“Faction Master...”","The purple-robed old man stood up slowly. “Wanyin...”","His face seemed to have aged even more, but his turbid eyes turned brighter. “I remember a saying, ‘If I could hear Dao in the morning, I may die in the evening without regret.’”","“My... memory isn’t good; do you remember this saying?”","“Yes,” the most outstanding disciple of the Taixi Faction bowed and answered, “It’s from the Li Ren Chapter of the Analects of Confucius. It’s a book that records the words and deeds of an ancient saint.”","While supporting himself with an ebony walking cane, the faction master walked to the front of the hall with Ling Wanyin’s help.","Suddenly, a hot white lightning bolt exploded on the square before him, and thunder resonated in the sky. Many low-level disciples hid in their rooms and shivered.","“Today, I think I’m such a person... who just heard Dao.” His slightly bent figure stood straight under the lightning bolts flashing in the sky. While pointing at the sky, he said, “Perhaps I’d rather die for it?”","Boom!","The winds howled while thunderbolts danced wildly, illuminating this cultivator who stood tall and proud between the sky and the land. It seemed like the flashes of lightning were engraving the soul of this cultivator, who had spent all his life on the pursuit of Dao, into the sky.","...","– Jiuhua City Shop –","“To stay away from the shop...” The old cultivators from the Wuwei Daoist Alliance in the Jiuhua City Shop looked out of the shop.","At this moment, the low-level cultivators and warriors didn’t even dare to venture out, but there were still many people in the shop.","They were people who would look calm even if Tai Mountain collapsed before them.","“Immortals?! Tribulations?! We’re not afraid!” Nalan Hongwu said coldly.","“They think that we don’t dare to do anything even if they unleash godly punishment?!” In the Half City Shop, Demonic Woman Ning Bi revealed the intense murderous spirit that she had never shown in the shop. Like a prehistoric major demon, she showed her chilly fangs.","“There’s nothing to be afraid of!” In the Yuanyang City Shop, Gu Tingyun said chillily.","“If you dare to touch one inch of the mortal land...” On the shore of the Heavenly Abyss Sea, the two black figures revealed their chilly gazes. “We’ll make you repay one hundredfold!”","On Sanfen Field in Wind and Cloud, the old Sword Saint showed people the unyielding spine of a swordsman. With his sword spirit that even the world and the fate couldn’t distinguish, he unleashed that dazzling sword strike named Sword 23.","When the Qionghua Faction fell from the sky in the Legend of Sword and Legend 4, only the young man who took control of his fate from the Heavens could create the miracle of shooting down Qionghua with one arrow.","...","Although those things were in the past, they had obtained courage from these memories. They lifted their heads and stood tall. This world witnessed their growth of not only strength but the vision and courage which were the integral parts of cultivators and warriors!"]},{"number":822,"title":"Chapter 822","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[System upgrade progress: 45%]","At this moment, Fang Qi received a message from the System.","[Task: Challenger’s Tutorial School (Intermediate)","Task Target: 1) Help the muggle students become masters, 2) Help 80% of the students reach Grandmaster Level (Battle Skills), 3) Help the best students become challengers","Completeness: 1) 65%, 2) 33%, 3) 0%","Task Reward: The Soul of Cinder*1, System Upgrade Big Gift Bag*1, 5-day access to the new upgraded system cultivation room]","[Synchronization Pendant Upgrade: After upgrading, it can store energy. The limit of stored energy is broken down into ten levels, and 10,000 magic crystals will be the equivalent of one level. Each level can be used to reduce the synchronization percentage requirement and increase synchronization time.]","Mr. Fang got the Synchronization Pendant when he first received the Game Cultivation Room. It was used as a medium between the cultivation room and the game characters. Mr. Fang looked at the pendant dangling before his chest and wondered, This was also upgraded?","Besides the upgrading of the pendent, he saw more new content.","[Dungeon Fighter Online’s new expansion is updated. Host can choose a date to release it.]","[World of Warcraft’s new expansion: Wrath of the Lich King has begun its promotion process. The cinematic trailer of Wrath of the Lich King has been released.]","[The Journey to the West is 95% complete and will be done in three days. The countdown begins.]","[Wukong, the Monkey King, Champion Gift Bag in League of Legends will be released in one week. The promotion will begin in three days.]","[While the System is upgrading, the Host must manage the shops well and keep things in order.]","“The initial upgrade... is completed?!” Fang Qi looked at the System Interface in pleasant surprise and with expectation.","...","As the promotion of the new expansion of World of Warcraft began, another horrifying godly weapon – Frostmourne began to reveal a part of its horrifying power.","– In the Canglan City Shop –","“The trailer for the new expansion of World of Warcraft?!” As local knights in Canglan City, the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion came to the internet café each day regardless of what happened.","Today, they came to the shop each holding an umbrella.","The moment that they sat down, they saw a QQ message popping out.","Although the release time wasn’t set yet, and many groups of players hadn’t seen Illidan in the current expansion yet, let alone the Warblades of Azzinoth, not everyone was a fan of PVE, and not every player craved for these things.","However, every World of Warcraft player knew about the storyline, which meant that they could still watch the trailer of the new expansion despite their slow progress in the game.","Right now, the Lich King was a distant legend for the World of Warcraft players. Only the players of the small game, Warcraft, in Qzone knew that the Lich King brought them the same horror and suppression as the three destructive demon lords in Diablo 2.","The horrifying spirit energy that could erode the minds of ultimate masters was especially creepy.","“What’s this Wrath of the Lich King?!” The knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion and the elves who had just entered the shop immediately watched it.","Nearby, St. Leidon and St. Willy who had just opened Diablo 2 also looked over.","This game was one of the games that they had obtained during the promotion activity of ‘buy ten and get one free’ in the shop. It was one of their favorite games, and they played many games such as Dark Souls, Diablo, League of Legends, and World of Warcraft.","Although the saint-level masters were more interested in the first three games and picked two of them to be their main games, they were also interested in the story of World of Warcraft.","Immediately, they began to watch it.","In the chilly ice which had been frozen for countless years was the vague shape of an ice-sealed throne.","In the chilly ice that had been frozen for countless years, one could see the cold armor with black metal glares and the figure sitting on its eternal throne. On its righthand-side stood a silverish-grey two-handed great sword that had a special shape.","Frostmourne was the godly weapon that was forged by demons and contained the great evil power of the Lich King. The goat demon head engraved on the crossguard and the strange and mysterious runes on the body of the sword gave people a strong sense of its evil power.","At this moment, gloomy blue flames leaped up in the dark holes inside the armor. Then, the eyes lit up.","Before them was a wasteland covered in ice and snow. There was no life or anything signaling the existence of life.","When the accumulated snow was brushed away, the ice underground which contained endless frost that had accumulated for many years began to crack.","“Bone Dragon-!?” While the viewers exclaimed, the most horrifying undead legion in the world spread all over the mountains and fields!","...","– Meanwhile, in the Yuanyang City Shop –","“It’s said that Dungeon Fighter Online’s new expansion is releasing today?” The people from the Ultimate West Realm were still playing Dungeon Fighter Online. They had tried other games, but this was their favorite.","Of course, streamers such as the Black Light Sword Saint who had become famous due to Dungeon Fighter Online didn’t forget this game. After graduating from the old expansion, they had gradually decreased their time in the game.","When they heard about a new expansion, which was said to be an unprecedented major expansion, was going to be released, they returned to the game immediately.","On the other side, others such as Nalan Mingxue and Song Qingfeng found that their wish had come true; a new expansion had indeed come out.","“Should we enter the game and check it out?” Song Qingfeng asked.","Although it was an old game, they had many memories about it.","King’s Ruin, Screaming Cavern, and the Vilmark – Area 50 with the mechanical bull...","They wondered what happened to the elf girl named Seria whom they had rescued.","Besides, the new expansion would open the Second Awakening, and it was worth a try.","“Anyway, I don’t have matches today and can take a break.” Nalan Mingxue logged into the game cheerfully.","“Say...” Song Qingfeng looked up at the sky outside the shop subconsciously and said worriedly, “Are we really in trouble?”","“Those immortals and gods... I wonder how powerful they really are. Will they...”","Perhaps those existences could destroy this world with a wave of their hands.","“Don’t think about things that you can’t control.” Nalan Mingxue looked at her screen and saw her level that stopped at 70. After clicking open her friend list, she found that most of them had turned grey.","But some of them were still online.","A private message popped out.","[Sia whispered, “Ya? You’re online?!”]","“F*ck... What are these new sets of equipment?” Song Qingfeng watched as Nalan Mingxue choose to browse the equipment and found that Sia was wearing some equipment that they never seen before. “They look awesome...”","[Yeah. I came back to have a look.] Nalan Mingxue still remembered that these people who had lived in the bitter cold big snow mountains naively claimed to guard this beautiful continent. She replied quickly, [I wonder what is going to happen in the new expansion that is about to be released today.]","[Haha!]","The Arad Continent was still beautiful and vibrant, not losing any glory and glamour due to the departure of any players.","The streets of Hendon Myre and the West Coast looked the same as they had been.","In the forest, the elf bard played light music, looking relaxed. Suddenly, as if sensing something, he looked up at the sky involuntarily.","At this moment, countless players all looked up at the sky without thinking.","Countless birds flew out from the beautiful jade-green forest surrounding Hendon Myre. There were so many of them that they looked like black surging floods.","Alarmed, they left their nests where they had lived in peace for countless years and flew to the distance.","Or more accurately, they fled!","The black sky and black birds drew a sharp contrast with the snow-white Hendon Myre, a miracle in the desert. The nightly breeze blew by and seemed to be singing a sad eulogy for Hendon Myre.","Countless adventurers walked out from the taverns and dojos onto the streets. Looking up at the sky, they seemed to sense that an unimaginable big event would happen in this world."]},{"number":823,"title":"Chapter 823 - Destruction Era!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","When the players first started the game, it was a relatively peaceful game that didn’t have fierce battles in cities as in the Legend of Mir 2 or encounters between the opposing factions as in World of Warcraft. There were only battles of wits and courage in the Shadow Thunderland.","From that bright blue Storm Pass covered in white snow, they stumbled their way to Empyrean and then Pandemonium.","It was an uneventful story of adventures.","But their peaceful life was turned upside-down in this instant!","On their way to Empyrean and Pandemonium, the adventurers increased their strength continuously and began to understand some of the cores in this world.","At the beginning of the universe, everything was chaotic. One day, a great will appeared and created everything including the Arad Continent, and his power illuminated this land.","He gradually gained a name – Origin Light, Carloso.","When there is light, there is darkness. When the world was created, darkness also fell in this endless universe. Accidentally, it was turned into 12 powerful gods by the powerful people of Terra.","They could be called gods, Bellatrixes, or apostles.","However, light was opposite to darkness, and a war finally broke out between them and destroyed everything. After Carloso was defeated, the 12 powerful existences only had awareness left in them and drifted in the endless universe again.","This was the beginning of the entire Arad Continent.","The origin and the creator of the world was defeated, and the tens of thousands of laws in the universe were broken. That was why the Arad Continent had such strange phenomena, including weird transfers and the endless appearances of abyss demons coming from alternate dimensions.","...","At this moment, countless players were looking up at the chaotic sky above Hendon Myre and the West Coast.","The depths of this void was at a location in another dimension.","The whole space rotated around this center while countless dimensional fragments began to gather under the suction of this force.","Not only the oasis-like and beautiful Hendon Myre, but the whole Arad Continent began to turn desolate. More and more people noticed the weird phenomenon in the sky, and they stared at it, forgetting whatever they had been doing. For an unknown reason, they had an ominous feeling in their minds.","In that unknown dimension, a confused warrior walked over slowly.","No one knew where he came from. At this moment, nebulas spun in his chest as if a mini-universe was hidden in it.","In the shadow under light, they seemed to see the creator of this world in the depths of the universe.","In the light and flames, the most magnificent figure in the universe condensed slowly before this confused warrior.","Dressed in a holy golden battle robe, this figure had a halo, which represented the beginning of the world, behind his head while his figure began to gather and solidify.","Then, he reached out his arm toward the mysterious warrior.","When their hands touched, a radiant golden light beam turned everything around them golden.","Carloso had once disintegrated into countless shadows and disappeared. Now, these shadows began to solidify behind him with dazzling golden and holy lights.","Like the countless shadow doppelgangers, the warrior before Carloso was the last shadow doppelganger, and he finally returned.","Streaks of golden light rotated and shone on this desolate alternate dimension.","The energy, perhaps the most powerful in the universe and had once scattered in different places, now combined into one.","While the energy gathered, a part of it spilled out during the process.","The golden lightning bolts and white-hot energy beams spilling out were insignificant to Carloso, but they violently spread out from this dimension like countless huge ancient dragons that were running wild.","Then, the space cracked.","Among the countless rolling mountains, countless star lights gathered in one spot and then exploded violently!","A beam of lightning energy pierced the sky that was covered in dark clouds!","A hole appeared in the sky as if it got penetrated, and people could see the dazzling river of stars in the endless starry sky.","Even the river of stars lost its color when this bright beam appeared.","The horrifying energy instantly squeezed out everything including air, lightning bolts, gusts, and trees...","Pushed by this horrifying energy, everything in the world spread out like surging ocean waves like a destructive light shield!","The land cracked, and giant pieces were pushed up and formed tall cliffs before shattering. The seemingly endless energy spread out in great waves with explosive force.","“Look over there...!” The Ultimate West Realm players in Hendon Myre pointed at the other end of the world and said in horror.","Countless people heard his yell and looked over.","What a sight they saw...","A lightning bolt connected the sky and the earth.","With lights that seemed to come from the endless chaos, everything exploded in the distant horizon.","The streak of extremely horrifying energy expanded at a visible speed. Instantly, it grew as high as the sky and continued to enlarge!","Even from the distance, they could still sense the tremendous force of that energy.","“What’s that-!?” Sia pointed at the distance in horror and yelled.","Beside her, Gabriel and Luo Piaoling also looked over.","Countless players who were online also turned their gazes over.","“What’s that?!”","“What’s happening over there?!”","“What’s up?!”","All the people in the city and the neighboring cities were yelling as they watched the energy, containing turbid gusts, rainstorms, thunder, lightning bolts, and even mountains, sweeping across every corner of the world between the sky to the land.","It had turned into a horrifying destructive light wall. It had been far away when people spotted it. However, when they reacted, they could already hear the howls of winds, the roars of the thunder and the land, and surging ocean waves.","When they tried to do something subconsciously, everything was shattered ranging from the distant high mountains to the snow-white West Coast port and the miraculous Sky Tower leading to Empyrean.","The land behind them would be the next to be turned into dust in this catastrophe.","At this moment, the bold promises that the players had made when they first stepped onto this continent echoed in their minds.","This beautiful continent was a part of their youthful dream.","Ultimate Slay: Tempest.","Ghost 7: Furious Blache.","Extreme Overkill.","...","One by one, the names of these powerful skills... their hoarse roars in prior battles flashed across their minds.","“A sword may conquer the flesh, but only your heart may conquer the mind...”","“The core principle of martial arts is to become one with nature...”","Their trainers’ teachings echoed in their ears.","“Luo Piaoling...” Sia pulled on the sleeve of the warrior standing beside her.","Vaguely, they remembered that these so-called barbarians who had lived in the big snow mountains had been fascinated by this beautiful world at first glance.","They had once playfully promised that if one day, someone tried to destroy this world, they would fight to the death without any regrets.","“Nooo-! Ahhh-!”","“Tempest-!” They saw a figure charging at the destructive light wall.","In the darkness, countless lights flashed as the surrounding space was shattered!","However, in the next moment, everything including the person who used this skill was swallowed by this horrifying energy!","“Extreme Overkill-! Ahh-!” Gabriel yelled hoarsely and charged forward like a madman.","Then, his whole body, together with the once unrivaled sword energy, turned into dust. Blood mist sprayed around like a shower.","“Ghost 7: Furious Blache!”","“Ha-!”","Everything was swallowed!","Everything on the continent where the warriors had adventured on and guarded together was destroyed."]},{"number":824,"title":"Chapter 824 - As the shop owner, I can only give you this advice...","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Countless people who were online in the game had seen the beauty of this place and experienced lots of leisure and fun times here.","They also witnessed its destruction.","Of course, not everyone died in the catastrophe. In the horrifying energy explosion, time and space started to distort.","Some of them snapped back to their senses and found that they were on another continent.","There were many familiar faces, but many things were different.","For example, the place where they were standing was Underfoot Town instead of Hendon Myre.","Yes, it was the Underfoot Town where the headless knight guarded the gate.","They even saw the male slayer trainer, the blind old man named G.S.D, but this was the place where they had fought countless monsters.","What was more? Everything was in the opposite position. Storm Pass had been to the west of Underfoot Town, but now it was located to the east and had turned into a desolate ice cliff.","The Sky Rift to the north of Underfoot Town was now to the south of this world. In the ruined Sky Rift, a waterfall appeared, and it flowed upward instead of downward.","They seemed to be in another world in which everything was the mirror image of the original world. It was an astonishing change.","Some people called this the ‘Great Transfer’, after which time and space were distorted while the events in the past and in the future were turned upside-down.","Some people survived the huge catastrophe and were transferred by the distorted time-space continuum into another continent which was similar to but different from the previous one; some people were turned into dust with the old continent.","At this moment, everyone’s minds turned blank in disbelief.","With vague speculations, many people began to accept the fact after some time.","...","In the Canglan City Shop, Sala and other elves were talking...","“I heard that the so-called Dungeon Fighter Online released a new expansion. Should we go and check it out?”","“Why?” Rowling asked in bafflement on the side.","“I heard that it has awesome scenery!” Sala said happily, “Many people recommended it to us. Now that the new expansion is out, should we take this opportunity and check it out?”","“Scenery?!” Elder Sewell looked over in surprise.","“Yeah,” Sala said, “People say that there’s a Sky Tower which looks like a miraculous piece of architecture. Should we go and check it out?”","“Okay! Okay!” Hearing that there was good scenery, the elves were motivated. “Dungeon Fighter Online seems to be a game that is free of charge. We can just enter and play!”","“Let’s go and try it...” one elf said cheerfully.","It was wonderful that they could view the scenery without paying for it!","Then, they all entered the game.","– One hour later –","With great efforts, they came into the new city. Like those warriors before them, they looked around curiously and felt like everything was new.","“Sala, where’s Sky Tower that you mentioned...” Rowling squatted down on the roadside in a huff. “We’ve looked for it for so long and still can’t find it...”","“Um... They told me that it’s to the west of Hendon Myre.” Sala looked at the city in bafflement.","“Maybe that person was exaggerating about the magnificence of the Sky Tower?” Rowling said in displeasure.","“Let’s ask someone about it.” At this moment, Elder Sewell said this.","“Okay.” Sala nodded and said, “Let’s ask a veteran player.”","“Look at that guy... he looks awesome with those great items! He must be a veteran player!”","...","Luo Piaoling, who was doing quests to level up, saw a group of players walking toward him.","“Hello. How come we can’t find Sky Tower?”","“...” He was silent for a long time. Seeing their sincere and expectant faces, he had a complicated expression on his face.","He seemed to have lots to say, but whenever he opened his mouth, he was at a loss for words.","With deep regret, he said after a long pause, “Sorry, we failed to protect Arad.”","...","Perhaps the stories of these adventures had ended here with that world.","...","– In Yuanyang City –","“Sir–!”","At this moment, Mr. Fang was listening to songs while playing League of Legends. Suddenly, a voice message popped out from QQ. He clicked on it and was almost deafened by the yell from the message.","“Who is it...” Mr. Fang looked at it in a bad mood. “Sia?”","When did I add her as a friend...?","After some thinking, he remembered that she was the first customer who had deposited millions of crystals in her membership card as soon as she bought the card. It was normal for her to be on his friend list.","“What’s wrong...” Mr. Fang said sulkily.","...","In the Yuanyang City Shop, a blonde woman cried her heart out with her head resting on the computer desk. “Our Arad Continent... exploded! Wu–!”","She gestured at the screen to Mr. Fang and cried, “We were playing the game and doing window shopping... then, it exploded!”","“You see... everything was fine a moment ago!”","Dungeon Fighter Online was the favorite game of the people from the Ultimate West Realm.","Of course, some other veteran players were also playing the game. They all looked at the shop owner with anger and bafflement. “Sir, this... what’s happening?!”","Mr. Fang was confused, thinking, Hiss-? It’s fine that you come to me when you don’t understand the games or can’t clear some stages. How come you are coming to me to protest the explosion of the Arad Continent?","“As the shop owner, I can only give you this advice...”","“Um... Ignore those things.” Mr. Fang clicked open the official website and said, “Look, the new expansion is about to be released. There’s Aton Dungeon, the biggest dungeon in the history of Dungeon Fighter Online. There is also the Second Awakening.”","Sia looked toward the spot where Mr. Fang pointed.","“Look,” Mr. Fang continued, “On May 1st, we’ll release the Labor Day’s Gift Bag and new Labor Day fashion outfits with gift box. There is a high chance that you might get a Pure Golden Amplification Grimoire and Amplification Protection Vouchers. It’s not May 1st yet, but they are on pre-sale now.”","Amplify was an enhancement method stronger than Reinforcement. As everyone knew, when the equipment reached level 10 reinforcement, any more reinforcement that ended in failure would break the equipment, and all the previous efforts would be wasted.","Meanwhile, it was extremely difficult to acquire superior equipment in Dungeon Fighter Online, so...","“Amplification Protection Vouchers?!” Sia looked at Mr. Fang’s screen and saw not only Amplification Protection Vouchers but items such as the Abyss Orb as well. They were all good items that were rarely seen. The most important was that there were no trash items in the gift bags, and the buyers were guaranteed to have rare items when they opened them!","If it was true, then...","Sia began to imagine herself equipped with sets of equipment amplified to level 14 or 15. In the past, she didn’t even dare to think of it since any failure in reinforcement would destroy the equipment. The situation changed!","“Is this gift bag really so good?” Sia looked at Mr. Fang with excitement and asked.","“Huh?!” Her gaze moved down and saw the promotion which offered more bonus rewards when buying more things with the upper limit set at ten sets of gift bags. For example, if she bought three sets, she would get a level 80 superior chest of her own choice; if she bought eight sets, she would get a random level 85 superior weapon chest which is the current highest level; and if she bought ten sets, she would get a unique title.","“Are these... really free?!” With glinting eyes, she looked at Mr. Fang in amazement.","Then, she got confused. “These precious things sell for only about 200 crystals each? Aren’t you going to lose money by giving out all these bonus rewards?!”","“Of course they are free. This is a special promotion to help adventurers challenge the more powerful monster – Apostle Anton.”","“Apostle Anton?!”","It must be noted that it was the previous forms of these apostles who had battled with Carloso, the god of creation. Although the game didn’t elaborate on this part of the story, many details showed that the wills of those 12 gods drifting into the depths of the universe were related to the apostles who were now on the top of the world.","Would the god of creation who had destroyed Arad Continent also enter a dungeon one day?!","“I must work hard to get stronger!” She had never looked so determined before. “I have seven characters. Each account can buy one set... which means that I need three more sets to get the most rewards. Maybe I shouldn’t buy so many?”","“No... I can’t miss this opportunity to grow stronger! If I get stronger, one day, I will be able to battle Carloso!”","Instantly, she had a determined look on her face. “I’ll buy ten sets!”","“I’ll take six sets!”","“I’ll buy eight sets!”","“I want to grow stronger. I’ll buy ten sets too! Carloso, you shall die!”","Instantly, the whole shop turned boisterous!","...","Mr. Fang glanced at the System Interface which showed, [Creation of Journey to the West is speeding up...]","[The System Upgrade is speeding up...]"]},{"number":825,"title":"Chapter 825 - Monkey?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– Meanwhile, in the Canglan City Shop –","“A monkey!?” The elves had entered Dungeon Fighter Online to see the scenery but saw none. Then, they each bought two to three gift bags. While feeling like they might not be able to guard the Arad Continent without money, they were listening to Mr. Fang as he revealed the information about the new TV Series.","The saint-level masters such as Gulth were among the people standing around Mr. Fang.","They had heard that it was about a stone, and now it changed to a monkey?!","The problem was...","What is there to see about a monkey...?","“Not interested!” With a wave of his claws, Gulth went back to play World of Warcraft.","Right now, he was raiding an old instance, Blackwing Lair. He murmured to himself in a muffled deep voice, “The dragon in this instance is very powerful, even though it’s a bit outdated now. But I heard that its father, called something like ‘Deathwing’, is even more powerful. I think I might discuss what a catastrophe is with it.”","“Aiya... monkeys are not interesting!” The elves also complained. “We don’t want to watch this kind of TV Series!”","As art-loving elves, they were fans of beauty to some degree. If the main character was good looking, they would still watch despite the boring content.","But... monkeys?!","Then, they went back to play Dungeon Fighter Online, After all, as fans of scenery, if they didn’t care about equipment, they could play any game including World of Warcraft and Dungeon Fighter Online. “There’s an elf class in this game too!”","“We can enjoy the scenery in this game too! What are you playing?”","“I’m playing as a rogue. It’s said that this is a new class in this expansion.”","“I’m playing as an elven knight which seems to be a new class too.”","“I’m playing as this Lightbringer... Huh? How come you can change into an elf, but I can’t?”","“Let’s go and check out some good scenery.” Although they didn’t have money and thus couldn’t protect the Arad Continent, they still could dress beautifully and go out to enjoy the scenery that this world offered.","...","With the expansion of Mr. Fang’s shops, the games and TV Series in the shop could be divided into two big categories and some smaller divisions due to the differences of the cultivation systems of the players.","The two big categories were naturally divided according to the oriental and occidental systems in the games.","For players from the East Continent and the Continent of Immortal Relics, TV Series such as the Turbulent Homeland as well as games such as the Legend of Sword and Fairy and even Dungeon Fighter Online and the Legend of Mir 2 were more to their liking.","It was why these games had more players from these continents. Of course, when these games were popular, there had been many players and viewers coming from the West Continent too.","Likewise, the games such as Dark Souls, Assassin’s Creed, and the old game Diablo 2 which had recently become popular in the West Continent always had many fans in the Canglan City Shop.","Even when the new expansion of World of Warcraft continued to gain popularity in different shops, many players such as those in the Continent of Immortal Relics still continued with their explorations in the world of Legend of Sword and Fairy, Dungeon Fighter Online, and the Legend of Mir 2.","Likewise, when the viewers in the shops were stunned by the appearance of Qi Tiandi in the Turbulent Homeland, many players in Canglan City were quietly playing World of Warcraft or challenging the horrifying monsters in Dark Souls.","Of course, some were limited by their own talents. For example, some people with good talent could obtain inspirations from the ultimate godly techniques that were casually used by Qi Tiandi in the Turbulent Homeland. But others... emmm... would be better off trying other stuff.","Some excelled in heavy weapons, some in magic spells, some in sword control technique, and some in the study of spiritual artifacts and machinery...","Despite all this, some saint-level masters and many other players in the West Continent were engrossed in the study of item combination in Diablo 2, trying to find the method to fight the last three Uber Demon Lords. Also, they searched for the countless secrets hidden in the world of Dark Souls. Lastly, with great efforts, they fought Illidan, the powerful demon coming from over 10,000 years ago in World of Warcraft while understanding these great figures’ stories in Warcraft.","We all have our own favorite games and stories. In these touching stories, we have different beliefs and perspectives. Then, why should we play and watch the games and TV Series which have different structures and power systems?","Furthermore, the people of West Continent didn’t even have enough time to play all the games and watch all the movies such as World of Warcraft, Dark Souls, StarCraft, Diablo, Final Fantasy, and Resident Evil after everything was released.","They only had a vague idea about Xianxia and Wuxia, and few of them would spend much time to study them.","It was so with average people and more so with higher-level existences.","...","“Such insignificant... and lowly creatures...” Standing on the top of the endless godly mountains, the palace-like fortress had a layer of light snow on the walls.","With golden pupils and a silver godly crown that was hovering above her head as if it was supported by a godly force, this woman’s face looked like a statue made of white jade and oozed a casual and natural nobleness.","Standing next to her was a man wearing five-colored godly armor and looking as dazzling as the sun.","“Radiant Light... tsk, tsk,” the woman said mildly, “I heard... the mortal nation under your control is in trouble again?","“The Godly Court has entrusted the whole issue to the Innumerable Immortal Sea.” The woman sneered and said, “The God of Radiant Light Judgment is nothing in their eyes.”","This man’s face didn’t show any emotion. In fact, it seemed like he had the urge to smirk. “You underestimate me.”","“Oh?” The woman waited for him to continue.","“In my eyes, they are like a group of monkeys.” The man wearing five-colored godly armor had extremely handsome immortal features and an extremely dignified presence. “Do we need to dirty our hands to deal with a group of monkeys living in the most primitive wasteland and playing the lowliest tricks?”","He looked cold, showing no emotion on his face as if he didn’t feel any anger when he heard the woman’s rude words. He didn’t seem angry from the very beginning with the fact that he wasn’t entrusted with the task to deal with a group of ridiculous monkeys.","“Monkeys?”","“Are they...” The woman thought for a moment and seemed to remember the records about this kind of creature in the mortal world. “Are they the animals in the mortal world that will do funny tricks for bananas?”","The woman on the side couldn’t help but stifle a giggle. “Hehehehe...”","Yes, for these lofty existences, humans were just a group of monkeys in a cage. How much turbulence could the monkeys create anyway?"]},{"number":826,"title":"Chapter 826 - Water Curtain Cave in Flower-Fruit Mountain... Monkey King!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Hiss! Come and check this out! The official website of League of Legends has updated the big gift bag of a mysterious champion! It will be released one week later!”","“What?! We can finally buy that mysterious champion gift bag?!”","“I’ve saved for it for a long time now! I’ve been waiting for this new champion!”","“How come it also looks like a monkey?” The elves browsed the official website and exchanged a look when they saw the profile released on the website.","Then, they sent messages to complain to Mr. Fang. [Hey! Sir, can the game pass on the monkey?]","[🥺🥺 (*’*) Can you release another champion?]","At this moment, Xiaoyue also sent a complaining message. [Boss! This monkey doesn’t look awesome. Why don’t you release another dragon?]","[Don’t we have a dragon king already?] Mr. Fang replied.","Despite the Star Forger who was based on the oriental dragons, this little girl was still unsatisfied.","[That one is super cool! Hehe!]","“I think the shop should release a super powerful immortal.” Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin from the Heavenly Faction commented, “Every champion in League of Legends is powerful, but there aren’t powerful immortals.”","“You’re right!” The Heavenly Faction’s Eldest Senior Disciple, Zhuge Qinlong, also said, “The Shu Mountain Faction in the Legend of Sword and Fairy is indeed powerful, and their ancestral master even ascended to become an immortal, but it mainly tells the story happening in the mortal world. Why doesn’t it tell the story of their ancestral master? It would be awesome!”","“The story of the Legend of Sword and Fairy is trying to express something different.” Obviously a more observant player, Yu Yin rolled her eyes at him.","...","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","“Qingqing, the shop will release that Journey to the West tomorrow. Are you going to watch it?” Xu Zixin asked while playing the new expansion of Dungeon Fighter Online.","“Not very interested...” She caught herself half-way during speaking since she wanted to find out what Mr. Fang was up to.","“Um...” Shen Qingqing thought for a long moment. “If the price is fair, I might try it. Anyway, we don’t have any new releases of other TV Series to look out for these couple of days.”","“You have a point.”","...","On the other hand, Su Tianji was with her favorite disciples, Fenghua and Yuexin.","“Master! Master! Are you going to watch that Journey to the West tomorrow?” Seeing that the TV Series would be released tomorrow, Fenghua asked immediately.","After all, they had many games to play and TV Series to watch, so they must make good plans with their 10-hours of online time. They had no time for TV Series that were not interesting.","Besides, the most important and urgent issue they faced was that the mortal world was about to be struck with a catastrophe. Although they didn’t know how horrifying the descending gods and immortals would be, they had seen the powers of Qi Tiandi and Carloso.","Frightened by those scenes, the players needed to use every moment they had to obtain more strength, thus having no time to watch an irrelevant TV Series.","Even though the elves, fans of beautiful scenery, entered Dungeon Fighter Online to view the world, they also had the plan to learn powerful skills after the Second Awakening.","So...","“I wouldn’t watch a monkey...” Su Tianji caught herself half-way and thought for a moment. “Ugh... hehe, I think I will try it first! Just try it!”","Even though the new TV Series looked uninteresting, Mr. Fang had always been reliable, and so had the shop.","As one of the earliest customers, Su Tianji would try the poison for the shop and the shop owner. Anyway, she might find this TV series tolerable.","Although they couldn’t imagine how a TV Series with a monkey as the main character would be interesting, they thought that it didn’t hurt to try!","They had low expectations for it, but they would do it for the sake of friendship.","After all, they had been in the shop for years; it was natural to return the favor.","...","– On the next day –","Although some people including Xiaoyue, Su Tianji, Nalan Mingxue, and Gu Tingyun had claimed that they wouldn’t watch the TV Series...","In the Canglan City Shop, the elves, the members of the knight legion, and the assassins of the Assassin Brotherhood asked upon entering the shop, “Sir, the new TV Series was released today?”","“Huh?” Dozing at the counter, Mr. Fang suddenly woke up and replied. “Didn’t you say that you wouldn’t watch it?”","Regardless if it was good or not, these people would watch the new TV Series to create momentum for it and make the shop owner happy.","The elves had bought several Labor Day Gift Bags yesterday and heard that the bonus rewards were things the old players had been dreaming about but couldn’t buy!","We must be nice to the shop owner for that, right?","Therefore, they came over to show their support.","Of course, they couldn’t admit it to the shop owner. Otherwise, it would be humiliating for him to know that these people only watched his new TV Series just to do him a favor.","These groups of viewers denied, “We thought about it yesterday, and we think that this TV Series is quite novel. Hehe... we’ll try it!”","As if they were afraid that the shop owner would see through their scheme, they trotted over to the computers with flushed faces.","“These people...?” Mr. Fang looked in the direction that they took off to and scratched his head in bafflement.","Soon, some old customers in the old shops and some customers in the new shop began to watch Journey to the West either with a cup of Cappuccino or a bowl of instant noodles.","“Hundun wasn’t divided, and the world was in a mess. Everything was blurry, and no human could be seen.”","[TL Note: Hundun means primordial and central chaos in Chinese Mythology.]","“When Pangu broke the dense hundun apart, the pure and turbid could be distinguished from that moment on.”","[TL Note: Pangu is the first living being and the creator of all in some versions of Chinese mythology.]","“Every creature should be thankful to the world that birthed them, and Pangu earned a lot of merits for creating all things in the world.”","“If you want to know how the cycles of life work, you need to read the Journey to the West.”","Following Pangu’s construction of the world, the rule of the Three Sovereigns, and the laws of the Five Emperors, the world was divided into four great continents. They were the East Purvavideha Continent, the West Aparagodaniya Continent, the South Jambudvipa Continent, and the North Uttarakuru Continent.","[TL Note: These are the four ancient continents in Chinese Buddhism.]","[TL Note: The Three Sovereigns and Five Emperors were two groups of mythological rulers or deities in ancient northern China.]","The people in this world didn’t know the Three Sovereigns and Five Emperors, but the brief introduction summarized the ancient history of the whole world including the different continents and the achievements of Pangu as well as Three Sovereigns and Five Emperors.","The scene before them showed a great ocean with surging waves and weird-shaped boulders on a sharp and strange cliff.","Like an excellent painter, the story presented the key points of the entire history of the world and the vast universe to the viewers with only a few strokes.","“How is it? Is it good?” Some people were watching while standing behind the viewers. They didn’t have high hopes for this TV Series but still felt curious.","No one answered them.","They were quietly appreciating the picturesque scenes before them.","The story returned to the immortal mountain. On the mountain was an immortal stone, and on the stone were nine perforations and eight holes which corresponded to the Nine Palaces and the Eight Trigrams. Nourished by the essence of the sun and the moon, it gradually grew a spirit.","After many years of nourishment, it split open one day and gave birth to a stone monkey...","“This...?!” The elves covered their mouths with their hands while gasping, having never seen such a miracle before.","The cultivators and warriors in Jiuhua City were even more astonished.","The beams of golden light shooting from its eyes even disturbed the Celestial Jade Emperor in Heaven. Then, the viewers watched as it leaped into the Water Curtain Cave and received the loyalty of the other monkeys, becoming the Monkey King.","The viewers exclaimed, “Is this really a monkey...?!”","They recalled the trailer that they had watched and began to connect information such as the Flower-Fruit Mountain and the Water Curtain Cave.","Now looking at the Water Curtain Cave in the Flower-Fruit Mountain, they felt like the Monkey King...","“F*ck!?” Instantly, they felt like they had fallen into a deep pit.","“Where’s the next episode? Is there more?!”"]},{"number":827,"title":"Chapter 827 - The Mountain of Mind and Heart!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the world where Fang Qi had come from, not only the people in the east but also those from the west would gasp as soon as they saw the trailer.","But for the people in this world, they had only watched a few strange scenes before, so they certainly wouldn’t have the same reaction as the people from Fang Qi’s homeworld since they knew nothing about this story.","Subconsciously, they thought that it was just a story about a monkey.","Besides, the TV Series sold for an outrageous price for each episode!","But now, their thoughts gradually changed...","“How come... these monkeys are so smart?!” The elves felt amazed.","Su Tianji, Nalan Hongwu, and other people, who were the first group of viewers of the Journey to the West, watched the monkeys prostrate themselves before the monkey king and appoint officials and ministers, forming order and a dynasty. The viewers were greatly entertained when they watched the monkeys wander on Flower-Fruit Mountain during the day and live in the Water Curtain Cave during the night.","It was indeed an insouciant life on this happy and beautiful land.","Many years passed. Humans couldn’t escape the process of life and death, neither could the monkeys.","When one old monkey died of old age, the other monkeys all covered their faces and wept.","Therefore, they began to worry and said, “Although we aren’t subject to the laws of man and aren’t afraid of beasts, old age, and physical decay in the future can’t be avoided, and we are managed by the Yama, a god of death.”","In the whole world, only three species were not subject to Yama’s management, and they were the buddhas, the immortals, and the gods.","Therefore, the monkeys gathered immortal peaches and rare fruits, made a bamboo raft, and packed a bag for the Monkey King, seeing him off to the distant place to learn the way of immortality.","When this grand legend began to unfold before the people of this world, they had indescribable and complex feelings inside.","Perhaps this story wasn’t only a legend.","By now, these naive and simple-minded monkeys and the strange, imaginative, and naughty Monkey King, who had sprung out from a stone, began to take root in their minds.","“He just went off to find the way to immortality like this?!” The cultivators looked incredulous. He heard that there are immortals in the South Jambudvipa Continent and then embarked on a sea journey on a raft with a pile of fruits?!","It sounded like a tall tale.","“Can these monkeys really learn the way of immortality?!” The viewers wondered about the naivety of the monkeys. However, since they were monkeys, no one felt strange about the story.","There were great dangers in the sea. A small raft was a tiny vulnerable thing on the ocean.","If it were someone who was afraid of danger and challenge, the Monkey King would have died in the ocean long ago. However, the Monkey King who was determined to cross the ocean and learn the way of immortality finally managed to get onto the shore.","Going through big cities and visiting small towns, the Monkey King managed to survive but was still scorned and mocked as a strange species. After traveling for eight to nine years, he crossed the Great Western Ocean and came to the West Aparogodaniya Continent, and he heard that an old immortal lived in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars on the nearby Mountain of Mind and Heart.","Nothing was impossible to a willing heart. Yes, it was a legend, but the deep meaning contained in the story began to reach people in its own way.","While the viewers were happy that the Monkey King finally found an immortal residence, they were impressed by the Monkey King who was both naive yet determined, unworldly yet smart.","The viewers had felt novel while watching the previous events, and now they were impressed after watching the smart monkey travel from the East Purvavideha Continent to the West Aparagodaniya Continent and finally find the immortal residence after experiencing years of hardships even though success was elusive.","“Do you think the Monkey King will learn the way of immortality?” Su Tianji watched the monkey walk along the mountain path toward the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars and chatted.","Obviously, they were watching the Journey to the West together.","“Who is the immortal living in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars on the Mountain of Mind and Heart...?” Fenghua was more concerned with this issue. “He’s not famous... maybe he’s not powerful at all...?”","It must be noted that the immortals and gods in the current era were well known with stunning titles such as the God of Radiant Light Judgement, let alone the immortals living in the Innumerable Immortal Sea in the Immortal Realm.","In the world where Fang Qi came from, almost everyone would understand the words such as ‘Mountain of Mind and Heart’ and ‘Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars’. They would understand what a holy place this was without it being explained.","Of course, the people in this world knew nothing about such things. They were still talking, “Will the Monkey King only find a little immortal who doesn’t know the way of immortality?”","“Oh... then, wouldn’t all his efforts be in vain?” Fenghua said worriedly.","In the Canglan City Shop, the knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion were also talking about it. “Who do you guys think is more powerful, the immortal in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars or the Ancestral Master of the Shu Mountain Faction?”","“I think this immortal should be slightly more powerful but not as powerful as the Ninth Heaven Mystic Fairy,” others on the side commented.","After all, when they played the Legend of Sword and Fairy, the Ninth Heaven Mystic Fairy showed an unrivaled presence.","However, this Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars and the Mountain of Mind and Heart... the Monkey King only learned about the name of this immortal after asking a passing woodcutter. It seemed like these woodcutters would visit this immortal when they had time. While watching the TV Series together, the elves looked at the engraved words ‘Mountain of Mind and Heart, Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars’ when this stone monkey finally found the cave abode. They said to each other, “I feel like this must be an amiable old immortal but not a very powerful one.”","“Oh, even if he’s not a powerful immortal, he must be much more powerful than us,” one elf said, “Let’s follow the Monkey King into the cave. The scenery here is great!”","They saw mist and smoke in diffusive brilliance and the flashing lights from the sun and moon, and rare flowers and green-jade-like slim bamboos decorated the cave. The cranes spread out their wings, and a phoenix occasionally soared overhead, stirring five-colored clouds. It was well worth their money to watch such rare scenery for the fans of natural beauty!","Then, they saw Patriarch Subodhi solemnly sitting on the platform with about 30 little immortals standing below dressed in Daoist robes.","Before the real immortal, no one dared to make trouble, regardless if he was the ‘amiable old immortal’ that they had guessed or Patriarch Subodhi.","At this moment, like the monkey, the viewers all stood below the platform, feeling uneasy.","Even Patriarch Subudhi didn’t expect that anyone would come here by crossing two great oceans from the East Purvavideha Continent.","Seeing the patriarch almost kicking out the monkey since he thought that this monkey was lying, the viewers all worried for him.","The patriarch asked, “What’s your surname (xing)?”","The Monkey King answered, “I have no temper (xing). If a man rebukes me, I’m not offended; if he hits me, I’m not angered. In fact, I simply repay him with a ceremonial greeting and that’s all. My whole life’s without ill temper.”","[TL Note: Temper, Xing in Chinese, has the same pronunciation as surname, Xing.]","The viewers felt sad when they heard these words.","When they heard the patriarch giving him the name ‘Sun Wukong’ and his joyful shout, “I’ve got a name; I’ve got a master”, they were all touched.","The simple and innocent image of Sun Wukong began to take root in their minds.","For them, Sun Wukong had turned from a simple monkey to the vibrant and nimble Monkey King with flesh and blood.","So it was that, “At nebula’s parting he had no name. Smashing stubborn void needs Wake-to-the-Void (Wukong).”"]},{"number":828,"title":"Chapter 828 - Listening to Patriach Subodhi’s Teaching and Hearing Buddha’s Words – Learning from a Sage!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The Dao taught by Patriarch Subodhi on the Mountain of Mind and Heart had 360 heteronomous divisions which all resulted in Illumination.","Some of them were more powerful than the others.","The first one was Method division, which consisted of summoning immortals and working the planchette of divination by manipulating yarrow stalks, and of learning the secrets of pursuing good and avoiding evil.","The second was the Schools division which included the Confucians, the Buddhists, the Daoists, the Dualists, the Mohists, and the Physicians. They read scriptures or recited prayers, interviewing priests or conjuring up saints and the like.","The third was the Silence division which consisted of quiescence and inactivity, meditation and the art of cross-legged sitting. This division was similar to the hard cultivation in seclusion in this world to achieve a breakthrough.","The fourth was the Action division which included activities such as gathering the yin to nourish the yang and experimentation with alchemical formulas, burning bushes and forging cauldrons.","They were all practices to achieve immortality and Illumination.","[TL Note: Even though in the original novel, these practices can’t achieve immortality.]","After that, two senior brothers led Sun Wukong out of the patriarch’s lecture platform and taught him how to clean, water flowers and trees, and move and speak with courtesy.","Then, Sun Wukong learned the art of language and etiquette, calligraphy, and burning incense from his senior brothers. During other times, he listened to the discussions about the scriptures and the doctrines between his senior brothers.","At this moment, cultivators such as Su Tianji and Gu Tingyun, warriors such as Nalan Hongwu, and even members of the Demon Clan such as Xiaoyue all were watching the Journey to the West together.","“Hiss... Look at that spell!” While the disciples were discussing the scriptures, one of them demonstrated a spell, pushing a flame toward an ancient tree in the courtyard with the force from his palm.","Of course, as a disciple, he didn’t dare to damage the plants on the Mountain of Mind and Heart. The flame only left a small scorched mark on the ancient tree which was then withdrawn, leaving no traces. It didn’t show much power but demonstrated a high-level of control.","“Can we learn this?” Gu Tingyu looked at the spell and murmured, “It looks... not that difficult...”","Although the caster was the disciple of an immortal, this small spiritual spell looked easy to learn.","Gu Tingyu immediately started to copy the move.","On the other side, another disciple was practicing spell casting.","“Master, look at that person!” Fenghua pointed at this disciple and yelled, “What spell is he practicing?”","This disciple seemed to know both spiritual spells and martial arts. He would cast lightning bolts from his palms with great presence.","“Oh. I just heard that the name of the technique is Palm Thunder, which involves casting a thunderbolt from the center of your palm.” Su Tianji looked over and answered.","“Huh? Can we learn it?” Fenghua copied the move and said.","It looked easy.","“That’s easy. Let me demonstrate it...” Su Tianji ran over and copied the moves. “This is a small spell, just like the lightning spells that the beginners learn in our Liuyun Daoist Palace.”","At this moment, warriors such as Nalan Hongwu, Zong Wu, and Song Qingfeng saw that some disciples were practicing fist techniques and halberd skills, and they began to copy these moves. Although they couldn’t cast spells in this virtual reality world in the TV Series, they could still copy the moves.","On the Mountain of Mind and Heart, a monkey imitated the moves happily with a group of cultivators and warriors doing the same beside him.","“Ahey! This technique is intriguing!” Zong Wu imitated the moves twice and said with a laugh.","“Look at Sun Wukong! Hahaha... he was startled into a somersault!” the elves were amused by this scene.","“He picked up a stick to imitate the moves. Hahaha! So funny!”","...","Soon, the first episode ended.","A group of people stood behind Jiang Xiaoyue and asked, “You guys... Is it good or not?!”","“It’s expensive per episode. If it’s not good, I’ll not watch it.”","“Aya! It’s good! It’s good!” Xiaoyue replied impatiently and then eagerly activated the next episode without stopping.","Like the Legend of White Snake, this TV Series also had an opening theme song, which was called Immortal Sound Above Cloud Palace.","Ethereal musical notes rose with animated rhythm...","“Huh... is this the Heavenly Realm?” The scene of the Great Sage, the future title of the Monkey King, getting drunk in Jasper Pool flashed past, and then came the beautiful scenes of the Monkey King swimming in the ocean full of pretty corals.","“Where is this place...?” Before they knew it, they were gradually hooked by the TV Series even though they watched it just to do Mr. Fang a favor.","“I wonder if Sun Wukong will master powerful skills and the way of immortality and then tour the heavens and the bottom of the ocean?” The elves speculated among them.","“The rest of the story is about the Monkey King’s adventures all over the world?” Obviously, they couldn’t be more wrong with their speculation.","...","About seven years passed in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars.","Finally, they got a chance to see Patriarch Subodhi ascend the platform and take his high seat. Then, he began to lecture on the Great Dao.","As a sage, his words were so florid and eloquent that it seemed like golden lotuses were springing from his tongue. He lectured on every doctrine including Buddhist essence and Daoist truths.","His thunderous voice moved the Ninth Heaven while he lectured on both Daoist and Buddhist doctrines and even touched on Confucianism. The three schools had different practices, but he harmonized them effortlessly.","“This old immortal’s lecture is excellent!”","Su Wukong was so pleased with the lecture that he scratched his ear and rubbed his jaw, grinning widely and doing a little happy dance. The seemingly casual words in the lecture touched their hearts, and the cultivators and warriors also clapped their hands and praised lavishly.","“This true immortal’s lecture on Dao is indeed awesome!”","Of course, listening to the lecture from a true immortal in itself was an awesome thing.","Their goal was quite low since they didn’t have unrealistic ambitions or desires.","After all, most of them would count themselves fortunate if they could hear the lecture from a grand Ascendance Realm master.","At this moment in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars on the Mountain of Mind and Heart, they listened to the immortal’s lecture just like that described in the song, “Listening to the ethereal Sanqing ethereal’s teaching and hearing Buddha’s words.”","The lecture given by Patriarch Subodhi combined doctrines of Confucianism, Buddhism, and Daoism, and it included all the essences from these three schools and all the heteronomous, so the cultivators, warriors, and even non-humans were all enthralled by his words."]},{"number":829,"title":"Chapter 829 - 72 Transformations, Cloud Somersault, and Wondrous Way of Immortality!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“This old immortal’s lecture is...” At this moment, Elf Queen Kellybel was also listening to the lecture standing among the elves. After corroborating it with her previous insights, she found that the lecture touched many key points. After all, for her and other pinnacle stage saint-level masters, they only needed a little nudge to step over the threshold.","“In this West Aparagodaniya Continent, even a casual old immortal living on a mountain is so powerful...?” She looked surprised. “Are all people in this place like him?”","“No wonder he’s an immortal... he’s indeed extraordinary...”","Then, her heart lurched when she thought of the gods and immortals who were going to unleash terrifying catastrophes in the mortal world. If every immortal is so powerful, doesn’t it mean that the world is doomed?","After all, this immortal resided in the forest on a mountain that even woodcutters could enter. However, when Sun Wukong was born, they had seen the Heavens, and there were many golden and radiant immortal palaces which looked super powerful.","They knew that all the immortals were powerful, but it seemed like Patriarch Subodhi wasn’t as powerful as those in the Heavenly Court.","After all, the Heavenly Court was the special place governing the gods and immortals.","I wonder if this old immortal will teach more powerful skills...","The viewers didn’t have the slightest idea about godly punishment and great tribulations, but they knew that they must learn as many skills as they could.","At this moment, Patriarch Subodhi finally asked Sun Wukong what he wanted to learn.","He listed the four divisions among his 360 heteronomous divisions, including Method, Schools, Silence, and Action.","The viewers had watched and learned some of the skills of the four divisions during the past six to seven years while Sun Wukong lived in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars.","They felt...","They are fine... Anyway, these skills were from the immortal. Regardless if this immortal was powerful or not, he was still more powerful than them. Therefore, they had all learned these skills enthusiastically.","In the past, they just copied moves from the disciples, but now...","“The patriarch is going to personally teach the Monkey King?!” In the old shops, the cultivators and warriors were thrilled.","At this moment, they heard Sun Wukong ask, “Can I gain immortality by practicing like this?”","Of course, the Method division couldn’t achieve immortality without the support of cultivation strength.","With the Schools division, he needed to choose one school from Confucianism, Buddhism, and Daoism, read scriptures, and recite prayers. Although he could achieve immortality, it was like setting a pillar inside a wall. If the mansion decays one day, the pillar would fall with it.","The Silence division consisted of cross-legged sitting, quiescence and inactivity, exercises of complete stillness, and contemplations in solitary confinement. But with this practice, immortality was like unbaked bricks on a kiln. The bricks may have been molded into shape, but if they had not been tempered by water and fire, which represents great tribulations, a heavy rain would make them crumble.","As for the practice to achieve long life through alchemy and taking elixirs, it seemed to be a way to gain immortality but could only extend one’s life. After all, who could really make an immortality elixir? With this practice, immortality was just an illusion like the moon in the water.","“Then, I won’t learn these divisions!” The viewers watched as Sun Wukong refused to learn any of these divisions.","“Aiya! How come Sun Wukong refused to learn any of them?!” The viewers were confused.","After all, for average people, it seemed impossible that they would see the day when Confucianism, Buddhism, and Daoism crumpled or the great tribulations in which even gods and immortals couldn’t escape their demise. Therefore, they thought that the situations such as ‘setting a pillar inside a wall’ or ‘unbaked bricks in a kiln’ that the patriarch mentioned were just exaggerations!","“No... the patriarch is angry!” In various shops such as the Jiuhua City Shop and the Yuanyang City Shop, the cultivators stared at the screens, afraid that Patriarch Subodhi would get angry and kick the monkey out. Then, they wouldn’t be able to learn skills either.","Sure enough, Patriarch Subodhi left in a huff after hitting Wukong three times on the head with a ruler.","Then, it was midnight, and the monkey sneaked into the patriarch’s room.","“Hey-!” The viewers sighed heavily, feeling anxious.","“He can’t learn anything this way!” Gu Tingyun sighed heavily.","“He brought it onto himself!” Su Tianji commented.","“If he doesn’t get kicked out for doing this, I will eat three pounds of poop on livestream!” Song Qingfeng was also watching the TV Series with his classmates from Lingyun Academy.","At this moment, Patriarch Subodhi was asleep with his body curled up, facing the wall.","The viewers held their breaths, afraid that they would alert the patriarch, and the latter would jump up from the bed and kick out this monkey with a beating.","At this moment, the asleep patriarch suddenly said something.","The monkey wasn’t startled, but the elves shrunk their necks!","Alarmed, the cultivators took several steps back, afraid that the patriarch would cast some powerful immortal spells.","At this moment, Patriarch Subodhi said, “Since you have solved the riddle, come closer and listen carefully. I’ll teach you the wondrous way of immortality.”","Then, he chanted a pithy formula.","“This bold, secret saying that’s wondrous and true; spare and nurse nature and life – there’s nothing else.”","“...","“Squeeze the Five Phases jointly, use them back and forth – when that’s done, be a Buddha or immortal at will!”","There were only eight sentences, but the viewers felt as if eight years had passed...","“This pithy formula... it is... really the wondrous way of immortality-?!” After a long while, someone yelled hoarsely.","“My goodness-!”","“Hiss-! Such a lofty and wondrous pithy formula...”","“Can we learn this...!?”","“Huh? What do the words mean?” Gu Tingyun looked baffled...","He turned to Zong Wu who was beside him. “Did you understand?”","“Not yet...” Zong Wu shook his head repeatedly.","“Huh...? This...?! ‘The moon holds the jade rabbit, the sun, the crow; the tortoise and snake are now tightly entwined.’ What does it mean?” Even Nalan Hongwu was confused.","“‘You’ll face the elixir platform, enjoying the moon...’ What does it mean?” On the other side, Lan Yan looked at Nalan Mingxue beside her in confusion and asked.","“Um...”","While they talked, they saw the monkey stepping on clouds and beginning to fly.","“Look at that, guys...” Song Qingfeng pointed at Sun Wukong.","“Huh...?”","“F*ck!?”","“He has mastered it...?!” The viewers stared with widened eyes in stupefaction.","They were totally no match for him!","Then, the patriarch taught Sun Wukong the 72 transformations.","He transformed into a pine tree!","“Ya-!?” (⊙ˍ⊙)","Cloud Somersault!","One somersault moved him forward for 108,000 li!","[TL Note: Li (Chinese miles). 108,000 li is equal to 34,884 kilometres.]","“Wow-?!””Σ(っ°Д°;)っ","“Aya-!” The elves looked at each other.","“We haven’t learned any of them-!”","“He’s got such awesome talents?” The cultivators and warriors were dumbfounded.","By now, it had been over 20 years since Sun Wukong left Flower-Fruit Mountain. But for the viewers, it was just a short while.","He had spent over ten years searching for the way of immortality through hardships, seven years learning ceremonious greetings and doctrines from his senior brothers to build the foundation, and then three years to practice Dao and solidify what he had learned.","“After this... how powerful is he now...!?”","“I forbit you ever to mention that you are my disciple. I’ll never see you again.” Before the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars, the master and disciple parted. “Off with you...”","“Why did he kick away his disciple after teaching him...” The cultivators felt sad as they watched Sun Wukong shed tears.","But eventually, he had to accept the decision with regret.","The viewers had followed him, witnessed the hardships that he had withstood in search for a master and Dao, and shared his joy in finding the Immortal Dao.","Now, they felt his deep feelings for his master.","Despite his naughtiness and unruliness, he was sincere and candid.","Like the most precious treasure in the great world, he gathered all the essence in the Heaven and Earth.","Smart and nimble, he made the boring talk of doctrines among disciples and the long wait throughout the midnight quite amusing.","Gradually, the viewers grew to like this monkey even though it was only a ‘reckless ape’ in his senior brothers’ eyes and a ‘mischievous monkey’ as the patriarch called him.","Reluctantly, he kowtowed to his master and said farewell before returning to Flower-Fruit Mountain in the Eastern Ocean.","Cloud Somersault!","An immortal legend from the ancient nation named Huaxia in the distant east began!","[TL Note: Huaxia is the ancient name for China.]"]},{"number":830,"title":"Chapter 830 - Borrowing Treasures from The Dragon Palace... and the Immortal Who Was About to Descend!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“He’s going home?!” The elves stared at the TV Series.","“It’s been 20 years; I wonder if those monkeys still remember the Monkey King...?” The cultivators also watched attentively.","“I wonder what has Flower-Fruit Mountain become like now!” The warriors wished that they could do a Cloud Somersault and go to the mountain before the Monkey King.","As the story continued, they watched it with great expectations.","“This TV Series... is indeed good!” Su Tianji, who had criticized this TV Series earlier, was now commenting, “Hahaha! I knew the shop owner would never sell bad stuff to us!”","She had completely forgotten her previous remarks.","“Hey... this... the TV Series in this shop... are always good!” Song Qingfeng, who had also had a bad opinion about this TV Series, said, “Why can’t it be a monkey?! Can’t a monkey enter the heavens and the earth and walk the great path to immortality?!”","“This TV Series is unrivaled!”","In the Canglan City Shop, Sala also said, “This Journey to the West is so good! I didn’t expect it would be so good!!","“I thought...” Sala looked out of the shop and said, “I thought it was a monkey just like those we see in the mountains... But this is the Monkey King!”","They aren’t from the same species!","It wasn’t our fault that we didn’t want to watch it before!","If we were told from the beginning that we’d watch this kind of a monkey, we’d have watched it sooner!","She tried to explain herself.","Then, she continued watching eagerly.","At this moment...","Everyone heard music rise.","“You... shoulder the carrying pole, and I lead the horse...”","[TL Note: This is the ending theme song of TV Series Journey to the West. The song is named ‘Where is the road?’]","“Um...? What’s this?” They froze.","Then...","“Ah-!?”","“It ended?!”","“How come it ends here?!”","“Where’s the next episode-?!”","They clicked open Super Theatre again and saw that they could only pay and activate the first and the second episode while the following 40-plus episodes were all grey, which meant that they couldn’t be activated!","As if bedlam broke out, many customers gathered at the counter in the various shops, including the Jiuhua City Shop, Yuanyang City Shop, and Canglan City Shop.","Mr. Fang was now staying in Yuanyang City, and he was surrounded by crowds!","“Sir!” Zong Wu, the Castellan of Yuanyang City, asked, “We can activate four episodes of other TV series per day. But with this TV Series, we can only activate two episodes each day?!","“Where are the other two episodes?!”","“Yeah!” The others joined in the protest. “Journey to the West is expensive and short with each episode! Besides, we can only have two episodes each day?!”","“The episodes are not short!” Mr. Fang looked at them in puzzlement. After walking to a computer, he pointed at the screen and said, “Look! One hour for one episode.”","“Um...” Zong Wu and the others followed Mr. Fang to the computer and looked.","“They are just short!”","“They are just short!”","They complained immediately.","“Can you be reasonable about this?” Mr. Fang looked exasperated.","“We could activate four episodes of other TV Series a day, but this only has two episodes!?” They finally found the correct issue to complain about. “Are you afraid that we can’t afford more?!”","Mr. Fang looked contemptuous. “How can the previous TV Series be compared with this one?!”","“Among other things, have you guys understood the Dao lecture and the spells taught in the first and second episodes?!","“You must know that haste makes waste!” Mr. Fang talked eloquently as if he was arguing with a group of scholars. “That’s why my shop custom-made the right number of episodes for you each day. You’ve watched two episodes today and can watch the next two tomorrow! This way, you can obtain something from the TV Series and really enjoy it.”","“Oh... so this is the reason...” They nodded, thinking that it made sense.","Then, they thought for a moment...","“... Sir! I still want to watch more episodes today!”","Mr. Fang sat before his computer and put on the virtual reality headset, concentrating on the game and ignoring them.","“...”","...","At this moment, on Connate Cliff where immortal breezes moved ethereally, an unworldly-looking immortal sat cross-legged on the edge of the cliff. While wearing a silver-grey Daoist robe, a silk belt, and a silver headpiece, his eyes were as bright as stars.","When he inhaled, clouds gathered around him. When he exhaled, clouds evaporated. The technique that he was cultivating looked miraculous.","At this moment, a figure walked up from behind, and he opened his eyes slowly.","As a member of the Gui Family which had existed since prehistoric times, Gui Ye was a well-esteemed existence even in the Innumerable Immortal Sea, let alone when comparing him to insignificant mortals.","His eyes glinted with chilly lights. “To die in the heavenly tribulation and godly punishment or... obediently return to their factions and continue their lives as faction masters and elders?!”","“My Lord, do you think some people are just ignorant and don’t understand the situation?”","“Ignorant?” He replied with a snicker, “Even 10,000 years ago, few of the mortals and filthy savages could show any powerful abilities... they are worse now...”","His gaze seemed to travel through the endless void and reach an unknown spot beyond the sky.","Even he shivered involuntarily in fear.","“We members of the Gui Family are immortals who have withstood challenges of blood and fire. “He looked down contemptuously at the mortal world below the clouds. “These mortals know nothing but hard cultivation in seclusion and are not qualified to ascend. How can they compare with us?!”","“They will know that the more ancient an immortal clan is, the more severe consequences they will face for offending and challenging them. If they try it, they will bring destruction to themselves!”","“It’s almost time. I think they must have made the right decision, right?”","...","“What do you think will happen in today’s episodes of Journey to the West?” On the early morning of the next day, the elves entered the shop while talking among themselves.","From the looks of it, they had been talking about it all the way here.","In front of the Jiuhua City Shop, Half City Shop, Yuanyang City Shop, and even... the new shop in the East Continent, many people stood outside, waiting for the shops to open.","It seemed like the shops hadn’t seen such eager crowds in a long time.","“I think... after some careful meditation last night, I understand a tiny bit of the pithy formula that the patriarch taught Wukong!” one cultivator said in a low voice.","“Get out! Even the Ascendance Realm masters are clueless. You can keep dreaming!”","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue saw the profile photo of a little deer popping up on her communication jade. [Princess, I think I’ve got some clues about transformation! Yohahaha!]","After seeing the transfiguration spell, watching the Legend of the White Snake, and then hearing Patriarch Subodhi’s lecture on Dao, it obviously had accumulated lots of understanding in this area.","Although it was still too young to reach the transformation stage for an ancient spiritual beast...","It felt some signs.","“Really?!” Xiaoyue replied with pleasant surprise.","“Yes! Yes! I think I will be able to transform before long! Princess, you must come and watch when it’s time!”","“Okay!” She replied and entered the shop.","Immediately, she took a computer and began watching the TV Series.","Different from the previous episode, in this episode, the Monkey King returned to his home with great triumph. He destroyed the Monstrous King of Havoc who had been bullying his little monkeys, and then he taught his monkeys to make spears with bamboo sticks and carve out sabers with wood pieces. He taught them martial arts and made them practice each day.","This way, these monkeys could protect themselves.","However, the bamboo and wooden weapons were not real weapons. So, this episode told the story of borrowing treasures from the Dragon Palace.","Wukong leaped down the sheet iron bridge of Flower-Fruit Mountain and entered the passage leading to the Dragon Palace through the creek under the bridge.","On the bottom of the ocean were clumps of corals and schools of colorful fish. There was the Water-Crystal Palace and patrolling Yashas.","[TL Note: In legend, Yasha is a class of generally benevolent but sometimes mischievous, capricious, sexually rapacious, or even murderous nature spirits who are the custodians of treasures.]","“Wow... The dragons’ residence is so beautiful...” Xiaoyue was feeling dizzy while she looked around the palace, wishing that she could move to this place.","“What weapon do you think the Monkey King will use?”","Soon, the members of the touring group entered another heated discussion while they watched."]},{"number":831,"title":"Chapter 831 - Compliant Golden-Hooped Rod!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“High Immortal, when did you become accomplished in Dao, and what kind of immortal spells have you learned?” In the Dragon Palace, the host and the visitor exchanged pleasantries.","“Since the time of my birth, I have left the family to practice self-cultivation. I have acquired a birthless and deathless body...” Sun Wukong answered fluently.","“Will he use a saber?” While the viewers talked about Sun Wukong’s potential choices of weapons, the Dragon King found it hard to refuse the request and ordered a stout perch commander to fetch a long-handled saber.","The warriors who used sabers were happy and said to their peers, “Hehehe... He will use a saber! Saber!”","“This Old Monkey doesn’t know how to use a saber.” At this moment, Sun Wukong said, “I beg you to give me something else.”","“Huh...” The smiles on the faces of the warriors who used sabers turned stiff.","“Maybe he uses a polearm?” Xiaoyue mumbled.","After all, she was quite knowledgeable with weapons such as spears, halberds, etc.","Soon, the Dragon King commanded a whiting lieutenant together with eel porters to carry out a nine-pronged fork.","The fork glinted with treasure lights, and the blades flashed chillingly. With one glance, the viewers knew that it was a great treasure.","“Ugh-!” Xiaoyue’s eyes brightened. “That’s it! That’s it!”","Wukong took hold of it and tried a few thrusts with great presence.","The old Dragon King said smugly, “It weights 3,600 jin and is a rare treasure!”","[TL Note: Jin is a measurement unit, equal 500g. One jin is close to one pound.]","“3,600 jin?!” Even the saint-level masters who were used to heavy weapons were surprised.","It must be noted that using weapons wasn’t a contest of weightlifting. For saint-level masters, something that weighed 3,600 jin was easy to lift when they circulated their essence.","When they fought in battles, they could block and parry an attack with tens of thousands of pounds of force, let alone only thousands of pounds, when they used proper exertion techniques and skills.","Even in the world where Fang Qi had come from, a master could unleash an explosive force several times or more than ten times the force of an average person with one punch, let alone these warriors.","However, even the masters who were used to heavy weapons wouldn’t use such a heavy weapon since holding it would continuously consume their energy, which would greatly reduce their strength during a battle.","To choose a weapon, one must see if it suited one’s hand regardless of its weight. Otherwise, trying to bluff with a heavy weapon would decrease one’s combat strength instead of increasing it.","The viewers were experts of weapons and naturally knew this fact.","However, Sun Wukong picked up the nine-pronged fork without activating any essence as if the fork was weightless.","It gave the viewers the illusion that this fork wasn’t that heavy.","Xiaoyue grinned happily. “This must be it!”","Yesterday, Xiaoyue tried the TV Series alone. But today, all the members of the Heavenly Faction joined her.","Seeing this, the others said, “Is the Monkey King going to use a fork?”","“Aiya!”","Boom! Sun Wukong put down the fork, which almost cracked the floor of the Dragon Palace due to its weight. Then, he said, “Too light! Too light! It doesn’t suit my hand!”","“Too... light-?!” Leidon watched the scene dumbfoundedly. As a master using heavy weapons, he swallowed his saliva with difficulty.","They knew that Sun Wukong might have a high cultivation strength, but he had only learned from that old immortal for several years.","His power shouldn’t be that great, right?","For an average immortal, this would be a good middle-scale weapon...","But...","It is too light?!","At this moment, the Dragon King commanded an admiral and a brigadier to carry out a giant halberd.","“This halberd weighs 7,200 jin.” When mentioning this treasure, the Dragon King looked proud. “This is the best weapon in the Dragon Palace, and no one can use it.”","“7,200 jin...!?” The warriors and cultivators watching Journey to the West exclaimed.","Although one couldn’t judge a weapon by its weight, no one dared to say that it wasn’t a great treasure by looking at the dragons and phoenixes engravings on it and the chilly glints flashing on its body.","Its blade was so sharp that no one doubted the fact that it could easily break most of the good weapons that the viewers knew.","The halberd’s body was so hard that they suspected none of the weapons they knew about could leave a scratch on it.","Even for immortals, it was a rare treasure in the world!","“Huh...?! This one is good!”","“I guess he’ll take this weapon?”","“If it were me, I would take this halberd!”","The viewers avidly looked at the weapon in excitement, as if they were the ones getting this halberd.","Wukong took hold of the halberd and made a few thrusts casually. Then, he inserted the end of the halberd into the floor.","Crack!","With a blunt noise, the magnificent and extremely hard floor paved by unknown treasure materials was pierced! It cracked open as if a godly sword cut it.","“It’s still light! Too light! Too light!” Sun Wukong said in disdain.","“It’s still light?!” The viewers stared at Sun Wukong in a daze.","What kind of treasure, what kind of weapon can satisfy this Monkey King?","At this moment, a few dragon daughters standing behind the Dragon King whispered, “That piece of rare magic iron...”","“That was the ruler with which the Great Yu fixed the depths of rivers and oceans when he conquered the Flood during the ancient time. It is a piece of magic iron, but of what use could it be to him?” The old Dragon King said doubtfully.","[TL Note: Yu the Great (c. 2123 – 2025 BC), was a legendary ruler in ancient China who was famed for his introduction of flood control, his establishment of the Xia dynasty which inaugurated dynastic rule in China, and his upright moral character.]","“A piece of rare magic iron...?”","“What’s that?!”","“This old Dragon King has a treasure better than this giant halberd?!”","“Aiya! How come there are so many treasures in the Dragon Palace?” Jiang Xiaoyue had lights flashing in her eyes.","“What a powerful figure is the Great Yu...?” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Su Tianji mumbled to herself.","The ancient time in the mouth of an immortal was a time beyond their imagination.","Following the Dragon King to the ocean treasury, the viewers saw countless shafts of golden light at the depths with auspicious essence and clouds floating around. The light was so bright that it almost blinded the viewers.","Sure enough, there was a divine iron rod in the depths of the golden light.","But it seemed... too thick to hold; it looked like an iron pillar.","“What treasure is this...?”","“Such a big piece of iron... is he going to hold it in his arms and smash it toward enemies?” The viewers shook their heads. “This is not good! Not good! The previous weapon is better.”","“It is a little too long and too thick,” Sun Wukong shared their opinion. “It would be more serviceable if it were somewhat shorter and thinner.”","“Right! Right!” The cultivators and warriors nodded.","While they were nodding, they suddenly saw the rod turning thinner after Sun Wukong said those words!","They instantly shouted, “This treasure-!?”","Then, Wukong said, “Smaller!”","The rod shrunk further until it became the size that could be held in one hand. Wukong examined it and saw the inscription on the rod – [Compliant Golden-Hooped Rod!]","It weighed 13,500 jin!","It wasn’t just heavy.","When Wukong brandished it, it disturbed all the water in this sea area, shaking the Water-Crystal Palace and frightening the sea-turtles, tortoises, fish, shrimps, crabs, and the dragon princes and princesses. Even the old Dragon King shook with fear!","It could change into a slim needle or a big rod that could pierce layers of clouds. Seeing the Golden-Hooped Rod, even the viewers were frightened, afraid that it would pierce a hole in the sky!","At this moment, even the Jade Emperor in the Heavenly Court received a report from the heavenly general and soldiers, “Your Majesty, the heaven-born stone monkey is making trouble in the lower region, and he is sticking an iron rod up into the heavens!”","“This treasure-!!??”","“My goodness!!”","“It’s still growing! The Heaven will be pierced-!”","Even when standing in the Heavenly Court, people could see the iron rod continuing to grow, reaching as high as Heaven and as low as Hell. Not only the people in the TV Series but the viewers in the real world stepped back in fear.","“F*ck!” Song Qingfeng and the other young warriors couldn’t find words to express what they were feeling right now.","They had never heard of such a treasure before, let alone see it!"]},{"number":832,"title":"Chapter 832 - Elder Asked Me Why I’m Watching on My Knees; I Don’t Know!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After ‘borrowing’ this weapon from the old Dragon King, Sun Wukong also ‘borrowed’ some outfits, including a gold cap adorned with phoenix plumes, a gold set of chain mail, and a pair of cloud-treading shoes that were the color of lotus root. Wearing this set of clothes, he looked magnificent and miraculous, appearing totally different from the previous image of a wild monkey.","“How come I’m beginning to find the Monkey King to be good-looking!” The elves felt like their sense of beauty began to change due to this monkey.","They had never imagined that they would find a monkey dashing!","Gradually, Flower-Fruit Mountain was restored to order. With the Monkey King as their leader, the well-equipped monkeys formed troops with generals and leaders. Naturally, no demons dared to bully them again.","After settling this, the Monkey King felt completely at ease to soar on the clouds and ride the mist, to tour the four seas and disport himself in a thousand mountains. He made extensive visits to various heroes and warriors and even entered into a fraternal alliance with six other monarchs, including the Bull Monster King, the Garuda Monster King, and the Dragon Monster King, enjoying life as much as he could.","The viewers were thrilled while they watched, surprised that the Monkey King had grown into such a top existence in a short time.","“How come the Monkey King is so powerful now...?” Su Tianji said in surprise while she watched.","“Hehe... is the rest of the story about how the Monkey King tours the rivers and mountains each day with his little monkeys...” In the Canglan City Shop, the elves talked among themselves while they watched it together.","“Hehe. That would be great! We love checking out the scenery around the world!” Sala said in pleasant surprise.","“The scenery at the Mountain of Mind and Heart is excellent!”","“Yeah! Flower-Fruit Mountain is very beautiful too!”","“The Dragon Palace has great scenery as well!”","“Right! Right! Right!” The elves had never seen the beautiful scenery at the bottom of the ocean. “The Dragon Palace has the most beautiful scenery! That old Dragon King lives in such a pretty place and has so many treasures!”","They had an animated discussion.","One day, the Monkey King had a big banquet in Flower-Fruit Mountain and got drunk. Then, he fell asleep under the shade of the pine tree in front of the sheet-iron bridge before the cave.","He had a few monkey generals guarding him.","In his sleep, he saw two men approach with a summons with the three characters ‘Sun Wukong’ written on it. They walked up to him and, without a word, tied him up with a rope and dragged him off until they reached the edge of a city.","“This...?!” The viewers were alarmed when they saw such an easy capture.","“They look like the Black and White Impermanence, who capture people’s souls!” Obviously, there were many Legend of Sword and Fairy players among the viewers. In the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 and 4, there were events in Hell, and that was why they recognized these two men.","[TL Note: Black and White Impermanence are two deities in Chinese folk religion in charge of escorting the spirits of the dead to the Underworld.]","Sure enough, when they looked up, they saw above the city an iron sign bearing the three words [Region of Darkness].","“The soul summoners said that his age in the World of Life had come to an end?!” The cultivators watched in bafflement. “Hasn’t Sun Wukong finished walking the path to immortality?!”","Even the old Dragon King was frightened by Sun Wukong’s holy presence, which showed that he wasn’t an average immortal.","He had cultivated for hundreds of years; how could he die like this?","“What can he do now?!” In various shops, like the Jiuhua City Shop and Canglan City Shop, the viewers looked at each other in confusion.","From their experience in the Legend of Sword and Fairy, they remembered the horrors in Hell which governed all the livings. They had made narrow escapes from Hell in both the Legend of Sword and Fairy 3 and 4.","During those adventures, they only snuck in and hid their presences, not attracting the attention of the truly powerful existences.","But now, Sun Wukong had reached the end of his age in the World of Life and was summoned by the Black and White Impermanence. They were now standing before the Palace of Darkness, and demon soldiers would meet them at any moment.","As the saying goes, “If the Yama King wants someone to die at midnight, he wouldn’t delay it until the next morning!”.","Sun Wukong couldn’t escape it!","“Finished! Finished! This time, he’s in big trouble!” In the Canglan City Shop, a dragon didn’t turn off the External Communication Option and yelled, and all the people in the shop could hear it.","“Hey! Cowardly Dragon, can you stop shouting?!”","“Yeah. You’re disturbing us from watching the TV Series!”","While they talked, they saw the Monkey King taking out the Golden-Hooped Rod from his ear and shattering the two soul summoners with one strike!","“Oh-!? The Golden-Hooped Rod is hidden in the soul?!” In the Canglan City Shop, the saint-level masters such as St. Willy and St. Leidon widened their eyes and yelled hoarsely, “There’s such a wondrous use of this treasure!?”","“I, the old Monkey himself, have transcended the three Regions and the Five Phases; hence I am no longer under Yama’s jurisdiction. Why is he so confused that he wants to arrest me?!”","With a shout, he fought his way into the city!","The bull-headed demons scrambled to hide, and horse-faced demons fled in every direction. Anyone touched or scratched by the rod would be injured or killed. No demons dared to get close to him!","In the Palace of Darkness, the kings of the underground had just straightened out their attire and sat down in the palace when they heard horrified shouts, “Great Kings! Disaster! Disaster! Outside, there’s a hairy-faced thunder god fighting his way in!”","At this moment, not only demon soldiers but the ten kings of the underground held their breaths in fear. They yelled, “High Immortal! High Immortal! Please have mercy on us!”","When they played the Legend of Sword and Fairy, the players almost died every time when they ventured into Hell and the Palace of Darkness. They had never seen such a scene before!","They couldn’t even manage to defeat the Black and White Impermanence. The ten kings of the underground were only legends to them! They had never seen them!","What were they watching now?!","The Monkey King said, “I’m the Heaven-born sage Sun Wukong from the Water-Curtain Cave in Flower-Fruit Mountain. What kind of officials are you?” The ten kings bowed and said, “We’re the Emperors of Darkness, the ten kings of the underground.”","Wukong said, “Tell me each of your names at once, or I’ll give you a drubbing.”","The ten kings said, “We’re King Qinguang, King of the Beginning River, King of the Song Empire...”","“My Goodness!?” The elves, who had played the all the games in the Legend of Sword and Fairy series, held their heads in their arms, feeling like their brains would explode.","They couldn’t believe their eyes!","Then, they saw Wukong picking up the register of births and deaths. Then, he found the ledger on monkeys and crossed out all the names that he could find. After tossing down the book, he said, “That ends the account! That ends the account! Now, I’m truly not your subject!”","Brandishing his rod, he fought his way out of the Region of Darkness.","“Come and watch the immortal-!” The cultivators and warriors were more than frightened; they were stupefied!","“Why are you watching on your knees...?!” with tears on their face, one elf looked at another elf and asked.","“The elder asked me why I’m watching on my knees; I don’t know...” the other elf said shakily.","The scene awed them so much that they fell on their knees!","...","However, it wasn’t the time for celebration yet.","Then, they saw in the Treasure Hall of Divine Mists, the Cloud Palace of Golden Arches, the divine ministers, civil and military, were just gathering for the morning session when suddenly the Daoist immortal Qiu Hongzhi announced, “Your Majesty, outside the Translucent Palace, Auguang, the Dragon King of the Eastern Ocean is awaiting your command to present a memorial to the Throne.”","From below, the Immortal Elder Ge, the Celestial Master, also brought forth a report, “Your Majesty, the Minister of Darkness, King Qinguang, supported by the Bodhisattva King Kitigarbha and other people of the Underground, has arrived to present his memorial.”","“From the lowly water region of the Eastern Ocean at the East Purvavideha Continent, this small dragon subject, Aoguang, humbly informs the Wise Lord of Heaven, the Most Eminent High God and Ruler, that a bogus immortal, Sun Wukong, born of Flower-Fruit Mountain and resident of the Water-Curtain Cave, has recently abused your small dragon and gained a seat in his watery residence by force...”","“We earnestly beseech you to dispatch the Heavenly troops and capture this monster, so that tranquility may be restored to the oceans and prosperity to the lower region. Thus, we present this memorial.”","The other memorial said, “The Region of Darkness is the nether region proper to Earth. But now appears Sun Wukong, a Heaven-born baneful monkey from the Water-Curtain Cave in Flower-Fruit Mountain, who practices evil and violence, and resists our proper summons. Exercising magic powers, he utterly defeated the ghostly messengers of Ninefold Darkness; exploiting brutal force, he terrorized the Ten Merciful Kings...”","“We humbly beg you to send forth your divine army and subdue this monster, to the end that life and death may once more be regulated, and the Underworld rendered perpetually secure. Respectfully, we present this memorial.”","After the Jade Emperor finished reading, he gave a command, “We shall send our generals to arrest this culprit!”","Watching this, the viewers were alarmed and shouted anxiously, “Finished! Finished! This time, he’s really in big trouble!”"]},{"number":833,"title":"Chapter 833 - The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In the world where Fang Qi came from, there was an ancient legend that had been passed down from generation to generation for thousands of years. Its popularity far surpassed other myths and legends in the same genre, and everyone, from old people to little kids, could tell a part of the story.","That was the Havoc in Heaven.","There might be more miraculous and majestic legends than the Havoc in Heaven, but this story was the most popular.","Perhaps it was more than a legend. For people in that era, it represented the spirit of resistance and the courage to fight under the heavy suppression of power.","The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal was not just a name but the personification of the people’s wishes.","If there were ‘super-heroes’ in the nation named Huaxia where Fang Qi had come from, then this was the most ancient one.","...","For the Heavenly Court, an existence with great cultivation strength, superpowers, and understanding of Immortal Dao seeking weapons from the Dragon Palace wasn’t a big crime.","Also, since the Monkey King had obtained the Immortal Dao, it was not right to send soul summoners to arrest his soul. Of course, no one would admit this out loud.","The immortals knew it and kept it to themselves.","This was why the Heavenly Court sent the Gold Star of Venus to the lower region to summon him up and give him an official position.","Of course, it wasn’t so easy to live in Heaven.","After all, Wukong was only a stone monkey from the mountains and a small demon without a great reputation. How could he sit at the same rank as the immortals?","Some of the gods and immortals looked down at the Monkey from the bottom of their hearts.","-In the Heavenly Court-","“Look at that Heavenly Palace...” The viewers were engrossed in the scenes of the palaces engulfed in dazzling colorful lights.","“Look at the jade Kirin on the pillar!” It was so lively that it seemed like it would fly down from the jade pillar at any moment.","Following the Golden Star of Venus who lead Sun Wukong into the palace, the viewers got the chance to enjoy the scenery.","“I guess it must be fun to be an official in this place?” Sala exclaimed.","Not only the Elf Royal Palace, but even the old Dragon King’s extremely beautiful Water-Crystal Palace was far inferior compared to this place.","Soon, they felt that things were not as simple as they had thought.","The Star Spirit of Wuqu reported on the side, “In every mansion and hall in the Palace of Heaven, there’s no lack of ministers. Only at the imperial stables is a supervisor needed.”","“A supervisor of the imperial stables?!” Nalan Hongwu and the warriors of the Royal Clan Guild exchanged a look. As royal members, they naturally understood the rank of this position.","“An official to take care of the horses?! Will he take care of horses for the royal family in Heaven?” the Royal Princess looked at the Star Spirit of Wuqu and said.","“This...? It’s a slight to him!” Nalan Hongwu also frowned.","One day, the Star Spirit of Wuqu came to the stables. “Ban Horse Plague, go and get me an imperial horse.”","[TL Note: Ban Horse Plague is the official title for this position.]","“You want me to get you a horse?” Sun Wukong froze.","“If you don’t do it, who would?” the Star Spirit of Wuqu said casually and demanded in a cold voice.","Previously, the viewers had been thrilled when they watched Wukong learn from the immortal, ‘borrow’ treasures from the Dragon Palace, and cross his name off the Life and Death Ledger in the Palace of Darkness.","They had never seen or heard of such abilities before!","Even among immortals, Wukong’s power was superior.","However, he was disdained in this way!","“Ya! This Heaven is infuriating!”","“He’s just a groom!” In the Canglan City Shop, the elves were angry.","The cultivators and warriors were even more furious after watching Sun Wukong’s hardships in his pursuit of Dao. It had taken him over ten years to cross two great oceans, getting to the Mountain of Mind and Heart from Flower-Fruit Mountain while overcoming countless dangers.","Once he obtained Dao, he was no longer bound by the Three Regions and Five Phases. With such great cultivation strength, he ended up with such a lowly position?!","“So, he is only a groom after all! Did you hear them say that this position is... unclassified?” Zong Wu said in anger.","“I think they did it on purpose. With his great power, the Monkey King can be entrusted with great missions. But they made him into a groom!” The others were also indignant.","The Star Spirit of Wuqu snickered and said, “It’s an honor for you to be a groom! The Jade Emperor planned to send his army to the lower region to arrest you!”","If the Jade Emperor sent the heavenly army to the lower region, the result would be obvious. After all, in the whole world, no demon could resist the heavenly generals and soldiers!","At this moment, Sun Wukong knocked over the official desk, took out his Golden-Hooped Rod, and fought his way out!","He rebelled against the Heavens!","“Well done!” At this moment, facing the great power of Heaven, many people would have backed down and restrained themselves.","But the viewers saw Sun Wukong choose a path that they wouldn’t have dared to pick!","In the new shop at the East Continent, the cultivators and warriors from forces such as Heavenly Faction and Xiaoyao Cave Abode watched attentively as Sun Wukong fought his way from the Imperial Stables all the way out of the South Heaven Gate. The viewers had been hesitant with their own choices, but now they were thrilled by this scene.","...","What was the good of being a minister in Heaven? It would be much more enjoyable to call himself the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal and be a king in the mountain!","First came Mighty-Spirit God brandishing his spreading-flower ax, and then came Third Prince Nata who changed into a form with three heads and six arms and fought Sun Wukong with his Universe Ring and Fiery Wheel!","All kinds of spiritual treasures were used, and they dazzled the viewers while the immortals fought with powerful abilities.","“Aiyaa... This spear technique!” Jiang Xiaoyue imitated the moves while she watched.","“This spell...?!” They watched as Sun Wukong rubbed the hair in his palm, and the strands of hair turned into countless doppelgangers.","“This is one of the spells that came from the pithy formula that Patriarch Subodhi taught him...” Gu Tingyun told the other viewers, “The Great Sage is making wondrous use of the pithy formula while he fights the gods and immortals. Watch carefully. If we can understand a tiny bit of the pithy formula that Patriarch Subodhi taught him and verify it with our own techniques and spells, we’d gain tremendous benefits!”","“I wonder where this pithy formula came from...” Zong Wu said, “It’s super powerful since it can be transformed into so many powerful and complex spells at the will of the user...”","“If someone can really understand it, I wonder what realm they can achieve...”","“That’s not easy,” Gu Tingyun said with a smile, “After all, the godly moves that Qi Tiandi used are right there, but who can understand the core essence? Those godly moves are only casual strikes for Qi Tiandi, but this pihty formula is the ultimate essence in Patriarch Subodhi’s teachings and thus is deeper and more mysterious. I’m afraid that only one in a trillion people can understand a tiny part of it. We’d better put more effort in understanding the lecture that Patriarch Subodhi gave and studying the super powerful spells cast by the gods and immortals. We should see if we can obtain some benefits these ways.”","“Senior Gu, you’re right!” the viewers nodded repeatedly."]},{"number":834,"title":"Chapter 834 - Havoc in Heaven!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Although the system version of the games and TV Series were great for the players and viewers to understand and learn the spiritual spells and Marital Dao, none of the people living in this turbid world had talents that were as great as those of Sun Wukong, who had a Heaven-born and Heaven-nourished body and all kinds of miraculous fortunate encounters. Even if they could obtain a tiny bit of understanding, it would be extremely difficult for them to gain Sun Wukong’s super abilities with their much inferior talent.","In all kinds of games and TV Series, they had experienced countless world-destroying catastrophes cast by gods and immortals. During the process, the players and viewers had a clearer understanding of themselves and knew that they were indeed extremely insignificant in the eyes of gods and immortals.","After accepting reality, they were no longer impatient. Instead, they obtained steady progress patiently and improved themselves little by little.","At this moment, the viewers actually saw the Heavens giving the Monkey King the title ‘The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal’!","“This... is another attempt to recruit him using a pacifistic method...?” After all, even the Pagoda Bearer, Devaraja Li Jin, a famous immortal general, and his son were defeated, so it was natural for the Gold Star of Venus to offer a compromise and settle everything.","“In my opinion, he doesn’t need the Heavens to give him the title of ‘Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal’; he can give himself this title,” Jiang Xiaoyue mumbled, “This way, he will live a free life and doesn’t have to abide by the rules of Heaven.”","“Um...” Beside her, the Heavenly Faction’s Elder Xiao Yunhe explained, “Despite his unruliness, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal is a being who respects his master and Dao. The patriarch instructed him repeatedly not to make trouble, which is why he makes peace whenever he can.”","Perhaps the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal had many internal struggles...","“I see...” Remembering Sun Wukong’s weeping face when Patriarch Subodhi kicked him out, Jiang Xiaoyue suddenly understood something.","Although the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal was a stone-born monkey, if he was just a powerful wild monkey, people wouldn’t have passed down the legend about him for thousands of years and admired him so much.","In the Journey to the West, Wukong was indeed unruly, but he had his principles.","Even though the patriarch had scolded him and called him a mischievous monkey in exasperation, he had never discarded his respect for his master and Dao, which was the tradition and soul of Huaxia Culture in the past thousands of years.","At this moment, the viewers watching Journey to the West began to realize that even though the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal had transcended the Three Regions, he was different from those ‘gods’ who looked down on the mortal world with cold eyes. He was an existence with blood, flesh, and mortal emotions.","Although he didn’t need the Heavens to grant him the title of ‘The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal’, it was the first time in the history of the Heaven to grant the title of ‘sage’ to a young demon immortal who was only a few hundreds of years old.","Even though it was an empty title without any actual power, it suited the temperament of the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal.","In Heaven, Wukong visited all kinds of gods and immortals. When meeting the Three Pure Ones, he addressed them as ‘Your Reverence’. When he saw the Four Thearchs, he would say, ‘Your Majesty’. After spending about eight years on learning ceremonious greetings, he certainly wouldn’t act like a wild beast. After the previous battle, they got to know each other better. While making all kinds of friends in Heaven and calling them his brothers, Wukong enjoyed his life very much.","Due to his friendship with these gods and immortals, when Wukong encountered difficulties on his way to the west, he would be able to enlist their help whenever he went up to Heaven despite the havoc that he was about to cause.","The star spirits were certainly his good friends. Among them, the Gold Star of Venus was friendly with Sun Wukong and had dissuaded the Jade Emperor from sending an army to the lower region to arrest him several times.","Three Pure Ones, Four Thearchs, Five Elders... and Nine Luminaries, 28 Constellations, the Four Devarajas, and the Eight Immortals...","There were many gods and immortals with official positions, let alone those who were independent and didn’t hold official titles.","The gods and immortals were as many and dazzling as the stars in the sky, showing the viewers a huge system of immortals and gods.","The immortals were prosperous and many. While countless immortals were governed by the Heavenly Court, there were quite many who were not bound by the rules of Heaven!","The viewers couldn’t imagine what kind of existence dared to fight such a powerful system of gods and buddhas.","Of course, things didn’t end here.","In the Heaven System, not everyone liked the Great Sage.","“Hehe... Heaven seems fun...” amused, the cultivators laughed and said.","“Your Majesty, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal has no duties right now, and he merely dawdles away his time. He has become quite chummy with the various Stars and Constellations of Heaven, calling them his friends regardless of whether they are his superiors or subordinates!” In the Treasure Hall of Divine Mists, the Star Spirit of Wuqu reported, “I fear that his idleness might lead to roguery!”","At this moment, the Garden of Immortal Peaches had a empty position.","“Summon Sun Wukong and get him to take charge of the Garden of Immortal Peaches, so he won’t cause trouble due to idleness.”","“The Garden of Immortal Peaches...?” The viewers exchanged a look.","There were 3,600 peach trees in the Garden of Immortal Peaches. In the front were 1,200 trees. The fruits ripened once every 3,000 years, and after one taste of them, a man would become an immortal enlightened in the Dao with healthy limbs and a lightweight body. In the middle were 1,200 trees. The fruits ripened once every 6,000 years. If a man ate them, he would ascend to Heaven with the mist and never grow old. At the back were 1,200 trees with fruits that ripened once every 9,000 years, and if eaten, would make a man’s age equal to that of Heaven and Earth, the sun and the moon.","The story had shown how difficult it was to obtain the way of immortality, but here in the Garden of Immortal Peaches, eating one immortal peach would give one the age equaling to that of Heaven and Earth!","“There’s such a treasure-?!” Since they began watching Journey to the West, the cultivators were shocked so much that they had become numb by now.","Staying in the Garden of Immortal Peaches, the monkey lived a peaceful life and occasionally stole some peaches to eat. It was a great job for this monkey.","However, when the seven immortal maidens came here to pick the peaches, Wukong heard that all kinds of big and small immortals and gods from all palaces were invited to attend the Grand Festival of Immortal Peaches”.","All kinds of big and small gods and immortals from different palaces were invited but him, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!","Wukong had suppressed his temper to follow his master’s instructions, but such slights were made to him again and again, making it impossible for the monkey to keep his temper in control.","Having been fooled once before, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal felt like he was being fooled again.","This time, he was serious.","He would rather return and be an idle king than to be a target of disdain, sneer, and mockery in Heaven!","Perhaps, under such a system, there was no place for the unruly and proud Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal.","His just couldn’t fit in.","Even if there wasn’t the Star Spirit of Wuqu to oppose him, there might be the Star Spirit of Wenqu or other immortal officials.","The cause of the conflict seemed accidental, but it was in fact inevitable.","This time...","The entire Heaven was turned upside-down!","He ruined the Grand Festival of Immortal Peaches, ate all the immoral peaches, drank all the immortal wine, and shattered the desk, chairs, bowls, and plates at the banquet! After getting drunk, he even ate all of the immortal elixirs in Tushita Palace!","Since he could no longer bear the rules, he didn’t need to anymore!","On Flower-Fruit Mountain, the demons all bowed their heads while the Monkey King, dressed in gold armor and his phoenix-plumed cap and holding the Compliant Golden-Hooped Rod, stood tall before the heavenly generals and soldiers and all kinds of gods and immortals who descended to arrest him. Behind the Monkey King, a golden flag flapped in the wind with five words on it – [The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal.]","From a small demon monkey who concentrated on the pursuit of Dao, he had become what he was now step by step.","Seeing this scene, the cultivators and warriors all became teary-eyed!"]},{"number":835,"title":"Chapter 835 - Showing Various Superpowers... and the new powerhouse ‘QQ Studio’?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ya! They sent 100,000 heavenly generals and soldiers...”","Standing on the layers upon layers of clouds, the heavenly soldiers seemed countless in one glance.","On the highest layer, golden light illuminated Heaven and Earth. This time, the Heavenly Court sent out most of its military force. Countless powerful gods and immortal officials glared down with spiritual treasures in their hands.","It was the first time that these cultivators and warriors saw so many gods and immortals.","The number of soldiers and generals seemed to surpass that of the mortal world! The great presence with so many gods and immortals gathered in one place was unimaginable!","“Who are these Four Devarajas... they can fight with the Great Sage for so many rounds!” After all, Sun Wukong, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal, had obtained tremendous cultivation strength after eating so many elixirs and immortal peaches.","When swords were unsheathed, chilly lights flashed all over the mountains. When the pipa instrument was played, its sounds overshadowed all other sounds in the world!","On Flower-Fruit Mountain, the demon kings under the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal’s command covered their ears, howled pathetically, and couldn’t fight anymore.","Even Sun Wukong, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal, felt a headache.","“So powerful-!”","Then, Third Prince Nata and the Twenty-Eight Constellations took turns to fight Sun Wukong, casting wind, lightning bolts, fires, and water, turning the whole world into darkness.","“These immortals are ganging up on him!” In the new shop at the East Continent, Xiaoyue and the disciples of the Heavenly Faction were indignant.","At this moment, Sun Wukong pluck off a handful of monkey hair and changed them into hundreds of Monkey Kings’ who were dressed in sets of gold armor and phoenix-plumed caps and holding Golden-Hooped Rods.","“Ah-!” Seeing this, the Heavenly Faction disciples screamed and clapped their hands in pleasant surprise.","“The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal is even more powerful than before!”","“Of course. It’s said that eating one of the 9,000-year-old immortal peaches will make one live as long as Heaven and Earth. He ate many of them!” Yue Bai, who was also in Heavenly Faction at the East Continent as an exchange student, exclaimed.","“Right! Right! He ate elixirs too!” Mu Qing yelled in a thrill.","“Who is this Erlang Immortal Master of the Mouth of the River of Libations...?”","This time, the viewers saw the Heavenly Court send Erlang Immortal Master of the Mouth of the River of Libations.","“He isn’t at a disadvantage...” Looking at the extremely heroic-looking Immortal Master with the third vertical eye between his brows, Heavenly Faction’s Elder Senior Sister Yu Yin said, “What kind of god is this Erlang Immortal Master? He’s so powerful!”","“He even dares to compete with Sun Wukong in strength... my goodness!”","“How come we didn’t see this immortal in the Heavenly Court... doesn’t he live in Heaven?”","“Look! The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal changed into a sparrow and flew away! This is a skill taught by the patriarch. It is said to be able to hide from the eye of Heaven and Earth...”","“My goodness! He has been seen through by this guy with three eyes! This immortal can change forms as well! He changed into a sparrow hawk! Oh! The sparrow is in danger!”","“The Great Sage changed too! He changed into a cormorant!”","“The Erlang Immortal Master changed too... My goodness, this Erlang Immortal Master is so powerful...”","When they finished the fourth episode, the viewers had watched the Great Sage compete with the Erlang Immortal Master with spiritual spells. In the end, Wukong was captured. The immortals tied Wukong to the monster execution block. He was struck by immortal sabers and other godly weapons before godly thunderbolts and celestial fires were applied. However, those methods were all useless. Then, he was thrown into Laozi’s Brazier of Eight Trigrams. He was smelted by high and low heat. The viewers were enthralled by the scenes.","“What is the Samadhi fire-?!” The viewers watched as Laozi used the Samadhi fire to burn Sun Wukong. It hurt so much that Sun Wukong screamed in pain.","“Then, this time...?” Worriedly, the viewers looked at the brazier in which the Great Sage screamed pathetically. Even though the previous heavenly thunderbolts and fires couldn’t burn one strand of hair off him, the viewers felt like their hearts were in their throats at this moment.","Then, they saw the brazier burst open, and a monkey, engulfed in blazing flames, and shooting out golden dazzling light beams from his eyes, broke out and fought his way to the Treasure Hall of Divine Mists.","Watching the entire Heaven being shattered by this monkey while all the gods in the Treasure Hall of Divine Mists retreated from him, all the cultivators and warriors who were watching Journey to the West in the shops cheered.","Bedlam broke out in the shops while everyone, men and women, old and young, cheered!","Perhaps they had never imagined that they would laugh and feel sad because of a monkey.","It didn’t matter whether or not he won or lost this battle. The image of this monkey had been imprinted in their hearts.","The figure who held the Golden-Hooped Rod and faced the gods who filled the sky, the body that had bronze skin and iron bones on the monster execution block, and the proud aura when he stood tall in the Treasure Hall of Divine Mists... all these formed the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal that they knew!","At this moment, they knew a monkey who was called the Monkey King; he was the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal who looked down on Heaven and Earth with great pride!","...","“Um... Sir...” In the Canglan City Shop, a big black dragon scratched his head with his claws while he watched the ending theme song on the screen, knowing it was the end of the fourth episode. “Didn’t you say... League of Legend will release a new champion gift bag? Is the champion the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal?!”","“What?! The new champion gift bag features the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal?!” The elves with keen hearing looked over from the distance and asked loudly.","“Right...” Kellybel said with sudden understanding, “I remember the profile on the gift bag was the shape of a monkey!”","“Ah-!” They immediately yelled in excitement, “We want to buy this champion gift bag!”","There were two kinds of gift bags for the champion – champion gift bag and champion skin gift bag.","“Volcanic Wukong...?!” Widened-eyed, one elf stared at the Sun Wukong who was engulfed in blazing flames and had golden lights shooting from his eyes. This elf shouted, “Wow-! This is...”","“This is how he looked when he came out from Laozi’s brazier...?!”","“This is so cool! I’ll buy this one-!”","“Ahh-! I’ll buy it too-!”","“I’ll buy this Volcanic Wukong skin!”","“But...” The First Elder of the Elf Clan stroked his beard and thought that things were not as simple as they looked. He asked immediately, “How come the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal came to the Valoran Continent...”","Although Sun Wukong could travel 108,000 li with one Cloud Somersault, the Valoran Continent wasn’t just a distant place!","“Sir...?! Is the Valoran Continent in this world too?”","Instantly, the elves, knights, and assassins all looked curious. “Sir... this world has only four continents in the east, west, south, and north, right? Where does the Valoran Continent come from?”","“No... even if the relationship between the Valoran Continent and the four continents in Journey to the West is like the relationship between the West Continent and the East Continent, there’re no such four continents in League of Legends!”","“Um...? This...” Mr. Fang found that it was a difficult question to answer.","But he was the shop owner and must answer all the questions that the customers had for the products in the shop. After thinking for a moment, he said, “Indeed, the god who created the Valoran Continent is not from the same world as Journey to the West, but...”","Mr. Fang took a moment to organize his words. “A powerful organization named QQ Penguin from the mysterious east bought the entire Summoner’s Rift. In answer to the wishes of the summoners from the mysterious east, it connected the two worlds.”","“At this moment, the Great Sage feels lonely in Heaven and sent a spirit doppelganger here to relieve his boredom by joining the fight,” Mr. Fang explained.","“QQ Penguin...?!” They looked at each other and thought, How come this organization’s name is so strange?","They had heard of organizations named after Kirins, dragons, or phoenixs, but none of them used ‘penguin’ as their name! Also, this organization named QQ Penguin was a huge entity that could buy the entire Summoner’s Rift!","Then, they looked at the QQ Communication App on the screen.","Everyone was started. Is this one-?!","My goodness-! We always thought that this was a simple and free chat tool that everyone has. It seems like not only the games have awesome studios such as Blizzard and Ubisoft behind them, even the ordinary-looking chat app has such a huge organization behind it!","Instantly, they found it hard to look at the logo of a penguin with a red scarf on the bottom-right corner of their screens!"]},{"number":836,"title":"Chapter 836 - Changes in the cultivation room!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","On the other side, people like the Xiaoyao Ancestral Master, one of the four great Ancestral Masters, and Dugu Yi all bought Wukong’s champion skin gift bag.","Eagerly, they entered the game.","“First... I’ll get myself familiar with the monkey in a solo queue matchup.” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master rubbed his hands eagerly. Although Sun Wukong was a melee champion, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master saw the gods and immortals in the Journey to the West could engage in both melee combat and ranged battles, so he decided to try it.","Upon entering the game, Xiaoyao Ancestral Master looked at the champion options and asked after a moment of consideration, “Which lanes are you taking?”","“P1 is top!”","[TL Note: P1 stands for player 1. In Chinese, it is called ‘first floor’]","“P2 is mid!”","“Then... P3 is support!”","“I’m P5, I will jungle then.”","“Um...?” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master was baffled. “They say players in solo queue matchup always fight for the roles. How come they are so nice today?”","They even left the carry position to me!?","But...","Since he was coming here to play the Monkey King, he asked tentatively, “How about I play support? By the way, what champions are you choosing?”","While he spoke, he moved to choose the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal when the option suddenly turned grey.","“Huh...?” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master saw that his teammate, P1, had chosen a champion with a big monkey head.","“???” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master froze.","“P1 Wukong top lane!” The announcement sounded very dominating.","As a grandmaster player, I haven’t even played the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal yet. And you, a guy from nowhere, dare to take the monkey to the top lane?!","Before Xiaoyao Ancestral Master could speak, P2 said, “I’m going Wukong mid. I’m a gold player! I ensure you guys that I’m not a feeder!”","“Bullsh*t!” P5 cursed, “I’m a diamond player!”","Xiaoyao Ancestral Master frowned and said, “Stop it. I’m a grandmaster player. Let me play the Great Sage.”","P2 said, “F*ck off! Today, I played over ten games with players who claimed to be a grandmaster, but they were damn feeders! I’m taking the monkey mid lane! If you don’t give Wukong to me, I’ll feed!”","The moment he said it, they saw P1 lock in his choice!","Abode Master Lingxu Zi looked at their ancestral master and said, “Ancestral Master is playing League of Legends again! Come over and learn from watching him play!”","The cultivators of the Xiaoyao Cave Abode all walked up.","“Huh? Ancestral Master, how come you are taking revive and teleport again?”","“Hey?! How come you guys are all charging toward the enemy turrets?!”","“Um?! Ancestral Master?!”","“These teammates are just a group of... a group of...?!” The Xiaoyao Ancestral Master slammed his hand on the desk in fury.","“A group of noobs!” Behind him, Lingxu Zi saw that their ancestral master was stuck midsentence and immediately provided the word for him.","[TL Note: In China, people call others ‘elementary schooler’ for being noobs. Many elementary schoolers in China play League, and they are bad.]","“Right! A group of noobs!” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master cursed, “This game is free for the enemies! Free!”","The moment he said it, he saw that Evil Emperor Shang Jiuwen sitting next to him was busy playing as Wukong.","He glanced at the score and saw that KD was 0-9.","[TL Note: KD: Kill – Death.]","“... You’re a noob!”","...","“I hear that Erlang Immortal Master is no less powerful than the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal...” After watching the fourth episode of Journey to the West, people were either buying Wukong’s champion and skin gift bags or talking about the content of the TV Series.","[What’s the background of Erlang Immortal Master...?] Many people sent messages to the shop owner, asking, [Sir, can you explain it to us?]","After all, this mythology system was so huge that lots of the stuff in it was unheard of for people in this world despite the knowledge that they obtained in the Legend of Sword and Fairy and the Legend of the White Snake.","At this moment, Fang Qi was in the Cultivation Room, studying the System which was 50 percent upgraded.","Words on the System Interface said, [The upgrade is not finished. Host, please experience parts of the upgraded content by yourself.]","Before Fang Qi, the world was desolate. The land had collapsed with only countless heavenly pillars supporting a giant and magnificent palace in mid-air.","An impeccable and extremely noble ultimate godly figure stood on the godly palace!","The figure was Qi Tiandi!","Standing opposite to him was a white-robed swordsman who was looking forward fearlessly with a chilly gaze while gusts flapped his robe and belt violently!","Standing next to the swordsman was a white-robed monk who raised a hand vertically before his chest with a merciful look on his face.","There were words next to the figures.","[Qi Tiandi, the Saint Demon Vital Embryo. Synchronization Rate: 3%. Complete Synchronization in this space: not available]","[Feng Zhihen, the Demonic Style Sword. Synchronization Rate: 15%. Complete Synchronization in this space: available]","[Yi Yeshu, the Brahma. Synchronization Rate... ]","Then, with a spin of the pendant in Fang Qi’s hand, the scene before him changed.","It changed into a monkey dressed in gold armor and holding the Golden-Hooped Rod. Opposite to the monkey were gods and buddhas filling the sky!","[Sun Wukong, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal. Synchronization Rate: 2%. Complete Synchronization in this space: not available]","[Yang Jiang, the Erlang Immortal Master. Synchronization Rate: 2%. Complete Synchronization in this space: not available]","As a note on the side, the synchronization rates were determined by Fang Qi’s progress in training instead of the power of the characters.","“It added... this wondrous function?! In the Cultivation Room, I can train in a certain battle as a certain character?!” Mr. Fang looked at the scene before him with great pleasure and surprise.","“Huh... Who’s sending me messages?” Mr. Fang was about to enter cultivation when many messages popped up on his communication jade.","“Erlang Immortal Master...?”","Jiang Xiaoyue asked, [Sir... Can you explain it to me...? ]","“I’m busy...” Mr. Fang replied.","[What are you doing...?] Jiang Xiaoyue asked with a pitiable expression, [Can you just tell a little bit? Just a little bit?]","“Um...” Mr. Fang thought for a moment. [I’ll tell you a story about the heavenly dog which eats the sun...]","[TL Note: In ancient China, when eclipses appeared, people believed that the heavenly dog ate the moon or the sun.]","“Okay! Okay!” The loli instantly beamed happily.","...","“Heavenly Dog Eating the Sun... do you know this story? It’s said that the naughty Roaring Heavenly Dog, Erlang Immortal Master’s pet, swallowed the sun, which is why there’s no sun during the day occasionally...” In the new shop at the East Continent, Xiaoyue played League of Legends and showed off her knowledge of the ancient legends.","“Even the Erlang Immortal Master’s dog is so powerful...” Xiaoyue’s senior sisters and elders all looked at her in surprise while gasping, “How did you learn about it?!”","“Hehehe! The shop owner told me.”","“Why didn’t he tell me?” Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun looked sulky. “Aiya!”","“Um...”","They all knew Sun Wukong’s background, but the stories of the other immortals and gods piqued the cultivators’ curiosity.","For example, they were curious about the Erlang Immortal Master, the only immortal who could break even with the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal.","“Erlang Immortal Master can do 72 transformations too... do you think that he is in fact Sun Wukong’s senior brother?!” Yu Yin said thoughtfully.","“The Great Sage already said that the Jade Emperor is Erlang’s uncle...” Mu Qing said, “He even asked Erlang before the battle, ‘I remember that the sister of the Jade Emperor some years ago became enamored with the region below. She married a man by the name of Yang and had a son by him. Are you that boy who was reputed to have cleaved open Peach Mountain with his ax?’”","[It seems like there’s a story about it...] Not only the disciples, but even the elders and the Faction Master were chatting about it in a group chat on QQ named ‘Heavenly Heritage’. The Heavenly Faction’s Elder Xiao Yunhe said, [Let’s put this topic aside for a moment. Guys, do you know how the Great Sage got these abilities... For example, how he is able to turn his hair into small monkeys?]","“Yeah...” Dugu Xiao said on the side, [I didn’t see the patriarch teach him that in the Mountain of Mind and Heart!]","Gu Tingyun replied, [In my opinion... the pithy formula that the patriarch taught is so wondrous that understanding it will lead to comprehension of many other things. Besides, the immortal elixirs greatly increased Wukong’s cultivation strength, which is why he could make those spiritual spells so powerful!]","[I must go back and hear the pithy formula again. I’ll watch it again...!] the Heavenly Faction’s Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun said."]},{"number":837,"title":"Chapter 837 - Cultivation","paragraphs":["Chapter 837 Cultivation","“How come we can only watch four episodes of the Journey to the West this week?” Jiang Xiaoyue complained while she watched the first four episodes again.","In the past, the TV Series such as the Wind and Cloud and the Legend of the White Snake released four episodes on both Monday and Tuesday, which meant that there were eight episodes each week.","But with Journey to the West, they found that they couldn’t watch the fifth episode until...","“The next week?!”","“I’ll protest to the shop owner!” Song Qingfeng said, “Since other TV Series released eight episodes each week, this one must release two episodes a day for at least four days a week!”","“Forget it.” Sitting next to Nalan Mingxue, Lan Yan sipped her milk tea and said with an unsurprised expression, “The shop owner would say, ‘Can you absorb all the content if you watch so many episodes? The shop is doing it for your own sake...”","While she spoke, she imitated Mr. Fang’s ‘majestic and tactical’ gestures.","Then, she looked at Nalan Mingxue who was sitting next to her and found that the latter was engrossed in watching the Journey to the West for the second time.","Right now, the League of Legends competition in different regions almost came to an end. Since it was set up in a way that teams had to accumulate as many points as possible, now that the teams and players were used to the system, it was much easier to participate.","“Worlds won’t begin for some time,” Nalan Mingxue said, “We can take a break when we have time.”","Therefore, they had time to watch Journey to the West a few more times.","“There’s a saying that ‘if you read a book 100 times, its true meaning will present itself to you.” Nalan Mingxue said, “There are three days before the next episode is released. We can watch the first four episodes many times during this time and will eventually obtain some benefits.”","In this world, the teleportation technology for cultivators between different continents was very mature.","The Heavenly Faction and the Heavenly Academy shared the same origin despite the fact that one was in the Continent of Immortal Relics while the other was in the Continent of the Immortal Village. At this moment, they were discussing in the group chat.","[Do you think... we should build more teleportation arrays?] Gu Tingyun said in the group, [After all, there is only a small-scale private trans-continental teleportation array between us. It’s not convenient.]","[Old Academy Master Gu, how come you have time for this trivial stuff?] Heavenly Faction Master Feng Xuehe laughed and said.","[A few days ago, some families, like the Tang and Xun, asked me to borrow the teleportation array so that they could go to the East Continent for exchange...] Gu Tingyu shook his head. [But I couldn’t help them...]","Some disciples of my academy even applied to go on a study tour in... the West Continent!] Gu Tingyun sent a dizzy face emoji. [I just... can’t do it!]","[This is indeed an important issue.] Grand Elder Zhuge Qingyun said, [With more teleportation arrays, we can help each other in emergencies. I think it’s necessary to build more of them.]","It was still peaceful and serene in the shops with people either watching the TV Series, chatting on QQ, or playing games with concentration.","They were studying all kinds of game skills.","At this moment, Mr. Fang was alone in the System’s Cultivation Room.","The previous Cultivation Room had only one cultivation mode, which was choosing one character from the games, movies, or TV Series and fighting this person. As the synchronization rate increased, the benefits that Fang Qi received rose accordingly.","Meanwhile, Fang Qi could continuously learn and improve the character’s battle skills during the process and make them his own skills.","But there was one shortcoming with this mode. When the character that he chose had a battle force too high for him, he would be killed in one attack and thus couldn’t learn anything or increase his","cultivation strength.","After the System was 50 percent upgraded, the Cultivation Room added a brand-new cultivation mode. Fang Qi could now synchronize with one character from a game, movie, or TV Series and simulate a battle.","Cultivating this way, his foundation wouldn’t be lacking.","When he synchronized with some characters who had higher strength, his cultivation strength would increase much faster than before.","Of course, in the Cultivation Room, he had to have at least 10 percent basic synchronization rate with the characters before he could perform Complete Synchronize in the Cultivation Room. It meant that the previous cultivation progress made was still useful.","“Which one should I choose...?” The scenes before Mr. Fang changed constantly. Of course, Fang Qi’s current synchronization progress wasn’t enough to battle any gods or the 100,000 heavenly generals and soldiers that were present in the Havoc in Heaven.","“Havoc in the Region of Darkness ...”","The scene before Fang Qi was a monkey holding the Golden-Hooped Rod and facing a group of ghost soldiers.","In the Battle of the Havoc in Heaven, Fang Qi only had a two percent synchronization rate with Sun Wukong. But in this battle, his synchronization rate increased to seven percent.","“Is it because... at this moment, Sun Wukong hasn’t gone to the Heaven and stolen immortal peaches yet, and thus he has a lower cultivation strength compared to when he caused the Havoc in Heaven?” After thinking, Fang Qi spun the pendant in his hand again and changed to another scene. This time, the monkey was looking down at the distant Flower-Fruit Mountain while in the Cloud Somersault. He didn’t have the Golden-Hooped Rod with him.","Below the cloud, a black-haired demon king was bullying the small monkeys on Flower-Fruit Mountain with a big saber. It was the scene when Sun Wukong first returned from the Mountain of Mind and Heart.","At this moment, his synchronization rate increased to nine percent.","At this moment, Fang Qi nodded slightly.","[Complete Synchronization: you can’t synchronize with this character due to your low synchronization rate.]","[Do you choose to train by fighting this character?] “Yes.”","After Fang Qi chose this method, the demon king and the small monkeys dimmed out. In the sky above the Flower-Fruit Mountain, a monkey flew over on the cloud and slowly turned his gaze to Fang Qi.","Different from the mischievous monkey who liked to play, laugh, and cuss, this monkey had murderous spirit in his eyes! Targeted!","Then, Fang Qi saw a blur when the monkey in the Daoist robe instantly appeared before him!","Wukong punched out silently, but Fang Qi instinctively knew something. If I’m hit by this punch, I will certainly die!","In the last second, Fang Qi tilted his body to one side with all his effort. Although death in the Cultivation Room wasn’t real, still...","Another punch came!","Without caring for his image, Fang Qi rolled on the ground like a donkey while the fist whipped past his left arm.","Crack!","A crisp noise sounded.","Fang Qi usually turned the sense of pain to less than 100 percent when he fought unrivaled opponents in the Cultivation Room. However, this factor would affect the increase of his synchronization rate, so he wouldn’t make the sense of pain too low.","A drop of cold sweat fell from Fang Qi’s forehead.","In the next moment, another silk-tearing sound whistled toward him!","Almost at the same time, a string of pale blue data flashed in Fang Qi’s eyes.","Boom!","With a huge noise, a pair of ugly and demonic arms covered in scale gauntlets instantly blocked this strike.","A huge groove appeared on the ground while a demon wearing a red windbreaker kneeled on one knee on the ground before lifting his head slowly.","“Complete synchronization?!” Fang Qi looked at his hands in surprise. “Is this another new function after the upgrade?!”","Feeling that his energy and strength were falling sharply, Fang Qi instantly turned off Complete Synchronization. Then, the sword beneath his feet flashed, and he flew into the blue sky.","“I must use it as little as possible...” After all, the synchronization time that wasn’t traded with the godly weapon fragments was very precious as well, and Fang Qi split a period of synchronization time into dozens if not hundreds of portions to use.","The speed of Cloud Somersault was so fast that the monkey caught up with him in the blink of an eye!","The sword in Fang Qi’s hand flashed while he changed his move and turned into another figure with his robe flapping in the wind.","With a huge noise ringing in the sky, the strike almost scattered all the ethereal clouds around them!"]},{"number":838,"title":"Chapter 838 - Wish","paragraphs":["Chapter 838 Wish","-A while later-","Fang Qi lay on the ground, fatigued.","The battle was over.","The result of this cultivation was the following.","[Sun Wukong, the Monkey King of the Flower-Fruit Mountain. Synchronization Rate: 9% -> 9.5%","Synchronized Spells and Techniques: Comprehensive The increase in the Synchronization Rate: 0.5%","The increase of cultivation strength: from the pinnacle stage of the second tier of level 8 to the early stage of the third tier of level 8]","[Do you want to continue?]","“Hu...” While exhaling deeply, Fang Qi got up from the ground.","“Continue!”","A period of time later, the scene before him changed again.","A white-robed swordsman shot out sword beams that looked like fancy dancing dragons while the monk fighting alongside him unleashed extremely powerful palm strikes. However, the black-robed man before them remained intact while he blocked the attacks calmly!","Beside the scene was the stats of synchronization.","[Qi Tiandi, the Saint Demon Vital Embryo.","Synchronization Rate: 4%. Increased by 1%]","[Feng Zhihen, the Demonic Style Sword. Synchronization Rate: 20%. Increased by 5%]","[Yi Yeshu, the Brahma. Synchronization Rate: 20%. Increased by 5%]","Some time later, the battleground changed to the Dragon Palace in the Eastern Ocean...","The Region of Darkness...","“Hu...”","When evening came, Fang Qi had stayed in the Cultivation Room for more than half a year.","In his room in the Jiuhua City Shop, Fang Qi took a shower to rinse off all the smelly sweat. After wiping off the sweat on his forehead with a snow-white towel, he walked downstairs.","“Huh?” He saw cultivators and warriors such as Su Tianji, Nalan Hongwu, and Song Qingfeng sitting on the couches in the lounge area and talking about the story, spiritual spells, and martial art techniques in the Journey to the West.","“Scummy Shop Owner!” Su Tianji looked over in disdain when she saw Mr. Fang. “Where have you been today?”","She pulled him over and handed a bottle of Coke to him with an awkward smile.","“Hiss...” Mr. Fang rolled his eyes at her and said, “Don’t smile so awkwardly like that! You’re obviously up to something when you act kind to me!”","“Hehehe... we talked about Journey to the West for a long time but still can’t figure out some parts. Can you explain them?” Sitting next to Su Tianji, Song Qingfeng also said with a smile.","“...” Mr. Fang was exasperated. “When you can’t clear stages in the games, you come to me. Now, you even come to me with questions about the TV Series?!”","The group of people looked at Mr. Fang with helpless and desperate expressions on their faces.","“The lecture on Dao that the immortal gave us was so deep and profound that we don’t understand a word of it. It’s not our fault!” Su Tianji said.","“If you can’t understand it, why do you expect me to...” Fang Qi caught himself. After training in the Cultivation Room and verifying what he had learned from the synchronization practice with the content in the Journey to the West...","He realized that he indeed understood some of it! Huh...?","“Um... Today, I’ll explain a bit to you?” Mr. Fang said tentatively.","“Okay! Okay! Okay!”","“Then...” Mr. Fang looked at the sky outside the shop and said, “Today, I’ll tell you some of my understandings about the content in the first two episodes and the patriarch’s lecture on Dao.”","Xu Zixin said excitedly, “Teacher Fang, come on! Quickly start class!”","“When did I become Teacher Fang?” Mr. Fang scratched his head, feeling uncomfortable at this title since he had been used to them calling him Old Demon Fang behind his back.","“Ugh... Then, I’ll explain the part when Sun Wukong studied the super-powerful Daoist spells in the Mountain of Mind and Heart...”","In the lounge area of the Jiuhua City Shop, a group of people sat on the couches in a circle and listened to Mr. Fang’s lesson.","“Sir! Sir!” After explaining the content in the first two episodes, Lan Yan asked curiously, “You mentioned the Great Yu conquering the flood; who is this Great Yu?”","“Um... Then, I’ll tell you the story named ‘Great Yu Conquering the Flood’.”","“Sir! I have another question! Sun Wukong said that the Erlang Immortal Master had once hacked open Peach Mountain with an ax; can you tell us this story?” Soon, Su Tianji’s disciple, Fenghua, also asked, “I feel like the Erlang Immortal Master isn’t on good terms with his uncle, the Jade Emperor...”","“Um...” Mr. Fang thought for a moment. “Then, maybe I’ll tell you the story about how the Erlang Immortal Master rescued his mother by hacking open a mountain and chased after the sun with two mountains on his shoulders...”","“Great! I love to hear stories!” Fenghua clapped her hands and said with great pleasure.","Fang Qi’s class lasted until about 9 PM, and the audience expanded from those in the Jiuhua City Shop to all the other shops including the new shops at the East Continent and in Canglan City. They all watched it online.","Fatigued, Mr. Fang waved his hand and said that he would continue tomorrow, and only then did the viewers left the shop reluctantly.","At this moment, he opened the System Interface and looked at the tasks.","[Task: Challenger’s Tutorial School (Intermediate)","Task Target: 1) Help the muggle students become masters, 2) Help 80% of the students reach Grandmaster Level (Battle Skills), 3) Help the best students become challengers","Completeness: 1) 80% (12.6% increase today), 2) 45%(8% increase today), 3) 20% (6.7% increase today)","Task Reward: The Soul of Lords of Cinder*1, System Upgrade Big Gift Bag*1, 5-day access to the new upgraded system cultivation room]","“It seems like my lecture that lasted so long works...” Mr. Fang poured himself a cup of iced red tea and took a big gulp.","– Outside the shop –","The elders and disciples of the Heavenly Faction flew together while riding on flying swords, looking like a long river of shooting stars in the night sky. They shot into the sky from the entrance of the abode and flew in one direction.","Countless light beams drew a huge arc across the sky, looking magnificent even in this rainy night.","“How come the Homeland and Huaxia that Mr. Fang mentioned has so many immortals.” Flying on a sword, Senior Elder Sister Yu Yin asked, still savoring the stories.","“Boss didn’t explain them very clearly,” Xiaoyue said in a huff, “When he told the story of the Great Yu Conquering the Flood, he said that the Ying Dragon created rivers in the earth with its tail. What dragon is this Ying Dragon?”","“Besides, how come there are so many kinds of dragons!?” This little girl almost couldn’t tell them apart! There were the dragon kings in the four oceans, the Aurogon, and now the Ying Dragon.","“There are so many gods and immortals too...” Yue Bai exclaimed, “There are even many gods and immortals who are not governed by the Heavenly Court...”","“Some of the gods and immortals are very nice!” Mu Qing commented, “For example, Patriarch Subodhi who taught Sun Wukong is really amiable, not like the Star Spirit of Wuqu who is a bad and cunning being!”","“He deserved the beating!” She snorted.","“When the Great Yu conquered the flood, many immortals came to help him,” Yu Yin said longingly, “It’s a pity that we are not in Huaxia and can’t witness their magnificence...”","“It seems like the Erlang Immortal Master isn’t as fierce and aggressive as I thought,” Yu Yin said with a nod, “He’s super powerful too...!”","“So good...” They got even more envious while they talked, wishing that they had been born in the land that Mr. Fang had mentioned in the stories.","Boom–!","With an explosion, a streak of red lightning crashed down. Looking at the gloomy sky which looked as if it was the eve before a great catastrophe, countless mortals hid in their homes during the storm and shivered with sadness.","Subconsciously, they tied their robes tighter around their bodies, knowing that their strength was indeed... insufficient.","It would be great if they had the immortals and gods such as the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal, the Erlang Immortal Master, and the Great Yu in this world. At least they wouldn’t be so frightened by these evil gods."]},{"number":839,"title":"Chapter 839 - Immortal!","paragraphs":["Chapter 839 Immortal!","[Sir!] Fang Qi looked at his communication jade. Academy Master Gu?","Mr. Fang replied, [You’ve made the decision about what you want for the prize that you won in the last event? I must tell you beforehand that it can’t be something too powerful. Otherwise, I’ll go bankrupt.]","Mr. Fang was half-joking.","“Um...” After a while, Gu Tingyu replied, “I’ve made the decision.”","In fact, the prizes allocated to different factions and shops in the last event were very nice. For example, now in the Nanhua Faction, Mo Xian pointed her fingers, and an extremely miraculous-looking longsword that was engulfed in bright green light unsheathed itself.","Smugly, she looked at Liu Ningyun beside her and fluttered her long eyelashes before saying, “Junior Sister, this is the Wuchen Sword, a famous immortal sword and Li Xiaoyao’s best weapon in the Legend of Sword and Fairy. Don’t you want to try it?”","“...” Liu Ningyun had the urge to fight with Mo Xian. She stomped her feet and said, “Senior sister, even if you gave it to me, I wouldn’t take it!”","“Are you sure...” Mo Xian put the sword before Liu Ningyun while giggling.","“Aiya! Take it away! Now!”","At this moment, a hand reached between them and took away the Wuchen Sword.","It was an ethereal-looking woman with a dignified and solemn face.","The two girls bowed and greeted, “Greeting, Master.”","“Xian’er,” the Xichi Spiritual Master said, “About this Wuchen Sword...”","She made a sword energy flower with the Wuchen Sword and put it in her spiritual storage bag. She said, “I’ve talked with the elders and the Faction Master. Since you two are still young and not fitting to keep such a godly weapon, I will keep it for you temporarily until you are older...”","Mo Xian looked as if one piece of her flesh was cut out. “!!!” She was wild in frustration.","Looking timid and wanting to protest at the same time, she mumbled in a low voice, “You said the same thing when you took away our New-Year red envelopes when we were little. How old must we be before you can return them to us!”","With puffed cheeks, her beautiful eyes sulkily stared at the Xichi Spiritual Master who had flown into the air on her sword.","Beside her, Liu Ningyun shook her head and chuckled as if she had also remembered the things when they were little. She comforted Mo Xian, “It was because you snuck down the mountain to have fun and even bought more than ten ‘top-tier prehistoric spiritual artifacts’. You were even showing them off to the sisters...”","“Hehe!” Yue Yan smirked and said, “I know that too. I remember that Master was furious at you... and the next year...”","Mo Xian’s pretty face blushed. “...”","“Aiya! You guys are just jealous of my Wuchen Sword!” Immediately, Mo Xian tickled Yue Yan’s waist with her hands, afraid that the latter would tell more of her embarrassing childhood stories.","“Hehehe...” They giggled and flew away on their swords.","“Long, long ago, in the barbarian era when humans were still eating raw meat and drinking blood, there was a god who was 10,000 meters tall. His breath was like a gust, and his gaze was like a thunderbolt. There was also a demon hiding in the depths of Hell; its huge mouth opened in the darkness like an abyss and instantly devoured all the creatures in the world. One immortal taught us languages, ceremonious greetings, and manners, etc...”","“I remember that we have tales here too. In our world...” After frolicking with each other for a while, Yue Yan suddenly said.","“Yeah,” Liu Ningyun said after thinking for a bit, “In Jiuhua City, someone rewrote them and compiled them into a book. I wonder if it’s true.”","“Is it the book called Celestial Warrior?” Mo Xian said, “I read a bit of it.”","“It’s about the stories that happened later. It’s not as good as Journey to the West.”","“Right... let’s talk about Journey to the West. The spell of Heavenly and Earthly Body that the Great Sage Sun and Erlang Immortal Master used is so powerful! It can make people grow to such a height; I think they almost poked their heads through the Heavens...”","“Huh... look at Yellow Spring Sea over there...”","“The sea surface is rising? It’s natural with the rain pouring down everyday! Anyway, there are no people around here except for the ones in Half City. Ignore it. Cultivators are not afraid of a flood.”","Their voices dimmed in the dark night.","Mostly inhabited by cultivators and warriors, Half City had its defense array and couldn’t be damaged by ordinary fires or water. Even if it was devoured by a huge flood and sank to the bottom of the ocean, it could still function as usual.","However, the continuous pouring rain for days was unusual.","A flood came!","The rainstorm flooded the rivers, mountains, and the land. In the north of the Dongxuan Cave Abode where Fang Qi’ shop was, the Dragon River lay between the Heavenly Faction and the Dongxuan Cave Abode.","Like an evil dragon, the surging muddy river, containing the gods’ fury, instantly crashed down the banks in the pitch-black night and devoured more than 10,000 hectares of farmland as if a great tribulation had come.","Catastrophes always came silently, catching people off guard.","In a small town by the river, there was only silence except for the sounds of rain in the dark night.","Perhaps the storm was so loud that its sounds covered all the other sounds.","Vaguely, coughs sounded from a low house on the edge of the town.","Then, a dim light was turned on.","The lamp light was so weak and shaky that it seemed like it would extinguish at any moment under the gust and heavy rain.","“Mom... I can’t sleep...” a baby voice said with a sob, “I’m scared...”","“Don’t be afraid,” a woman’s voice sounded. “This is the fury of the immortals in Heaven. When their fury is gone, the storm will stop...”","“But when will the immortals calm down?” the baby voice sounded, “The Mr. Cultivator in the town used to say that if people did something wrong, they would anger the immortals in Heaven. But I didn’t do anything wrong... Can you tell the immortals in Heaven that I didn’t do anything wrong... I have been very obedient... Wuu...”","“Silly girl... Ay!”","Suddenly, huge explosions sound from the outside. The sound grew louder.","Creak! Suddenly, the window was opened, and the oil paper lamp shone through the window while a black shadow, looking like a black dragon, dashed its way down the mountain outside.","It instantly came to the house.","“Mom!” A shrill cry sounded. With a flash in the dark night, the voice was instantly devoured!","It completely died off in the dark night.","“Faction Master! Something is happening below!” Several light beams flashed across the sky.","Standing in the sky, the people of the Heavenly Faction gathered spiritual essence in their eyes and looked down, seeing a river mingling with a flood of mud, sand, and debris running down the mountain like a black dragon.","Vaguely, they could hear the shrill screams coming from below, and the sounds were then devoured completely.","They seemed to see a weak light of spiritual essence lightning up below them. In the light, they seemed to see an immortal statue.","People yelled and prayed, hoping that the god whom they worshipped would come and rescue them.","However, the light quickly dimmed. With countless shrill yells and howls, the people scrambled to flee in desperation. Then...","The mountain behind them collapsed!","In front of Heaven and Earth, humans were as tiny as the bugs crawling on the ground.","They felt nothing but endless despair!","“Help them!” A hoarse roar came from the sky, and countless sword beams that looked like stars dashed down like a shower!","At this moment, many people kowtowed with tears on their faces as if they saw real immortals!","– In the Jiuhua City Shop –","Lying on a couch and resting, Fang Qi watched the shop with an exquisitely made blue-covered book in his hands.","“Celestial Warrior... This book hasn’t ended yet?” Mr. Fang flipped through it casually.","“Yeah...” Shen Qingqing sipped her Coke and said, “I began reading it long ago, so I must finish it. We must finish the things that we start.”","“Hey... This immortal master’s name is not good. He’s a figure from the prehistoric time; how can he have a surname of ‘Fang’?” While dangling his leg over the knee of the other leg, Mr. Fang said in amusement.","“As the saying goes, ‘Sky is round, and the earth is square. Why can’t he have the surname ‘Fang’?” Shen Qingqing rolled her eyes at him.","[TL Note: ‘Square’ is pronounced the same as ‘Fang’ in Chinese.]"]},{"number":840,"title":"Chapter 840 - Don’t Block My Way, Guys!","paragraphs":["Chapter 840 Don’t Block My Way, Guys!","“Open the shrine; cast the spell!”","Looking down from the Connate Cliff, the world below looked like a pitch-black ocean. It looked as if many nameless ocean beasts were tumbling and roaring in the ink-colored black ocean of clouds among the occasional blinding lightning flashes.","The high platform on the cliff was about 1,000 meters high. On the platform was a three-legged cauldron with engraved dragon patterns, and a coiled dragon incense stick was burning with thick black smoke gushing out.","The smoke that was as black as ink turned the whole ocean of clouds below the cliff into black, and a big black flag embroidered with complicated bright yellow runes flapped in the gust like a black dragon.","-In the mortal world-","The rain poured down even harder as if the heavenly river was falling. In the storm which the raindrops were falling like a waterfall, the cultivator cities were intact while the small mortal nations were flooded by surging water. Outside Jiuhua City, a thunderbolt suddenly flashed, looking as if it cut the whole sky into two parts!","The array patterns on the city walls lit up for one instant and then quickly dimmed!","In the horrifying catastrophe, the river outside the city roared like a black furious dragon, startling countless demon beasts which swarmed toward the city like mindless animals!","The river water in the city surged over the banks and spread to the whole city through the streets, looking as if the whole city would be devoured by the flood.","“Ah!” Shen Qingqing shrieked when she put one foot out of the threshold. The quick currents outside the door almost swept her away!","During the night, urgent shouts sounded, “The city gate is lost! The city gate is lost!”","“The river is pouring in! Be careful of water demons! Be careful of water demons!”","“Where is the Jiuhua Army?!”","Jiuhua City had been peaceful for countless years and had never witnessed the level of chaos that was present tonight.","Gong He, the Deputy Commander of Jiuhua Army, got offline in a hurry with a few middle-aged men dressed in military uniforms and ran out.","In the Jiuhua City Shop, Half City Shop, Yuanyang City Shop... in the shops, different factions, and big families, the players faced the same situation.","This was definitely a sleepless night!","The Daoist finished casting spells and swaying the Rain Flag, wiping the sweat off his forehead and bowing to the man who was wearing an ancient-looking robe, a gold belt, and a jade headpiece.","In the gust, the man laughed wildly like a demonic god.","“Mr. Gui, I’ve cast spells for seven days continuously. I’m sure that the mortal world is already flooded. The mountains are turned into flat ground while the hills must have become swamps!” the black-robed man snickered.","“Very good!” Wearing in a blue immortal robe with embroidered silver Kirin, a gold belt, and a jade headpiece, the man said in satisfaction, “Rain Officer, well done.”","“From the beginning of time, the Gui Family has been allocated a streak of Dao essence, which gave us the honor where the world would listen to our commands. Breaking the rules made by the ancient families is equal to rebelling against the Heavens! Many years have passed, and I’m afraid that the mortals have long forgotten our power. This time, we’ll make them remember who the master of this world is!” the man said while laughing.","“It’s time!” With a mild word from him, tens of thousands of immortal soldiers behind him soared into the sky!","-Outside the Jiuhua City Shop-","Mr. Fang was fighting off large groups of demon beasts and rescuing people who had fallen into the water with the soldiers of the Jiuhua Army, but the thunder suddenly intensified in the sky with dancing lightning bolts, illuminating the whole world with bright white!","Everyone seemed to have sensed something and looked up at the sky involuntarily.","“Look at the sky!”","“What’s that?!”","“What’s happening?!”","Subconsciously, many people stopped battling and looked up at the sky in which countless lightning dragons and snakes seemed to be pulled by an unknown force and gathered in one spot.","Boundless thunderbolts gradually solidified and condensed into an extremely huge face, looking like a demonic god!","In front of godly power, everyone was like an ant. These cultivators and warriors had never seen such a scene before!","Some low-level cultivators and warriors panicked and yelled in alarm.","“Is... that a god?!”","It’s so horrifying that one tiny trace of this presence is more than what an average person can withstand.","“Are they... really here?!” At this moment, people like An Huwei, Nalan Hongwu, and Shen Qingqing in the Jiuhua City Shop took a step back subconsciously after seeing this and exchanged a look of horror.","They finally came.","Despite their previous proud words, it was impossible not to feel a bit uneasy and fear when the gods finally came.","“Have you made your final decision?” In the sky, the extremely huge head completely made of","thunderbolts said slowly.","The thunderous voice sounded like a roar from a prehistoric demonic god, hurting people’s ears.","Wild gusts swept around as if they would break everything that they touched, and heavy rain poured down as if it would devour everything in its sight!","Frightened by this presence, the countless demon beasts which had gone crazy fled to hide behind the rocks and shivered.","The mortals were even more frightened when hearing the words from an existence that looked like a demonic god under the night sky.","“What decision?!” Despite their fear, some people yelled in fury, “Here, we’ve learned how to be a cultivator, understood the meaning of life, and comprehended the meaning of Dao. We owe it to the shop owner, and do you think that we’d be so ungrateful as to back off at this moment?!”","“No!” At this moment, all the cultivators and warriors yelled furiously.","An Huwei shouted, “What did we do wrong?! What did this shop do wrong?! What made you make such a big move!?”","“Even if it’s a big deal, it’s only a small shop!” Nalan Hongwu looked at the ruined city and said with a shaky voice, “Why did you... do this?!”","“Why did I... do this?” In the sky, the huge face formed by thunderbolts said in a cold voice.","“But... I can tell you!” he said with a snicker, “The Innumerable-Immortal Sea isn’t something that you mortals could imagine. The Green Sky Immortal had warned you, but you are stubborn in your old ways. You only have yourselves to blame.","“Then...” His eyes looked fierce. “Where’s Fang Qi?!”","“Sir!” Shen Qingqing looked at the silent Mr. Fang beside her.","Everyone looked over.","At this moment, Mr. Fang deeply inhaled and walked out. “He’s right. This is the private business","concerning the shop, and you’d better stay out of it. You should back off now.”","“No!” Shen Qingqing yelled immediately.","Su Tianji also said angrily, “Kid Fang, what kind of people do you think we are?! Are we the kind of people who will take all the benefits and flee at the first sign of danger?!”","“She’s right!” Everyone gathered around Mr. Fang, surrounding him in the center to guard him. “This shop is the best shop that we’ve ever seen. We’ll guard it together!”","“If we must die, we’ll die together!”","“It seems like you won’t shed tears until you see the coffin! You can only blame yourselves for following the wrong man. Remember to reincarnate as a better being in your next lifetime.”","Gradually, dark clouds surged behind the huge face in the sky, and countless figures appeared on the clouds. The thronging crowds were all... immortals!","A huge eye appeared in the dense clouds in the sky.","In the eye of the clouds, endless tribulation","thunderbolts gathered. The horrifying thunderbolts could turn any ordinary people into dust.","With countless immortals casting spells together, the Heaven and Earth instantly changed color, and the mountain and land shook!","“You can only blame yourselves for touching the things that you’re not supposed to touch. Today, I’ll show you the difference between immortals and mortals!”","At this moment, everyone saw a huge rainbow-like light pillar shooting down from the Heaven!","Facing such a catastrophe, almost no one could rouse any hope. No one could block such an attack, not even a god. As to Mr. Fang...","Regardless of how powerful he was, he was not a god! Even if he was a god, what could an average god do at this moment?","With weapons in their hands, they stood firmly before Mr. Fang.","In this instant, they remembered the catastrophes that Qi Tiandi caused when he descended to the mortal world and when Carloso destroyed the Arad","Continent. Such a catastrophe was beginning now!","“You guys...” Mr. Fang pushed out of the crowd with great efforts, sweating profusely. Then, he said impatiently, “Don’t block my way, guys!”"]},{"number":841,"title":"Chapter 841 - The Mortal World Is Filthy Again!","paragraphs":["Chapter 841 The Mortal World Is Filthy Again!","As mentioned before, Mr. Fang had the last godly weapon fragment that the System gave him as a reward.","It was his last trump card, but now wasn’t time to hesitate.","At this moment, Mr. Fang browsed the content on the System Interface.","Mr. Fang was about to make the move when the System Interface beeped.","[New Task: Play Safely and Peacefully at the Internet Café (3)","Task Description: Ever since the shop was opened, it has been favored and loved by countless players. Now, their safety is threatened due to the shop. Despite the disturbances of the small powers and spells which are like tickles to this shop, always remember – you can play safely and peacefully at the internet café","Task Target: Fight back with the most dominating method. Show the world that any people who dare to mess with the shop will bear the consequences","Task Reward: One Immortal Peach Gift Box (There is a chance to get an unripe immortal peach, lower chance to get a ripe immortal peach, and the lowest chance to get a 6,000-year-old immortal peach), 1-2 random items (The quality of the items in the gift boxes will be determined by the performance)","Task Description: When accidents happen in the shop, as the owner, you must actively find a way to solve it! You can’t sit back and watch!]","Mr. Fang looked exasperated. Aren’t I trying my best to solve it?!","On the second thought, he decided to take the task since he would do the same thing anyway.","But... my performance will influence the quality of the items in the gift boxes? Mr. Fang thought for a second. What character should I synchronize with to achieve the greatest performance?","At this moment, the horrifying lightning pillar was crashing down!","Countless cultivators and warriors unleashed their sword techniques and spiritual spells viciously against the destructive lightning pillar.","However, they couldn’t block it. The lightning pillar connecting the Heaven and Earth fell without stopping!","“It’s over now.” Gui Yu gazed down coldly at the city, streets, and countless horrified mortals under the illumination of the lightning energy.","At this moment, it wasn’t important whether this was a big or small issue. All rebels must be punished, and anyone who dared to resist the punishment would be turned into ashes of tribulation.","We’ve cultivated for tens of thousands of years and are not here to reason with ants like you!","As a direct descendant of the Gui Family, Gui Ye was also the leader of the immortal army in the Connate Cliff. Even among the immortals, he was a lofty existence.","With this act, he would tell everyone that no one could withstand the fury of certain existences.","Not a city, a nation, or even a whole world!","He seemed to be enjoying the beautiful view of these creatures’ last moments in life.","He tried to see a trace of remorse or horror on their faces.","But sadly, he didn’t see any of it. Instead, he saw something that he had never imagined before!","The city which had been ravaged by a flood, a storm, and demon beasts shook violently. Even the land, sky, black clouds, and lightning bolts shook violently.","They seemed to be shivering!","It seemed like even the Heavens and Earth were shivering.","The storm that had been raging a moment ago suddenly froze!","Then, streaks of dazzling light shot up from below, and the huge lightning pillar in the sky suddenly paused!","Looked down from the distant high sky, everything on the ground including debris, water currents, and tiles seemed weightless as they slowly floated up toward the sky.","It even seemed like the distant ocean which had gradually calmed down surged up with huge waves that were thousands of meters high. The rainbow-like lightning pillar shooting down from the sky didn’t land!","Suddenly, it began to shatter inch by inch!","Countless streaks of lightning energy shot in all directions as if a lightning bolt from Hell exploded in the mortal world!","Some of the scattered lightning snakes shot into the forest outside the city and caused blazing fire, and some shot up into the sky, forcing the immortals to retreat in fear!","Then, the lightning pillar in the sky completely collapsed like a bamboo shoot that was being vertically chopped by an ax!","When the lightning energy dispersed, the night sky which had been covered in dark clouds suddenly turned bright as if it was shined on by sunshine. Manny colorful clouds appeared as if the dawn arrived early.","With a slight wave of a pair of hands, a thread of dark-golden sunshine fell from the Ninth Heaven and shined on the impeccable face unerringly.","The golden plumed headpiece shined with dazzling golden sunshine. Dressed in a wide and impeccable black robe which was decorated in elegant and luxurious ancient glittering jewels, he looked like an almighty emperor descending to the mortal world from the ancient Heavenly Realm.","With slightly closed eyes and a smile on his","impeccable face, his deportment, grand presence, and all features were perfect.","“This... this is ?!” All the cultivators and warriors in","Jiuhua City almost dropped to the ground. “This is... Qi... Tiandi...”","“Qi Tiandi?!”","“How... how can he come to our world ?Pi A","greater amount of horror instantly struck them.","They almost screamed in their minds!","Since the Saint Demon Vital Embryo couldn’t bear all of Qi Tiandi’s power, this being could only use a part of his power which was neither too low nor too high. After Mr. Fang trained diligently in the Cultivation Room, he was able to synchronize with this character.","“Who are you?!” In the sky, the huge face transformed from thunderbolts slowly shrunk and turned into a noble-looking young man who was dressed in a blue robe with silver patterns and had a cold expression on his face. He was Gui Ye.","After staring at the scene intently for a while, he sneered and said, “I heard from the Green Sky Immortal that this shop is backed by some defiant gods and immortals. It seems like she’s right!”","“But...” Gui Ye said while laughing, “You are such a little god! How dare you to fight me?!”","With a flick of his hands, two streaks of immortal lightning turned into two eye-piercing light beams and crashed toward Qi Tiandi like two furious dragons!","The blinding lightning bolts drew a trace of deep darkness as if they had torn open the sky!","At this moment, Qi Tiandi didn’t move; he didn’t even open his eyes. Then, a streak of dazzling light was emitted from his body before dispersing.","The two lightning dragons seemed to crash onto a natural barrier. As if pulled by an invisible force, the two dragons encircled Qi Tiandi from dozens of meters away and then exploded!","The shower of thunder and lightning bolts swept backward so much that it forced Gui Ye to retreat several steps.","At this moment, Qi Tiandi opened his eyes. “The mortal world... is filthy again!”"]},{"number":842,"title":"Chapter 842 - Who’s the God of Destruction?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 842 Who’s the God of Destruction?!","“This... this is ...real?!” In Jiuhua City, countless people yelled uncontrollably with horror in their eyes.","At this moment, they felt like they were in a dream.","“My goodness! Our mortal world is not filthy!” Su Tianji was frantic like an ant running on a hot pan with her mind turning blank after the previous narrow escape from death. She pointed in the opposite direction and said, “It’s them who are filthy. Go and hit them!”","At this moment, everyone saw Qi Tiandi slowly opening his eyes and indeed turning his gaze toward the opposite direction.","“Who are you?!” Gui Ye looked a little startled and asked in a grave voice.","“Qi Tiandi!” With every word he said, Heaven and Earth shook as space became unstable. Hovering high in the sky, he didn’t land on the ground as if the land would shatter instantly once he descended.","[TL Note: Qi Tiandi means Heaven-Deserting Emperor in Chinese.]","“Hehehehe... Hahahaha!” Gui Ye laughed wildly at his words before saying, “If you’ve deserted the Heavens, how dare you call yourself the emperor!? I’ve never heard of this name before; I’m afraid that you’ve given this title to yourself in the past 100 years? Are you the one behind this whole thing? You have some abilities!”","Tens of thousands of immortal soldiers spread out behind Gui Ye like wings, covering the whole sky!","Then, a long whip appeared in Gui Ye’s hand. Engulfed by purple immortal thunderbolts, the whip seemed to be able to instantly shatter the surrounding space as purple lightning bolts jumped on it.","“Now, I will give you two choices since I’m a person who values talented people,” Gui Ye said while laughing, “You can submit to me, or my Purple Lightning Immortal Whip will shatter your soul!”","“My...” In the Jiuhua City Shop, the cultivators and warriors stammered when they heard these words.","“What’s your decision?” Gui Ye looked at the horrified cultivators and warriors, letting the immortal soldiers behind him release all their presences. Glancing at the cultivators and warriors who became even more horrified now, he said with a snicker, “Or... Tsk, tsk! It will be bad if we frighten these pathetic mortals.”","“Minor god from the alternate world.” At this moment, Qi Tiandi said with an indifferent and mild emotion in his eyes as if he was stating an","indisputable fact. “They always overestimate themselves.”","“...” Gui Ye’s face instantly fell, and he waved his hand. “Kill!”","Countless immortal soldiers drew strange arcs in the sky, forming a weird array and surrounding Qi Tiandi, whom Fang Qi synchronized with.","Then, countless colorful light beams were emitted from the soaring mist while countless blazing purple essences turned into heaven-burning flames, shooting forward!","Passed down from the ancestors of the Gui Family, the flames had extremely high temperatures. They were the Blazing Sun Heavenly Fire that could even melt real immortals!","They were so fast that an average immortal wouldn’t have time to react.","Almost instantly, they devoured Qi Tiandi!","Seeing this, Gui Ye froze and then sneered, “If you can’t even block the Blazing Sun Heavenly Fire, then...”","Before he could finish, he saw a scene that he had never expected. A huge vortex began to spin in the center of the purple heavenly fire.","Countless heavenly flames flew backward like petals of a blooming lotus flower!","The immortal soldiers who were caught by the flames screamed. The harder they tried to put out the flames, the higher the flames grew. Finally, the soldiers fell from the sky.","In the high sky above Connate Cliff, many of the immortal soldiers corresponded with what was happening in the mortal world. They screamed as blazing flames appeared on them, and they fell from the sky like shooting stars!","At this moment, a layer of invisible but solid protective essence shield lit up around Qi Tiandi, and he was intact and hadn’t moved a muscle while standing in the center of the essence shield.","At this moment, even Gui Ye felt chills running down his spine. “Who... on earth are you?!”","“The Strengthened Saint Demon Vital Embryo can’t contain a ton of power.” Synchronized with Fang Qi, Qi Tiandi turned his hands slightly and said coldly, “But it’s a piece of cake to destroy you.”","“Protective essence shield 21 He blocked it with","that?!”","“What is with Qi Tiandi’s protective essence shield? How can... it be so strong?!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, some warriors asked in shaky voices.","Obviously, many people who had watched the TV Series didn’t study the content carefully.","Nalan Mingxue explained, “There are two layers of the protective essence shields. It’s formed by the extra essence that the Saint Demon Vital Embryo can’t contain. The two layers of pure forces of essence can’t be breached by any skills. Even if a layer is breached, it will recover instantly... So, he doesn’t need to defend...”","“No... impossible!” Gui Ye’s narrow eyes stared at Qi Tiandi intently and said in a chilly voice, “It must be hard for you to stand here, right? You are forcing it! In fact, you are burning inside and suffering from the pain, right?!”","“Anyway, we’ll find the answer in the next moment! Everyone! Put all your force into the array!” Gui Ye yelled.","“God’s Flames!” At this moment, Qi Tiandi who was synchronized with Fang Qi turned his hands, and streaks of purple-blue flames shot up into the sky!","With solely Yin, nothing can be born; with solely Yang, nothing can grow. But God’s Flame was ultimately pure and contained not a single spot of impurity.","Instantly, the purple flame engulfed the Heaven and Earth.","About ten immortal soldiers standing in the frontline couldn’t retreat in time and were turned into ashes at a visible speed in the soaring blazing flames!","Then, hundreds of soldiers behind them were engulfed by the blazing flames. Except for the soldiers standing in the distant at the back, at least half of the invading soldiers were turned into fireballs and fell from the sky!","A little while later, their number was greatly reduced!","At this moment, Qi Tiandi began to unleash the second technique. “God’s Vortex!”","The third technique. “God’s Light!” The fourth technique...","Earth, fire, wind, metal, wood, water; the techniques that Qi Tiandi casually used were within the boundary of the five elements but broke the coexistence of Yin and Yang. Every move that he made summoned the ultimate form of the purest single element. Each technique was a catastrophe that could instantly destroy the whole world.","In the sky, countless immortals were attacked by the wind, thunderbolts, lights, and flames which swept across the space while shrill screams sounded occasionally!","No one would doubt that this was the scene of the real god of destruction that had descended to the mortal world to destroy it!","A drop of cold sweat fell from his forehead. Gui Ye said in a grave voice, “I see! You’re an evil god!”","He had never imagined that these real immortal soldiers, even though they were summoned by him from the lower region and didn’t have pure foundations, would be butchered like weeds!","With great efforts, Gui Ye bit on the tip of his tongue and dripped a drop of pale-golden immortal blood on the long whip that was emitting dark-purple thunderbolts.","The purple whip lit up inch by inch, and then he lashed it toward the crowds.","The first layer of essence shield lit up and broke! Then, the second essence shield lit up and broke!","No one knew what kind of artifact it was, but it broke two layers of essence shields with one strike!","His eyes brightened. “You shall die!”"]},{"number":843,"title":"Chapter 843 - The Master of the Gui Family","paragraphs":["Chapter 843 The Master of the Gui Family","The purple lightning bolt arrived in the blink of an eye. The horrifying thunderfire shot toward Qi Tiandi who was battling with the immortal soldiers in the array. It was launched from the trickiest direction and with the chilly presence of a viper!","“In a previous battle, the Purple Lightning Immortal Whip scattered the soul of an evil god in one strike. It can even easily break the essence shields. Regardless of how powerful you are and how great your abilities are, I don’t believe that you can block this strike!” Seeing that his attack was about to hit the target, Gui Ye finally revealed a cold smile.","Meanwhile, a tremendous heavenly fire swept toward Qi Tiandi from the array built by the immortal soldiers, trying to engage all his attention!","However, at this moment, while dealing with the immortal array, Qi Tiandi, who was synchronized with Fang Qi, lifted his right hand and blocked all the attacks. Then, his left hand lowered and then struck out!","“You dare to take the strike with your palm of flesh?!” Gui Ye’s smile turned chillier.","But in the instant when the palm touched the lightning whip...","The force of purple lightning bolts suddenly poured back without stopping!","One coming in, and one rushing out... two streaks of terrifying opposing lightning energy collided in the whip. Gui Ye even felt as if the immortal whip couldn’t withstand the force of the collision.","However, this immortal artifact was personally made by the artifact elder of the Gui Family by killing a demon dragon and pulling out its meridians and blood and collecting the purest purple immortal lightning bolts in the godly sky. With the top-tier materials and the delicate creation process, it wasn’t an average immortal artifact and wouldn’t be destroyed like this.","Since this was the came, the only result was that one of the forces would be subdued and then pour back!","“What’s this move?!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, everyone saw the purple lightning whip sneak-attacking in the sky but was blocked by Qi Tiandi with a hand. Like a horrifying huge abyss beast, a greater purple lightning bolt instantly devoured the small purple lightning snake and forced it to turn around and go back!","“It seems to be the Reverse of Demonic Origin!” Nalan Mingxue obviously had studied this and explained, “In simple words, it reflects the incoming damage.”","“Is... this possible?! This is...” Song Qingfeng stuck his head out of the door and watched tensely while saying, “This... is an attack from an immortal! Besides, this artifact isn’t an ordinary device!”","“The Saint Demon Vital Embryo is a perfect life form that Qi Tiandi created to hold his awareness in the mortal world. Even though it can only contain a small part of his power, it has many abilities. It isn’t an exaggeration to call it a human-shaped weapon.”","“Even if we ignore the two layers of protective essence shields, this body is so tough that it can’t be easily damaged. Even if this body is hurt, it will instantly recover,” Nalan Mingxue explained, “The TV Series purposely left a weakness in this body when it was created, but this one...”","“It seems like it is even better than the Saint Demon Vital Embryo. Perhaps... it’s flawless!”","If Mr. Fang heard this, he would add in his mind, “After all, it’s a creation of the System.”","“Flawless?!” Everyone stared at the figure hovering in mid-air and remaining still under all the attacks. “...”","“You... you can actually 21” Seeing this, Gui Ye lost","all his cool and composure. While his pupils contracted to the size of the tip of a needle, only horror and a trace of viciousness could be seen on his face. “Explode!”","Instantly, the Purple Immortal Thunder Whip exploded, letting out a surging force which vented out in all directions!","Then, a radiant purple lightning bolt instantly engulfed the entire sky, turning the world purple.","The immortal soldiers who was touched by it were turned into ashes before they could even scream without exception!","At this moment, Gui Ye’s immortal soldiers were crushed! They no longer looked like immortals, and their formations were messy and chaotic.","After a long while, the purple lightning bolts in the sky gradually dimmed.","“Is that immortal... dead?” A group of people stuck their heads out of the shop and looked up at the sky.","“Look at the sky!” Someone pointed at the sky and said, “It seems like... he’s not dead yet!”","In the sky, the arrogant Gui Ye, an aristocrat from the ancient immortal Gui Family who came here dressed in a noble and elegant robe, now looked disheveled as his robe had become rags. His body was covered in","bloody scratches and scorched lines.","A shiny golden heart-protecting mirror had flown out from his robe and blocked most of the damage, which was why he survived this destructive explosion of a top-tier immortal artifact.","At this moment, Qi Tiandi only moved a few steps back with some scratches on his body.","Just as mentioned before, his wounds all healed in the blink of an eye as if those scratches were just an illusion.","“How... how can it be?!” Gui Ye asked in a shrill voice, “The Purple Lightning Immortal Whip is a top-tier immortal artifact even rarely seen among the immortals. How can it be?!”","With disbelief in his eyes, he asked, “Who the heck are you?! Why are you fighting our Gui Family?!”","By now, the immortal soldiers all retreated to stand behind him while asking in their shaky voice, “Mr. Gui, what should we do now...”","“What should we do now...?” With shaky hands, Gui Ye took down the heart-protecting mirror which had saved him in the catastrophic explosion and was hovering in mid-air.","Then, he injected immortal spiritual energy into it. On the mirror, extremely ancient golden runes appeared.","As the spiritual energy continued to enter the mirror, the golden runes appeared in the sky from the reflection of the mirror.","With a slightly crazy laugh, he said, “You’re indeed a powerful evil god, and I’m not your match.”","“If I were someone else with the same cultivation strength, I wouldn’t even have the chance to escape. But...” Gui Ye suddenly yelled furiously with a distorted expression, “What do you think our Gui Family is?!”","He slowly lifted the miraculous godly mirror and said, “This Nine Palace Godly Heart Mirror is a gift from the Wondrous Spell High Holiness, the Sword-Holding Elder of the Gui Family. It contains the full-force strike of that elder of the Gui Family.”","Qi Tiandi slightly waved his hands in the sky, looking indifferent as if nothing in the world concerned him.","“Foolish minor god from the alternate world,” Qi Tiandi said indifferently, “You must know only I, Qi Tiandi, can exist for eternity.”","“Eternity?!” Gui Ye sneered contemptuously and said, “Even those immortal masters don’t dare to boast like this!”","After all, immortals have the same age as the Heaven and Earth. If the Heaven and Earth were destroyed, they would die as well.","While they spoke, the figure of a white-haired old man appeared between the streaks of runes that shot into the sky from the mirror.","The moment that the shadow of the white-robed and white-haired old man appeared, a horrifying force condensed, and the Heaven and Earth around him shook continuously!","The immortal figure that suddenly appeared in the sky, the horrifying immortal spirit essence, and the force that was gradually surging showed a level completely different from that of Gui Ye who was standing below!","Looking at this streak of immortal light, Gui Ye had a reverent and manic expression on his face. He said with extreme pride, “Are you shivering?! You’ll die without regret after witnessing a move from the Wonderous Spell High Holiness, the Sword-Holding Elder of our Gui Family!”"]},{"number":844,"title":"Chapter 844 - Minor God from an Alternate World, You Did You Best!","paragraphs":["Chapter 844 Minor God from an Alternate World, You Did You Best!","In the sky, streaks of eye-piercing immortal light fell, and the shadow of the white-robed and white-haired old man waved the whisk in his hand. His move contained the wondrous rule of the Heaven and Earth and corresponded with the miraculous Heavenly Dao.","At this moment, the remaining immortal soldiers and the elite subordinates behind Gui Ye let out gasps of disbelief.","They couldn’t believe that Gui Ye still had such a trump card and that the Gui Family was so powerful.","“Wow!”","“Is... this... the power of the Gui Family?!” “So horrifying...”","Below them, the people in the Jiuhua City Shop watched the battle in fear and said in low voices, “It seems like Qi Tiandi had only used a few casual moves in the God’s series and the Reverse of Demonic Origin to reflect the attack...”","“It seems so...”","Qi Tiandi’s God’s series of moves included God’s Hand, God’s Fire, and God’s Lightning. It was equivalent to launching a streak of godly power and then turning it into different forms such as fire or lightning.","These moves were easy for Qi Tiandi to use.","However, the godly power contained the purest forces. The fire would have the ultimate Yang force, the lightning would have the ultimate direct force... every force was on the ultimate level.","At this moment, Qi Tiandi slightly lifted his left hand, and a world-destroying move was created by his palm!","Driven by the godly power, the violent gusts sweeping between the Heavens and Earth. In turn, they increased the godly power. Above Qi Tiandi’s left palm, a mini-tornado appeared, making the Heaven and Earth change color. Also, even Qi Tiandi’s hand lowered slightly as if the force in his palm wasn’t a weightless gust but a world of storms that was even heavy for a god.","Then, he lifted his right hand.","A bright blue lightning bolt transformed by the godly power shot out from his palm and turned into a lightning tree that connected the sky and land with ear-grating destructive noises. Under the light, the whole world turned pale.","Looking up into the high sky from the city below, people saw Qi Tiandi lifting the two ultimate godly forces of wind and lightning as if he was lifting two worlds. Instantly, violent gusts swept across the whole human realm with flashing lightning bolts. While sand and debris flew in the sky, the world dimmed as if it was the end of the world!","At this moment, the old man waved his whisk in the sky, and a layer of lightning bolts struck down!","Almost at the same time, the world-destroying forces of wind and lightning gathered in Qi Tiandi’s two hands gradually became one as he brought his two hands together!","When the two forces collided...","Facing the godly power of wind and lightning that could move mountains and sees and sensing the world-destroying godly presence, not only the mortals but even the immortals felt tiny and insignificant!","“Minor god in the alternate world... you did your best!” The moment Qi Tiandi said that, everyone including Gui Ye saw an unbelievable scene. The lightning bolts only held on for one moment under the force of the godly forces of wind and lightning before... completely collapsing!","They didn’t realize anything when they heard the words that Qi Tiandi said. But in the next moment, an ultimate fear struck their hearts!","Like a world-ending catastrophe, the power of wind and lightning swept up everything with the power that could move mountains and seas.","The extremely horrifying force viciously crashed toward Gui Yu and everyone around him like a huge ancient mountain.","Even though it was paused for one second by that streak of gathered immortal lightning bolts which combined the wondrous power of Heaven and Earth, no one could escape from this ocean-like power.","Boom!","With an explosive noise, Gui Ye was sent flying backward by this extremely horrifying force despite the protection of the immortal artifact.","All his internal organs and meridians were instantly broken.","The people with lower cultivation strength were burned into coal or shattered into ash by the wind and lightning.","No one in its path could remain intact!","Horrified, Gui Ye looked at the scene before him in a daze.","How could such a horrifying demonic god exist in the world?!","Minor god in the alternate world... You did your best?!","You did your best?!","“Did your best?!” This sentence echoed in Gui Ye’s ears continuously.","“Pu!” Gui Ye spewed out a big mouthful of blood and stared at the unrivaled god intently while yelling frantically, “With your power, you can get a top position in the Godly Court with ease. Why... why must you work against our Gui Family?!”","“I have a question for you!” Qi Tiandi who was synchronized with Fang Qi said, “This shop does its business without disturbing anyone. Why did you lead an army to suppress it?!”","“Hehe!” Gui Ye said with a sneer, “This tiny shop in the mortal world violated the taboo in the high realm, was rude to the immortals, and even refused to listen to admonitions. So, it must be destroyed.”","“Okay.” Fang Qi said, “Then, I’m now telling you that your rules have affected the business of my shop and must be changed!”","“What did you say?!” Gui Ye widened his eyes, not believing his ears.","No one in the history of the world dared to say such a thing!","Gui Ye laughed wildly as if he had heard a hilarious joke.","The rules jointly created by the Innumerable Immortal Sea, the Godly Palaces, and even the Godly Court must change because they affect the business of your shop?!","Just because they affected the business of a shop in the mortal world?!","“Yes,” Mr. Fang said earnestly, “They must be changed.”","At this moment, the people in Jiuhua City finally understood the situation. While laughing, they yelled in surprise, “Is he... Mr. Fang?!”","“This time, that senior must have possessed Mr. Fang’s body with his mind...”","“I’m sure that senior helped him... he’s so horrifying! He’s much more powerful than Mr. Fang...”","“I won’t destroy your vital soul,” Mr. Fang said, “I’ll spare your life so that you can bring back the message. Tell others that to ensure the prosperity of the Origins Internet Club in the lower region, you must change the related rules.”","“If you don’t change them...”","“Humph! A small shop in the mortal world dares to work against our Gui Family, the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, and the Godly Court?! Regardless of how powerful you are, you’re alone. You can defeat and kill me, but do you think that you can defeat tens of thousands of immortal soldiers and generals who will come to conquer you?!” Gui Ye mumbled to himself and then yelled, “I’ll return and tell them your request! But it’s not my business if they will agree or not!”","On Connate Cliff, a streak of vital souls rose in silence and shot toward the center of Innumerable-Immortal Sea at an extremely fast speed.","– At this moment, in the place where the Heavenly Faction disciples were –","Faction Master Feng Xuehe exhaled a sigh of relief. “How are the casualties?!” He asked.","“We happened to pass this place and came just in time. Some are seriously injured but are safe now after our healing.” The white-robed Elder Xiao Yunhe said, “I instructed the disciples to stay here and take care of them. They will be fine in a few days.”","– At this moment, in the Jiuhua City Shop –","A group of people looked at the sun which was rising from the east. “The sky is clear?”","“It’s indeed clear!” a group of people yelled in surprise.","They stood around Mr. Fang and looked at him up and down as if there was something special about him.","“It’s over! It’s over!” Mr. Fang waved his hand at them.","Then, they returned to the shop to buy instant noodles or play games.","“Hahahaha! A new day! Another day filled with hope!” Song Qingfeng laughed and yelled, “Let’s go and finish our game time for today!”","“Qi Tiandi is so powerful!”","“Finish what?!” Su Tianji said sulkily. While yawning, she suddenly exclaimed, “No! I forgot to prepare for my lecture this month! No! No!”","“What lectures can you give?!” Mr. Fang looked at her in contempt. “You will mislead students with your lectures.”","“Why can’t I give lectures?!” Su Tianji said in a loud voice, “I only give one lecture a month, but the disciples like my lectures very much!”","“Can’t talk to you now. I must go and prepare for my","lecture!” She left swiftly while standing on her sword."]},{"number":845,"title":"Chapter 845 - Many Immortals Gather; 100,000 Immortal Soldiers!","paragraphs":["At this moment, in the Immortal-Equal Garden of the Gui Family in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea.","In the garden, immortal flowers bloomed radiantly, and rare plants competed with each other to show their unique beauties. At the same time, clouds and mist floated as radiant lights shined.","The pavilions were decorated with engravings of dragons and pictures of colorful phoenixes. On the Eight Treasure Jade Table were all kinds of immortal fruits, wine, and nectar.","Immortal maidens were dressed in colorful dresses, presenting a beautiful dream-like immortal realm.","“The Spiritual Auspicious Immortal Flower is an extinct ancient flower which blooms once every 3,000 years. We’re lucky that we can see it this year.” A white-haired and long-bearded old man who was dressed in a green immortal robe stood up and said, “The flower is very noble, elegant, and pure. If a mortal smells its fragrance, they can instantly obtain an understanding of Dao. If an immortal smells it, they can reach the Great Dao. After seeing it today, I find it indeed deserving of its reputation.”","Then, he sniffed the intoxicating fragrance of the flower. “This rare flower can only be seen in your place, High Holiness. I heard that the benefits are the greatest at the moment when the spiritual flower blooms. It is a rare moment that only happens once in several thousand years!”","Sitting next to him were the grand-looking immortal holiness and several awe-inspiring Godly Dao generals. They took seats one by one. The people sitting in the front rows had mysterious immortal powers and reserved godly lights. The Green Sky Immortal could only be seen in the last row of people.","Everyone looked amiable and glowing. Before them were flower buds that was as smooth as white jade. It was almost time for them to bloom.","They were enjoying the rare benefits of this moment.","At this moment, two immortal officials hurried in with stumbling steps but were stopped at the entrance of the garden.","The immortal soldier who was guarding the garden had a chilly light in his eyes. “Wondrous Spell High Holiness is hosting the Spiritual Auspicious Flower Banquet. Today, the Heavenly Treasure Spiritual Holiness, Hell River High Holiness, and godly generals from the Godly Palaces are all here. Why are you coming here in such a frantic state?!”","“The elder is meeting Heavenly Treasure Spiritual Holiness. How dare you try to break into this banquet?!”","“I’m not being insolent! I have important military intelligence for the Holiness!” The two immortal officials said frantically.","“Important military intelligence?” The guard frowned. “I’ll go in and report.”","At this moment, the old ethereal-looking Daoist dressed in a luxurious Daoist robe was showing the flowers to the guests in the garden. Hearing this information, he said, “Let them come in.”","Soon, the two immortal officials were led into the Immortal-Equal Garden. Seeing the majestic figures and Wondrous Spell High Holiness in the garden, they looked uneasy.","“What’s the matter?” Wondrous Spell High Holiness, the old immortal with white hair, inhaled the fragrance of the flowers with an intoxicated","expression and didn’t spare a glance at them.","“This...” One of the two immortal officials was the Rain Officer who had cast spells at the Connate Cliff","Fatigued after casting spells for seven days and seven nights, he didn’t join the battle but watched the entire battle from the Connate Cliff Under the instruction of Gui Ye, he came here to report the result.","Looking at the many guests, he felt hesitant. Finally, he said, “This is an important report...”","“Humph?!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness who was enjoying the flowers looked displeased and snorted.","A nearby immortal soldier scolded, “We have high immortals and high holinesses in the Immortal-Equal Garden. What report is so important that you can’t say in front of them?!”","“This...” The Rain Officer was still hesitant. He asked tentatively, “Do you really... want me to make the report here?”","Seeing Wondrous Spell High Holiness’s face turning darker, the immortal soldier reprimanded, “Hurry up and speak what you want to say!”","“Um...” Resigned, the Rain Officer forced himself to say, “Okay.”","“Mr. Gui led immortal soldiers to severely punish the mortals in the lower region who have violated the forbidden. Almost 100,000 immortal soldiers cast spells together and condensed tribulation lightning bolts, casting them toward the resistant mortals!”","“What happened?” One high immortal asked.","The long-bearded holiness who was dressed in a green immortal robe cupped his hands at Wondrous Spell High Holiness and said, “The Gui Family has great Daoist spells, and Gui Ye is an elite who had been through several battles. I’m sure that shop has been turned into dust?”","“No...!” The Rain Officer yelled in horror. “No?!” Everyone looked at him.","“It didn’t happen!” The Rain Officer anxiously avoided their eyes and said, “At that time, we saw a golden light beam as tall as 10,000 meters, and the Heaven and Earth shook. Then, a figure appeared in the golden light beam and said, ‘The mortal world is filthy again!”","“Then, the tribulation lightning bolt that was about to strike just shattered!”","“What?!”","“The tribulation lightning bolt shattered?!”","“The mortal world is filthy again?!” The long-bearded Heavenly Treasure Spiritual Holiness repeated. “Who is he?!”","“Qi Tiandi!” The Rain Officer howled in frustration. Everyone froze. “Who’s Qi Tiandi?”","“It doesn’t matter who he is.” Wondrous Spell High Holiness remained calm and said with a faint smile, “I gave that kid, Gui Ye, a spiritual mirror which contains one of my attacks. It’s enough to deal with them.”","“Hiss... Wondrous Spell High Holiness... How long has it been since you last attacked?” a nearby immortal asked in amazement.","“The person in the mortal world could force the Wondrous Spell High Holiness to attack...” Heavenly Treasure Spiritual Holiness stroked his beard and said with a smile, “He can die without regrets.”","The immortals talked among themselves animatedly and laughed. Then, they asked, “What happened then?”","The Rain Officer looked ugly while he hesitated. “I... can’t say...”","“What can’t you say?!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness stood with his hands clasped behind his back and said arrogantly, “Speak!”","“Then...” Being yelled at by Wondrous Spell High Holiness and stared at by so many powerful figures for the first time, the Rain Officer grew even more frantic and confused. While gesturing with his hands, he said in a shaky voice, “Then, Wondrous Spell High Holiness’s shadowy palm strike was instantly exploded by Qi Tiandi... the aftermath even killed everything it touched! Even Mr. Gui only escaped with his vital soul!”","“What did you say?!” Everyone looked at Wondrous Spell High Holiness and saw his glowing face instantly turning crimson.","“Impossible!”","“What happened then?!” someone asked.","“Then... Qi Tiandi said, ‘Minor god of an alternate world, you did your best!”","“What?!”","They looked at each other. “Minor god of an alternate world, you did your best!!??”","Everyone looked at Wondrous Spell High Holiness again. “Minor god of an alternate world 2!”","The coolness disappeared from Wondrous Spell High Holiness’s eyes, and it was replaced with chilly murderous spirit. He concealed the intention in his eyes very well, but his face was as red as a monkey’s butt.","The Rain Officer shrunk and howled in his mind, “This... you forced me to say it! I told you that I couldn’t say it!”","“Although this being indeed has some super abilities... this concerns a big issue, and they... must back off.” While suppressing his anger with effort, Wondrous Spell High Holiness said in a cold voice, “Tell them this! They are just a small shop in the mortal world, and they are messing with something that the force behind the shop wouldn’t want to offend even if it was 100 times stronger. They are messing with the Heavens!”","If they could subdue the shop without a fight, they could somewhat redeem themselves.","He nodded slightly to himself and thought, Those who are experienced are smooth with all situations!","“Um... He wanted Mr. Gui to pass on a message for him...” the Rain Officer said in embarrassment.","“What word?!”","“They said... the rules jointly made by our Innumerable Immortal Sea, the Godly Palaces, and the Godly Court have affected the regular business in his shops, so the rules must be changed; otherwise...”","“Gather... gather 100,000 immortal soldiers for me! Then, gather immortal generals from all places!” Before the Rain Officer could finish, a voice roared, “Outrageous! Lawless! I’ll show these ignorant mortals how high the Heavens are and how thick the Earth is!”"]},{"number":846,"title":"Chapter 846 - The Immortal Peach Gift Box, Abundant Prizes!","paragraphs":["The rain had gradually stopped.","The cultivators of the Heavenly Faction wiped sweat off their foreheads.","“We can’t relax yet!” Faction Master Feng Xuehe said in a loud voice, “This is just the beginning. The war isn’t over yet!”","At this moment, the disciples who had just gotten some free time checked their communication jades and said, “Faction Master! The war has just ended!”","“Ah?!” Feng Xuehe looked baffled. “Didn’t it just start? How come it’s over so soon?!”","Aren’t the immortals from the Immortal Realm going to cast immortal punishments on us?! We prepared for so long and took a lot of time to make the final decision to fight the lofty existences...","The war just ended like this?!","This... can’t you keep your promise 21","A disciple handed him the communication jade, and he read the messages.","[Shocking! Qi Tiandi used his God moves, saying, ‘Minor god of an alternate world, you did your best!’]","“Huh 21 This post?! Let me see...”","They stood closer and began reading the post together.","“Okay... since our teleportation array is finished, we can send people to the Jiuhua City Shop,” Feng Xiuehe said, “Even though we didn’t experience an immortal tribulation, we still suffered a lot of losses. I’m afraid that Jiuhua City hadn’t fared any better. Elder Xiao Yunhe and Elder Dugu Xiao, take some disciples to visit the Jiuhua City Shop to gain experience and help them however you can.”","“Yes.” The two elders took the order and left.","At this moment, residents in Jiuhua City and soldiers of the Jiuhua Army were repairing the damaged structures.","At this moment, Mr. Fang had just returned to his shop from the outside.","Mr. Fang had a shop to manage and thus didn’t participate in the cleanup after they forced back the flood with spells.","After all, he had an important thing to do – receiving the reward from the System!","[New Task: Play Safely and Peacefully at the Internet Café (3) (Completed)","Task Description: ...","Task Target: Fight back with the most dominating method. Show the world that any people who dare to mess with the shop will bear the consequences","Task Reward: One Immortal Peach Gift Box (There is a chance to get an unripe immortal peach, lower chance to get a ripe immortal peach, and the lowest chance to get a 6,000-year-old immortal peach), 1-2 random items (The quality of the items in the gift boxes will be determined by the performance)]","[Task Rating:","Degree of Counterattack: B Toughness of Attitude: A Level of Warning: A-","Comprehensive Rating: A]","[The odds of obtaining top-tier items after opening the gift box increased by 5%.]","[The odds of obtaining low-tier items after opening the gift box decreased by 20%.]","[Reward: Immortal Peach Gift Box (Advanced)] [Do you want to claim the reward?]","“Huh... is this a new function after the big upgrade of the System?” In his room in the Jiuhua City Shop, Mr. Fang glanced at the interface and chose to claim the reward.","Soon an antique-looking gift box with wooden engravings appeared before Mr. Fang.","“This treasure chest... I hope I’m not so out of luck that I get an unripe immortal peach...”","Highly pleased, Mr. Fang stared at the treasure chest before him and opened it slowly.","Then, a bunch of items jumped out.","A series of system prompts appeared.","[You obtained 3,000-year-old immortal peach*1.]","[You obtained the Godly Weapon Disassembler*1 (Can be used to disassemble the godly weapons that you had gotten in the past but do not need anymore. According to the quality of the items, you can obtain at least one godly weapon fragment).]","[You obtained godly weapons, Wangshu Sword and Xihe Sword.]","“Oh?!","“I seemed to have gotten some good stuff...!”","Mr. Fang examined the items that he got carefully in excitement.","He murmured thoughtfully, “Wangshu, Xihe... Without a doubt, these two swords are godly weapons. Besides, they contain powerful spiritual energies which can raise an average half immortal to a true immortal. I guess they can do more than that since the sword energies coming off them are","brighter than those in the game. They must have absorbed all the energy of the Demon World and achieved the ultimate state. They can bring a whole faction to ascend.”","Of course, Mr. Fang didn’t have the intention of bringing one faction to ascend. Besides, the ascendance in the two worlds worked differently.","However, the power that these two swords could unleash was extremely great.","“Wuu...”","Then, Mr. Fang looked at the strange Godly Weapon Disassembler.","“I can at least get one godly weapon fragment...” After all, some of the treasures that he had obtained were sitting idle in his storage artifact.","Some were good for collection, but some were not collectibles and would find better use to be disassembled.","Besides...","Mr. Fang thought, If I can get more godly weapon fragments, can I trade them for a permanent godly weapon?","“Um...” Should he keep these fragments or use them to trade for another godly weapon? He would decide later when he found out how many fragments he would get.","“The System... is really nice!”","The last item was a 3,000-year-old immortal peach.","He was a little disappointed that it wasn’t a 6,000-year-old immortal peach, but...","A 3,000-year-old immortal peach was not bad.","According to Journey to the West, after eating a 3,000-year-old immortal peach, a mortal can understand the Immortal Dao and extend his lifespan. Eating a 6,000-year-old immortal peach can make me ascend with mist and obtain immortality, Fang Qi thought, What’s the realm of understanding Immortal Dao... Is it the Earthly Immortal Realm? And eating a 6,000-year-old immortal peach will make me achieve the Heavenly Immortal Realm?!","“Earthly Immortal Realm...?” Mr. Fang scratched his ears and cheeks. “It seems like I still can’t ascend...”","But it would greatly increase his cultivation strength.","With greater cultivation strength, he would find it easier to synchronize with different characters.","There were many benefits.","Soon, Mr. Fang turned his gaze toward the extra-large peach.","The ripe immortal peach looked appetizing. It looked as if Fang Qi would smell the rich peach fragrance with one bite of it. Looking at the big peach, Mr. Fang was secretly pleased, “I’m smart to open the treasure chest in Jiuhua City Shop, so Xiaoyue can’t see it!”","After all, he felt a bit guilty after remembering that he was always taking snacks from her.","“Hehe! After all, she is in the distant East Continent and doesn’t know that I have this big and sweet immortal peach. I’m going to eat it now!” He would pretend nothing had happened after eating it.","Bam! Bam! Bam!","A small hand pushed opened the half-closed door, and a small head poked in. “Boss! Can I come in?! Everyone is playing downstairs. Why are you hiding in the room by yourself?”","Sitting at the desk while facing the door, Mr. Fang stared at her dumbfoundedly with the extra-large peach in his hand.","“How come you’re here?!”","“How come you have such a big peach?!” Jiang Xiaoyue’s big eyes stared at the immortal peach in surprise.","“Xiaoyue...” Mr. Fang put the peach on the desk calmly and said, “I have a very delicious peach. Do you want to eat it?”","“Yes! Yes!” Jiang Xiaoyue nodded repeatedly.","“How about this? You take one bite, and I take a bite. We share it fairly. Okay?”","“Wow!? Really?!” Jiang Xiaoyue giggled happily with her eyes curved up like new crescent moons.","After all, whenever they had good food in the past, the moment that she took a small bite, the shop owner had gobbled down the rest!","But this time, he is acting fair and even offered to take turns to eat it?!","“Of course!” Mr. Fang said solemnly, “I’ve never mistreated you, Xiaoyue, right?”","“Here...” He handed the peach to her.","“Can I really?!” Jiang Xiaoyue was bashful. But looking at the peach, she couldn’t resist the temptation. “Then, I’ll take a small bite first.”","Then, she took a small bite bashfully. “Aau!”","“Wow! It’s so delicious!” The fragrance of the peach penetrated her internal organs as if her whole body was soaked in the hot spring.","Jiang Xiaoyue squinted her eyes with great enjoyment.","When she opened her eyes again...","She only saw a peach pit on the desk while Mr. Fang, with his mouth full of peach, said blurrily, “Okay. We finished it. We each took one bite.”","It was super fair!","Jiang Xiaoyue... was stupefied."]},{"number":847,"title":"Chapter 847 - Demonic God!","paragraphs":["“Hu...” On the second floor in the Jiuhua City Shop, Mr. Fang felt the qi in his body. After training in the Cultivation Room for a long time, he had managed to increase his cultivation strength from level 8 to level 9.","At this moment, the essence transformed from the immortal peach circulated in his body and strengthened his physical form and the pure essences in his body. During the process, his cultivation strength went through a huge transformation!","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue had just walked down from upstairs.","In the lounge area in the shop, the disciples from different major academies such as the Lingyun Academy and Shengjing Academy gathered together.","Coming for a friendly visit, the core disciples from the Heavenly Faction sat with them and discussed about cultivation strength.","“Hehehe... the two big disciples in our faction have rather high cultivation strength. Despite their young ages, they have respectively reached the seventh-tier and the ninth-tier of level 8,” Elder Xiao Yunhe said in pleasure.","“Look! Look at them!” At this moment, Su Tianji rolled her eyes at her two young disciples, Fenghua and Yuexin. “They are almost level 9 now, but you two haven’t reached level 8 yet. You must play the games more diligently; do you hear me?”","“Yes... Master...!” They looked dejected.","“However, talking about cultivation strengths...” Su Tianji pointed at Nalan Mingxue who sat nearby and said, “We must mention our Little Nalan who is a great example in the Celestial Warrior Association in our Dajin. She’s only in her twenties, but her cultivation strength has reached level 8!”","“In her twenties 21”","“Level 8?!”","The Heavenly Faction disciples looked at Nalan Mingxue in astonishment. “So powerful...!”","“Hey... here’s Xiaoyue! Here is Xiaoyue!” While they exclaimed, they saw Xiaoyue walking over.","Su Tianji immediately pulled Jiang Xiaoyue to her side and said with great sincerity and affection, “Xiaoyue, it’s been a long time since I last saw you. How is your cultivation strength now? Has it increased? Look at your elder sister Nalan; she has reached level 8!”","“Really?!” Jiang Xiaoyue said with embarrassment, “You guys improve so fast... I...”","“Um, you haven’t reached level 8, right...?” They comforted her. “You’re quite good already...”","“Yeah. She’s so young. In fact...”","“Burp!” Suddenly, she had a hiccup, and her presence rose sharply. “Huh?!”","“I...” Jiang Xiaoyue said doubtfully, “I seem to have reached level 9?!”","“What?!”","The games, movies, and TV Series could help people increase their cultivation strength, but...","The people with greater talents would increase their cultivation strength faster. This rule also applied in here, and the only difference was that the talent needed in the shops was the talent of playing games, which was quite different from conventional talent.","Of course, gameplay talents aside, if one had excellent cultivation talent or found a special cultivation method extremely fitting for one’s conditions, they could achieve great growth in cultivation strength with diligent training even if they had poor talent in gaming.","Anyone with one of the two kinds of talents could obtain fast progression if they worked hard.","Of course, the people with both talents would double the speed in their cultivation.","Nalan Mingxue belonged to the latter group, and her cultivation strength had been much higher than her peers due to her extremely high talents from the very beginning. Right now, her advantage over others was still obvious.","But...","“This damn girl has such great talents 21 Her talents","aren’t even inferior compared to those of people in the East Continent?” Having finished regulating his breathing, Mr. Fang walked down from upstairs and mumbled to himself.","On second thought, he wasn’t surprised. After all, the veteran players had played games in the shops for a long time and had watched many TV Series, accumulating lots of experience. However, the new players in the East Continent had comparatively weak foundations.","If the talented disciples such as Yu Yin, one of the key disciples of the Heavenly Faction, had entered the shop soon after it was opened, she would probably have reached level 9 by now.","But now, whether it was the skills that they learned from the champions in League of Legends or the Dao lecture given by Patriarch Subodhi, they obtained less understanding than the veteran players.","It must be noted that Patriarch Subodhi only taught Sun Wukong for seven years.","These people were not as talented as Sun Wukong who was born from the Heavens and Earth. But with a deep understanding of the fundamentals, their growth wasn’t slow.","In the past few days, Mr. Fang explained to them the content in the first few episodes of Journey to the West, doing the system’s task of ‘Challenger’s Tutorial School’.","However, the Origins Internet Club always promoted the combination of work and entertainment.","“Ah...” Standing up from his chair, Song Qingfeng stretched and said, “I’ll stop watching now...","“I’ll go to Dungeon Fighter Online to use up the fatigue points... then I will spend several hours playing League of Legends...” Allocating game time reasonably was a good habit.","“Ding Ding Dong Dong...” With crisp music, he entered the game.","– Meanwhile in the Half City Shop –","After the storm stopped, the flood gradually retreated.","After the rain stopped, the city looked clean and fresh after the washing of the rain.","Standing on the edge of Half City, one could clearly see that the other half of the city had completely sunk into the ocean, looking like a broken cliff.","The ocean waves below the cliff clashed with the black riffs. Looking out toward the distant ocean from the uneven edge of the cliff, the ocean looked darker the deeper it went.","As if coming from a distant dreamland, a faint singing rose with the ocean breeze, sounding like murmurs of ocean beasts. The words seemed to be in another language.","Standing on the cliff on the shore was a figure who was dressed in a dark green long dress, and her pretty long hair draped over her shoulders like ocean waves.","The two sharp fangs protruding from her red lips showed that she was a hybrid of humans and demons.","She stared at the distant Yellow Spring Sea. The turbid ocean water seemed to conceal another world underneath.","According to the legends, despite the undeterminable age, the turbid ocean was at least 10,000 years old, having a much longer history than the cultivators in Half City.","At this moment in the Half City Shop, a black cloud was bragging on livestream, “Scummy shop owner. 10,000 years later, I ensure you that he will call me Granddaddy with great respect!”","Then, it picked up a bottle of Coke and slurped through the straw. “Slurp! Ah!”","“He has no idea how great my clan is!”","From the prehistoric times, gods and immortals lived above the eternal high mountains and vast sky while the existences opposite to them lived in the endless darkness.","They were called demonic gods or evil gods. The darkness didn’t refer to a specific place.","No one knew where it was. Perhaps it didn’t exist in the mortal world.","In the dark and deep void, horrifyingly huge corpses half buried in the dust could be seen scattered around.","Carrying the roars of roaming ghosts, the yellow winds seemed to be able to tear open a person’s soul.","“We can’t defeat them on the center-stage battlefield...” a low roar as deep as the land rose in the void, “I think we should change our strategy.”","“How?” another voice said.","“We can take the road in the mortal world.”","“Our clan has planned this for a long time... It’s time to carry it out. The Heaven-Devouring Turtle has absorbed enough spiritual essence. And when the time is right...","“The weak mortals will pose no threat to us and will become a good food supply for our army...” The booming voice that was as deep as an earthquake said, “This is a good plan...”","In the endless void, a huge shadow waved its four feet and slowly moved toward a certain direction.","– Meanwhile, in the Jiuhua City Shop –","“Are you ready to take on Anton?!” With a casual glance, Song Qingfeng saw the picture of a huge turtle on Nalan Mingxue’s screen. This huge turtle was as giant as a prehistoric continent.","The Seventh Apostle Anton! It also had all kinds of horrifying coexisting monsters around it."]},{"number":848,"title":"Chapter 848 - The Tough Challenge Begins!","paragraphs":["Chapter 848 The Tough Challenge Begins!","“Fully awoken to Bodhi’s wonderous truths; he cuts off Mara, returns to the root, and joins Primal Spirit.”","In a quiet secret chamber in the Nalan Family, Nalan Hongwu sat cross-legged with his palms facing upward.","Recalling the content of Patriarch Subodhi’s lecture on Dao and Mr. Fang’s explanation, he tried to obtain his own understanding and inspiration.","He put all of these insights to verify his own cultivation and tried to merge them.","A presence much more powerful than before was activated continuously...","Among the players in the shop, some concentrated on one cultivation area while some tried every style before choosing one of them as their specialization.","Of course, people made different choices in different continents according to their own customs and styles.","For example, in the East Continent and the Continent of Immortal Relics, the majority of people were like Nalan Hongwu and mostly focused on the Legend of Sword and Fairy, the Turbulent Homeland, Wind and Cloud, Dungeon Fighter Online, and the Journey to the West.","In contrast, the people in the West Continent preferred World of Warcraft, Dark Souls, and League of Legends in which most champions had similar styles to their own.","In the Yuanyang City Shop, due to the Ultimate West Realm people who had continuously played Dungeon Fighter Online from the max level 60 expansion until now, this game was more popular than in the other shops.","The shop with the second most Dungeon Fighter Online players was the Half City Shop.","Of course, the new shops in the East Continent and Canglan City had the least players of this game.","With the arrival of the new expansion, the janitors in the shop such as Jessica were busy doing the translation of the official novel and spinoff stories during their free time.","In the lounge area of the Yuanyang City Shop, the awesome janitor team consisting of a blonde beauty and two handsome foreign-looking men was doing the translation with large piles of documents around them.","There was only a basic introduction on the official website; people couldn’t find detailed information on it.","These janitors’ job was collecting clues from the storyline and different quests and compiling them into articles before posting them on the official forum and main post bars for the players to read and understand.","Next to them were piles of materials about Arthas and Frostmourne in the Wrath of Lich King Expansion that would be released later.","Seventh Apostle Anton was a supergiant turtle that was carrying a huge volcano on its back. According to the legends, when it fully spread its giant body, it could reach the edge of the world.","Feeding on energy, it swallowed the energy from the whole world greedily and could lead to the","exhaustion of the world. After destroying its own world by exhausting all the energy in it, Anton came to this continent.","This game was different from other games. For example, in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4, it was the Ninth Heaven Mystic Fairy who had finally defeated Xuan Xiao while the players could only submit to their destiny while doing the best they could. In World of Warcraft, players couldn’t kill the ancient god C’Thun; they only acted as the vanguards and did supporting work to consume some of its energy.","It was because at that time, the players were weak and didn’t have the ability and power to handle crises on that big of a scale.","However, as time went on, they had gradually grown stronger. These players were no longer the small figures who could do nothing but follow the masters and do some supporting work. They had gradually stepped onto the historic arena!","Regardless of who they were in the real world, they were real geniuses in the games. As time went on, they experienced one catastrophe after another and obtained more understanding of more powerful ultimate techniques. They had surpassed their trainers and risen to the same level of those powerful existences whom they had looked up to!","Therefore, in the battle of blocking the Seventh Apostle, these players were the absolute main force!","At this moment, on the screens of the players from the Ultimate West Realm as well as people such as Zong Wu and Nalan Mingxue, a vast ocean under a quiet night sky appeared. Looking through the sea mist, they could vaguely see a giant continent where a blazing fire was burning.","They looked carefully and recognized that the vast continent was in fact the giant body of a prehistoric giant turtle, and on the turtle’s back was a volcano erupting high into the sky!","This turtle’s four legs extended into the bottomless ocean, looking like four pillars that were supporting the sky. Its huge feet stood on the bottom of the ocean while its body stood high up above the vast ocean.","For this giant apostle, it walked in the vast ocean as easily as trudging through a creek.","At this moment in the internet café, players such as Song Qingfeng stood behind the players in the game and watched as the huge continent gradually filled the whole screen. “F*ck... it will burst the screen!”","Meanwhile, a huge battleship flanked by several smaller battleships flew across the sky in a V-shaped formation and then spread out in one line.","They blocked the way of the huge turtle!","On the huge battleship named ‘Noble Sky’, the people stood on the bow with their robes flapping in the strong ocean wind. Some of them carried magnificent and dazzling heavy swords on their backs with blood-red eyes and ugly bloody hands, and some were dressed in military uniforms and placed huge crosses before them, and some wore grey Daoist robes and slowly tied a black gauze over their eyes.","There were about 20 of them, a team consisting of the top-level adventurers (players) in the whole game. What they faced was a huge thing on the ocean.","-Meanwhile, outside Half City-","Under the deep and deadly silent water in the Yellow Spring Sea was an endless abyss. The deeper it went, the darker it got.","A dark and evil presence surged with the hidden currents at the bottom of the ocean. The hidden currents grew more rapid at the dark ocean bottom which was tagged as the forbidden zone by all cultivators in this sea area.","In the silent roars of the sea monsters and demons at the ocean bottom, a tiny crack seemed to appear in the bottomless ocean abyss.","Vague gloomy light dots seemed to pierce through the crack, and the water began to pour back. Vaguely, an extremely huge turtle foot seemed to appear!","Frightened by the horrifying presence, countless demons at the bottom of the ocean scrambled to flee!","A voice seemed to say in the darkness, “I’m surprised... that there is a path in this place that can lead to the mortal world...!”","“The Heaven-Devouring Turtle consumed lots of energy to widen the crack!” another voice said, “Even though the essence in the mortal world is not as abundant as that in our world, it can still replenish our stock.”","“Of course. This natural supply depot can support us for months! Our clan will win this war!”","-In the Jiuhua City Shop, Half City Shop, and Yuanyang City Shop-","On the screens was the great ocean in the dark night and the red clouds in the sky illuminated by the blazing huge fire.","A vast mass of black mist spread out on the ocean.","The vast black mist gradually devoured everything in the surrounding area.","The visibility was instantly reduced to the minimum.","Gloomy winds came in the darkness, and no one knew how many demons were hidden in the mist.","“The teams are formed!” With a scroll that laid out the plans for the battle in his hand, Zong Wu said in a loud voice, “Let’s clear the origin of the black mist first. Everyone in the Challenge Team, go!”","People leaped off from the deck. While unsheathing their blades and kicking hard on the sea surface, they shot toward the giant beast in the ocean like cannon balls!","“The tough challenge begins!”"]},{"number":849,"title":"Chapter 849 - Begin to Synchronize with the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!","paragraphs":["Chapter 849 Begin to Synchronize with the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!","“Sir...” At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue came to Mr. Fang bashfully and asked with eagerness, “Do you still have peaches just like the one that we ate last time?”","Whenever she remembered its taste, she would wonder, How come there is such a delicious peach in the world?","She looked at Mr. Fang eagerly.","After all, the snacks that were out of stock had been later for sale again, so she wondered if this kind of delicious peach would be sold later as snacks.","“Oh that...” Mr. Fang thought for a while. “Not now.”","“Really? How about in the future?”","Seeing the disappointment on Jiang Xiaoyue’s little face, he immediately said, “In the future... there might be.”","“Really?!” Jiang Xiaoyue asked in elation. “Of course!”","After all, he had a peach pit in his hand. Mr. Fang wondered if he could really grow a peach tree.","He thought for a moment and decided that it wasn’t possible for now. After all, he couldn’t find any spiritual field that could be compared to the Garden of Immortal Peaches! The Garden of Immortal Peaches was a place in Heaven after all!","He waved at Jiang Xiaoyue and said, “Go and play now. If you want to eat peaches, you can buy Golden Spiritual Peaches from Dong Qingli’s restaurant. They are top quality peaches with good taste. I must go upstairs and cultivate now.”","“Really?” Jiang Xiaoyue took out her ‘smartphone’ happily. “I’ll buy some right now, and they will probably deliver them to me very soon, right?”","“Yeah, they can deliver them to me...” “How long will it take?” Mr. Fang asked.","“About half an hour...” Jiang Xiaoyue answered without thinking, “Their business is getting better and better. The deliveries used to take much less time...”","“Oh... then, I’ll come down in half an hour.” With that said, Mr. Fang went upstairs.","The Gods’ Palace stood tall on the high mountains.","This was the residence of the gods worshipped by the humans in the West Continent.","According to the legends, they lived on the high mountains in the Godly Realm. On the mountains and in the oceans, there were their cities and godly nations. The Gods’ Palace was the holiest place even for gods.","Because only the most powerful gods had the right to live here.","At this moment outside the Gods’ Palace stood lines of honor guard team which looked extremely solemn and grave.","They seemed to be waiting for the arrival of an existence.","The bright-red luxurious carpet made with fire phoenix plumes spread to the end of the passage.","An army walked toward them, emitting chilly murderous spirit as if they had just returned from a hellish battleground.","The leader was dressed in full solemn dark-golden godly armor, a red battle skirt, and had a golden battle spear in her hand.","“Did the filthy devil gods retreat?” A god dressed in five-colored godly armor walked toward them. If people who had been to the Radiant Light Godly Nation saw him, they would find that this god’s features looked almost identical to the statue of the God of Radiant Light.","“Yeah. Those filthy devil gods retreated. From the looks of it, they don’t have any plans to send out troops again for the time being.” She pulled off her golden helmet and revealed her brown long hair that was pulled up in a bun. Holding her helmet in her arm, she walked toward the depths of the shiny golden palace along the bright red carpet. “I’ll get bored again!”","Strangely, her face that as exquisite as an angel looked quite like Princess Isabella of the Radiant Light Godly Nation.","“I heard that there are some problems in the mortal world again? A powerful devil god has grown strong and is making trouble in the mortal world?”","“Hehe... powerful?” The God of Radiant Light said with a little contempt, “If all he can do is mingle with the monkeys in the mortal world, it means that he’s only a monkey with greater strength.”","“My doppelganger in the mortal world awakened some time ago,” the goddess said, “She sent me lots of useful information.”","“What? Is the Undefeatable Valkyrie interested in these monkeys?” It must be noted that the goddess with the title ‘Undefeatable Valkyrie’ had never lost a battle in the wars against the various devil gods.","She said casually, “If they can survive in the hands of the self-important wastrels from the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, I don’t mind teaching the small monkeys that are messing around in the mortal world a lesson while I’m on vacation.”","At this moment, Mr. Fang had just entered the Cultivation Room, and a scene appeared before him.","A monkey dressed in golden armor and holding the Golden-Hooped Rod looked up at the sky which was filled with 100,000 heavenly generals and soldiers who were standing on the clouds!","The flag with the words, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal flapped in the wind!","[Synchronization rate with the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal: 10.3%]","[Complete Synchronization in this space: available]","After his cultivation strength surpassed the pinnacle stage of Ascendance Realm, and he could use the dual swords, Wangshu and Xihe, in this space, Fang Qi’s synchronization efficiency improved greatly. With continuous cultivation and training, he had reached the lowest requirement to synchronize with the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!","[Do you want to start the synchronization: Yes or No.]","“Yes!”","The still scene suddenly turned alive!","Brandishing the Golden-Hooped Rod with great presence, he soared up into the sky while riding on a cloud and charged at the immortal soldiers and godly generals!","-In the Jiuhua City Shop, Half City Shop, and Yuanyang City Shop-","Large groups of players either stood behind the computers or watched the livestream on their communication jades.","“You can fight in a team in this game?!” Having played the game for a long time in the past, Su Tianji stood behind Nalan Mingxue with a box of spicy sticks in her hands, looking at the latter’s screen in amazement while eating.","It must be noted that the players in this game could always form teams of four; this rule had never changed.","To deal with this giant prehistoric turtle, the challenge team consisted of 20 powerful adventurers (players) and had the backup of elite troops from Empyrean.","On the huge battleship were all kinds of super large cannons. The most strikes that they launched were cooling radiation waves so that the adventurers could have a landing spot on Anton’s hot surface. This method also prevented part of the lava from exploding by accident.","The players were divided into five teams with different missions.","The division was made after careful research of this quest.","Obviously, they had tried it many times before.","On the screen, the extremely huge ocean beast pulled one of its giant feet from the ocean and struck out!","Instantly, the ocean water surged up, forming a horrifying tsunami. More horrifying was that the water drops splashing out by the huge foot shot out like giant cannonballs. Launched with tremendous momentum, even these simple attacks were destructive.","Mages were the first group that shot up into the sky, and then the five teams of players such as slayers, priests, and Nenmasters shot up into the sky like sharp arrows, dodging the dense attacks. They flew swiftly toward the only firelight remaining on Anton!","They landed on Anton’s huge head.","But Anton was different from most of the other giant monsters.","With other monsters, if people landed on their bodies, they had no other options but to shake their bodies to get rid of the tiny bugs.","However, Anton was like a moving giant fortress with consciousness. On its body lived a species that was coexisting with Anton, much like rhinos and oxpeckers in real life.","In fact, the coexisting monsters were also powerful, and some of them had a level of strength on par with apostles!","Anton opened its huge mouth and spat out black mist together with large quantities of monsters. Behind the monsters was an extremely huge horrifying monster which had scales on its body and interlacing sharp teeth on its belly.","Like a horrifying giant vertical mouth, the huge crack opened and revealed a void-like black hole in the belly, releasing a huge sucking force that could pull in everything it saw.","It gave people the feeling that the souls of the living creatures imprisoned in the abyss-like black hole in the belly could never enter the next life cycle!","“Everyone! Be careful!” They all looked grim. “Tog!”","[TL Note: Tog is a type of monster in Dungeon Fighter Online. The monster is known as the ‘Devour Demon’ as one of his abilities was to create a large circle under him, and he will attempt to suck players in. Players in close proximity will take massive damage and heal Tog.]"]},{"number":850,"title":"Chapter 850 - The Black Mist Wiped out the Team?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 850 The Black Mist Wiped out the Team?!","“There are Beginner Gift Bags and Returning Veteran Gift Bags on the official website; have you claimed them?” At this moment, the elf players who had just entered the game in the Canglan City Shop finally leveled up to the maximum level.","Sala accepted the quest for the second awakening and asked.","“I did! I did! This game has lots of free good stuff?” Rowling said cheerfully, “There are so many gift bags that I don’t have time to claim them all!”","“I claimed many fatigue recovery potions, level-up coupons, experience capsules, and a set of purple equipment!” Helen had recently been pulled into the game by the elves. She spent most of her time in World of Warcraft and would play this game occasionally. After all, unlike others, she only played one character and would use all the fatigue points in one hour at most.","“Have you guys reached the maximum level?” Elder Sewell yelled, “If you have, we can do the awakening quest together!”","“Okay!”","In the old shops in Yuanyang City, Half City, and Jiuhua City, the players were different from those beginners. In the past when they were in the Shadow Thunderland, they almost died in the siege of a large group of zombies.","But now, they were facing a sea of monsters...","Standing on the edge of Anton’s huge head, the adventurers felt like they were standing by the cliff of a huge mountain. They were forced to the very edge by the thick and vast black mist and the endless monsters that were flying out from Anton’s mouth.","The ocean of black monsters almost devoured them.","Controlling a Hell Bringer, Gabriel exchanged a look with Zhu Yanxiao, the Black Light Sword Saint.","Almost at the same time, a cloud of heaven-devouring blood essence began to spread. Then, with a huge shock wave, it devoured everything around it like a huge ocean wave. “Blood Boom!”","“Lightning Draw Sword!” A sword energy torn open the sky and shot out from the blood explosion.","Instantly, the chilly sword energy almost swept across the whole land on Anton’s head.","“Illusion Sword Dance!”","Other players’ powerful ultimate moves almost struck at the same time.","Chilly ice and flames collided, and sword energies swept out in all directions!","Like the leaves that were swept away by the autumn gust, the monsters were all cleared!","The Black Light Sword Saint had a blood-red huge lightsabre in his hand. Beside him, Gabriel held a huge chilly blade that was emitting shiny golden light, showing that it wasn’t an ordinary weapon.","“Be careful of the Tog!” The moment that the warning came, they saw a black figure crashing down at them. The huge and ugly body landed in the crowd in the blink of an eye, and they saw that the Tog had four heads!","It landed in the herd of monster and the destructive explosions caused by the magic spells and sword energies.","All the players who had attacked it saw the words on their game interface, [You afflicted one point of damage to the Tog.]","Bathed in the violent attacks from the adventurers, it received almost no damage except for a few shallow white scratches on its vicious scales!","The void black hole in its belly opened, and a horrifying suction force drew almost everyone toward that horrifying black hole.","The fires that it spat out looked like an erupting volcano. More importantly, when it spat out fires, powerful energy spread all over its body, bouncing back any attacks that were aimed toward it. At this moment, they could afflict zero damage! Not even one point of damage!","“Follow the plan!” Zong Wu glanced at the Empyrean battleship that was hovering in the sky. “Send signals!”","The adventurers were the main force while the military force from Empyrean was the","reinforcements.","In fact, during the previous main quest, the players had done a complete exploration before the military force created the plan. At this moment, the main force and reinforcements both played important roles.","For the monsters like the Tog, not even battleship cannons could afflict damage to it, let alone average attacks.","Perhaps it had the same ability as Anton and could devour all energy.","While biting into the peach that she had just bought, Jiang Xiaoyue watched the battle on the screen in surprise. “How do you battle it?”","“We have ways to deal with it.” Nalan Mingxue and other members of the group were obviously well prepared. She said, “This monster has high elemental resistances and is almost immune to all elements. Also, its resistance to non-elemental attacks has reached 99.5 percent.”","At this moment, the reinforcements in the sky dropped light, fire, ice, and shadow orbs which emitted faint energy light.","They were very eye-catching in the dark night sky.","“Light!” Zong Wu yelled while the long saber in his hand lit up with a pure white dazzling light.","“Fire!” In the night sky, Nalan Mingxue lifted her huge blood-colored sword, and blazing flames immediately burned on it.","She leaped up into the air, and her sword drew an arc which looked like a meteorite shower, driving the light orb with blazing flames into the empty belly.","At this moment, a hot presence spread inside the Tog. This huge monster’s scales gradually turned red like that of a roasted shrimp.","With a pathetic howl, it crashed toward Nalan Mingxue viciously.","With a clean duck, she dodged the strike perfectly.","A sword energy of blazing flames slashed out, finally leaving a shallow scorched line on its scales.","“Look, we can use same elemental attacks on it,” Nalan Mingxue explained.","As if feeling the high temperature in the game, she wiped the sweat off her forehead and said, “I’ve been studying it lately.”","“Ho... so troublesome...” Song Qingfeng said, “Only your weapon has fire elements. Does it mean that only you can fight the Tog?”","“Um, sort of.”","While they spoke, on the screen, a horrifying black storm rose around the Tog.","The storm connected with the thunderclouds in the sky, looking like a huge pillar connecting the sky and the land!","All the attacks were shattered by the storm. The members who couldn’t dodge in time were instantly swept into the storm.","Even Nalan Mingxue was swept into it.","“F*ck... the team is about to be wiped out!” Song Qingfeng yelled.","“Impossible!” The members who had dropped to the ground instantly revived with full HP after a light pillar flashed in the sky. “Use life tokens!”","In one group dungeon, players could use no more than 12 life tokens.","Besides, they found that Nalan Mingxue’s skills including the awakening skills could be used again!","She had instantly returned to her prime state.","“Pu-!” Song Qingfeng’s face darkened. “It costs one crystal each!”","How many of such revives could they afford?!","“A while ago, I bought over ten Labor Day Gift Bags,” Nalan Mingxue said, “I got hundreds of life tokens for free.”","“That’s a good deal-!” Liang Shi, a veteran player, was also watching the game while standing behind her. “You get hundreds of coins this way...”","“This gift bag sounds good,” Song Qingfeng agreed.","“Over ten gift bags cost more than 3,000 crystals, right?” Jiang Xiaoyue mumbled beside them.","“Huh-?!” Everyone exchanged a look."]},{"number":851,"title":"Chapter 851 - A Higher Realm—Omniblade! Hypervigilance!","paragraphs":["Chapter 851 A Higher Realm—Omniblade! Hypervigilance!","– In the game –","On this continent, there was a Tower of Despair.","In here, time passed extremely slowly. If not for the feeling of loneliness, the people in the tower would have forgotten about the passage of time long ago","This was one of the many holy cultivation places on the Arad Continent.","At the top of the tower which shot into the high clouds, there was a weary-faced white-haired swordsman. On his back, he carried all kinds of blades, everyone having a time-weary presence as if they each had an ancient story and a glorious name which was later erased by the history.","He raised his head and looked out of the window.","The sky outside the window had been dyed red by the evening clouds in the setting sun. Soon, night would fall.","But inside the tower, it was always dim and gloomy regardless if it was day or night. It felt like Hell without a thread of warmth in it.","On the continent, there was a legend about the Blade Master Soldoros, who was the most ancient and most powerful swordsman on this continent.","Soldoros had understood the ultimate meaning and essence of sword.","At this moment in the Tower of Despair, this Blade Master encountered the toughest opponent in history.","“Is there an end to the path of the sword?”","In the interlacing sword energies, a lazy-looking young man stood before the Blade Master with a wood stick in his hand. It seemed like he had just picked it up from the ground casually.","Yes, this young man was about to battle the most ancient and most powerful Blade Master Soldoros from the legends with a wood stick.","Godly Sword Yang Ur was a name that many people on the continent had never heard of before. But after they heard it, they would never forget it.","“Your stance is wavering just from my question, that’s no good,” Soldoros called back the Devil Sword Claris and said with a smile.","“Sorry, I just had an old thought cross my head. An end to the path of the sword.” The young man with the wooden stick sheathed his ‘sword’ and fell deep in thought.","Seeing this, Soldoros looked resigned, wondering why he brought up this question. While Yang Ur was still in a daze, Soldoros became a bit embarrassed. “Did I ask a useless question? There really is no answer... as it is a level that even you have not reached!”","“No. There’s an answer.” Yang Ur finally snapped back to reality. “There are many swordsmen who have reached our level now and we may no longer be the best swordsman. A level that even we haven’t reached; The path to the next level may open to someone out there..”","“You mean...”","“Yes, I can sense it. Although we have already attained a high level of strength, there’s so much more left for us to learn. We simply just can’t see it.”","Yes, there was no end in the path of sword.","One word’s elucidation filled with truth points to the birthless showing nature’s mystery.","Great Dao returns to the origin. Some people understood Dao while others understood the laws of nature.","– In the Nalan Family –","Before his eyes, he seemed to see the sage’s faction in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars.","He seemed to see the top of the Forbidden City in that full moon night in the Duel...","He seemed to see the sword energies sweeping around the tall Mountain Shu in the Legend of Sword and Legend...","He seemed to see the world-destroying move on Sanfen Field in the Wind and Cloud...","Nalan Hongwu suddenly opened his eyes. Lifting the longsword which had been lying beside him quietly, his eyes were as deep and bright as lakes.","Then, he stood up.","In a blur, the streaks of true sword spirits seemed to overlap with him and then combined into one.","– On the top of the Tower of Despair –","While Soldoros and Godly Sword Yang Ur were talking, a white-haired swordsman stepped into the tower.","These two were not surprised since lately, many adventurers (players) had come to challenge them to obtain the breakthrough.","It was the best place for the players to test and improve their sword techniques.","But almost all the challengers ended in failure.","However, they found that the swordsman before them was different.","Because they saw in the ancient eyes of the challenger a total understanding of everything in the world.","“Understanding one law leads to the understanding of all laws. It is indeed true!” With his right hand resting on the longsword hanging on his belt, Nalan Hongwu felt that the previous deep and mysterious sword techniques now looked very simple in this instant.","Even the newly learned sword techniques looked simple now.","The sword was unsheathed.","At this moment, the dim and gloomy Tower of Despair was lit up by this sword beam!","The radiance in this instant was as bright as the flower blooming in the dawn!","Blade Master Soldoros had heat in his eyes, and the spiritual light in his eyes burned hot!","His hand that was rested on the sword handle grasped it subconsciously; he knew what it meant.","“The next level of sword... is fascinating...” Blade Master Soldoros, the most ancient and most powerful swordsman on the continent lamented as he watched his opponent leave.","A moment ago, he lost.","Yes, these adventurers (players) had surpassed them!","For these adventurers (players), the legendary existences had been too lofty for them to reach. But now, the latter had to look up at them.","No one knew how it felt, but for the people who spent all their lives on the pursuit of Sword Dao, failures might not be a bad thing.","“Ay, it’s not easy to reach the level that doesn’t have a name yet; it might take a lifetime. Hey, don’t you think that it’s time to name this level, just like Blade Master or Grand Master?” Looking at his opponent who was leaving, Blade Master Soldoros said slowly.","“What do you think about Omniblade?”","“Doesn’t that name sound too grand? After all, no one can be sure if there’s an end in the path of sword. What should we name the level above that then?”","“We can worry about that when it comes to it!”","A hearty and sincere laughter sounded in the Tower of Despair.","They saw a brand-new level.","Perhaps they had been waiting for this moment for a long time.","This... was probably the Omniblade in their eyes!","– In the Yuanyang City Shop –","“Huh?” In the voice channel of this team, Zong Wu said, “I’ll add a main carry into our team!”","[Prompt: Nalan Hongwu joined the Challenge Team.]","At this moment, the Challenge Team had spent a lot of time to fight the small elite monsters. With a blood shower, the last Tog finally fell.","No one could make a tiny mistake in this extremely difficult battle.","At this moment, Anton opened its huge mouth – the worse nightmare came!","The monster flying out from Anton’s mouth had a physical body tougher than the Tog’s. Covered all over by armor made up of energy crystals, this monster made the Tog look like a guardian dog. This was the final boss that was guarding the Source of Black Smoke!","When the players saw it, it vanished. Then, it reappeared in the crowd while horrifying lightning energy exploded around the players.","No one dared to doubt its power; its destructive lightning bolts could kill anyone they touched!","At this moment, like the first streak of light that was tearing open the chaos and separating the sky from the earth, a sword beam spread out like wings behind Nalan Hongwu as if it was a sword soul!","The highest level of known sword technique bloomed without reserve at this moment.","Just as the saying ‘Understanding one law leads to an understanding of all laws’ went, he could easily unleash the essence of such a profound and complex sword technique.","Hypervigilance!","Attacked by this pure sword beam, the master of the destructive lightning bolts was instantly frozen in the mid-air by a horrifying sword force without the ability to fight back!","The lightning bolts covering the sky instantly scattered!","“My goodness... This play that instantly freezes the boss...”","“DPS! DPS!”"]},{"number":852,"title":"Chapter 852 - Anton broke its foot!","paragraphs":["Pure sword energies rotated around the players and then shot down from all directions like a surging river or dancing dragons!","At this moment, all attacks poured out together!","So did the sword energies that Hypervigilance created.","The wave of sword energies shot into the monster’s body like rivers pouring into the sea, and even the thick armor condensed by energy crystals couldn’t block them.","The earth-shaking furious roars resonated in the entire sea area!","Finally, the thick and wide-spread smoke retreated from the vast ocean.","Then, the giant prehistoric turtle was revealed before them again.","They successfully finished taking down the Source of black smoke!","“We passed!”","“We finally passed!”","“So amazing ” Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed while eating her peach.","“What equipment do you guys have now...?” Obviously, she hadn’t played the game for a long time.","Randomly, Nalan Mingxue clicked on Zong Wu’s profile and chose a piece of equipment.","[+12 Spirit Furious Rampage Boots. Level requirement: level 65]","[+12 Dragon Spirit (short sword): Level requirement: level 80]","[+12...]","While Nalan Mingxue explained the equipment, the people suddenly saw a strange phenomenon on their screens.","The huge turtle raised its giant head and roared furiously, shaking its head wildly afterward.","Without the protection of the monsters, Anton knew that the situation was dangerous for it and couldn’t allow these people to stay on its head anymore.","“Be careful!”","The players leaped down like huge birds from its mountain-like head and landed on its huge continent-sized body.","“Do you remember the teams you’re in?” Zong Wu yelled, “Team One and Team Two! Durable Leg! Team Three and Team Four! Shaking Battleground!”","The moment he said it, he saw the huge volcano on the head on this monster spewing out flames further away; it would erupt at any moment.","When the volcano in this ancient prehistoric huge beast erupted, if people lingered at the foot of the mountain, the result would be obvious.","Almost at the same time, bright blue lights lit up in the giant cannons on the huge battleship named ‘Noble Sky’.","They were gathering energy to launch the cooling radiation waves.","At this moment, the ocean water around the huge battleship in the distance suddenly surged up.","From the huge ocean waves shot out countless monsters, and Noble Sky was their first target!","“Team Five, return to the battleship and guard the cannons!”","The teams got to their respective jobs smoothly.","Among the five teams, Team One and Team Two were the most powerful, Team Three and Team Four were comparatively weaker, and Team Five consisted of players who had defensive classes, and they stayed behind on the battleship to guard against the ocean beasts that were swarming up","Anton lifted its legs lightly, and the whole land and ocean shook. Even when the soldiers got onto its body, they were shaken off easily.","Anton’s body was so huge, yet its moves were so agile. It had absorbed enough energy from the energy center.","Since the players couldn’t retrieve the energy from Anton, they must destroy its joints to pave way for the final attacks from the main force.","The purpose of ‘Shaking Battleground’ was to destroy Anton’s joints.","‘Durable Leg’, as the name indicated, meant Anton’s legs.","Only after they cut off all its four legs, which were as huge as sky-scraping pillars, could they completely destroy its mobility.","The players could see that the more powerful monsters were guarding these places. They had evolved into human forms after continuous growth.","Looking from the distance, the players could see the ocean water only reached the back of Anton’s feet.","Above its feet, a female demon dressed in black armor and holding a longsword in her hand soared up into the high sky with her wings of flames spread out, looking down coldly at the intruders.","Of course, most of the monsters didn’t belong to the Demon Clan, but they looked almost the same to humans.","On the ground, scorched dry corpses of the butchered Empyreal army lay everywhere.","The monster engulfed in blazing flames waved the huge staff in her hand, and the dry corpses woke up. Covered in horrifying blazing lava flames, the corpses howled wildly and charged at the adventurers!","At this moment, Anton’s huge mouth opened again, and the black smoke flying from its mouth spread out into the whole world.","Glancing at the battleship cannons, Zong Wu slashed out his sword, and the sword energies shattered the monster before him. “Team Five! Are the cannons on the battleship ready yet?!”","Just right before the volcano erupted, several bright light beams shot out from all directions above the dark ocean and crashed onto the huge volcano that was about to erupt.","The crimson volcano was gradually covered in a layer of pale blue frost and ice!","“The cannons on the battleship are safe!”","“Suppress the black smoke now! Then, use the battleship cannons again!”","Even with their current combat force, the players must act with extreme caution. If the black smoke spread to them, and they had to fight the monsters in the poisonous black smoke, the results would be disastrous.","After all, their enemy wasn’t just any old ordinary monster but the Seventh Apostle!","With its powerful healing abilities, Anton could recover with great speed from any serious injuries. Meanwhile, the monsters seemed endless as they swarmed up.","Before Team One and Team Two finished their challenge targets, the other teams must suppress and attack the places where Anton was recovering and healing, including the Shaking Battleground. Meanwhile, they must guard the battleship cannons and be ready to help when Team One and Team Two might need them.","During the process, if one team made a mistake leading to either the spreading of black smoke or the volcano eruption, the coordination of the teams would collapse!","“Illusion Sword Dance!” On the huge battleship, Illusion Sword Dance was used. The players’ sword techniques were much better than when they were in the early stages. Like doppelgangers and phantoms, the earth-shaking sword waves and countless sword shadows shattered the surging currents of monsters!","“Acura Spirit Crescent!”","Above the shaking battleground that was full of lava, space cracked open, and a black demon with horns stepped out from it.","Flames of war burned all over Anton’s huge body, and all the teams were engaged in fierce battles.","This battle lasted almost one hour. After all the system version had a different challenge time from that in the original version.","Everyone remained highly concentrated and suppressed the places on Anton’s body that they were in charge of again and again despite Anton’s powerful healing abilities. Therefore, the most powerful Team One and Team Two could attack without being interrupted.","Finally, as the radiant flames fell from the sky, the monster guarding the Durable Leg finally fell to the ground with unwilling howls.","For the first time, the most powerful adventurers revealed their true powers in front of the horrifying monster and everyone else.","In the distance, the light beams shooting out from the battleship cannons engulfed the whole night sky.","This moment was absolutely brilliant!"]},{"number":853,"title":"Chapter 853 - Apocalypse... Ahh?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 853 Apocalypse... Ahh?!","When the portal in the space opened, a mechanical arm which was almost as huge as Anton’s giant leg crashed out.","“I made this device with my life. It will help our future Machinist find the item that our countless architects built with their lives. This item will lead us to resist the rule of Bakal. Its name is Gaebolg!” The last Machinist in Empyrean said this before he died.","This was the huge machine summoned by the Mechanic during the first awakening, and it contained the will of the people of Empyrean.","The Empyrean players were all the gunner players who mainly attacked using science and technology.","As the pride of the people of Empyrean, this huge mecha from the alternate space launched its most glorious attack.","Without the protection of its coexisting monsters, Anton received attacks from the Empyrean navy and the teams of adventurers.","The explosive flames at the joints of the turtle legs and the spraying lava swept up dust and smoke all over the sky. Huge waves surged up from all directions. Despite its great power, the Seventh Apostle’s four huge legs finally collapsed with half of its body sinking into the ocean.","Returning to Noble Sky, the tired adventurers sat on the deck to rest without putting down their weapons. Ocean breeze dried the sweat and blood on their faces, but they didn’t have time to wipe them off","“Take the time to get some rest. A fiercer battle will come soon!”","Instead of feeling relaxed after the fierce battle, the people on the battleship looked grim as if a storm would come.","The huge gusts swept up surging waves from the sea and violently crashed them onto the sides of the battleship, spraying water over the rails on the ship.","Looking into the distance, the players examined the core area on Anton after its huge legs were cut off. In the core area, the tall black volcano was now engulfed by an invisible energy shield.","Any outside attacks would be blocked.","It meant that they had to enter the volcano to destroy Anton’s core and annihilate Anton.","If they entered it, the adventurers wouldn’t receive any aid from the outside.","Of course, even without the protective energy shield, Anton’s turtle shell was enough to block attacks from the outside. After all, it had only four legs exposed to the air.","Besides, Anton’s head wasn’t its vital organ, and it was useless to attack it.","Therefore, the first thing that the Challenge Team must do was entering the energy center and destroy the energy transmission that Anton used to form the protective energy shield for the black volcano.","This way, they could enter the interior of the black volcano which would lead them to its vital part.","The second step was suppressing the respawning center inside Anton to stop the respawning monsters and suppress the self-healing of the energy center.","The respawning center produced all kinds of monsters and accelerated the self-healing In Anton’s eyes, they were like parasites in its body.","Once the energy center continued to heal itself, the monsters inside the black volcano would have enough energy to support them and thus would be invincible to any attacks.","The chains of events were tightly linked","When the other teams were in position, it was time to enter the black volcano.","There were five teams, and four of them would try to create the best opportunity for the most powerful team to enter the black volcano. It was the core idea of the whole battle plan.","After the road to the black volcano was opened, the five teams were reorganized.","The most powerful members of Team One and Team Two gathered in one team.","“It looks complicated...” Song Qingfeng and others who were watching from behind gasped, “I feel dizzy just watching you guys do it. Is this monster so difficult to beat?”","“Yeah...” Jiang Xiaoyue ate her peach and said, “In the past, we only met zombie king or headless knights which were killed by a few pokes. We only needed some battle skills at most. But this battle needs such complex cooperation between different teams as you guys take on different enemies?”","She rubbed her tired eyes. Her beautiful big eyes felt dizzy as she watched the complex gameplay.","“Sister Su, do you understand what’s going on?”","At this moment, Su Tianji who was also watching from behind felt dizzy too. “I’m finished... I feel like I can’t understand these games now. Am I getting old?”","“Isn’t it simple?” Beside them, Xiao Yulv summarized in a loud voice, “With the help of the four teams that were chilling, the top figures in Team One finally killed their way into the core of this big turtle!”","“Huh?!” The others brightened with sudden understanding","Jiang Xiaoyue said, “You mean we’ve been watching Sister Xue’er chilling on the side?!”","Nalan Mingxue’s pretty face darkened.","“What chilling?!” Lan Yan was displeased. “My Lady killed the Tog and several monsters who were guarding different places!”","Then, she rolled her eyes at Xiao Yulv and said, “You spout nothing but nonsense; it serves you right that you can’t play.”","Instantly, Xiao Yulv turned red and yelled, “The shop owner... the shop owner told me that I will soon get to play!”","“When you’re allowed to play, a new expansion will be released. You can’t even support others and chill on the side!” Lan Yan said, “Be satisfied as a cloud player!”","“Ah–!” Xiao Yulv howled pathetically, feeling cold inside.","While they bickered, the fight against Anton came to the most important moment.","A pale blue energy light from the black volcano slowly fell from the sky.","He had dark-golden skin and white long hair which stood up on end with the surging energy.","His body emitted overwhelming energy Standing before him, Nalan Hongwu and the others felt like the difference between their own energy and their opponent’s energy was like the difference between the light of fireflies and that of the full moon.","“Give up resisting.”","When he opened his mouth, Anton also opened its mouth. Like thunder, they said at the same time, “Give up resisting.”","Violent flames shot out from the underground. Everything seemed to be in his control.","Irm...11","Before he could finish...","“Hypervigilance!”","“F*ck?! Again?! Awesome! Keep on attacking!”","Instantly, all the attacks transformed into a horrifying storm and devoured their enemy!","“Wave Eye!”","“Ultimate Slay: Tempest!” “Apocalypse... Huh?!”","The boss stood still and didn’t move a finger, but the heroic-looking players who had just used Hypervigilance and Wave Eye were all lying on the ground.","The healer who still had one light orb to cast looked at the boss in the eye in stupefaction. “...”","“Huh...?” Everything was silent around them.","“The volcano exploded!” Nalan Mingxue, who was still suppressing energy, saw a male healer, the only survivor, racing out from the volcano and yelling, “The volcano exploded!”","Boom!","The land shook violently. Behind him, an extremely thick beam of lava erupted from the opening of the volcano and shot into the sky.","Horrifying volcano clouds covered the entire sky as lava fell from above like a world-destroying meteorite shower!","Lava flew everywhere through the crevices on its body. The turtle shell was so hot inside and outside that it was impossible to stand anywhere on it.","Ocean waves surged up high while Anton’s four legs slowly propped it up from the bottom of the ocean, and its dim eyes lit up like stars in the night sky, emitting intense and hot firelights."]},{"number":854,"title":"Chapter 854 - Will the Various Great Dao Help Me Pass Anton?!","paragraphs":["Chapter 854 Will the Various Great Dao Help Me Pass Anton?!","“Hu...! So difficult!”","“The volcano explovded again!”","“Don’t look at Egene’s eye!” At the energy transmission center inside Anton, the huge monster who was guarding this place opened the evil eye in its belly, and one of the members was slow to react and looked at the huge eye.","He instantly died!","At the same time, the monster’s injuries were all healed!","“The energy center also exploded!”","The raid failed!","Once!","Twice!","Three times!","Looking at the words on the screen, they all fell silent.","[Prompt: your game time is up; do you want to borrow time?]","“No!”","Everyone was fatigued. If they continue raiding, their state would further deteriorate.","“Let’s go then!” The audience behind them also left.","“The Anton raid... is quite difficult. They raided it for a long time before today, and they spent a whole day on it today. However, they still couldn’t pass it.”","While the people were talking about it, the players who were in the raid got offline","Nalan Hongwu took out his communication jade and clicked on QQ before saying, “Today, everyone is tired. Let’s take a break.”","“No!” Zong Wu said furiously, “With more practice, we will surely succeed!”","“Enough!” Gu Tingyun said, “The teams are obviously not in their best state. Let’s take a break.”","“...” The people in the group chat fell silent for a while.","“No... What happened when you guys were in the volcano?” In the real world, some of the team members were warriors whose cultivation strengths had reached the Saint Warrior Realm which was equivalent to the saint-level, and there was a healer with perfect equipment. “How come you failed so many times?”","“What difficulties does the volcano pose?” Nalan Mingxue asked.","“It’s impossible to defeat the dungeon. The boss moves so fast that it’s like it’s teleporting; I can’t even see it clearly!” Zong Wu said, “Besides, the entire black volcano including the monsters and lava is completely in its control. Facing constant lava eruptions and all kinds of elite monsters, we were fighting in very bad terrain and the situation was very disadvantageous.”","Elite monsters were weaker, but even Tog was an elite monster.","In the Anton raid in the original version, lava eruptions could only be seen in the Black Volcano. But in the system version, the monster was the same one, so it knew all the skills.","“Can’t we attack with area of effect spells?”","“No. This attack reflection will affect everyone. If one member attacks it with an area-of-effect spell, the whole party will be wiped out!”","The group chat fell silent again.","Even the top masters with the best equipment couldn’t pass it!","Is this the power that a great god possesses?! “We can’t attack it at all?” Nalan Mingxue asked.","“Not exactly...” Nalan Hongwu recalled the prior scenes and said, “It has an energy shield around it, and the shield opens when it attacks. But it opens too fast, and I only got to hit it once by accident.”","“In other words,” Nalan Mingxue said, “You can only attack the moment it launches its own attack; you can’t be earlier or later than that, or you’ll be killed by your own attacks?”","“...” If they faced an ordinary master and had to attack him at the same time as him, every one of them could achieve it with ease.","But what if they were facing a powerful... god?! It was impossible to do that.","But if they didn’t attack, they would be killed.","With the great difference between the huge energy in Anton and that in humans, breaking the shield by force was even more unrealistic.","In the previous raids and group raids, they could win with strategies and tactics.","But in this raid, there were no shortcuts. They could only rely on their real strength and battle skills.","“If I practice more, I should manage it,” Nalan Hongwu said after a moment of silence.","“Old Ghost Nalan, didn’t you just return to the game. How come you’re so powerful?!” Zong Wu asked in surprise.","Then, his heart sank, knowing that he was surpassed again.","“I made a breakthrough lately and obtained lots of inspiration in ideas and battle skills.” Nalan Hongwu brandished his blade in his own courtyard. “I have a feeling of Entering Micro as the shop owner said.”","“Entering Micro?!” Zong Wu said in surprise, “Isn’t it some nonsense that the shop owner sprouted when he told the story named Terror Infinity?! He said that the people who reach the fourth level of the genetic lock, which is Entering Micro, would be existences as great as gods, and people reaching the fifth level of genetic lock would be... sages?!”","“It might be nonsense,” Nalan Mingxue said, “But I think there’s a point in his crude theory. After all, if one reaches a new realm, it’s a bit unreasonable to assume that his battle skills and control ability would still stay at the mortal level.”","“Old Ghost Nalan,” Zong Wu asked Nalan Hongwu, “How did you obtain the breakthrough?”","“... This...” Nalan Hongwu thought for a moment. “It’s hard to describe.”","“It’s a type of accumulation,” Nalan Hongwu said thoughtfully, “It’s like...a full dam. When someone opens it one day, the water pours out naturally.”","Now, he could understand any moves from any system swiftly.","“Everyone, go home and think about it,” Zong Wu said, “Let’s pause the raid for now.”","At least for now, he couldn’t think of a better solution but to improve himself.","During this period, everyone worked hard to obtain a breakthrough.","Battler skills... Entering Micro. Heavenly Sword...","“Metaphysical sword rises above anyone in history, worshipped by all swords...”","In one quiet chamber in Yuanyang City, Zong Wu, a middle-aged warrior, sat down cross-legged and calmed his mind.","His accumulation wasn’t as great as that of Nalan Hongwu. He had a vague understanding which was like the flash of spiritual light that he had obtained when he sat before the platform of that ‘true immortal’ who was giving the lecture on Dao in the Mountain of Mind and Heart.","However, all laws of nature including the doctrines in Confucianism, Buddhism, and Daoism and the wondrous truths were like flowers in the mist and moon in the water.","But now, he felt different.","The doctrines of Heaven and Earth and all kinds of wondrous truths... could they allow them to achieve the way of immortality?","Sun Wukong didn’t need any Great Dao or wondrous truths since he had his own Dao in his heart.","There are 3,000 Great Dao, and one must choose one to follow!","What Zong Wu urgently needed now wasn’t all kinds of laws of nature, but his own Dao!","If so, then he would like to ask, “All kinds of Great Dao; can any of you help me pass Anton?!”","Crack-!","Suddenly, a storm of wind and thunder rose in the sky above Yuanyang City!","The Mountain of Mind and Heart.","Mind and Heart were one thing, and the slanting moon and three stars represented the heart as well.","He didn’t know how much time passed.","“The highest excellence is like that of water” as shown in the Legend of Sword and Fairy.","All kinds of realms were reflected in his heart. But his heart was as empty as void!","“I see...” He slowly stood up in the quiet chamber.","– In the game –","– Underfoot Town –","After the era of destruction, everything in the previous world was destroyed, including the humans living there.","Now, the main city had been moved from Hendon Myre to Underfoot Town in another world.","GSD, the first trainer of all slayers, had left the small alley in the Back Street long ago.","“The sword should never hesitate!”","“A sword may conquer the flesh, but only your heart may conquer the mind!”","“...” The familiar voice echoed in his ears.","A swordsman with his eyes covered happened to enter the guild zone and seemed to see the familiar figure of the white-haired old swordsman whose voice sounded as open-minded as before but unfamiliar at the same time.","“Did you see me in another world? I can feel his presence from you, Young Man. What kind of a person... was he?”","The open-minded old swordsman who had taught all the slayers had also died in that catastrophe.","The short white-haired old man hesitated for a moment.","Suddenly, the whole world seemed to be devoured by darkness.","Only a lightning bolt shot up!","In this instant, he seemed to see... a longsword tearing open the sky and descending to the world like a god!","But in the next moment, the lightning bolt was withdrawn as if this move was controlled by him with his will!","“The thunder god has descended...! He... has surpassed us...” Looking at the adventurer who was walking away, the old man seemed to be murmuring feelingly to his other self in another world, “You... must be very happy.”","“Anton Challenge Team, it’s time to gather!”","Mr. Fang had just come down from upstairs when he saw the group, both young and old, walking together. Their fierce presence seemed to be able to force gods and buddhas to retreat.","“What are you guys doing?!” “Raid... Anton!”"]},{"number":855,"title":"Chapter 855 - Black Volcano!","paragraphs":["Chapter 855 Black Volcano!","“Coming! Coming!”","“Are you ready? If you are, we’ll begin the raid now!” On their screens, the countdown began.","[3] [2] [1] [The raid begins!]","“What’s going on with them?!” Mr. Fang looked at these people in bafflement.","“They are a group that is doing the Anton raid.” Su Tianji walked past them to buy a mug of milk tea, and she said, “Lately, they have been working hard to obtain breakthroughs in order to raid Anton. I can’t talk to you now; I need to go and watch the raid.”","With that said, she walked over to watch with a mug of milk tea in her hand.","“Ah?” Mr. Fang looked in Su Tianji’s direction and glanced at these people. “How come you’re so passionate about a raid?”","“Aiya! Scummy shop owner, you know nothing.” Walking past him, Lan Yan rolled her eyes at him contemptuously.","Then, she hurried over to watch as well.","At this moment, the players again entered this ocean, and their auras and the glints in their eyes were totally different from before!","“Who are in Team One, the one going to the volcano?” While watching from behind, Su Tianji asked this question. “I know Senior Nalan and Zong Wu are going. Who are the Avenger and the healer?”","On the screen were an Avenger dressed in a black military uniform and a Crusader dressed in a snow realm fox fur coat.","“The Avenger is the black uncle who worked together with First Champion Rosen Rain in the tournament,” Lan Yan said, “The healer is Luo Piaoling, the mild-tempered blond man from the Ultimate West Realm.”","“I thought he played as a slayer.”","“He’s been playing the game all the time and has many alt accounts.”","“Indeed?”","As mentioned before, after Anton’s legs were cut off, a huge protective energy shield appeared around the vast continent-like a turtle shell, and no attack could breach it.","The adventurers had to fight their way into it and destroy the energy supply before damaging its core.","It would be like Sun Wukong entering a demon’s belly as a fly and destroying its bodily functions.","Su Tianji stood behind Nalan Mingxue and watched the game.","On the screen, the continent-like turtle shell on Anton’s back had a totally different look.","This was the inner layer of the turtle shell made of lava. The players came here through the joints in the legs.","With lava flowing, it wasn’t too dim in this place.","It looked like an underground world full of lava and flames.","Meanwhile, people saw thick and ugly meridians and some fiery-red huge eggs in incubation.","Looking down from the high sky, they saw a layer of pale blue and almost transparent energy light engulfing the huge volcano.","Outside the energy shield, the layer of thick grey rocks protected Anton’s limbs and head like armor.","The energy shield protected the dark red and hot summit and its core.","Under the volcano, the adventurers advanced toward the source of the energy shield.","They must find the meridian point which transmitted the energy and block it, like cutting off qi by pressing on an acupoint.","In fact, the adventurers didn’t need to search for it since many monsters guarded this place. The two-headed monster with horizontal horns and a huge eye in its belly drew everyone’s attention.","Perhaps since it had put all its energy into defense, its defensive abilities were horribly high. Only when it attacked did its defense lower.","The eye in the monster’s belly suddenly opened, and the blinding evil light almost turned everything in the underground space heated and white!","A sword beam fell on it and was absorbed completely without a sound.","“Don’t look at it in the eye!” Instantly, everyone, even those who were in the process of attacking, had to turn around even though it meant that they had to take the monster’s attacks.","Anyone who saw the evil light even if they didn’t look at the eye would instantly die!","When the light dimmed, a figure dashed over like a swift wind and landed before the monster in the blink of an eye.","“Healer! Sun (Light Orb)!”","Jessica controlled a female priest and chanted. As if a hole appeared in the sky, golden light fell, and she soared up. The golden light fell like sunshine — it was the light from god.","At this moment, everyone was bathed in the golden light, and a horrifying godly power surged in their bodies.","Meanwhile, Nalan Mingxue stood before the monster. “Spacetime Cutter!”","Opening its huge arms which looked like iron pincers, the monster lunged at her viciously. However, the moment that it charged up, space shattered and Nalan Mingxue stepped into the void with perfect timing!","“Tricked it! Hypervigilance!”","A pure sword beam flashed, and the monster’s body, including the flowing energy in its body, was frozen!","“Verdant Blast!” “Ultimate Slay: Tempest!”","“Team Three and Team Four have almost suppressed the energy. Team One, get ready to get up the mountain!”","Some time later, the huge energy shield that was protecting the Black Volcano evaporated with the disappearance of the energy source.","Now, the four players stepped across the boundary and climbed onto the Black Volcano in the center of Anton’s back.","The other teams guarded the outer range of the volcano. Under the support of Anton’s huge reservoirs of energy, the monsters that they killed would respawn, and the meridians that they had destroyed would recover.","The other players waited for the energy to gather again and the monsters to respawn. Then, they would kill the monster and cut off the transmission of energy again!","– Inside the Black Volcano –","With the pungent smell of sulfur filling the scorched air, it was hotter than any other place, and it felt as if the air could burn anyone in it.","On the ground were puddles of lava. All the power of the blazing flames and everything else was derived from the interior of the volcano.","Lava flowed, golden lightning flashes tore open the darkness, and the surging power of flames filled this space. Even an ordinary god would think that he saw a vast ocean when seeing this horrifyingly huge power.","When the figure engulfed in the protective energy shield of flashing lightning snakes soared up into the sky and looked down on the intruders with chilly murderous spirit in its eyes, the final battle began.","“I’m the last successor of Odin, King of Tartans!” The figure before the players roared, and Anton’s extremely huge body also let out earth-shaking noises.","Omnipotent Mateka.","It shared one mind with Anton, but they had different bodies.","In other words, it was Anton.","With it guarding the place, no one could pass.","The blue energy shield around its body condensed the huge reservoirs of energy that Anton had absorbed for countless years. No one could breach it from the outside.","Any attack would activate powerful energy reflection which would lead to the annihilation of everything around it.","There was no way to dodge it, and no one could escape from it in any way!"]},{"number":856,"title":"Chapter 856 - The Fall of Anton!","paragraphs":["Chapter 856 The Fall of Anton!","Even the Omniblade couldn’t freeze Mateka since their most powerful sword technique couldn’t handle a body that was as huge as that of Anton and its unimaginably huge stores of energy.","Mateka and Anton were one entity.","At this moment, a group of people stood behind Nalan Hongwu and observed the scorched land on his screen.","Nalan Hongwu unsheathed the sword that was hanging on his belt with one finger, and the slim frosty light beam that could bring chills to the bones was reflected in everyone’s eyes.","His white hair danced in the wind with his flapping black robe, and the icy light beam tore open the void like a flying snowflake. Then, the pure sword energies turned into five godly swords that were hovering behind him in the air.","The lightning bolts formed a rotating circle, and Zong Wu closed his eyes lightly with the thunder sword in his hand. In the darkness, slim lightning bolts spread around and illuminated his body, turning his hair into thunder threads and making his body look like a piece of blue jade.","The thunder resonated across the whole landmass! Boom–!","With a huge earth-shaking noise, the land shattered. In the darkness, a pair of horrifying eyes lit up, and a terrifying demon slowly stood up.","Even lava could do nothing to such a powerful body.","The Omniblade, Indra, and Immortal stood together. This scene was like the war among gods!","The three adventurers took the positions of Heaven, Earth, and Man, surrounding Mateka.","At this moment, Mateka hovered in mid-air with its arms crossing before its chest. Its ancient staff hovered behind it like a shadow.","Like an ancient god, it looked down at the weak bugs that dared to mess with it.","However, in the blink of an eye, it vanished on the spot. The next moment, a horrifying gust crashed toward Nalan Hongwu from behind!","Without warning, the punch smashed onto Nalan Hongwu’s back viciously like a huge cannonball even though Nalan Hongwu had spread his powerful sword energies around him!","Crack!","With an explosive noise, the air exploded, and Nalan Hongwu was sent flying!","In the next moment, another blue light flashed behind Nalan Hongwu!","“Be careful!”","Even the audience yelled in astonishment. The move was so fast that no one could react!","However, Nalan Hongwu adjusted his position in mid-air and put his hand on the sword handle. Dust rose from the ground behind him and formed a light twirling wind.","Almost at the same time when Mateka moved, a twirling bolt of sword energy shot out with ear-grating sword whistle. The slash was so fast that it didn’t even leave afterimages.","Pierce!","Mateka instantly took several steps back. Only the dust flying up from the ground and the shallow bloody line on its arm showed that Nalan Hongwu had unleashed a sword attack.","“So fast!”","“He hit the target!”","With a pause of steps, Mateka disappeared again and reappeared before Zong Wu in the next instant!","The moment that its fist hit Zong Wu’s chest, lightning bolts shot up into the sky and seemed to cut a deep line in space!","“Hit the target again!” Although Zong Wu was also wounded, he attacked as fast as a lightning flash and didn’t make a single mistake, exciting everyone in the audience even though it was only one strike.","They had hit it twice consecutively.","On the Black Volcano, blue energy glares flashed on the land full of dust while fist, sword, and claw collided at lightning speed.","They moved so fast that the audience felt chills running down their spines!","The screen was filled with sword flashes and thunderbolts; they looked chaotic, but each strike was ultimately fast and extremely wonderful!","At this moment, a huge portal lit up on the ground around them while countless huge eggs that were jumping were transported here.","The eggs in the area suddenly cracked open and spawned countless monsters that swarmed toward the intruding adventurers!","“Suppress the respawning center!” Zong Wu yelled, issuing instructions while attacking the volcano.","When these monsters lunged at them, lava flowed all over the ground beneath their feet in just a few seconds.","Mateka was among these monsters.","They must kill these monsters. But if their attacks shot on the energy shield by mistake, then each and everyone of them would face an unavoidable fatal strike in the next moment!","One mage monster put its staff onto the ground. Instantly, lava erupted from the underground like a volcano eruption!","It further decreased the area for the adventurers where they could set their foot on. In one glance, the audience found that there seemed to be no place for them to stand on.","They were cornered under the attacks from these powerful monsters and Mateka!","The most concerning thing for them was Mateka’s speed, which was even faster than the limitation set by time and space! Instantly, no one seemed to be able to strike back!","“Finished...” Even the audience were frightened by the scene. “They will be wiped out again?”","“What’s wrong with the respawning center?”","“They seem to have insufficient DPS...” Su Tianji watched other players’ screens for a while and came back.","Energy center, respawning center, and infection center were keys to decreasing the power of Mateka in the volcano. If the other four teams made a mistake in suppressing those places, the team in the volcano would face a catastrophe!","Boom-!","When the punch came, it seemed like even a god couldn’t react fast enough to block it. Zong Wu was heavily smashed into the lava. If not for the protective thunderbolts, he would have been turned into ashes instantly!","Almost at the same time, the three figures on the screen flew backward as if they had been struck at the same time.","They didn’t even have time to attack the small monsters, let alone the boss!","“What should they do?!”","A drop of cold sweat fell.","“They can’t even defeat it in this situation...?”","“In this situation, I guess no one can reverse the momentum...”","“I’ll do it!” At this moment, Nalan Hongwu roared furiously.","He was almost knocked out by the heavy blow. After forcing himself to snap back to his senses, countless scenes and sword techniques flashed across his mind.","He learned Sword 23 from the Wind and Cloud...","He learned the Heavenly Sword from No Name...","Seeing the magnificence of the sword strike on that night, he began to realize that swordsmanship was the art to continuously challenge one’s own limit.","He had the total understanding when he stood in the sage’s faction in the Mountain of Mind and Heart.","After the breakthrough, he had been like an embryo of the godly sword with a few impurities which couldn’t be removed with ease.","However, in this awe-inspiring battle, the godly sword was tempered and forged countless times by water and fire!","“Haa-!” All the previous sword techniques that he had learned seemed to merge together in total understanding, washing out the last bit of impurities.","While he was cornered by the attacks without any ability to fight back, the five godly swords behind him suddenly flew out automatically!","In the next moment, 10,000 sword energies shot out together!","“Hypervigilance?!”","“Is he giving up?!” It must be noted that multiple attacks would accidentally hit Mateka’s energy shield, which would wipe out the whole team, not just him!","However, everyone saw each sword accurately piercing each monster’s chest as if they were controlled by a god! The aims were impeccable!","“My goodness...!”","“You guys hurry up and suppress the respawns! The volcano site is steady now!”","The audience hurried to report the situation.","“Hurry!” Nalan Hongwu yelled. When Mateka attacked him, the last few sword energies flew back in a flash!","Swoosh! Swoosh! Swoosh!","They all pierced into Mateka’s back!","Almost at the same time, the whole space exploded. Wave Eye!","In the huge storm of attacks, it released an explosion at the same moment when Mateka opened its energy shield to launch an attack!","“Puchi-!” It spewed out a mouthful of blood and then vanished.","At this moment, lightning bolts lit up the world while an extremely huge god made completely of thunderbolts suddenly descended.","“You... became slow!” The moment that Mateka attacked, he looked horrified since he saw that huge thunder god roaring. Then, thunderbolts filled the sky and devoured him!","“Ultimate Blade Dance – Lightning!” “Judgement!”","Almost at the same time, attacks from the three adventurers arrived!","In the next moment, words appeared on every member’s screen:","[You cleared Black Volcano!] “We passed?!”","“We really passed?!”","After Mateka died, no one could block these adventurers, and the erupting lava was nothing for the people who had experienced countless catastrophes.","Everyone gathered at Anton’s huge heart, and they stabbed their weapons into it!","In the next moment, the huge throbbing heart had countless holes in it. Blood spurted out while golden thunderbolts and restless energy ran havoc in its body. The heart suddenly burst!","Looking down from the ‘Noble Sky’, they saw this extremely huge prehistoric beast spitting out a mouthful of burning lava. As if it couldn’t withstand the heavy burden anymore, it spasmed and struggled.","With a pathetic howl echoing in the area, the huge turtle head finally fell into the ocean while the lava on the volcano slowly cooled down, turning into a huge dead black volcano on the vast ocean.","The horrifyingly huge beast that could only be subdued by godly power fell at the hands of a group of powerful adventurers after a fierce battle!"]},{"number":857,"title":"Chapter 857 - Let’s See What These Guys Are Doing?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","A group of people was still watching in the shop.","“The raid is successful!” Everyone received this message on the game interface.","They stared at the screen intently. “What will drop in this raid?!”","“Let’s see what items it dropped!”","At this moment, a huge translucent virtual control panel appeared on their game interface, showing four shiny golden cards. Nalan Mingxue immediately clicked on one, and the card flipped to the back and showed the words: [Abyss Invitation*140]","The four cards vanished and were replaced by 20 golden cards.","She clicked on them one by one.","“Anton’s soul fragment? What’s this?”","“This is a material used to make new weapons,” Nalan Mingxue opened the store on one side and said.","At this moment, in the zone of Ultimate West Realm in the Yuanyang City Shop, people like Gabriel, Sia, and Luo Piaoling were also looking at their screens intently.","Such a monster must drop at least a godly equipment, right?","The golden cards opened slowly.","Suddenly, Gabriel found a new item in his backpack.","He erupted into a loud exclamation, “Savior’s Glory – Zanbato?!”","On the sword was engraved with a line of small words.","[Let all the energy in the world strengthen you.","Let your enemies feed you with their life force.","You will acquire the true power of an Apostle.","And when the power has done its work, it will shake heaven and earth.","-Eulogy to Anton]","“Skill attack +35%?”","“After activation, it can release the magic power of the Seventh Apostle: Fire-Eater Anton?!”","In disbelief, he rubbed his eyes.","Then, he opened his mouth wide.","“Hahahaha–! Ahahahahaha–!”","“Ugh–!”","“What’s happening?! What’s happening?!”","They saw a figure fall from the chair stiffly.","At the entrance of the internet café, the godly swords hanging on the bamboo stick yelled repeatedly, “No! Someone suddenly died!”","Bedlam broke loose in the internet café. “Sir! Someone got a Savior’s Glory – Zanbato and died of SCD!”","[TL Note: SCD – sudden cardiac death.]","The nearby Ultimate West Realm people’s faces twitched. “...”","“How is he?” Sia asked Lou Piaoling who was checking on Gabriel.","“Blood rushed into his head... perhaps it’s a result of his excessive cultivation recently...?” Luo Piaoling’s face darkened while he yelled, “It’s not SCD! Not SCD! It’s nonsense!”","They heaved out a sigh of relief.","If the story went out that a warrior of the Ultimate West Realm died of SCD while playing games, how shameful it would be?!","Immediately, he kicked Gabriel’s butt. “Hurry up and get up!”","...","On the endless godly mountains beyond the distant void.","This was the residence of the top existences in the world, the holiest place.","It was a view that the ignorant followers could never imagine even in their dreams.","Noble, ancient, elegant... every complimentary word could be used to describe this place.","“Hurry! Hurry up with your work!” Extremely chilly ice and snow and bone-chilling winds swept around the tall mountain peaks. In the distance at the top of the mountain was a grand god statue that wasn’t finished yet.","Many figures were busy moving huge boulders bigger than millstones toward the godly palace that was still in construction in the chilly winds.","Deep footprints were left in the thick snow.","“Hiss-! So cold!”","“I wonder when this will end...” In the ice and snow, a figure panted heavily, exhaling thick white vapor, and said in a low voice.","He was an unshaved middle-aged man with messy hair. Wearing a shabby thick cotton coat, his physique wasn’t strong, looking totally different from those great existences or the grand godly palace in the distance.","“This is... completely different!” The man blew white vapor at his hands that were covered in frost bites and said, “This is completely different from the things that they promised! Why must we do this here...?","“You know what I’m talking about.”","“Stop talking. Oh, please forgive his ignorance,” an old man prayed piously.","“A tiny gift from them is better than anything that we can imagine in the lower region!” a younger man scolded, “Not to mention the over-spilling elemental energy in this place. Although the situation is somewhat different from our expectations, it’s good enough.”","“These are solid benefits. Work harder...” With a huge boulder several times bigger than his body in his arms, the man looked at the godly palace in the distance and said wishfully, “One day, we’ll also have a godly palace of our own.”","...","“Hehe...” A series of lazy chuckles came from the distant godly palace. Two gazes were watching the activities in this place. “These people are so naive.”","The speaker was a young man who appeared to be 18 or 19 years old.","“Watch your language.” The man standing next to him looked as dazzling and noble as a golden sun; they were the noblest existences in this world.","Everything about them were flawless.","With his hands clasped behind his back, he walked toward the depths of the godly palace with a cold expression. “Think about their history. Instead of becoming the sacrifice for those evil gods...”","“Now, they have the opportunity to serve a grand existence; it’s their honor.”","After turning around, he walked toward another direction along the wide corridor.","The heavenly light came in from the window in the ceiling at the right angle, and the courtyard of the gods kept all kinds of rare beasts. Fire phoenixes spread out their plumes while three gold lions frolicked on the meadow.","Two figures talked casually while walking.","“Don’t you think they are alike?”","“Huh?”","“Eating the meat that the godly officials toss at them each day, they can’t see the world outside and thus won’t have any new ideas sprouting in their heads.”","“Isn’t it good?”","“But, the people in the... lower region are not as obedient as them.”","“They will be.”","“You mean the people in the... Innumerable-Immortal Sea?”","“Not only them. It’s said that those beings’ presences seem to appear in the lower region. You should know what it means.”","“By that time, I wonder how these weak bugs will look when they beg for our protection. I think they will really look ugly...”","“How about the Innumerable-Immortal Sea...?”","“Isn’t it more interesting to see the armies of gods and demons both descend to the mortal world?” the figure snickered, “They are living too peacefully. Without some excruciating pain, those monkeys wouldn’t remember their lessons.”","“If they knew that they were in such a dangerous situation, I’m afraid they would be too horrified to sleep at night,” the young man chuckled and said, “Let’s see what they are doing now.”","He drew a line with his fingertip, and an extremely strange dark space appeared before him. Then, visuals appeared in it.","“Let’s look at the place near that shop.”","The scene zoomed in.","-On the street outside the Yuanyang City Shop-","A huge banner was spread in the mid-air.","A group of Ultimate West Realm people stood there, and they had dragged Jessica and her companions of the West Continent to join their party.","Gabriel stood in the middle of them.","Around them, firecrackers and fireworks boomed.","“Congratulations to Young Master Gabriel for acquiring Savior’s Glory – Zanbato!”","“Hahahahaha-!”","The two men in the godly palace exchanged a look..."]},{"number":858,"title":"Chapter 858 - The Expedition of the Innumerable-Immortal Sea and the Descendance of Demonic Gods!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","At this moment, the immortals of the Innumerable-Immortal Sea were obviously also monitoring the situation of the ‘damn ants’; they were going to send an army to suppress them.","“Savior’s Glory – Zanbato?” They exchanged a look. “What’s that...?”","“It seems to be a weapon in a game?!”","These people are totally oblivious of the crisis. Instead, they are in the mood to celebrate the acquisition of a weapon in a game?!","“Good...! Very good!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness had an intense murderous spirit in his eyes. “Ever since the prehistoric time, you are the first group of people who dare to disregard our Gui Family and the Innumerable-Immortal Sea!”","...","The Innumerable-Immortal Sea was a world of its own, separated from the lower region. The immortals usually traveled to other places through teleportation arrays.","If they sent out immortal armies, they would travel to other regions through the Remote Demon-Slaying Platform.","At this moment, on the Demon-Slaying Platform, 100,000 immortal soldiers were dressed in shiny silver armor and stood tall under flapping flags!","Like demonic gods from the prehistoric times, the immortal generals from the Ying, Yun, Gui and Yao Families stood proudly and magnificently in the skies with their dragons and cloud beasts!","They were led by four people. The first one was a middle-aged man dressed in a blue robe, and his visage looked a little green. Beneath his feet, a pair of black dragons soared in the air, summoning clouds and rain with booming heavenly thunderbolts.","The second one was a man in his prime. Six meters tall, he had a dark face and was dressed in black armor. Holding a huge gold hammer, he shook the Heaven and Earth with each step he took!","The third one was a young Daoist dressed in a white robe. Standing on the auspicious clouds with a smile on his face, he waved his paper fan and summoned violent gusts, putting more respect and fear into the eyes of the immortal soldiers than the others.","The last one was a white-haired old man. When they were all here, Wondrous Spell High Holiness said with a laugh, “It’s just a small issue. I’m honored to see four famous heavenly generals taking the time and coming here in person.”","“It’s not troublesome for us. With High Holiness leading the army in person, there’s no reason that we can’t obtain victory! We’re just here to witness your victory, offering a little help to your great power!” the old man said while cupping his hands.","The young Daoist said, “The Immortal Master of our Yao Family heard about the uproar in the mortal world and their audacious public challenge. They were so insolent that they killed our immortal soldiers. If we don’t punish them severely, how can our families stand tall in the world of immortals and gods in the future?!”","“Besides...” the green-faced middle-aged man said in a cold voice, “I heard that a man even demanded us to change rules and give way to him! I, Yun Hai, have never seen such a brazen person! He deserves to die!”","“Excellent!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness laughed. “We’ll show these ignorant people what they get for slighting immortal rules and killing immortal soldiers!”","“Kill! Kill! Kill!” On the Demon-Slaying Platform, the flags covered the sky while murderous spirit shot up into the Ninth Heaven!","...","– Meanwhile, at Origin Internet Club –","Mr. Fang was now tidying up his storage space. Before him stood a very strange metal machine with a strange screen.","“Which one should I disassemble...?”","“Unlimited Rocket Launcher?” Mr. Fang glanced at it. “Would it work? Can it produce godly weapon fragments after being disassembled?”","This weapon was the earliest reward that the System gave him. In the past, it had indeed been a powerful weapon, but now, its damage was less impressive compared with others.","He put the rocket launcher into the machine and saw words appearing on the screen. [After disassembling, you’ll get defective godly weapon fragments. (Ten defective godly weapon fragments can combine into one godly weapon fragment.) Do you want to disassemble it?]","“Damn it!” Mr. Fang cussed and took the launcher out of the machine.","“Forget it. I’ll put this damn thing in my collection.”","Then, he glanced at the second item that he wouldn’t use anymore: a runeword broadsword from Diablo 2.","Due to the material limits of the sword and the growth of Mr. Fang’s strength, this sword had been rarely used.","[You’ll get godly weapon fragments and defective godly weapon fragments. Do you want to disassemble it?]","“Yes.”","The machine hummed. Soon, one godly weapon fragment and six defective godly weapon fragments appeared on the System Interface.","“Light Wing Sword... an epic weapon from Dungeon Fighter Online...”","“I’ll disassemble it...” After all, after getting the dual swords, Wangshu and Xihe, the other swords were no longer of great use. Now, with his current strength, Fang Qi could use Apophis even without synchronization.","“I don’t need this big gun anymore...”","“The blade-style missile launcher...” It was the weapon used by Dante and the main female character, Lady, in Devil May Cry 3. Obviously, Fang Qi didn’t need it anymore.","He got altogether four godly weapon fragments through disassembling. After combining the defective godly weapon fragments, he now had six of them.","Mr. Fang nodded in satisfaction and put away the disassembling machine.","At this moment, he suddenly sensed a strange presence.","Meanwhile, a prompt appeared on the System Interface.","[New Task: Severely Punish the Troublemakers","Task Reminder: A large group of troublemakers will come to the new shop. Host must deal with it solemnly!","Task Reward: Carrier Rock*1, System Gift Bag*1, Double Coupon for the Cultivation Room*1 (It will increase cultivation speed)]","“A large group of troublemakers will come to my new shop...?” Mr. Fang was puzzled. “What’s happening? I didn’t mess with the local gangs when I opened the new shop. Who is there to crash my internet café?”","Immediately, he went to the new shop.","– At this moment, in the old shop in Half City –","– Half City Cultivator Alliance Artifact Research Association –","In the center of the association stood a huge and tall tower on the surface, and it was engraved with dense and complicated arrays.","Energy waves invisible to the naked eye were released from the tall tower into the endless distance.","At this moment, a virtual screen looking like a large-scale communication jade screen inside the tall tower had some strange visuals on it.","“Huh...What’s this...?”","“At the bottom of the ocean...?! Something seems to be moving?”","“Report it! Strange things appeared at the ocean bottom with weird energy waves!”","“Strange energy is growing quickly! Its nature is ‘Yin’, suspected to be large demonic monsters!”","“Degree of danger is...”","The golden spoon on the exquisite golden Chinese compass beside the cultivator slowly turned to the very top!","“Degree of danger is...” the cultivator howled in astonishment, “God-level!”","“Hurry-! Report to all major factions!”","...","In Yellow Spring Sea, the creatures living here had always been fiercer and more horrifying than those living in the other oceans due to the influence of the presences leaking from Nine-Fold Darkness Demon Realm where the demonic gods and monsters lived.","There were countless evil beings hidden in it.","But at this moment, all the monsters living in the Yellow Spring Sea seemed to be submissive as if they were worshiping their king.","From the depths of the ocean, an extremely huge crack was torn open.","Then, a large group of unimaginable horrifying huge beasts came from another world in silence!","A chilly voice sounded in the gloomy darkness, “When we truly descend in this world and appear before these weak humans, can you guess how horrified they will look...?”"]},{"number":859,"title":"Chapter 859 - This is...!!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","...","– At the Cultivator Alliance Artifact Research Association –","The threat of god-level monsters plunged the entirety of Half City and even the nearby cities and factions into a panic.","This wasn’t something that could be easily solved. This was a catastrophe that no ordinary cultivators could withstand.","“The presence... is still growing! It’s getting stronger and stronger!”","“How far is it now?!”","“We can’t let it get close to the cities!” Duan Yue, the Chief Artifact Master of the Cultivator Alliance Artifact Research Association, was the cultivator who had led the project of making a mimic of Heavenly Mirror. He yelled, “No... we can’t let it get within 50 kilometers of any city!”","“Inform all the faction masters! Move the Vital Magnetic Wind Thunder Battleships!” Vital Magnetic Wind Thunder Battleships were spiritual ships that were equipped with the spiritual artifacts of war, which were mimics of railguns. In the battle with the Judgement Godly Palace, the mimicked railguns had knocked over their enemy’s destructive magic missile cannons.","Now, they had improved this weapon and equipped every cultivation faction with them.","“Half City Vital Magnetic Wind Thunder Battleships are on the move; the factions need some time to move theirs!”","“How long?!” Duan Yue asked.","“From several hours to three days.”","“Can’t they use the teleportation array...” Duan Yue paused and killed this stupid idea since the current teleportation array technology couldn’t transport things that were as big as the Vital Magnetic Wind Thunder Battleships.","“The presence is still growing and will probably reach Half City and other nearby cities in one day!”","“It’s too late!” Duan Yue gritted his teeth and said, “Go... ask for reinforcements from other places!”","...","At this moment, Ning Bi began her new day in the Half City Shop. As the main healer in Team Two of the first raid group of Anton, she couldn’t vacate her post.","Besides, she hadn’t played her alt Demonbane and Archmage accounts yet.","Having just finished one account, she put down the virtual reality headset and lounged on the computer chair to rest.","“Big... big trouble!” At this moment, a woman who managed the business for Ning Bi hurried to her side and whispered, “Mistress, demons have been detected in the Yellow Spring Sea, and the degree of danger is god-level! It’s very possible that they will threaten Half City.”","“What?!” Ning Bi’s face darkened, knowing that threats on this level were hard to deal with. It would be fine if they were ordinary monsters, but demons from the Yellow Spring Sea...","Everyone knew how fierce and powerful they were.","[I probably can’t join the party for the raid for now.] At this moment, Ning Bu posted the message in the group chat with a grim expression.","[What happened?!]","[I have three alt accounts to go!]","[I have seven!] Gabriel yelled.","[They seem to have trouble.] Gu Tingyun replied. [A god-level demon came close to Half City.]","[What?!] Everyone was shocked, wondering how such a monster would appear suddenly...","[How come such a demon appeared?!]","[Do you know its background?]","[Not yet,] Ning Bi said.","At this moment, everyone felt the grim atmosphere.","[I plan to go and check it out.] Gu Tingyun said, [What are your plans?]","[It’s a big issue, and I can’t stay out of it.] Nalan Hongwu said, [I’ll go and see what demon it is!]","...","– In Half City –","High ocean waves surged up and viciously crashed against the tall cliff of Half City. More than ten spiritual ships slowly flew out like a fleet in the sky.","Today, the sky above the surrounding sea area was unusually clear with a few puffy clouds floating in the bright blue sky peacefully.","It didn’t look like a catastrophe was about to strike.","These spiritual ships were very fast. The ocean water gradually turned from dark-blue to turbid-yellow. While reflecting the sunlight on the surface, the sea looked peaceful except for a few floating sea weeds.","But only the Half City cultivators who had lived here for a long time knew that this sea area was a dangerous place that few cultivators were willing to step into.","At this moment, they found...","“The sea water... seems to be flowing...?”","All the ocean water seemed to dim without a reason. A shadow engulfed the bottom of the sea, and even the shadows the spiritual ships cast on the sea were indistinguishable.","It looked as if an extremely huge creature was hovering overhead.","But when they looked up, they saw nothing. Although they knew that this shadow came from the bottom of the ocean, the creepy feeling sent chills down their spines.","“Be careful! There’s something at the bottom of the sea!” Even Nalan Hongwu looked grim.","...","– At this moment, at the bottom of Yellow Spring Sea –","A voice seemed to rise from the extremely gloomy darkness, “Finally... we’re here!”","“Is this the presence of the mortal world...?!”","“There are humans here?” It seemed to sense over ten spiritual ships coming from all directions.","“Oh-?!”","“Let’s go up!” the voice seemed to come from the depths of Nine-Fold Darkness.","...","Immediately, the shadows at the bottom of the ocean grew darker and deeper. At this moment, someone exclaimed as a huge mountain seemed to rise from the turbid yellow water.","Then, the ‘huge mountain’ grew larger and wider until it filled the entire sea area. It looked as if a huge continent was slowly rising from the sea!","At the sight of this huge horrifying monster, almost everyone stepped back in horror with their mouths opening wide.","Almost no one had ever seen such a huge and horrifying monster.","Its head rose from the sea, looking like a huge mountain peak rising into the clouds!","“Roar-!” The earth-shaking hoarse roar almost shattered people’s eardrums. When its giant black mouth opened, it sucked in all the spiritual essence from this region like a whale sucking in water.","Like an extremely huge black hole, it looked as if it would devour everything in the world!","“Be careful, everyone!”","“Fire! Fire!”","Alarmed yells and curses rose immediately.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Streaks of spiritual light lit up one by one but afflicted almost no damage to the horrifying monster.","At this moment, the extremely huge monster stopped absorbing spiritual essence.","Then, a figure flew out from the mouth of the huge turtle.","Looking at the over-confident humans and the ships that were as small as the debris on the ground, it laughed as if it was mocking their over-confidence.","The attacks on this scale were weaker than tickling to the monster.","“Is this the god-level monster...?!” Duan Yue’s face darkened as he warned other people around him. “Be careful!”","Emitting a presence that was as huge as an ocean, the monster was as big as an enormous island. On its pitch-black back were ugly spikes. This monster wasn’t something that humans could block.","“This... This is?!” The group led by Nalan Hongwu exchanged a look and saw the astonishment in each other’s eyes. “This is-!!”","“Yes. This is it.” Duan Yue and the faction masters looked grimmer. “You guys must be careful. This...”","“Cackle-! I’m the messenger of the Nine-Fold Darkness Demonic General. It’s your honor that we are borrowing the path in the mortal world. Are you ready to sacrifice yourselves to us?!”"]},{"number":860,"title":"Chapter 860 - A Legend from the Distant Ancient Huaxia Nation!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The moment that this creature said the words, it saw about 20 people including warriors and cultivators standing on the foremost spiritual ship. One person stood motionless on the bow with swords hanging at the belt while violent ocean winds brushed his face, someone else wore a cap made of pure-white snow fox fur, a thick coat from the Ultimate West Realm, and had a huge cross standing before him. Another person held a black silk band and began to cover his eyes with it...","...","– Meanwhile, in the new shop in the East Continent –","Jiang Xiaoyue had just finished playing games and was walking out of the shop with a large group of Heavenly Faction elders and disciples, happily talking about today’s games and TV Series with them.","She had just pushed open the door when she saw wild gusts sweeping up the sand and dust while a layer of auspicious clouds with soaring purple mist blocked the sky.","She looked up and saw dense crowds standing in the clouds with flapping flags around them. They were troops from the Innumerable-Immortal Sea.","Immortal generals stood among them, and black dragons soared in the sky with dazzling golden lights. These dragons’ chilly eyes looked down and sent chills down people’s spines.","“This... this?!” Several Heavenly Faction disciples had never seen such a scene before and retreated in horror.","They stumbled and almost fell to the ground.","Then, several thunderbolts shot down from the vast purple clouds and struck the crowd.","Boom!","They came so suddenly that almost no one could react. Instantly, these players screamed in fear and scrambled to flee while some were injured by the thunderbolts. Some purple immortal thunderbolts crashed toward Elder Senior Disciple Yu Yin and the exchange disciples including Yue Bai.","How could these disciples dodge such great spells? Even a scratch from the thunderbolts severely wounded some disciples, let alone the people who stood right under the thunderbolts!","At this moment, a small figure shot up in a flash!","The thunderbolts turned and struck the ground beside them. As if the land cracked and the sky collapsed, the thunderbolts instantly left a deep crater in the ground!","“Xiaoyue!” the players yelled in alarm and saw Jiang Xiaoyue’s face turning slightly pale.","“You have some abilities!” A sneer sounded in the sky. “I’ll see if you can block the next strike!”","While this person spoke, a purple lightning snake thicker than the previous ones crashed toward Jiang Xiaoyue.","“Xiaoyue, be careful!” Even the elders standing in the distance turned pale in fear.","At this moment, the door behind them opened wide as a bright blue light shot out like a beam of ebony ice. The purple thunderbolt was shot down and turned into dazzling purple air currents that swept outward in all directions!","The scattered thunderbolts retreated from the bright blue light and didn’t hurt anyone.","At this moment, a figure came out with a box of fried chicken bites in his hands. Having just finished the last piece of chicken, he threw the empty box into a nearby garbage can and walked out of the shop.","“Sir?!” They looked back in pleasant surprise. Sure enough, the figure was Mr. Fang.","Mr. Fang yelled at the sky blurrily, “Who just bullied Xiaoyue?”","“Hehe!” A light chuckle sounded in the sky. “Instead of taking the easy way to the Heaven, you must break into Hell!”","“Cast the Star Silk Heavenly Net!”","The Star Silk Heavenly Net was an immortal item that the Gui Family made by collecting the essence of the fallen stars. Once it was spread, the entire sky looked like a curtain of clouds with starry lights blinking on it.","Like a heavenly net, it blocked all exits in the area. Today, no one could escape from it!","Then, a young general walked out from the crowd in the purple cloud, and he shouted, “I’m Gui Yuan from the Gui Family. Today, you can’t run from us even if you have wings. How dare you block the attacks for others?”","“So, it’s you guys?","“Was it you who shot those purple thunderbolts?” Mr. Fang’s face darkened. As a shop owner, he only needed to oversee the staff and keep an eye on his shops, but he couldn’t remain calm when people made trouble before his shop and even wanted to hurt his customers.","“It was me; what can you do?” Gui Yuan said coldly.","The moment he said it, a streak of burning firelight shot out like a long rainbow!","With a scream, Gui Yuan looked down and saw that his left arm had been cut off by the sword blade. Instantly, cold sweat popped out on his body from the pain!","“You-!” Intense murderous spirit flashed in his eyes. He was about to leap down to battle when Wondrous Spell High Holiness stopped him. “Back off! Haven’t you disgraced yourself enough?!”","With his sharp eyes, he had naturally seen that even though the young man who was using the flying swords had lower cultivation strength than Gui Yuan, his sword techniques were extremely powerful and could easily defeat Gui Yuan.","At this moment, they saw two flying swords, one blue and one red, dashing back into their scabbards.","“They are... Xihe and Wangshu!?” Behind Mr. Fang, Jiang Xiaoyue stared at the two swords with sparkling eyes. While looking at Mr. Fang eagerly, she asked, “Boss, where did you get Xihe and Wangshu?!”","“Thank you for the rescue, sir.” At this moment, some disciples walked up to express their gratitude. Then, they asked curiously, “Xihe and Wangshu? Do these two swords have special backgrounds?”","Obviously, not everyone had played the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4.","“These are two godly swords. In the legends, Xihe is said to be the Mother of the Sun, who is the goddess controlling the sun. Wangshu is the god controlling the moon. They are both extremely powerful!” Jiang Xiaoyue said, “Hehe, I heard it from Sister Qingqing and others when they studied the plot. Named after the gods, the two godly swords are the most powerful godly weapons of the Qionghua Faction!”","“Legend...? Is it a legend just like that of the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal?!” Hearing Xiaoyue mentioning legends, the other players looked interested.","“Right! Right! They seem to be in the same long timeline! The legends are very grand; some of the characters are even more ancient than the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!”","Hearing their talk, Gui Yuan couldn’t help sneering. “What legend?! How come we’ve never heard of it before. In my opinion, it’s just a joke that you ignorant mortals made up!”","“You know damn nothing!” Zhuge Qingyun, Heavenly Faction’s Grand Elder, yelled furiously with a walking cane in his hand, “These legends exist in the ancient nation named Huaxia! They are absolutely real!”","Do you think we are learning fake stuff?!","“You’re ignorant and stubborn, and you even dared to hurt immortals of our Gui Family. Call out the reckless immortals who have your back.”","At a wave of the command flag, the battle drums shook the Heavens while countless troops swarmed up like the yellow spring. At this moment, the mortals beneath their feet truly felt the force that was totally beyond their realm!","Their faces looked extremely grim.","“Are you afraid?!” Chilly gazes looked down from the purple clouds. “I’ll see if the so-called legends from your damn ancient nation can protect you!”"]},{"number":861,"title":"Chapter 861 - Real Masters!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Inside the Heaven-Devouring Turtle, there was a huge space in which the demon soldiers and generals were stationed. Hiding here, they commanded the troops outside.","This was the command center inside the Heaven-Devouring Turtle.","At this moment, all the demon soldiers and generals knelt on one knee with great respect on their faces.","Before them sat a brawny man dressed in pitch-black armor.","The man looked totally different from humans. With twisted horns on his forehead, his face was engulfed in gloomy and fierce presence. His skin emitted a metal glare, and his armor seemed to be part of his body. Compared to humans, he looked more like an... evil demon!","This being rested one arm on the armrest of the throne that was made of bones.","Before him was a clear projected screen that showed the scenes outside.","Countless demon soldiers soared up into the sky like black feathers. At this moment, black smoke covered the rivers, mountains, and land!","The humans who were like ants and bugs didn’t scramble to run. Instead, they dared to launch attacks!?","“My Lord...” The demon generals sensed the presence, and they felt uneasy, afraid that this being would destroy the Heaven and Earth in a burst of fury!","The demonic god sitting high on the throne of bones had cold glints in his eyes. “It’s okay.”","They never thought that the bug-like mortals could be their enemies, but it wasn’t a bad thing to let the demon soldiers and generals get some warm-up exercises before the real battle.","Instantly, turbid waves surged and shot up into the high sky above the Yellow Spring Sea.","A streak of pitch-black evil presence spread out in all directions and gradually engulfed the whole sea area. The gloomy winds made those places look like the chilly... Nine-Fold Darkness Realm!","The huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle in the distance was also engulfed in the vast evil presence. When the gloomy winds blew at the evil presence, people could see the demon army with chilly auras standing on the mountain-like head and continent-like back of the Heaven-Devouring Turtle in neat formations!","More frightening was that even mere demon soldiers emitted scary energies, let alone the horrifying monster which looked like a demonic god.","Perhaps this was the legendary demonic god who could devour the Heaven and Earth!","Boom!","A huge noise sounded.","The huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle waved its giant palm, looking as if a heavenly pillar crashed down, surging up a heavenly curtain made of seawater. Two spiritual ships that were not quick enough to dodge were viciously crushed by the currents.","Like a piece of paper, the pale spiritual light shield was shattered. Then, the spiritual ships instantly collapsed under this strike. While screaming, countless cultivators were swept into the ocean waves and got devoured by the turbid sea!","“!!!”","At this moment, all the cultivators paused their attacks and felt chills running down their spines!","At this moment, they remembered that it was the first time that they faced such enemies!","Games? They had killed god-level enemies in the games, but they would never really die in the games. They could detect their enemies’ weaknesses through deaths and find a solution in the end.","But in the real world, they knew almost nothing about their enemies.","There was a big difference and barrier between the real world and the virtual world. Reality was always harsher than the ideal world.","Right now, they were facing existences truly beyond mortals! Before such demons, humans were like ants that were floating on an ocean!","Feeling the vast ocean-like power, these people didn’t doubt that a casual strike from their enemies would turn all of them into dust!","Besides, when they were in the game, they could easily use certain skills since they had the talent of the main characters.","But in the real world, they probably couldn’t use these skills. Their cultivation strength wasn’t even as powerful as one ten-thousandth of the main characters’ strength.","This was the difference between the real world and the virtual world.","It would be fine if these enemy troops were like the troops of the Judgement Godly Palace which concentrated only on cultivation strength instead of skills.","However, the enemies had obtained great combat force on the bloody battleground while fighting with gods! They went through blood oceans and corpse mountains!","In a few moments, the black currents made of demon soldiers swarmed toward the spiritual ships like a black tsunami, bringing intense murderous spirit with them!","Instantly, they engaged in combat with the cultivators and warriors on the battleships, forcing the latter to retreat continuously.","“Pu-!” The Nanhua Faction Master was casting spells when he was struck by a demon hiding in the demonic presence. Then, a demon that was ten meters tall lunged at him with a roar.","A sword beam flashed, and Nalan Hongwu ran to his rescue.","“Leave me; go and rescue the others!” The Nanhua Faction Master pushed Nalan Hongwu away and then killed his way into the crowd of monsters!","Seeing the fierce battle, Nalan Hongwu felt as if he was teleported to the battlefield hundreds of years ago before Dajin was established. In that battle, he was ambushed by enemies, and the entire battlefield was dark with fierce killing. He didn’t know when the battle would end.","Coming with lofty ideas but being beaten into a bloody pulp by the cruel reality!","This was how he felt right now.","The old man who was a veteran of wars again felt the heaviness of wars many years later.","...","“Cackle... Humans are still so useless...”","The demonic god sitting on the throne of bones sneered. In his hand was a black three-legged cauldron full of crimson liquid, and the pungent smell filled the air. It seemed to be a special beverage made with the blood of a certain demon beast and some unknown processes.","He gulped it down, and a shocking blood trace was left on his chin.","“Go and tell them to bring out all the masters that they have.” The demonic god said indifferently, “We can treat them as an appetizer before the war.”","“Yes!”","...","“Didn’t you do the raid?! Can’t you handle it as you did with Anton?!” While he was thinking, Nalan Hongwu heard a roar.","“But we don’t have any intelligence on these demons!”","Nalan Hongwu wished that he could handle this giant turtle as Anton!","They looked similar, but wars were not games. These players could learn the skills and combat techniques from the games, but how could they copy the tactics from the games?!","They were not stupid and knew that they would fail miserably if they copied the strategies in the games to deal with the demons in the real world.","Besides, even though this demon looked like Anton, they were not of the same species. It wasn’t something that these players could play with!","One mistake would plunge all of them into a catastrophic situation.","They could kill Anton since they had sent teams to cut off its energy supply and suppress its power as much as they could. Otherwise, the result would be different.","But now, how could they suppress this horrifying demon?!","“Shop owner... where is he?” Nalan Mingxue browsed her communication jade while a layer of sweat appeared on her forehead.","Even Zong Wu and others were trying to contact Fang Qi.","It must be noted that even in the battle with the Judgement Godly Palace, the shop owner had watched them from behind, which was why they didn’t have to think about failure as the shop owner had their backs.","At this moment, Zong Wu received a message. [I... I can’t be there in a short while.]","[No matter what, you must try it once by yourselves.] Mr. Fang sounded tired.","[What if something unexpected happens...?] Zong Wu asked in alarm.","[Then, change your plan accordingly!] Mr. Fang looked up. The auspicious clouds blocking the sun released an even more horrifying presence. Obviously, Mr. Fang would have a tough battle before the new shop on the East Continent!","[Remember, you guys are also true masters...] Fang Qi recorded this sentence on his communication jade and clicked [Send].","Zong Wu suddenly froze as he held onto his communication jade.","“We... are also masters?!”","“Old Ghost Zong, what did Kid Fang say?!” At this moment, Nalan Hongwu grabbed Zong Wu’s communication jade from his hand.","“He said... we... are also masters,” Zong Wu said, “Real masters.”","Before they knew it, they were no longer the noobs who complained whenever they encountered a difficult stage and must beg Mr. Fang to show them the walkthrough.","Without hints and help from anyone else, they had cleared the Anton raid which was extremely difficult to pass and killed the horrifying apostle which was even more powerful than gods.","Now, they were also masters...","“Do we define masters as people who fight battles according to the directions from guides?!”","“Everyone! Everyone! Just now... the Cultivation Alliance got some intelligence at the risk of their lives after hearing that you are members of the party who completed the Anton raid and are familiar with the battle method of dealing with this kind of huge beast.” At this moment, Mo Xian, Liu Ningyun, and other Nanhua Faction elites fought their way through demon crowds with several jade slips in their hands.","“Are we really going to do it...?!” Zong Wu looked grim.","It was a raid that they must win in one try. Otherwise, not only themselves, but all other people would die!","“All the raid teams! All the raid teams! Gather!”","The people from the Cultivator Alliance and different factions also worked together.","“Support. Give them support as much as we can!”","“The raid... begins!”","Inside the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle, the demon soldiers and generals were all watching the situation outside.","At great risks, the human spiritual ships spread out in one neat line before the Heaven-Devouring Turtle. Then, about 20 people broke through the demon soldiers’ frontline and landed on the huge head of the Heaven-Devouring Turtle!","In the surging murderous spirit and demonic smoke, several teams stood in a strange formation.","One had holy light rising before him, one had dazzling thunderbolts around him, one controlled pure sword beams, and one looked as bloodthirsty as a demon...","At one quick glance, they looked like godly statues from the ancient time who stood in surging murderous spirit.","For a moment, these demons felt like they saw the illusion that true gods had been born on this battleground!"]},{"number":862,"title":"Chapter 862 - The Unparalleled Battle Shocked Gods and Demons!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Surrounded by an ocean of demons, these people, a little over ten in number, looked over the demons into the distance.","Altogether, there were five huge demons dressed in demonic armor and standing among the other demons like huge mountains.","They were from the Giant Demon God Clan, and they would obtain the power of an average godly figure the moment that they reached adulthood!","The vanguard demon general standing in the front had a pair of huge halberds in its hands. It lifted its head and let out a furious roar, changing the colors of the wind and clouds instantly!","...","“What are they doing?!” In the command center inside the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle, they turned their gazes to this place. “There are only a little over a dozen people. What are they planning to do?”","The demonic god sitting on the throne of bones gazed at the people venturing into their headquarters for no reason, and his face turned cold. Immediately, he issued a command.","Receiving a signal from his gaze, one of the giant demons led demon soldiers to swarm toward the human teams tentatively!","They were in the direction of Team Two led by Zong Wu.","Zong Wu stood in the front while Zhang Hao, the Vice Academy Master of the Heavenly Academy, stood beside him.","Almost at the same time when the giant demon rushed up, it seemed like a prehistoric godly statue that had been sealed in dust for countless years had suddenly woke up!","With a peaceful look on his face and a heart as bright as a mirror, a dazzling thunderbolt shot out from Zong Wu’s sword with strands of lightning snakes flowing around it. Illuminated by the thunderbolt, the entire blade was turned into the color of white jade.","A streak of bone-chilling murderous spirit spread out invisibly.","While his wide white robe billowed up with the dust on the battleground, Zhang Hao spread out his arms slightly, and a huge and invisible air field circulated around his body. Essence changed into golden light beams and flowed around him, slowly lifting him up into mid-air.","When a streak of aurora tore open the gloomy darkness and lit up in his eyes, the seemingly endless essence surrounding him instantly devoured all the essence in the natural world!","Even all the demons around him lost control of their bodies and were drawn toward him.","Meanwhile, Zong Wu’s left foot stomped on the ground.","In the next moment, thunderbolts spread over the ground and transformed into a miraculous lightning array!","Like a huge meat grinder, it pulled all the demon soldiers and generals who swarmed over into it!","Finally, two huge and evil-looking sword energies slashed at the giant demonic god and sent it flying out and landing at the feet of Nalan Hongwu and the others.","Like a fuse that was ignited, Nalan Hongwu’s essence instantly rose to the peak!","Another giant demonic god rushed over. At this moment, Nalan Hongwu unsheathed his sword, and all the monsters around him and even the time and space froze.","Only countless godly swords hovered in the air!","Like a god of the sword, Nalan Hongwu was the lord in this area. With a light slash, a sword pierced a demon soldier’s chest!","Then, the second slash, the third, the fourth... the slashes grew faster and swifter until the sky was filled with sword shadows!","When the sword energies stopped after a long while, the two giant demonic gods had countless cuts in their armor and bodies. Almost no part of them was intact. Then, they flew backward listlessly and fell in the dust.","Seeing this scene, an indescribable chill spread all over the battleground.","When the team of less than 20 people advanced a step forward, the previously arrogant and horrifying demonic gods... took a step back involuntarily!","With disbelief in their eyes, they looked at the humans before them and shouted, “What’s with these humans?!”","“Get out!” At this moment, the dragon-headed vanguard demon general who was holding a pair of huge halberds roared. Then, the tumor-like bumps on his shoulders squirmed and transformed into five dragon heads!","The six heads separated and turned into six huge demon dragons. Instantly, the whole world was filled with gusts and lightning bolts. The Heavens and Earth changed colors as the black dragons soared in the sky!","...","The black demon dragons seemed to draw pitch-black cracks in the sky, moving so fast that it was almost impossible to see their movements. Suddenly, black lights flashed!","Like they were teleportating, the six huge dragon heads attacked from six different directions. While opening their huge mouths which looked as deep as black holes, they appeared as if they could devour everything in the world.","Countless destructive black thunderbolts fell in the crowds, and the demon soldiers who accidentally touched them were instantly turned into dust!","It was obvious what would happen if humans were struck by them.","...","“It has been years, and I’m surprised that these mortals... have obtained some good abilities!” Inside the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle, one demon general said, “The Nine-Fold Darkness Demon Dragons are not only equipped with endless spiritual power and great strength; they also were born with the ability to control winds and thunderbolts. They can fly over thousands of kilometers in one instant. I’ll see how these humans block them.”","“Deputy Commander Lu is right!” another demon general said, “When the six dragons fly at the same time, one vital spirit must control six bodies simultaneously. The vanguard general under Deputy Commander Lu is quite good.”","Of course, it was not difficult for one being to control six puppets at the same time, but it was totally different for one person to drive six fighter jets at the same time...","...","“One splits into six...!” At the same time, the people watching the scene from the head of the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle felt fearful!","The six demon dragons launched six different spells with different attack methods!","At this moment, a bolt of sword energy looking like a streak of aurora lit up!","The pure sword energy spread out, and countless godly swords flew out from behind Nalan Hongwu as if they had minds of their own.","“That’s...”","“Hypervigilance?!”","Everyone yelled in astonishment.","“You want to outplay me?! In your dreams!”","Instantly, the five godly swords spread out behind Nalan Hongwu like wings and transformed into countless godly swords. More than 10,000 sword energies flew up together!","Before the six demon dragons could finish using their spells and attacks, they were surrounded by the sword energies. Instantly, the six demon dragons were forced to stop.","Outside the demon dragons was a circle of godly swords emitting seven-colored lights. The space inside the circle of the sword energies seemed to be totally still, looking as if it had been separated from the surrounding space. It was like... a godly realm!","“Got you!”","The moment that the six demon dragons appeared, they were completely trapped by the unbelievable godly sword energies.","The demonic thunderbolts scattered and didn’t afflict any damage to the people around them.","In a flash, the attack was launched so accurately that it didn’t allow any demon dragons to escape!","“This play is so awesome...!?” The people around them stared at the scene with widened eyes!","“Awesome!”","“I can only control the evil dragons for three seconds!”","“It’s enough!”","“DPS! Full DPS!”","“This...?!” At this moment, even the demon generals who were watching the battle inside the giant Heaven-Devouring Turtle couldn’t sit still. They watched the scene dumbfoundedly.","Born with godly strength and control over thunderbolts and winds, the grand general of the Demon Dragon Clan was instantly trapped by the sword energies and couldn’t even fight back!?","“This... this is...!?”","“This is... a god-and-demon-level combat technique! It’s an advanced combat technique only an existence of our rank can use!” A deputy commander yelled in surprise, “How can the weak humans use it?!”","Only gods and demons who were born between the Heaven and Earth with extremely powerful strength and knowledge about the ultimate laws of nature could master such powerful skills.","How could these humans achieve these skills?!"]},{"number":863,"title":"Chapter 863 - That’s... The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Surrounded by the demon soldiers on the head of the giant Heaven-Devouring Turtle, the group led by Nalan Hongwu felt like they were engulfed in dark clouds, and they charged in all directions with their weapons!","Non-stop roars and shouts of fury resonated on the field. At this moment, it looked as if the heroic beings that had died on the ancient battlegrounds rose and burned in the depths of their souls!","In the dark chilly scene, these people managed to kill their way out.","Such a scene instantly ignited the bravery in all the other cultivators. Instantly, they were united for one purpose!","A streak of clear light from the Heavenly Mirror rose and shone on the battleground as Lan Mo, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance Master, and some elders circulated their vital essence and controlled this treasure mirror!","“The demon vanguard is dead! Follow my Heavenly Mirror and find the source of the murderous aura!” Lan Mo said loudly.","The murderous aura filling the air had a very bad impact on most of the cultivators. If they could take the opportunity to get rid of it, the situation would change for the better for the cultivators.","“Team Five, stay here!” Zong Wu looked down and saw the horrifyingly huge turtle forcing almost all the cultivators to retreat with its attacks. He yelled, “The other four teams, follow me to cut off the turtle’s legs!”","Soon, the teams leaped down from the turtle head. Meanwhile, the Vital Magnetic Wind Thunder Battleships turned the cannons accordingly!","...","“What are they going to do?!” The demonic god sitting on the throne of bones looked thoughtful. “Lu You!”","“Here!” The demon general stood up slowly and bowed respectfully.","“These mortals have some abilities,” the demonic god said coldly, “You go and ask them if they want to join my army. Weak mortals always crave for the great power and immortality that I can give.”","“Yes! The mortals will be honored to have garnered appreciation from you, Nine-Fold Darkness Demon General!” The demon general who responded had a bird head and was engulfed in blazing flames. Anyone getting close to him would feel the hell-like burning heat. “But...what if they don’t want to submit?”","“After killing so many demon soldiers in my army, do they want to leave intact?!”","...","God is a character of combined ideograms, and its meaning derives both from ‘shi’ and ‘shen’. ‘Shi’ means the inspiration of wisdom while ‘shen’ refers to the shape of a lightning bolt, meaning speed and quality like lightning flashes. It also means morality and quality.","[TL Note: God is 神 in Chinese, which combines the two words, shi (示) and shen (申).]","In the ancient legends, the word ‘god’ didn’t mean specifically the existence beyond mortals. In fact, ancient legends started from the Three Emperors.","– In the new shop at the East Continent –","At this moment, all the players gathered outside of the shop.","Some were cultivators who had come to help from other shops.","At this moment, the cultivators of the Half City Shop were not the only ones in a crisis.","When the immortals of Gui Family descended in Jiuhua City, most of the players didn’t witness the horrifying power far beyond mortals. But now, they truly experienced a power that ‘no mortal strength could reach’!","These players had thought that a true immortal like Gui Ye was unimaginably powerful. But now, they found that they had been sadly mistaken. In the aura that was as vast and deep as an ocean, except for those immortal soldiers, every immortal here was much more powerful than Gui Ye, the immortal from Connate Cliff!","Seeing such a presence, these people had the feeling that even if Qi Tiandi was here in person, he wouldn’t be able to kill so many immortals!","The immortals looked down coldly from the Heaven.","“I’ll give you one last chance.” On the clouds, Wonderous Spell High Holiness said coldly, “Some of you don’t have to die. You must make the choice to give up these unorthodox practices or die!”","“Why?!” Xiaoyao Ancestral Master stood out and said, “What we learn is the orthodox Great Dao; what we know are elegant and ceremonious greetings; what we find are all ultimate truths in the Heaven and Earth! Why can’t we study these things?! How can you call them unorthodox practices?!”","“Don’t you think that it’s too late to talk about it?!” Wonderous Spell High Holiness yelled fiercely, “You dared to kill immortal soldiers from our Innumerable-Immortal Sea and injure the vital spirit of an immortal of our Gui Family!”","“If we aren’t allowed to do that, do you expect us to wait and be killed?!”","“Good! Good! Good! You mortals are so stubborn that you want to fight the Heavens?!” Wonderous Spell High Holiness’ furious yell came from the sky.","He lifted his hand high and then waved indifferently. “Then, you will turn into dust with this place!”","Instantly, tens of thousands of immortal soldiers and generals, countless immortal weapons, and the horrifying presence that went beyond mortals’ imagination swarmed up like waves. In the next moment, they would devour these confused mortals and the human world!","These mortals didn’t know what they did wrong. Perhaps being weak was the biggest mistake that they had made in this world.","The Faction Master and elders of the Heavenly Faction looked into the distance outside the cave abode. Those ordinary mortals without cultivation strength relied on the cultivators to cast immortal spells and superpowers, giving them a guiding light in this catastrophe.","But how about us...?!","When they rescued those mortals, they also wished that someone or some existence would show them the way forward in such a situation.","After pursuing Dao for dozens of years and dreaming about Dao for thousands of years, they would die without regrets if they could really hear and see the real Dao.","“Kill-!” With a fierce roar, someone charged first. He was followed by the second and the third!","These cultivators brandished spiritual artifacts and flying swords and charged at the immortals in the sky with crimson eyes!","But in the next moment, they dropped to the dust one by one.","Regardless of how they struggled, they couldn’t get up. Despite their improvements and ability to handle some immortal soldiers, they could never fight the elders and holinesses from the saint families!","At this moment, the people suddenly saw a figure shooting up into the sky.","“That... that is...!?”","As if they saw a heavenly light falling from the place beyond the Ninth Heaven and shining on the heavy clouds, the grand existences also turned their gazes toward the figure flying up into the high sky.","The defiant figure dressed in gold armor and wearing a golden hat looked to be engulfed in blazing flames from Laozi’s Brazier, and the flames also flattered his scarlet cape.","As if they couldn’t believe what they were seeing, everyone rubbed their eyes subconsciously.","They didn’t see it wrong. The figure wasn’t as grand as the immortals standing in the sky; he even looked a bit tiny. However, he stood before the hundreds of thousands of immortal soldiers and immortals like an insurmountable natural barrier!","“A monkey?!” The immortal soldiers sneered when they saw the being before them.","However, the people on the ground...","The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal, Sun Wukong. His body is as hard as ebony iron, his eyes are fiery and golden, his way of immortality. and... the 72 transformations...","“That’s...”","“The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal-!”","At this moment, not able to control their feelings, everyone yelled, “That’s... the Great Sage!”"]},{"number":864,"title":"Chapter 864 - When the Great Sage Comes, All Immortals Dim!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I thought it was an immortal or a god.” Uncontrolled laughter sounded in the sky. “But it’s only a monkey!”","“Where did this demon monkey come from?! How dare you run havoc in front of immortals and your Granddaddy Yao?!” A cuss sounded in the sky. It came from a black-faced immortal general with intense murderous energy around him. With a bear-like head and tiger-like eyes, he had a brawny body and a huge hammer shaped like a golden melon in his hand.","“I’m Yao Tong, the Earth Spiritual General of the Yao Family! Today, I’ll show you, a hairy monkey, the power of my Heaven-Shaking Hammer!”","In the eight ancient immortal families from the prehistoric times, there were altogether 72 earth spiritual generals, each of which had extremely high cultivation strength and great military merits, not to mention...","“Is that Yao Tong, one of the top-ten earth spiritual generals?!” Exclamations rose from the formations of the families. “He’s among the most powerful ones within the ranks of the 72 earth spiritual generals!”","The immortals from different families talked among themselves animatedly. “The 72 earth spiritual generals obtained their rankings according to the military merits that they accumulated...”","“This Yao Tong is indeed powerful. It was said that he once tore several demon dragon to pieces with his bare hands on the Previous-Life Battleground. Let’s see how he captures this demon monkey!” Seeing the golden melon-shaped huge hammer shooting toward the demon monkey, the immortal soldiers from all families looked pleased.","But in the next moment...","“Look at the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!” Tsunami-like exclamations erupted from the ground. Looking up, the mortals saw the Great Sage remain motionless and even use his head to block the huge hammer!","Crack!","It seemed like the entire world shook three times!","The immortals from the different families who had been talking animatedly were horrified! They saw that the golden melon-shaped huge hammer cracked in the middle and broke into two pieces.","With his spiritual treasure destroyed, Earth Spiritual General Yao Tong shivered violently, and his face instantly turned pale!","“This...”","“This...?!”","“The Golden Melon Huge Hammer was forged with a special gold from outer space!” One spiritual general roared, “It’s impossible! How can it be...!!”","“Quiet!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness snorted and gave that spiritual general a hard look. In this expedition, he was the leader of the alliance forces of all the immortal families and had a much higher rank than these minor generals. “Don’t disgrace us by yelling in front of the enemy!”","“The demon monkey has nothing but a hard body!” Wonderous Spell Almighty said, “He will dissolve when we temper it with water and fire!”","“You’re wise, High Holiness!”","“Spiritual General Yun!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness turned his head and said to the green-faced immortal general who was dressed in a green robe and stepping on a pair of black dragons, “The demon monkey has some abilities. It seems like we must summon the Spirit-Melting Godly Flame of the Yun Family!”","“Spirit-Melting Godly Flame?!” The immortals behind them became animated again.","“It’s said that this flame was made by the ancestor of the Yun Family by collecting the rare items in the depths of outer space and the essence from Heaven and Earth. It’s a miraculous creation and can melt anything.”","“Even the immortal masters don’t dare to touch it. It’s said that even one thread of this flame can burn a large group of heavenly immortals to death...”","“Let’s see how the demon monkey dies this time!”","“What’s this demon monkey doing?!” These immortals were more confident when they saw the look on the monkey, as if he was saying, “Do whatever you can; I’ll admit defeat if you can damage one hair on me.”","“This monkey... will surely die!”","While they talked, the immortal general with the surname of ‘Yun’ took out an immortal token made of ancient jade, and he chanted while holding a Daoist gesture.","A little while later, the sky dimmed as if the whole world was plunged into a vast catastrophe. In the dark sky, a streak of golden light appeared!","Then, a strange blue flame lit up in the space, flashing with waves of cold blue light.","It seemed to have no heat inside.","But everyone could feel that a frightening high heat was hidden in the gloomy blue flame. The immortals didn’t even dare to take one step closer to it, afraid that the wind would blow the light-looking flame toward them.","At this moment, the monkey didn’t dodge. Instead, he remained where he was without moving a muscle.","In the next moment, a surging fire instantly devoured the monkey!","“Hahahaha! This demon monkey is destroyed!” In the sky, the immortals scorned while they looked at the mortals standing in front of the Origins Internet Club. “We’ll see what else you can do!”","“F*ck off! Banana boat!” Instantly, a disciple of the Heavenly Faction cussed.","[TL Note: This curse came from a famous League streamer in China named PDD.]","“Open your eyes and have a good look!”","“Good cussing! Where did you learn it, Senior Brother?!” Seeing some spiritual generals shrinking their necks involuntarily upon hearing the cusses, one disciple asked curiously.","“I picked it up from watching a League of Legends livestream!” Zhuge Qinlong, the Elder Senior Disciple of the Heavenly Faction, smirked smugly.","At this moment, the immortal generals looked carefully with wide eyes. Sure enough, they saw the monkey rolling and frolicking in the strange blue flame as if he was taking a bath with great enjoyment.","“Too cool! Not hot enough! Make it hotter!”","“What?!” All the immortal soldiers were stupefied. Even burning in the Spirit-Melting Godly Flame, he doesn’t look uncomfortable at all. Instead, he is asking for more heat?!","These immortal soldiers and generals had never seen such a scene before. Even Spiritual General Yun, who cast the spell, looked dumbfounded and yelled, “This is... not real. The monkey must be using a spell to trick our eyes!”","The moment he said that, he saw the monkey shooting into the crowd of immortal soldiers. Instantly, the immortal soldiers screamed pathetically, ran around, and caused chaos in the formations.","More astonishing was that Yao Tong, the Earth Spiritual General, was caught off guard, a tiny flame jumped onto his body. Instantly, the flame turned into a blazing fire and melted his armor and tempered his body, causing a series of pathetic howls.","If the flame continued to burn, this powerful spiritual general who ranked in the top among the spiritual generals would be turned into ashes!","“Quickly summon back the spiritual flame!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness stared at Spiritual General Yun who stood in a daze and reprimanded him loudly.","“Oh...” Spiritual General Yao snapped back to his senses. Then, after biting open the tip of his tongue, he spat essence blood onto the ancient jade token. “Godly Fire, please return!”","After spitting essence blood three times and issuing orders repeatedly, he finally withdrew the godly fire. By now, he was disheveled and covered in sweat, losing all the magnificence of an ancient immortal family.","At this moment, a flag silently rose from the crowd in front of the shop. On the red flag were written five big black characters, [The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!]","The flag flapped in the wind, adding more magnificence to the Monkey King who stood proudly in the sky dressed in a golden set of armor and a golden helmet, looking down at everything in the world. At this moment, the immortals who had filled the entire sky changed color.","...","Even Wondrous Spell High Holiness looked grim right now.","“High Holiness...” There were many immortal generals in the ancient families, and the most powerful four were called the Four Directional Spiritual Generals who were very famous among the immortal families. At this moment, their faces looked chilly. “How about...”","Wondrous Spell High Holiness’s old face had never looked so cold before, and a gloomy glint flashed across his eyes. “You and I deal with the demon monkey together, and we will see how powerful he is! The others take the opportunity to capture the mortals. With these hostages, we can force him to surrender!”"]},{"number":865,"title":"Chapter 865 - In a Sage’s Faction! The Rise of the Players!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Clouds flew in all directions in Liuyun Daoist Palace.","Beautiful flowers bloomed all year round in the Tianji Palace. Many pavilions and buildings dotted this place, looking like a chessboard with pieces on it. In the sky, spiritual patterns and arrays circulated like stars. Light dots hovered and danced like flying fireflies.","A pair of eyes that were as clear as water opened while the spiritual essence stopped circulating in her body.","After walking out of the palace, she saw a long pavilion winding through the rich spiritual essence and blooming flowers among which colorful butterflies danced. It seemed like this was a paradise in the mortal world.","“Master! Master!” Her two disciples flew over cheerfully like butterflies. “How come you’re late today? What have you been cultivating lately?”","“Nothing special...” Su Tianji shook her head and said, “Lately, I’ve been understanding the Dao lecture given by the immortal living in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars in the Mountain of Mind and Heart. Whenever I found enjoyment from it, I’d forget the passage of time.”","“That immortal’s lecture is very profound and mysterious... I think its super difficult...” Disciple Yuexin frowned slightly and mumbled, “Master, don’t you find it too profound and mysterious...?”","“No...” Su Tianji said.","“Huh...?!” The two disciples exchanged a look. Does our master have extraordinary talents?! Is she far more talented than average people?!","“Are you more powerful than Senior Nalan and know how to do the Cloud Somersault?” Disciple Fenghua looked at their master in pleasant surprise and asked.","They all say our master is getting idle and becoming more noob, but it seems that those rumors are just slander! Look, she can even understand the mysterious Dao lecture given by that powerful immortal living in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars!","“No.”","“72 transformations?” Yuexin asked immediately.","“No...”","“Have you obtained the way of immortality?!”","“No-!”","“Um... there are so many spells taught in the Cave of Slanting Moon and Three Stars. Why should we learn those...? Look, the Palm Thunder is relatively simple...” Before her two disciples, Su Tianji condensed thunderbolts in her palm and then pushed it out before withdrawing it with proficiency.","She stood straighter with great confidence. “It’s super easy!”","“...”","...","Standing alone in the world and waiting to ascend to become an immortal. This sentence could be used to describe Dugu Yi and the other ancestral who had been away from the world for a long time. They were lonely and desolate.","Different from Xiaoyao Ancestral Master, they lost all of their previous forces, let alone their descendants.","Most people gave them respect, but they also kept a distance from them in fear. The three of them usually gathered at Cloud Ethereal Peak to talk about Dao, so they were also called the Three Friends of Cloud Peak.","Li Wuchen, Dugu Yi, Shang Jiuwen... The glories that these names represented had been buried in the passage of time. Regardless if they had been good or evil, no one in this world cared to find out. After all, even their enemies and their enemies’ forces and descendants had all been devoured by the long river of time.","Their era had long passed...","The current era didn’t need them.","Luckily, in the place called the internet, no one would care if they were ancestral masters or not. With the goal of becoming god-like figures, they had something to occupy their time.","“I realize...” The immortal-like Daoist dressed in a white Daoist robe and holding a whisk said, “The things that we spent all our lives pursuing... don’t seem important anymore. Perhaps we are getting old... and thus no longer care about certain things?”","“When you are old, you pretend to be profound and mysterious!” Beside him, Shang Jiuwen said with a snicker, “If you don’t care about things, then don’t fight for mid lane with me!”","“Huh-!?” Dugu Yi said, “Let’s continue the talk about Dao! Let’s continue!”","“Watching the battle with Qi Tiandi at the Firm Stealth Godly Palace... and listening to the lecture on Dao given by the old Immortal Subodhi at the Mountain of Mind and Heart, I gained more benefits than cultivating for hundreds of years...”","“When we talk with others in the future, we can boast and say that we watched a battle of gods and listening to a lecture on Dao given by an immortal, right?”","“It’s a pity that everyone in the world has watched it and listened to it. They are not things belonging to us alone.”","...","“Master!” Fenghua yelled, “It seems like... something big is happening! Should we...”","“Go and help them!”","...","– In the new shop at the East Continent –","Several earth spiritual generals came down and led the remaining immortal soldiers and generals. Some had huge heaven-hacking axes, and some held the power of wind, thunder, and other heavenly powers.","Hundreds of thousands of immortal soldiers covered the whole world!","Even the prehistoric true demons would be scared by such a great army, let alone a group of weak mortals.","How could mortals have the strength to fight the Heaven?","“Mere mortals, surrender to us! Why are you still struggling?!” The huge ax hacked down with sky-shattering force. As soon as these mortals dodged it, a godly light shot down like a long rainbow! Then, with a boom, a tribulation lightning bolt that could kill real immortals crashed down!","The two sides of the battle were not on the same level. Heavenly Faction Master Feng Xuehe was surrounded by several immortal elites, not to mention others...","In the blink of an eye, their faces turned pale, and their steps stumbled.","Soon, the cultivators and warriors were forced to retreat continuously in defeat.","If the immortals didn’t want to capture them alive, most of them would have died already.","“Die or surrender!” As the immortal lights of the spiritual treasures devoured them like ocean waves, one immortal general yelled furiously.","But at this moment...","“Don’t be scared!”","Heavenly Faction Master Feng Xuehe yelled, “The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal is battling alongside us shoulder to shoulder!","“If the immortals and gods are kind, we respect them. If they are cruel, we must fight them!”","With a mystical iron sword in his hand and covered in blood, the black-robed Elder Dugu Xiao glared at the enemies who were tightly surrounding him. “Even if we die, we have 100,000 heroic souls with us!”","“Haya-!” His roar resonated all over the region as he fought his way into the enemies without a care for his life!","“Our heroic souls will live forever-!” Covered in blood, the members of the Heavenly Faction charged toward their enemies!","“Master-!” Wars were cruel. In the blood-covered battleground, a yell of alarm rose.","The whole battleground was in chaos.","Su Tianji looked back and saw that Fenghua and Yuexin’s spiritual shields had broken, and Fenghua even had a bone-deep wound in her belly.","Then, a horrifying immortal thunderbolt crashed down from the sky!","She looked up and saw an immortal general looking down from the sky as if he was looking at the ants on the ground.","The light from the thunderbolts turned the two girls’ faces white.","Nothing in the world was constant; Heavenly Dao is merciless.","This morning, they had frolicked happily and talked about the recent TV Series and game guides. But perhaps they would never return to the place full of blooming flowers and starry lights.","They smiled bitterly.","No one expected this to be their last moment in the world.","At this moment, Su Tianji’s mind turned blank.","She wondered what spells in her knowledge was powerful enough to block these unimaginably powerful immortals?!","She couldn’t think of one and didn’t have time to ponder.","Almost subconsciously, she condensed spiritual energy and summoned a thunderbolt in her palm!","The Palm Thunder created a small ball of thunder, and it looked pale and weak.","Glancing at the immortal thunderbolt that was as thick as a bucket, the immortal in the sky had a contemptuous and mocking look in his face.","This... was destiny!","However, no one knew that the statement which Dugu Yi and the other two ancestral mentioned on the Cloud Peak Mountain, ‘we watched a battle of gods and listened to a lecture on Dao given by an immortal’ wasn’t accurate.","It should’ve been ‘we watched a battle of the gods of war and listened to the lecture on Dao given in a sages’ faction!’","Yes, a sage’s faction.","This was Palm Thunder, the most orthodox, the most basic, and the most mysterious immortal spell used by average immortals, Tongtian, and Patriarch Hongjun in most of the oriental legends before Fang Qi traveled through space!","[TL Note: Both Tongtian and Patriarch Hongjun are mythological figures in ancient China.]","At this moment, the Palm Thunder collided with the spiritual thunderbolt that the immortal cast.","After the thunder, it seemed like the Heaven and Earth had turned silent.","Then, to everyone’s horror, they saw the immortal thunderbolt with unrivalled force beginning to shatter and... collapse!"]},{"number":866,"title":"Chapter 866 - Above the Gods – the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“My goodness...” Seeing the dancing thunderbolts from the earth-shaking thunder spells, everyone exclaimed as Su Tianji fought several immortals all by herself without showing any disadvantage.","“Isn’t she the...”","“The noob and idle streamer-!?” Some Heavenly Faction disciples who loved watching such streamers instantly brightened up.","“She’s using...?!” The mortals were inspired.","“Wuu-!” At the same time, a flute sound exploded in the mind of the immortal soldiers like a sharp whistle piercing the sky!","With a jade flute in his hand, a black-robed scholar sent demonic notes into the minds of the enemies again and again.","A grey-robed swordsman flew over while standing on a sword which was as bright as lightning...","“The three ancestral master are here as well...!”","...","“High Holiness... I’m afraid that the immortal soldiers might not be able to capture these mortals in a short while...” At this moment, most of the 72 earth spiritual generals, the 36 heaven spiritual generals, and the strongest Four Direction Generals surrounded the demon monkey tightly with all kinds of immortal artifacts and spiritual treasures.","Except for the ones who descended to capture the mortals, the remaining soldiers out of the hundreds of thousands of immortal soldiers and generals all gathered here.","“Wastrels! They are all wastrels! They can’t even arrest a group of mortals!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness stared at the demon monkey coldly and found that the latter was watching the battlefield on the ground, which infuriated him even more. “At this moment, you even have the leisure to watch others...? Think about what will happen to you!”","“Heaven spiritual generals, earth spiritual generals, the Four Direction Spiritual Generals, and immortal soldiers from all families, listen to my command! Go and capture the demon monkey for me!”","“As you wish!” Hearing his command, tens of thousands of immortals moved together!","“A mere demonic immortal dares to fight the Heavens. Regardless of where you come from, today, you’ll be turned into dust with the land under you!”","For average mortals, every single immortal was an unimaginable great existence with ultimate superpowers and spells. They could rarely meet their opponents this time!","At this moment, all these immortals swarmed up, unleashing all kinds of immortal spells using wind, fire, thunder, and lightning, darkening the whole battleground!","Even the masters of the immortal families might not be able to survive these attacks, let alone the minor demonic god in the mortal world","Countless immortal soldiers dressed in shiny silver armor stood in neat formations, looking like a huge silver cliff hovering in the air.","As fierce yells sounded, thunderbolts rose above thick clouds in all directions, and spiritual light beams shot 10,000 meters high, illuminating the spiritual figures who were as high as Heaven!","Some immortals had bodies as giant as mountains, some had spiritual lights around them that were as dazzling as burning sunshine, some had spiritual artifacts with profound and mysterious powers, and some... even stood on heavenly dragons and were dressed in great armor, looking unrivaled in their godly magnificence!","27 of the earth spiritual generals took the front and charged forward with intense murderous aura, spreading over 90,000 acres. While driving dragon-drawn chariots and holding immortal treasures, they dashed from all directions! A spiritual general crashed his heavy halberd at Sun Wukong’s face!","Then, he saw the demon monkey lifting his right hand and reaching at his ear before drawing out a slim rod with shiny golden light.","Compliant Golden-Hooped Rod!","He pointed the rod at the sky!","The tight siege on the battleground suddenly split open! Although it looked like Sun Wukong was tightly surrounded from above, the situation changed too fast.","The huge rod grew in the wind, sending a spiritual general who was holding a heavy halberd flying backward like a cannon ball. All the iron-like formations made of tens of thousands of immortal soldiers dressed in silver armor shattered!","Then, figures were sent flying backward from the center of the battle one after another. Meanwhile, a rod could be vaguely seen spinning with blurry shadows, attacking like a dragon that was shooting out of the ocean and withdrawing like a dragon returning to the abyss. Instantly, many figures were sent flying like the waterdrops from a shower.","All the immortal soldiers saw this scene in horror as the huge Golden-Hooped Rod grew so tall that it reached the end of the Heaven and Earth and then swept at them!","Boom-!","With continuous loud noises, the immortal array formed by tens of thousands of immortals was broken into two halves in the blink of an eye!","The immortals fell from the sky like raindrops in a storm!","“Heaven Spiritual Generals!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness’s face was dark.","“Demon monkey, despite your great abilities, can you escape from the Heaven-Turning Cauldron of my Ying Immortal Family?!” One spiritual general dressed in golden armor yelled furiously as a three-legged green cauldron flew out from his hand. Engulfed in green mist, the cauldron contained dim hundun energy as if it was as heavy as the Heaven and Earth. Like a prehistoric mountain, it crashed down with vicious force!","The Compliant Rod grew as tall as a Heaven-reaching pillar and struck down.","A huge sound resonated in the Heaven and Earth!","The misty green cauldron cracked in the middle. The second strike hit the center of the cauldron, making it explode with earth-shaking huge sounds!","As his immortal treasure was destroyed, the heaven spiritual general felt it in his body, and his face turned white as if he had been struck by a thunderbolt.","“Try and take my Vital Spiritual Gold Sword!”","“Take my Heavenly Immortal Aurora!”","“Take my Transformation Godly Blade...”","16 heaven spiritual generals surrounded him and launched streaks of immortal light one after another with world-destroying presence!","“Regardless of how powerful you are, you are one man. With so many soldiers and generals with us, I’ll see how many rounds you can last!”","The moment he said it, the Monkey King who was dressed in golden armor plucked a handful of monkey hair and blew it at them.","Then, countless Monkey Kings appeared around them in the sky and on the ground, striking down with the Golden-Hooped Rods and shattering countless spiritual treasures and immortal artifacts as if they were glass and jade cups!","At this moment, even the lofty heaven spiritual generals were frightened. They felt like they weren’t seeing a monkey but an unrivaled battle god!","Having lived countless years and experienced countless battles, they had never seen such a horrifying god who could destroy the Heaven and Earth with an iron rod.","What kind of god is he?!","“High Immortal...” The Four Direction Spiritual Generals looked grim as well. “We...”","At this moment, Wondrous Spell High Holiness remained calm, but his eyes revealed a chilly light. “Good Demon Monkey, today... you must die! Four spiritual generals, help my ultimate spiritual figure!”","The Four Direction Spiritual Array took shape, and Wondrous Spell High Holiness gathered all of his ultimate wondrous spells together.","When the Golden-Hooped Rod fell, Wondrous Spell High Holiness vanished from the mortal world.","Spiritual light surged up in the endless void. Beyond the sky, the white clouds opened and revealed a godly figure who was taller than 30,000 meters.","“Heaven Holy Spiritual Figure!” In great horror, the immortal soldiers and generals watched this true immortal whose head and feet touched the Heaven and Earth respectively. All the people including the immortal soldiers and mortals on the ground stopped fighting subconsciously and looked up at the horrifying spiritual figure that went beyond their imagination.","Is this an immortal...?!","The power of the prehistoric immortal families were greater than all mortals’ imagination. At this moment, everyone felt like the mortals were just a drop in the vast ocean.","Before them, humans were indeed tiny and insignificant!","An extremely huge hand extended from beyond the sky and reached for the infinitely small monkey.","No one could escape from this ultimate spiritual figure or this vast and horrifying power. It looked like a tribulation appeared under the Heaven Mandate!","“Cloud Somersault-!” Suddenly, everyone saw a figure who was stepping on clouds slip from the sun-blocking huge hand and shoot upward!","The Golden-Hooped Rod shot out like a sharp arrow and grew 10,000 times bigger in the air. The rod that was as thick as a heavenly pillar whipped up roaring heavenly winds and then blazing flames!","Stepping on clouds, the small figure who carried the huge rod struck it down with vicious force!","Everyone saw that the spiritual figure’s head cracked, and a drop of golden immortal blood fell from the sky, shaking the whole universe!","Not only the mortal world, but the Innumerable-Immortal Sea shook violently, and the ocean of clouds swept backward!","“Charge-!”","“Attack-!” Seeing this sight, countless cultivators and warriors charged with hoarse yells, looking like surging ocean waves!","As if the horn for the counterstrike was blown, countless cultivators and warriors charged at the enemies fearlessly, scaring the immortals both in the sky and on the ground.","At least in 10,000 years, people would always remember this rod strike and the figure standing proudly before all immortals and looking down at the Heaven and Earth in defiance. They would always remember the name – the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal, Sun Wukong!"]},{"number":867,"title":"Chapter 867 - We’re Never Afraid of a Technology Competition!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","While the people from the new shop at the East Continent were battling the immortal families, the Half City Shop was also engaged in a fierce battle.","Red light rose between the Heaven and Earth!","These people were facing demonic gods who were far more powerful than them!","On the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle, the light beams coming off the godly swords illuminated the Heaven and Earth!","“The source of murderous presence has been destroyed-!” On the vast ocean, the pure-white light shone from the Heavenly Mirror. Under its light, a sword energy beam shot into the weak point of the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle.","“The demons who blocked us have been killed! Start targeting!” It was a desolate scene on the huge turtle. Led by Nalan Hongwu, the cultivators and warriors who were covered in blood panted heavily as they stood over the demons’ corpses that were lying all over the ground!","Then, sword energies surged up and condensed into a huge Heavenly Sword in mid-air, striking toward the vital joints of the turtle.","“Fire!” In the roars of the ocean, circles of destructive lightning energy lit up in the huge cannons that were sitting on the bow of the Vital Magnetic Wind Thunder Battleship.","Looking down, people saw several bright blue light beams tearing through the gloomy ocean and attacking the turtle’s joints with accuracy together with the cultivators on the back of the huge turtle.","Getting attacked from all sides, all four legs of the turtle were severely injured in the blink of an eye!","...","The true power doesn’t lie in physical bodies. The inner determination and unyielding spirit that can withstand countless hardships are the source of true power.","On this battlefield, there weren’t any great heroes or immortal gods as on the other battleground. Regardless of how bright their sword energies were, they were only little sparks in the Heaven and Earth.","However, they were trying to use these small sparks to illuminate the dark world.","One person might not be able to achieve it, but how about a group of them?!","After receiving severe injuries in its four legs, the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle howled pathetically and sank to the bottom of the ocean like a collapsing mountain.","The huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle opened its giant mouth and revealed a vast space inside. It was the command space inside the huge turtle.","With sword in hand, these people followed the retreating demon soldiers and killed their way into the giant command space inside the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle!","In the past, the weak humans who were stuck between the gods and demons regarded them as natural catastrophes.","Today, whoever dared to invade the mortal world would shed blood in the sky!","“Haya-!” With sword energies emitting radiant light beams in the dark, Nalan Hongwu took the lead and ran into space, followed by people from different factions!","Heavenly Mirror, Wuchen Sword... with all kinds of godly artifacts and spiritual treasures and all kinds of superpowers, Nalan Hongwu and the others took advantage of the carelessness and overconfidence of the demon soldiers and killed their way into the space.","They seemed to come into another small world.","In this space, there were many complex paths, making it seem like a dim underground cave.","Looking closer, the people saw squirming walls made of flesh. However, it didn’t look like the interior of the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle. There were no impurities being absorbed and excreted, much cleaner and neater than the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle’s stinky huge mouth when they first entered.","Sitting on the throne of bones among the troops, the demonic god had a mysterious glint in his eyes.","“My Lord...” A deputy commander looked chilly. “These humans are reckless. Give them an inch, and they take a mile. They even dared to kill their way in here...!”","The demonic god sitting high on the throne of bones said coldly, “My Nine-Fold Darkness Space is extremely complex. Even if they can come in, they can’t get out without a map. Perhaps they will get lost in the space before we attack them!”","“Hehe...” another deputy commander said with a sneer, “After they killed countless demon soldiers, we must give the humans a taste of our great power!”","“After all...” another demon said, “Regardless if it is spiritual treasures, artifacts, or any other things, we’re much more advanced than those humans!”","“Hehehehe... hahahaha! Instead of taking the broad way to the Heavens, they must break into our Nine-Fold Darkness that doesn’t have a gate!”","In their long history, the demons had created countless advanced items that humans could never imagine!","With that said, an visual appeared before the demons. “Even if we monitor them all the time like this, they’ll never notice it.”","Through the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection, they were watching Nalan Hongwu and others.","“Nalan! Brother Nalan!” At this moment, a streak of light from a mirror shone in the Nine-Fold Darkness Space.","Nalan Hongwu turned his head and saw that it was Lan Mo who was holding the authentic Heavenly Mirror.","At this moment, except for Team One led by Nalan Hongwu, others were all lost in the space.","“There’s something strange in this space!” Nalan Hongwu looked grim. “We might have entered a trap set by these demons!”","After they cut off the turtle legs and killed their way into this space, Nalan Hongwu, a veteran general, had sensed a weird presence.","“Cackle!” The demon generals in the command center snickered again as they saw that their enemies were indeed trapped.","“It doesn’t matter.” At this moment, Lan Mo took out his communication jade and shook it. Soon, it showed a strange and crude map.","It looked like a map in the games. Of course, if Fang Qi was here, he would find it similar to the Google Maps in his previous life.","The map showed their current position and direction that they were facing. “This is... the map function that we, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, newly developed. Under the guidance of the Heavenly Mirror, I drew a small part of the map. When we finish this part, we can use QQ Communication to share our location with other people and upload the map at the same time. It will soon show the locations of other people according to their signals. I believe that we’ll find each other very soon.”","Seeing this, the demon general in the command center froze.","“QQ Communication...?! Location sharing?! What’s that?!”","“Hurry!” The demon general’s face turned livid. “Activate Spiritual Confusion Array to disturb the spiritual essence and interrupt their communication!”","“Yes!”","Soon, Lan Mo shook his communication jade. “Ugh...? Strange. There’re no signal?!”","“What should we do then?” Zong Wu asked.","“It doesn’t matter!” Lan Mo said, “This is the newest version of the military communication jade developed by the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, and it can process all kinds of signals at the same time. I’ll change to electromagnetic signals...”","“Hurry! Activate Darkness Magnetic Aurora to interrupt their communication!” The demon general sneered, “Do you think that you can use it by changing signals?! A mere piece of human technology dares to compete with the technology of our clan.”","“Huh-?!” Lan Mo shook his communication jade in bafflement. “Even electromagnetic signals are blocked?”","“I’ll try the light wave...”","“Issue the order to activate the Darkness-Connecting Array!”","“I’ll try the radio waves...”","“Activate Black Thunder Ebony Water Array!”","“I’ll change to infrasound wave...”","“Activate...”","“I’ll try ultrasonic wave this time...”","“These humans... where did they get so many communication methods!!??” Dumbfounded, those demon generals stared at the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection before them as the mortals tried different signals on the communication jade and finally got a good connection."]},{"number":868,"title":"Chapter 868 - Gods and Demons Are All Defeated!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","One demon said, “The spell that this person used seems to be a spell using outer sounds, just like the spell named ‘Great Sound Is Silent’. We don’t have a defense array for such a rarely-seen spell, unless... we do it personally.”","“...”","...","In the place where Nalan Hongwu and the others were standing.","“I have a feeling that... someone is eavesdropping on our conversation,” Lan Mo said, “The new signals that we switched to were great in the beginning, but now it’s lagging again?”","“Do you have a way to stop it?” Zong Wu asked.","“Of course!” Lan Mo said, “When the Great Sage studied in the Mountain of Mind and Heart with his senior brothers, he learned many unorthodox small spells. I’ll cast one!”","In the next moment, the demon generals in the command center began watching a ‘silent movie’.","A while later, the silent movie turned black!","“What is going on with these mortals?!” a demon general roared.","This was totally different from the information that they had on humans in their memories!","...","“The murderous presence is gone. The Cultivator Alliance has scouted the inner structure of this demon turtle and the origin of these demons. They found that the spiritual essence that it devoured mostly flowed to these places. I’ve marked these points on the map.” Lan Mo continued to study the map.","“Different from the Anton raid, even if we cut off its energy, we won’t be able to do great damage to the strength of the demons in here. But Academy Master Gu and other cultivators discussed it and found something. After we get familiar with its structure, we can secretly use this tremendous energy in the space and form the 36 Tiangang Sword Array that Shu Mountain Sword Faction used to subdue the Almighty Demon Lord!”","“If this array is built, it will give you all a great boost!”","At this moment, when these people looked at each other, their eyes were full of glints of self-confidence!","The sword array that could subdue the Almighty Demon Lord, and it would be powered with such a huge amount of energy.","Perhaps this time, they would use their actions to tell their enemies that human wisdom was infinite!","Just like how they had found the weaknesses of the monsters that were far more powerful than themselves in the raids, this time, they also seemed to have found a solution!","This was what they obtained after failing countless times in that virtual world!","“If we encounter danger, we’ll need the raid teams to block it!” Lan Mo said gravely, “We’d better...","He pointed at the center of the map and continued, “We must monitor this place all the time!”","“Of course!”","...","Soon, through communication jades, they shared the information with every cultivator and warrior who had to enter this space.","They began working hard in the places where the spiritual essence went through to carry out the plan of building the 36 Tiangang Sword Array.","At this moment, the demonic god sitting on the throne of bones looked even grimmer.","The Nine-Fold Darkness Demon General wasn’t a small general with little experience in wars.","Right now, he put away his arrogance and began to study the humans in a new light.","Borrowing a path through the human world to attack their enemy by surprise was a key part of the plan, and he couldn’t allow any mistake to happen at this stage.","Except for the demons going out to guard the demon turtle, only a side general and a deputy commander stayed with him.","One was a brawny demon god who was dressed in black stone armor covered in strange runes. The other was hovering in the air upside-down and engulfed in a chilly presence. Its withered body looked like a corpse that recently died.","The demonic god finally walked down from the eternal-looking throne of bones, and its surging demonic presence instantly shook the entire Nine-Fold Darkness Space!","At this moment, an abyss demon with an iron-like black body rushed in.","He was followed by a figure who was covered in blood. With blood-red eyes and low hoarse roars, he looked like a demonic god from Hell.","About to walk out, the three demonic gods in here froze and looked at these two. “Who are you?!”","Are they our peers?! But we have never seen any demons looking like these two!","The demonic god covered in blood said, “Who am I?! I’m King of Enhancement, King of Unboxing, and The Father of the King of Black Iron! You asked me who I am?!”","“Outrage Break!” The huge sword crashed down with surging lava!","“...”","“You two deal with the demons on the sides. Leave the middle one to us!” At this moment, two more voices sounded.","Two more teams killed their way into this place. The leader had five godly swords spreading behind him like wings, and another had slightly closed eyes and held a sword engulfed in jade-like thunderbolts!","Clap! Clap! Clap!","At this moment, the demonic god who had horns on his forehead and distorted facial features applauded. “I admire you for finding this place in such a short time.","“But...” His eyes turned cold. “What kind of confidence drove you to appear before me?!”","Right now, they were standing in a vast underground space. The demonic god roared as his bulging muscles expanded. In a short time, he transformed into a giant as tall as 300 meters!","Its horns almost reached the top of the space, and the ground shook with each step its huge body took.","Its body was still growing until the top of the space was pierced and shattered. An extremely huge demonic god stood on the back of the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle. When he stepped into the ocean, waves surged up and shattered the surrounding spiritual ships like cannonballs.","Even the remaining Vital Magnetic Wind Thunder Battleships were battered and on the verge of breaking.","As if bedlam broke loose, demon soldiers swarmed out from the broken space in large groups. Their number was even bigger than before, blocking the sky and covering the ground!","“Kill them all!”","At this moment, who could block such a horrifying demonic god?!","Yells and screams rose continuously! At this moment, the demonic god from the Nine-Fold Darkness struck the deepest fear into their minds!","It was undefeatable and unrivaled!","Even the huge Vital Magnetic Battleships looked as small as its hands and were shattered by one touch, let alone mortal bodies!","“Today, I’ll show you the price that you must pay for angering with me!”","However, at this moment, 36 golden light beams lit up at the feet of the demonic god!","Corresponding with the positions of the 36 Tiangang, the spiritual light beams connected and moved like stars.","Then, from the space beneath its feet, sword energies rose like a group of stars!","“What’s that?!”","The endless sword energies gathered above its head, and they formed a huge Tai Chi Yin Yang Pattern in the sky!","The tremendous spiritual essence was drawn out and gathered in the sword array. Although humans couldn’t possess such huge spiritual energy, the sword array could contain far more spiritual essence than humans!","With a sharp yell, a figure flew up into the high sky while stepping on a sword. “You drew out such a huge amount of spiritual essence from the Heaven and Earth and caused the imbalance of spiritual essence, exhausting the nearby areas. You killed at will and regarded human lives as that of grass. Do you really think that no one in the mortal world can stop you?!”","Flying swords filled the sky, forming a sword curtain before blocking the sky and covering the ground.","Then, a force powerful enough to scare demonic gods began to gather in the sword array!","Like endless currents, countless sword energies gathered in one spot before transforming into a golden rainbow that connected the Heaven and Earth, falling from the sky!","“What... is that?!” At this moment, even the demonic god looked horrified!","He sensed the aura of death that he hadn’t felt for countless years!","In the next moment, an extremely huge golden light beam shot down! The golden light filling the sky and swept in all directions like Heavenly Power!","...","On the other battleground, the extremely huge spiritual figure collapsed with booming noises like a falling gold mountain or a jade pillar!","“Kill!” Following the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal, all the cultivators and warriors charged at the previously arrogant, lofty, and fierce immortals.","“Retreat! All retreat!” In the sky-shaking battle shouts, countless immortal soldiers and generals from different families dumped their helmets and armor while they scrambled to run!","They had never experienced such a moment in their lives.","On this day, both gods and demons were defeated in the mortal world!"]},{"number":869,"title":"Chapter 869 - Mr. Fang’s New Reward","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Going eastwards of Half City and crossing the vast and gloomy ocean, one would see the turbid Yellow Spring Sea.","At this moment, the whole area was golden.","Light almost engulfed the entire sea area. Even people from thousands of kilometers away could see the aurora in the horizon as if the sun had just risen and dyed the whole world golden!","The 36 Tiangang Sword Array of the Shu Mountain Faction was designed to subdue demons that mortals couldn’t defeat. It could be used by one person as Fang Qi had done when he used it to deal with the Nangong Family. It could also be used by multiple people to borrow the Heaven and Earth’s boundless energy.","In the Legend of Sword and Fairy 1, the Grand Uncle-Master Jiang Qing who was trapped in the Demon-Suppressing Tower was one of the people who used this array to fight the Almighty Demon Lord.","In the Legend of Sword and Fairy 2, Li Xiaoyao controlled the array when his group killed the resurrected Almighty Demon Lord.","These veteran players were obviously very proficient in all kinds of games, and they mastered some aspects of the games. Arrays were used to activate the force of the Heavens and Earth. By taking the tremendous energy from the Heaven-Devouring Turtle as the base of the array, the energy level of the array was now on the same level as these demonic gods.","All the demons stopped what they were doing and watched the sight in horror.","When the golden light faded away, the extremely huge demonic god stared at its chest in astonishment. There was a huge hole in it.","“Aw-!” An extremely shrill howl spread all over the Heavens and Earth.","Then, it fell on its back.","Huge waves surged up as its blood spread up to 1,000 kilometers away!","“Hurry! Escort Mr. Nine-Fold Darkness out of here!” At this moment, the other demon generals lost the will to fight and scrambled to retreat with the severely wounded Nine-Fold Darkness Demon General!","The other demon soldiers either died or fled.","They didn’t even have time to take the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle with them. Many of the demon soldiers who were not able to flee died together with the footless huge monster in the ocean.","“It’s finally over...” The turbid seawater was dyed dark-red by the demon blood.","Everyone looked fatigued.","“Hurry and heal the wounded and count the casualties!”","Orders were issued. This time, both Half City and the new shop at the East Continent had great casualties.","Gu Tingyun said in a loud voice, “Although... the resurrection spell needs harsh conditions and is now in great shortage, I have good news for you. We’ve obtained a major breakthrough in the research of the Vital Spirit Revival Recreation that the E’mei Faction used for their dead disciples. Even though we can’t bring the disciples back to life as the E’mei Faction did, we can soon direct them to reincarnate and begin cultivation again! For those people who had no factions, we won’t let their heroic souls wander outside. Our Cultivator Alliance will help them too!”","In the new shop at the East Continent, Faction Master Feng Xuehe of Heavenly Faction also heard the good news. He said excitedly, “Now, our faction is truly powerful!”","“Can we really do that...?!”","“My goodness!”","Instantly, cheers spread to every corner of the world like a tsunami!","For cultivators, if their vital spirits weren’t destroyed, they weren’t dead.","Only at this moment could the major factions call themselves top factions with pride.","Right now, covered in wounds, Fenghua and Yuexin said with tears on their faces, “Master, even the dead can be brought back to life; why did we fight so hard anyway... I thought we’d die together...”","“Nonsense!” Su Tianji rolled her eyes at them and flicked her finger on their heads while saying, “Who do you think your master is?! I’m Fairy Su of Tianji Palace, the popular technical streamer!”","“I hit them with a Palm Thunder from the left hand. When they didn’t die, I hit them again with a thunderbolt from my right hand!” She made gestures while she spoke. “Even though they are immortals, your master can deal with them!","“Besides, those disciples of the E’mei Faction looked like new people after they reincarnated, and they lost all of their cultivation strength; what a bother!”","“Right!” With sudden understanding, Fenghua and Yuexin looked back at the shop and said, “Then, after buying so many games, we’d have to buy them again?!”","“Aiya-!” They patted their chests and said with great relief, “Fortunately, we didn’t die!”","“What are you thinking about?! You know nothing but games!”","“When you have time, you must spend more time on TV Series!”","“Okay-!”","...","“But...” Fenghua said sadly, “The Great Sage is now put under Five Phases Mountain...”","“Yeah... It’s said that a monk who’s going to the west for Buddhist scriptures will come and get him out. We’ll see it soon!”","“I wonder what’s the background of the Tathagata Buddha. How come he’s so powerful?!” Yuexin said, “Even with the Cloud Somersault technique, which allows one to cover 108,000 li in one leap, the Great Sage couldn’t get out of his palm.”","While walking toward the teleportation array with Su Tianji, she rubbed her dirty face and extended one palm while saying, “Even if it’s tens of thousands of times bigger than this, it can’t be that large.”","“You two are... Hurry back and heal your injuries. You can talk about this after you recover!” Su Tianji immediately escorted the two pale-faced girls back to Liuyun Daoist Palace.","“After we heal, let’s go and watch Journey to the West together! I want to watch the Great Sage travel 108,000 li with the Cloud Somersault after he comes out!”","“Okay! Okay!” Seeing the Great Sage come out as lively as before was all they hoped for after watching all the dangers that he had experienced at the Demon Hacking Platform, Laozi’s elixir brazier, and in the palm of the Tathagata Buddha.","...","The people with slight injuries were cleaning up the battleground.","All of them were talking about their favorite topics while they worked. This place was in ruins, but they believed that the damage was only temporary, and everything would be better since they were growing stronger each day.","Perhaps one day, they could fly under the vast starry sky on their swords, going to wherever they wanted.","They would fly casually and relaxed, covering 90,000 li in one breath like a rainbow!","At that time, they might be able to go beyond the starry sky and see how vast the universe really was.","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang had returned to his shop, looking fatigued.","He was looking through the ‘spoils of war’.","During this synchronization with Sun Wukong, he had used three godly weapon fragments to trade for the one-time use of the godly weapon, the Compliant Golden-Hooped Rod.","Only half of the six godly weapon fragments were left; it was a big consumption.","Fortunately, the System would compensate him with the gift bag.","[Task: Severely Punish the Troublemakers (Completed)","Task Reminder: A large group of troublemakers will come to the new shop. Host must deal with it solemnly!","Task Reward: Carrier Rock*1, System Gift Bag*1, Double Coupon for the Cultivation Room*1 (It will increase cultivation speed)","Task Rating: A+++]","“Huh...?” Mr. Fang was baffled since he expected the rating to be lower than the last time due to the casualties.","How come the rating is higher?","After all, there were zero casualties last time, but he didn’t get A+++. The only level higher than this was an S!","“Is it because...” Mr. Fang glanced at the group chat and saw that people were announcing and cheering for the victory in the battleground outside Half City.","“Is it because of this...?!”","[Do you want to claim this reward?]","“Yes!”"]},{"number":870,"title":"Chapter 870 - New Snacks! Super Yummy! Mustard-Flavored Seaweed! Durian Candies! Stinky Tofu!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– In the Canglan City Shop –","Obviously, many players had joined the battle as allies.","They didn’t make great contributions on the central battleground, but some paladins and priests provided great assistance in the battle.","Without the Symbol of Life provided by the System, the resurrection spell required many strict conditions to cast, but it had made great contributions.","At this moment, a group of elves led by Elder Sewell was healing the wounded with the unique healing spells that they had learned.","“It’s unbelievable...” Elf Girl Sala exclaimed, “The Great Sage was like a God of War!”","Even the players in the Canglan City Shop were talking about it.","“That Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal... really showed up?!” Big Black Dragon Gulth stared at the people who were trying to describe the fighting scenes with gestures, and his big eyes opened wide.","“Did you see the Havoc in Heaven? That part in Journey to the West?”","“I assure you that the battle was even more stunning than Havoc in Heaven!” St. Leidon gestured with his hands and said, “He struck out his rod like this!”","“Hiss-” Standing before him, Black Dragon Gulth shrunk his neck involuntarily as if he was afraid that the Great Sage would appear and hit his head with the rod.","“What do you think happened?!","“He broke the head of that immortal’s spiritual figure, and blood flowed out!”","“So strong... he is a real god!”","“Unfortunately, his cultivation system and combat techniques are more fitting for the people in the East Continent...” Beside them, St. Willy said with a sigh, “We can only get some inspirations.”","“I wonder...”","They exchanged a look. “Forget it!”","“Let’s go and play League of Legends!”","“Let’s go and play Dark Souls! People get their skills by practicing hard!”","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang was on the second floor of the shop at the East Continent.","[You obtained : Carrier Rock*1, System Gift Bag*1, Double Coupon for the Cultivation Room*1.]","He knew the great power of Carrier Rocks. Even though the Carrier Rocks had the shortcoming of not being able to protect Fang Qi, but it could recreate the complete characters from the games and movies and required only 10 percent synchronization rate with the chosen character, which was much less difficult than the 20 percent synchronization rate that Mr. Fang must achieve before he could synchronize with any characters in person.","[System Gift Bag.]","Since this gift bag had excellent quality, Mr. Fang had greater odds to find powerful items in it.","“Um...?! This is good...!”","At this moment, Mr. Fang was holding a purple silk-covered box in his hands in his own room upstairs.","It was again the exciting moment to unbox!","Mr. Fang put the gift box on the desk carefully and opened it slowly.","Immediately, blinding golden light shot out from the box.","“What good stuff did I get this time?!” Items popped out from the System Gift Bag and filled the square desk before him.","There were weapons, snacks, and items that were put into the System Storage due to the limited space in the room. There were even...","Mr. Fang glanced at the beautifully wrapped...”Game disc?”","He grabbed it and read the description. “Collector’s Edition of God of War I-II?!”","“After activation, I’ll get the right to sell God of War I and God of War II as well as the conditions to obtain the tasks for this series?”","“Um... I got a new game...?!”","“What else have I got...?” Mr. Fang looked at the desk and saw a wrist blade that had a strange shape. Looking at the blood-colored light and the godly blade engulfed in fiery presence, he realized that it was...","“Flame Wave Blood Blade?!”","“Almighty Demon Lord... Chong Lou?!” Fang Qi stared at the wrist blade dumbfoundedly.","[Flame Wave Blood Blade: This blade is made of the godly iron from meteorites and the flame wave spring soul. It’s a demonic weapon that no human can handle. Using it will greatly increase energy consumption and reduce synchronization time. Please use it with great caution due to its great power.]","“F*ck?!”","He rubbed his eyes. “F*ck-!”","“Hahahahaha–!” Almost everyone downstairs heard the wild laughter from upstairs.","“What else have I got...?” Although synchronization with a character who had much greater cultivation strength than himself would greatly shorten the synchronization time and increase the energy consumption, and Fang Qi might be kicked out of synchronization mode after using two strikes. However, this weapon gave Fang Qi another powerful hidden card.","“What else...?”","“Snacks...?” There were bags of snacks on the desk.","He dug through them and finally found a black rock.","Carrier Rock: At 10 percent synchronization rate, it can summon a character from a game, a movie, or a TV Series for a certain time.]","“That’s all?!” Mr. Fang dug through the items and found that the rest were all snacks.","While browsing the System Interface, he knew that this task was completed. The good news was that another task, Challenger’s Tutorial School (Intermediate), was close to completion, and it would end soon.","At this moment, he heard a prompt from the System.","[The System is 60% upgraded. The expansion of Wrath of Lich King is completed.]","[The summer gift bags in Dungeon Fighter Online are released online.]","[The pool party skins in League of Legends are online.]","Considering the different customs, the summer game outfits for the people in this world were less exposed compared to those in the original version.","“New game and new expansion?! And new gift bags?!” Mr. Fang looked at the sky outside with a loss of words. It was already summer, but there were no summer break in this world!","While he was musing over this thought, Fang Qi heard a knock on his door.","Remembering what had happened the last time when he opened the box, Mr. Fang had closed the door before opening the box this time.","But now, he had nothing to hide, so he opened the door.","“Huh?! Xiaoyue?!","“Haven’t you returned to your faction?!”","Jiang Xiaoyue said, “I’ve good news! We’re having the summer break soon! Royal Father delivered many crystals to me and told me to study hard... but I have no place to spend them... Hehe!”","“Huh-!?” Mr. Fang widened his eyes. “You even have summer breaks?!”","“What do you mean?!” Jiang Xiaoyue said with a pout, “We’re very tired from studying in the faction. Each day after studying in the faction, we must play games. With such a tight schedule each day, why can’t we have a summer break?!”","“During the summer break, we will have lots of free time after playing games! I can go to the Elf Forest with Sister Sala and others! I can also go and tour the Orc Kingdom! I heard that the Half City is organizing a so-called Nine-Fold Darkness Expedition Team, and our Heavenly Academy and Heavenly Faction are planning an expedition to the void. I can join them too!”","“Forget it! Those places are dangerous!”","“Huh-!” As if discovering a new continent, Jiang Xiaoyue looked behind Mr. Fang and saw...","“So many snacks-!”","“Boss-! How come you have so many snacks that I’ve never seen before!”","“Oh!” Glancing at the snacks on the desk, Mr. Fang got an idea. “Xiaoyue, if you promise not to go to Nine-Fold Darkness or the void, I’ll give you half of the snacks.”","“...” Jiang Xiaoyue hesitated and then looked at the snacks on the desk before saying reluctantly, “Then, I promise you I won’t go...”","“Then, you can have this, this... and this!”","Jiang Xiaoyue watched Mr. Fang split the snacks into two equal piles and pushed one pile toward her.","“Wow-!” In disbelief, Jiang Xiaoyue carried the snacks in her arms and hurried downstairs, afraid that Mr. Fang would change his mind.","After putting them all on the tea table in the lounge area, she saw two exquisite bags with fruit pictures and words ‘Durian-flavored Candies’.","In a translucent box were pieces of black tofu shiny with oil. Traditional Stinky Tofu.","There were also two exquisite bags that had pictures of seaweed on them. Mustard-Flavored Seaweed.","At this moment, most people had finished cleaning up at the battleground. Su Tianji and the others returned to the shop, and their eyes lit up at the snacks on the desk. “Xiaoyue, you bought so many snacks?!”","“Aya! The shop owner gave them to me.” Seeing the expectant gazes from Su Tianji and the others, Jiang Xiaoyue said bashfully and reluctantly, “Would you like to have a little?”","“Can we?!”","“Okay! Xiaoyue, you’re so nice!”"]},{"number":871,"title":"Chapter 871 - This Sounds Fishy... the Void Plan!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s this?!” An elf picked up the bag of candies with pictures of a fruit on it. “Durian-flavored candies?”","“This seems to be the picture of a fruit!” Sala said happily, “Fruit-flavored candies must be good!”","These elves especially liked fruits.","Su Tianji picked up the box which looked like the box for spicy sticks that were sold in the shop. “What are these? Tofu that tastes like spicy sticks?”","Jiang Xiaoyue picked up a bag of seaweed and said eagerly, “I’ve never seen this before, but it looks good. I’ll try this first.”","“Wow-!” The elves were thrilled. They had heard about these snacks that weren’t for sale in the shop, but they had never tasted them before!","They were in luck today to try the delicacies that others couldn’t have.","After all, these snacks were not for sale, and it was the only opportunity for them to eat such snacks!","At this moment, other people in the shop glanced at them enviously.","“Then, I’ll open this box!” Su Tianji said cheerfully.","“Me too!” Sala and other elves each took out a candy.","They unwrapped their snacks eagerly.","“I’m eating it!” At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue tore open a small packet of seaweed and almost instantly stuffed a few sheets of seaweed into her little mouth. At the last moment, she suppressed her impatience and took a small bite delicately.","Instantly, her little pink face changed color.","Then, a weird stinky braised taste together with an indescribable pungent taste began to spread out...","It felt as if they had opened Pandora’s Box!","As if someone dropped a biohazardous bomb into the lounge area, the elves’ faces turned yellow at the smells.","“This is...?!”","“What-?!”","“Ahh-! Pooh! Pooh! Pooh...!” Jiang Xiaoyue’s little face turned bitter at this pungent and spicy taste. “Water... I need water!”","While fanning at her little pink tongue, she hurried off to find water.","“So stinky-!” Sala covered her nose, feeling suffocated!","Dizzy from the stinky smell, Su Tianji closed the box lid with difficulty, and her face turned green due to suffocation.","She turned her head and saw that all the other people in the shop had moved more than 30 meters away from them with their hands covering their noses. Their envious expression changed, and it looked as if they had seen a ghost. They had a feeling that this group of people might be eating some poop together?!","...","Unlike them, the faction masters, elders, and leaders such as Gu Tingyun, Zong Wu, Xichi Spiritual Master, and even Demonic Woman Ning Bi had many pieces of business to tend to.","After all, Mr. Fang’s job was managing the shops, and the players’ job was playing the games. The other stuff also needed attention and management.","At this moment, Ning Bu was supervising the wardens of Half City while the latter interrogated the captives from the Innumerable-Immortal Sea and Nine-Fold Darkness.","Meanwhile, the faction masters and elders of different factions were talking about the subsequent plans. Even the West Continent sent representatives to join the discussion.","...","The Innumerable-Immortal Sea was even more busy. Wondrous Spell High Holiness was a top figure among the elders, not only in the Gui Family but in all other families.","In the expedition that he led in person, he was wounded severely and forced to retreat in defeat. This incident had a great impact not only in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea but in the whole Heavenly Realm.","– Meanwhile, in the Nine-Fold Darkness –","The fierce generals led by Nine-Fold Darkness Demon General tried to borrow path in the mortal world with the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle to launch a sneak attack at the Heavenly Realm, but the moment they landed, they were driven back in defeat. This news had swiftly spread all over the demon army of Nine-Fold Darkness.","In the Gui Family in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, Wondrous Spell High Holiness stared at the distance coldly with squinted eyes. “The moment we moved, we encountered a monster with a hairy face and a protruding mouth?! I don’t believe that such a powerful demon monkey exists in the mortal world. Is it a demon from the Nine-Fold Darkness army...?! What’s their scheme?!”","In the Nine-Fold Darkness Army, the Nine-Fold Darkness Demon General knelt inside a grand palace despite its severe wounds. A gloomy voice came from the endless darkness before it, “You were ambushed the moment that you arrived in the mortal world... and those humans’ power was far beyond your imagination? Perhaps it was an ambush set by the Godly Court...?”","Wonderous Spell High Holiness said, “This whole thing feels fishy. We’ll make a decision after I report to the Godly Court and a thorough investigation is done.”","The voice from the Nine-Fold Darkness said, “This must be a scheme! I’ll put your defeat aside for the moment. Find out the background of the human masters whom you encountered in the mortal world and find a way to redeem yourself!”","“Report-!”","Meanwhile, in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea and in the Nine-Fold Darkness, they both received a report.","“Two of our captives were sent back with a message from the Cultivator Alliance in the mortal world!”","“What message?!” The people in both places turned dark. “Bring them in!”","The two captives knelt and delivered the message, “They said... said... they would break any claws extending into their world!”","“They said, ‘We never start wars, but we’ll do our best to fight you if you want wars!’”","The people from the two places instantly turned livid!","“Outrageous! They are so outrageous!”","“What shall we do, High Holiness?!” An immortal from the Gui Family in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea asked.","They knew who their opponent was without thinking...","“But I still feel like... there’s something fishy!” Wondrous Spell High Holiness said coldly.","...","In the Godly Palace, the god who was dressed in five-colored godly armor read the intelligence report that the Godly Palace had just received. “News came from the Godly Court.”","“They decided to bide their time?” The God of Radiant Light sat on his godly throne with no emotion could be seen on his face, and he said, “I’m afraid even they are suspicious that the Nine-Fold Darkness Army is behind it.”","“They will have peace talks with the mortal world and pay ransom for the captives! They will give the humans some benefits to steady them. After the truth comes out...” he said with a chuckle, “It’s a good plan. After they find out the truth, I’m afraid that the mortal world will become the new battleground between them and the Nine-Fold Darkness Army!”","...","“High Holiness, the mortal world... also demanded us to clear the Thunderbolt Zone in the void...”","“Thunderbolt Zone in the void ...?” Wondrous Spell High Holiness said with a sneer, “What a joke! Tell them that this zone has come into being for a long time and is a zone of its own. Thus, it isn’t easy to clear. Aren’t they very powerful? They can pass it if they are able to. If they can’t, it’s not our fault!”","The people living in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea had blood sacrifice seals in the Demon-Slaying Platform and thus could manage to descend to the lower region despite the great price they had to pay.","“These humans think that they are powerful, but how can they be compared with us!”","...","– Meanwhile, in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance –","On the big square of the Daoist Alliance parked several cutting-edge spiritual ships.","Now that the Cultivation Alliance and the warriors had saint-level masters among them, they began to carry out the Void Plan.","Artifact Master Jun Yangzi of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance had a jade slip in his hand. The jade slip contained the key projects such as the portal to the alternate world as shown in Diablo II, the warp technology in StarCraft, the Void Creatures shown in League of Legends, and the ascendance plan of the Qionghua Faction shown in the Legend of Sword and Fairy 4.","Some projects were old research projects which had gained certain results. For example, there were portal and teleportation technology in Diablo II and the void energy in League of Legends.","Some projects were brand-new without any clues, such as the warp technology in StarCraft.","They sat together and talked. “Let’s begin these projects first...”","For the cultivators, this was a grand plan, but a bit far-fetched for now."]},{"number":872,"title":"Chapter 872 - Plans for Mobile Games?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","It was deep in the night.","The giant dead Heaven-Devouring Turtle provided the cultivators a temporary landing place at the entrance to the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness in the Yellow Spring Sea. They constructed large stretches of land and islands with earth-element spells on the huge corpse of the demon, and they built a monitoring station to observe the strange movements on the other side of the crevice at the ocean bottom.","It was cold in the ocean during the night. Several black-robed cultivators slowly flew up from the bottom of the ocean and came out of the sea.","“Elder, guys.” In the dark night, the cultivators cupped their hands and reported, “Our enemy seems to have sent many soldiers to guard the bottom of the ocean on their side. We didn’t dare to venture too deep, but during our short investigation, we found that the spiritual essence in the nearby areas mainly contains yin and water properties on top of the five properties. There is gloomy and evil murderous presence in it, so ordinary cultivators can’t inhale it to recover essence.”","“I feel the opposite!” The long-haired male cultivator dressed in a black cloak was Black Demon. “The essence flowed more smoothly in my meridians when I was engulfed in the pure murderous presence.”","“The Heavenly Book said that when the Heaven separated the Earth, the light essence rose while the heavy essence fell. We each chose one type of essence to cultivate, and there are few geniuses who can cultivate both and go back to hundun...” The speaker was the Nanhua Faction Master. “It seems that we must rely on you guys from Half City to handle the Nine-Fold Darkness.”","Despite the disagreements between these factions and those cultivators in Half City, they were not mortal enemies and could put their disagreements aside to deal with the common enemy.","– While they were discussing the strategy –","In the depths of the vast pitch-black ocean bottom, hidden currents surged in the deep crevice. A pale blue array barrier lit up silently, blocking the strange and evil ocean demons from the opposite side from crossing the boundary.","But at this moment, a surge of thick and black essence slowly flew out through the array barrier in silence without alerting the barrier at all!","“These stupid humans don’t know the great powers of our clan,” a voice sneered, “But it seems like some grandmasters are guarding this sea. We can bypass this area and sneak into the middle of the mortals. By then, no one will know our origins!”","“Cackle... Hahahahaha!”","In the depths of the dark and mysterious ocean where no one could see, horrifying demons shot out in all directions like ghosts.","...","Meanwhile, on the island on the back of the huge Heaven-Devouring Turtle.","Black Demon said, “We’ve broken through their blockage with the stealth spell and the teleport skill from Diablo II, but it seemed to alert the demon soldiers. That was why we hurried back. But I think we can send a team of cultivators who excel in stealth and teleport into the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness, and they should succeed.”","...","Meanwhile, in an extremely desolate corner in the world, heavenly thunderbolts boomed while wind and clouds surged.","Several figures floated down like immortals descending to the mortal world.","“Is this the mortal world?!” One figure glanced around with a cold gaze.","“My Lord, we’re not afraid of the mortals, but... there might be a few evil demons that comes from the Nine-Fold Darkness. Please be careful,” another one cautioned.","...","– In the group chat of the Cultivator Alliance –","[I think we can’t just wait for them to move first,] Gu Tingyun said,","[They can descend at any time, but we can’t go up any time,] Nalan Hongwu said, [Unfortunately, we know nothing about the Demon-Slaying Platform that they use to descend and have no opportunity to visit and learn from it.]","[Then... the only way that we can pass this void and truly know that world is...]","After a moment of silence, Xiaoyao Ancestral said, [I think we old guys can give it a try regardless of how dangerous it will be; tell us your plan.]","...","Morning gradually arrived.","“Ow...!” Shen Qingqing stretched, feeling lazy in this mild weather of the early morning.","“It’s almost summer break, right?” She looked at people such as Song Qingfeng and Nalan Mingxue who entered the shop with her.","After the Heavenly Academy began to give its disciples summer break and winter break, the other major academies and factions copied this practice, thinking that their elite disciples needed time to obtain experiences in the real world and be up-to-date.","After all, they had seen from the battle at Half City that the training in virtual reality, even though it felt real, was still not the same as training in the real world. In the games, the veteran players got used to not really dying and thus were not afraid.","When they encountered some unexpected situations in the real world, they experienced some negative emotions that they hadn’t known before.","Therefore, the major academies and factions encouraged the disciples to build foundations in the virtual worlds and then move onto real practice battles in the real world.","It might not be so urgent to the senior disciples who had experienced the real world already, but it was absolutely necessary for the new disciples.","It was why most of the factions and academies found it necessary to take time during the summer and winter so that the disciples could experience the real world.","“Do all the academies demand the disciples to go out and obtain experience?” Xu Zixin and Shen Qingqing chatted during their free time before playing games in the early morning.","“We will have graduated by that time!” Shen Qingqing and Xu Zixin were senior sisters to the students in Song Qingfeng’s year. Having known them in the shop for many years, they were very close.","Lan Yan said, “It’s this year!”","“Oh! I have poor memory!” They looked embarrassed and amused.","“Sister Qingqing, do you have other plans?” While making a bowl of instant noodles, Song Qingfeng sat down on a couch casually. Having been in the shop for years, they felt at home here. “Writer of the official novels... The shop owner is using your great talents for this small job?”","“I think it’s fine for me to be an official novel writer.” Shen Qingqing loved stories. “I like this job. But what plans do you guys have after graduation?”","“I plan to tour around for a while,” Song Qingfeng said, “I’ll make plans after that.”","In fact, if they were not now playing online games or were just casual players, taking some time off occasionally would have little impact.","After all, in most games, the players didn’t fight each other in the first encounter as they did in the Legend of Mir 2. Therefore, there were many casual players.","While eating instant noodles, Song Qingfeng asked Nalan Mingxue casually, “Junior Mistress, how about you?”","“After graduation, I’ll take over some family businesses. Um... I plan to pursue some new business opportunities,” Nalan Mingxue said.","“New business opportunities...?” Everyone looked at her curiously.","“Yeah.” She took out her communication jade and clicked on a strange-looking icon, which looked like a smirk face emoji with a big open mouth. There was a dot in front of the mouth.","“Isn’t it a small game in Qzone?” Song Qingfeng said in surprise. “Pac-Man!? But it looks a bit different!”","“Yeah,” Nalan Mingxue said solemnly, “I’ve been talking with the Wuwei Daoist Alliance about the feasibility of developing games on the communication jade. We plan to produce a kind of communication jade especially for playing games. I plan to name these games... mobile games!”","“Mobile... mobile games?!” Surprised, the others said, “It’s a good idea, but if people are in the internet café, who’d play on the communication jade?”","After all, the rich people would choose to play in the shop, and those who couldn’t afford to play in the shop would have no money to buy this device which was surely not cheap.","“If such fun stuff had appeared before the shop owner opened the shop, I think us young people would have loved playing it. But now...” Song Qingfeng shrugged. “It can only be used to kill time.”","“I agree...” Nalan Mingxue frowned.","The others looked speechless. “Then, why are you still doing it? You’ll lose money unless you can find people who are wealthy but can’t play the games in the shops. But do you think such people exist in the world?!”","Do they exist? Nalan Mingxue looked up at the sky subconsciously. “I think they might exist... for example...”","The others followed her gaze up to the sky.","Their hearts lurched, and cold sweat popped out as they whispered, “Are you serious...?”","Then, they looked at the sky. “You...!? Your imagination is out of control!”","“I even have a name for it.” Nalan Mingxue’s usually cold face now had a bright smile. “It will be called Journey. What do you think of it? I’ll ask the shop owner to check the final product. I don’t think it’s a long shot.”","“Aren’t you afraid of losing money?”","“Things like this can’t guarantee 100 percent success,” Nalan Mingxue said.","“Check what? What are you talking about?” At this moment, Mr. Fang came over and sat down. “We have a new game today; don’t you want to check it out?”","On the small blackboard were the big words – [God of War]."]},{"number":873,"title":"Chapter 873 - Mysterious Gift Bag for Mythological TV Series!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","[The System is 60% upgraded. The expansion of Wrath of the Lich King is released.]","[Energy crystals are in a shortage, and the system is upgrading slowly.]","“What!?” Mr. Fang froze. Although he could only take a percentage of the income of crystals each day, he could calculate that the crystals and magic crystals that the shops earned was a very large number. But the damn System claims that it is in shortage of crystals!?","Seeing the system upgrade progressing as slow as a turtle and had almost stopped, Mr. Fang was at a loss for words.","At this moment, Mr. Fang received a new task.","[System Upgrade Task: Acquire Many Energy Crystals","Task Description: Be a truly excellent shop owner and earn as much money as you can!","Task Reward: Mysterious gift bag of a mythological TV Series (contains the TV Series activation right and a treasure from it)]","“Mythological TV Series...? What myth is it...?” Mr. Fang looked puzzled. A thought dawned on him, but he didn’t know if he was right about it.","“Forget it. Whatever.” He needed to consider how to make more money.","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang’s System Interface showed – [God of War series is open.]","[You obtained the task to sell God of War game series.]","As with the previous series such as Assassin’s Creed and Harry Potter, the activation of the later games in the God of War series depended on the sales of the previous games.","The sequels of the old series were still being released steadily with a stable number of players and viewers. For example, the Brotherhood members such as Assassin Elina and Harrison in the Canglan City Shop had played each game in the Assassin’s Creed series many times.","At this moment, the shops released the new games God of War 1 and God of War 2 at the same time.","God of War 3 and God of War 4 would be activated after the sales of the previous two games reached a certain target.","Perhaps it was because the God of War series had been acquired from the System Gift Bag that had an excellent quality, or that the number of players had grown even larger lately, Mr. Fang was surprised when he saw the target set for the series.","“The subsequent task is easy to do... it only needs 5,000 activations...”","Not to mention the old shops in Jiuhua City and Half City, even the new shop attracted players from all over the world with at least 80,000 players each day, making the less than 50,000 computers in the shop not enough despite the multiple folding spaces. Mr. Fang thought that 5,000 activations were easy to reach.","...","“Should I... open a few more branch shops?” Mr. Fang wondered. For example, he could open one in the Orc Kingdom and send Merlin from the Canglan City Shop to recruit a group of orcs to help manage the new shop there.","Perhaps... he could open a branch shop in the Lianshan Principality which had been the battleground where they fought the Shadow Legion. By doing that, he could divert a large group of customers.","Besides, some old shops could have branch shops. Li Wuya and the others had trained some good employees for him in the past years. With them watching over the old shops, Fang Qi could send the experienced employees to manage the new shops for a while.","“Hu...” While thinking about these issues, Mr. Fang rubbed his brows.","It was no wonder that Fang Qi didn’t get involved in other issues. After all, he had been an E-sports guy instead of a talented manager before he traveled through space.","He was the right person to play games, livestream, and organize E-Sports events. When he had time, he could even give plan surprise events.","But now, he was overwhelmed by the management of his internet cafés, not to mention that he needed time to play games and increase his strength.","If he forced himself to do more than these things, he would bungle them.","...","At this moment, Nalan Mingxue brought over two lapis cups and poured Fang Qi a cup of iced red tea.","“Want me to do something?” Mr. Fang asked.","“How do you know?” Nalan Mingxue poured herself a cup as well.","“I’ve known you for many years now.” Mr. Fang picked up the cup of iced red tea and sipped it casually. “If you treat me to iced red tea without asking for a favor from me, I’d suspect that you are a demonic god in disguise.”","Nalan Mingxue was at a loss for words.","“Very busy?” Nalan Mingxue tilted her head and looked at him while asking.","Seeing that Mr. Fang was about to stand up, Nalan Mingxue said, “I do need to ask a favor from you; no one else can do it.”","“I must tell you first that I won’t do anything too troublesome,” Mr. Fang said, “Or anything that needs too much thinking. For now, I won’t do fights either.”","“Besides... what do you need me to do?”","“I don’t need you to do those things.” Hearing Mr. Fang’s words, Nalan Mingxue said with confidence, “We have people to do the troublesome stuff. I’ll do the things that needs thinking. As for fighting... when have I ever ask you to fight anyway?”","“As for your last question, it’s something about making money.”","“...” Mr. Fang chugged the iced red tea and put the empty cup on the desk. “I’m in!”","...","At this moment, the seemingly peaceful relationships between the mortal world and the Nine-Fold Darkness Plane as well as the Godly Realm were full of hidden currents.","Ever since those two realms were defeated, they sent scouts to investigate the real situation. Meanwhile, the cultivators and warriors continued their exploration of the outside world and the new realms.","Those ‘gods’ and ‘demons’ that had only existed in the ancient legends... what kind of worlds were they living in?","When the cultivators began to turn their eyes out of their own world, the orbits of the three worlds began to connect...","...","For the gods and demons who lived beyond the sky, the mortals were weak.","For countless years, they received the worship of these weak creatures who begged for mercy and kindness from them.","Just like the rolling godly mountains where the Godly Palace was, some of the existences far beyond mortals were born after the Heavens were formed, and some were born... even before the Heavens appeared!","Since the very ancient times, they had ruled over this Heaven and Earth. The gods who were born before the Heavens were unrivaled existences and were born with the right to enjoy godly power for eternity.","It was the same in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea and the Godly Palace.","They lived on the tall godly mountains and looked down on the beings below them.","In every respect, they were the perfect and greatest existences in the world.","“The Innumerable-Immortal Sea was defeated just like this?” On the continuous godly mountains that had existed for an eternity and survived countless catastrophes, there was the vast godly nation where the loftiest gods lived.","With her brown hair pulled up in a ponytail and dressed in dark-red armor, she turned her perfect exquisite face to the golden light which was falling from the mountaintop, looking like a heroic godly statue that was gilded in gold.","Different from other gods, the God of Radiant Light was a descendant of an ancient god clan. Isabela, the young Valkyrie, was the last one born in the world and also possessed great godly power.","“It’s nothing to worry about. After all, Wondrous Spell High Holiness, an abled immortal in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea, is insignificant in the Godly Court.” Behind her stood a priestess dressed in a pure white priest robe.","“No matter what; I’ll know after I try it in person.” She looked determined. “I hope my opponents won’t disappoint me.”","“You’ll...descend in person?!”","...","At this moment, Mr. Fang was standing in the Cultivation Room with the Golden-Hooped Rod in his hand as golden lights bloomed in front of him.","An extremely huge hand slowly pressed down in the golden light.","“F*ck-!” Instantly, his vision blacked out.","Synchronization was over!","[The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal. Synchronization Rate: 0.6326%. Increased by 0.0002% in this cultivation session.]","[Tathagata Buddha. Synchronization Rate: 0.6326%. Increased by 0.0002% in this cultivation session.]","[Do you want to continue?]","“Yes!”"]},{"number":874,"title":"Chapter 874 - The First Experience in God of War! Beginning!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Ah-!”","“Auch–”","In the Cultivation Room, Mr. Fang controlled Sun Wukong to leap and jump. Then, the whole sky seemed to darken with thick clouds. He looked up...","Boom!","[You were suppressed under the Five Phase Mountain; the cultivation session is over.]","“It hurts so much-!”","“This cultivation... is so slow...” After the session, Mr. Fang glanced at the progress.","After eating the Immortal Peach, Mr. Fang wouldn’t encounter bottlenecks in the near future, but obviously, even in the Cultivation Room, his cultivation progress became slower.","With his cultivation strength getting higher, it was no longer possible to increase his power by several realms after staying in the Cultivation Room for one to two years as he had done before.","“Oh, let’s use... the Double Coupon for the Cultivation Room!” Mr. Fang remembered that he got a Double Coupon as a reward. This coupon’s time limit was five days, which were equivalent to five years in the Cultivation Room.","After cultivating five days in the real world or five years in the Cultivation Room, he guessed that he could acquire double the progression.","The current progress was so slow that even doubling it wouldn’t be that fast, but it was much better than the current speed.","After all, training in the Cultivation Room meant taking all kinds of beatings. If he used the Double Coupon, he would be spared of years of beating.","[Do you want to use the Double Coupon?] On the System Interface, Fang Qi chose to use it now.","[The coupon is successfully used. The double effect is now in effect. The five-year cultivation time now increased to ten-year, and the time that passes in the real world is still five days.]","Fang Qi, “???”","“Five years and ten years? Where’s the double progression?” Before Fang Qi could finish, a mountain-like hand pressed down...","“Ahh-!”","...","– Meanwhile, in the Canglan City Shop –","“It seems like the shop owner is quite busy lately, we don’t see him much these days. I wonder what he’s busy doing.” Some elves, knights, and assassins sat together in a small zone on the left of the entrance.","Booth-like seats and soft couches were very comfortable; they each had a mug of Cappuccino on the desk.","“Oh. I don’t have enough money now; I must do more quests.” With long life spans and great talents in battle skills and arts, the elves were usually not as busy as humans, but now...","“I always feel like I’ve become broke recently...” Elf Girl Sala had tears on her face.","...","In groups of twos and threes, the figures looking like aristocrats and officials in some empires sat in the private compartments. In contrast, the saint-level masters such as Sword Saint Wilson and World Mage Hematon sat wherever they could find seats due to being late all the time. It wasn’t unusual for them to sit with the local residents of Canglan City.","It proved that the truly smart people always abided by the rules set by the shop owner. As for the less smart people, they were handled by other passionate customers without troubling the shop owner.","Fang Qi did his best to keep the harmony in his shops, and everything went smoothly in each shop.","...","“Have you bought the newly released God of War?” In the booth by the aisle, Sala and Rowling sat in the row opposite to their captain and another male elf.","Sala controlled her blood elf warrior character to do quests on the Borean Tundra with great leisure while reading the storyline and enjoying the scenery.","“Not yet...” Rowling said on the side.","“The person sitting opposite to us is playing it.” Elf Queen Kellybel plunked down on the couch beside Sala with a bag of potato chips in her arms. Then, she glanced at the screen across from the aisle.","“Huh? You can’t find a seat?” Sala put down her virtual reality headset and glanced around.","“It’s a shame that the shop owner doesn’t put thousands of new computers in the shop. I have business to handle in a few hours, but I’ve got to wait in line...” Kellybel tore open the bag in a huff. “I’ll watch it for a while first. But how come God of Wars that they are playing look different from one another?”","“There are God of War 1 and God of War 2. I think they are not playing the same one,” Rowling said while playing World of Warcraft.","Across from the aisle, the elves could see a black dragon head that was wearing a virtual reality headset. Nearby was a grey-haired old man dressed in a mages’ robe and an aristocrat-looking middle-aged man dressed in solemn clothes.","They were saint-level masters such as Black Dragon Gulth, Wilson, and St. Leidon.","Some of them were indeed idle. For example, a certain black dragon...","Some had to squeeze time from their busy schedules to play games.","For the saint-level masters such as Wilson, this game... was indeed more fitting for them than Journey to the West.","Of course, nearby, young people like Ron and Joseph who were about 14 years old were also trying this new game.","“This guy looks so ugly...” Sitting beside the elves, Kellybel ate potato chips and watched the person across from her play God of War.","On the screen was an ocean of blazing flames, looking like the catastrophe at the end of the world.","It showed half of a man’s face which looked grand, gloomy, and pale, with a strange red mark.","Other than gloominess, this face emitted a presence full of bloody fierceness and aggression.","Obviously, many people were playing God of War 1.","Kellybel thought that this main character was ugly.","Besides, he is also bald?","Why does he look so murderous?","As a peace-loving elf, she obviously didn’t like this game. But since she had nothing to do while waiting in line, she continued to watch.","“Let’s choose [New Game].” St. Leidon chuckled. As a knight, he liked the main character who was obviously a melee fighter.","“Of course. Obviously, you can’t choose [Load], right?” Beside him, World Mage Hematon glanced over.","“Is this that ‘God of War?” The young players also exclaimed, “He looks powerful!”","The scene of flames dimmed and was replaced by a grey mountaintop, but the man was still the same one as before.","This scene would probably remain in the memories of the players for a long time.","“The Gods of Olympus have abandoned me.”","As the deep voice spoke, the view zoomed out and showed that Kratos stood alone on the edge of the cliff on the high mountain, looking like a hero who had aged.","“Now there is no hope.”","Kratos leaped down from the mountaintop.","He didn’t look like a god; he was more like a... mortal who had been cornered by gods and thus embarked on the last journey to end everything.","After all, Kratos was a mortal at the beginning.","The scene changed with the narration. “But it had not always been this way. Kratos had once been a champion of the gods...”","Time returned to the past. After only a dozen seconds or so, a tragic and indignant atmosphere engulfed the players. From a mortal to the God of War, the curtain of this man’s life was lifted."]},{"number":875,"title":"Chapter 875 - The Beginning of Slaying Gods!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Different from most of the previous games, God of War had three difficulty level: Mortal, Spartan, and God.","The difficulty setting was necessary. After all, the enemies in God of War were real gods, not minor gods but the 12 Olympians, the 12 major deities.","In the previous games, other than Dark Souls, which no one had passed yet, there had been few battles against opponents above the peak level of humans. Even Almighty Demon Lord Chong Lou had lowered his strength to the upper limit of humans when he battled Jing Tian.","However, in God of War, the System created this world with an ultimate difficulty level. Without lowering the difficulty through the difficulty levels, many players would never be able to handle the enemies in this game.","Although God of War and Dark Souls both revolved around legends, they had different core elements. Besides, when the players couldn’t pass Dark Souls, they could invite friends with ultimate skills to help them with rewards and work together. However, this practice couldn’t be used in God of War, which was why the system version of God of War had designed several levels of difficulty.","...","At this moment, Elf Queen Kellybel ate potato chips as she watched several players enter the game.","Even the saint-level masters were discussing. “Perhaps... let’s choose the second difficulty level...”","Frightened by the difficulty of Dark Souls, they immediately chose the Spartan Difficulty Level and entered the game.","The story brought them back to three weeks before the beginning scene.","With all kinds of questions on their minds, the players entered the game while feeling a sense of epicness.","On the vast pitch-black sea, huge waves surged up in a violent storm as if some horrifying demons were running havoc in the depths of the sea.","The huge shipwreck on the shore was full of monsters from the Underworld.","It was close to the shore, but the sea under the cliff was unfathomable. Suddenly, a huge head of a horrifying monster appeared before them!","It was a huge snake head. More horrifying was that countless giant snake bodies coiled on the deep ocean bottom. It was the monster only existing in myths – the Hydra!","In other words, the weakest monster that the players faced from the very beginning of the game was a monster from the myths!","“What’s this-?!”","“Is this person going to fight that snake monster?!” Elf Queen Kellybel ate potato chips as she watched the scene in surprise.","In such a stormy ocean, a human would certainly die if he had to fight such a horrifying sea monster.","Furthermore, it’s true form was yet to be revealed from the ocean.","The saint-level masters who were playing the highest God Difficulty Level encountered lots of dangers within the first minute of the game. Almost no weapon could inflict damage on the extremely hard scales of this monster.","The Blades of Chaos were dual short blades forged in the foulest depths of Hades.","The main character, Kratos, in God of War had the dual blades in his hands. The saint-level players could feel the weapon’s omnipresent horrifying power when they held the two blades.","But even such a weapon couldn’t do much damage on the nine-headed sea serpent.","With great efforts, the players could only force back one of its heads.","“My goodness... how come they have to fight such a big boss at the very beginning of the game?!” Elf Queen Kellybel said from behind, “Can they defeat it...?”","At this moment, Kratos was not its match. But don’t forget that at this time, Kratos was also a champion of the gods, which meant that he had the 12 major Olympian gods behind him!","After defeating one of the Hydra’s heads, Kratos finally came to the depths of the extremely huge ship. A blinding blue godly light lit up as a giant god’s face appeared before them.","Everyone shook involuntarily!","Even though it was only a shadow, the players could feel the vast godly power of the god behind the shadow. This was Poseidon, the Lord of the Seas. This god was worshipped by all the humans who survived with the resources from the ocean.","“Lord Poseidon.” Kratos showed due respect.","The bright blue face looked like surging ocean water, and one seemed to see endless ocean in it.","“Kratos, before you reach Athens, there is a task you must complete.”","“This beast is Hydra, it has terrorized my seas for far too long. Your skills are admirable, but you will need assistance, you will need the power of the gods.!","“Accept this godly power.”","In the next moment, the whole world turned into an illusion. The entire Heaven and Earth seemed to have transformed into a great ocean. In the vast surging godly power, horrifying godly thunderbolts crashed down from the sky and encircled around Kratos like snakes or dragons. Like the thunder god, he was bathed in godly thunderbolts.","Following the ancient rules, it transformed into a god’s wrath and turned everything around it into ashes. This was the magic power given by Poseidon, the Lord of the Seas – Poseidon’s Rage!","“This magic power...?!” While Kellybel stared at the magic power with widened eyes, the players such as St. Leidon were also stupefied.","Different from the character who was born with no power in Dark Souls, the players in God of War felt like they had the ability to destroy the Heavens and Earth!","“Magic power...” World Mage Hematon almost danced as his eyes burned with maniac-like heat. “I feel the power of the spell... this is real magic! Is this the magic power that gods can unleash?!”","“Let me get familiar with this god-level magic spell! I think...” Hematon controlled Kratos, and his expression had never looked so dominant before.","Indeed, the players had been extremely cautious when they fought with one of the heads of the Hydra. Now, when they encountered an attack that they couldn’t dodge, they could just block it head-on with Poseidon’s Rage!","Yes, a small mortal could fight with a mythical monster head-on!","“I feel like...I’m unrivaled!” Hematon laughed and said, “This game... is so cool! So cool!”","Soon, he got familiar with how to use Poseidon’s Rage. When one head of the huge Hydra bit at him with fierceness, thunderbolts appeared like dragons as the horrifying godly power exploded in the form of godly thunderbolts like a god’s wrath!","The Hydra’s huge head couldn’t break through this godly power. Instead, it was forced back dozens of meters as the thunderbolts almost shattered its sharp fangs!","“Hahahaha-!” He laughed wildly. If he could master this magic spell in the real world, then...","Behind him, Elf Queen Kellybel lost her composure as she watched this great power!","The saint-level masters such as Hematon laughed wildly as they played. “With such godly power, who can stop me in this world?!”","“This game isn’t difficult at all. In a while, I’ll try the God Difficulty Level!”","“Yeah! Yeah! I even chose the Spartan Difficulty Level. With such godly power, it’s child’s play to kill these small monsters!”","At this moment, an almighty god shadow materialized before them in the storm.","“Kratos, your next task is to kill Ares, the God of War.”","“Okay. It’s easy...”","“What?” Everyone fell silent instantly.","Poseidon, the Lord of the Seas... Ares, the God of War... how come the names sound a bit similar...?","“Whom do you want me to kill?!”"]},{"number":876,"title":"Chapter 876 - Descend!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","...","Different from the heroes in most of the mythological stories, Kratos wasn’t an orthodox hero; his behavior showed the mercilessness and indifference towards these Olympian gods.","Once a leader of an army of Spartans, who were famous for their strength and bravery, Kratos was courageous and vicious.","Defeated in a battle, he begged for help from Ares, the God of War. He received Ares’ help and defeated his enemies at the price of servitude under Ares by signing a covenant. Killing countless humans and gods, he became Ares’s puppet and killing machine, a powerful warrior who was serving the gods.","After that, he killed countless gods and humans. To make him into a perfect warrior, Ares set up a trap and made him kill his own wife and daughter.","With the ashes of his wife and daughter covering his body, causing Kratos’s skin to become pale grey, he was cursed with constant nightmares, reliving the scenes of that day. This curse made him into an even more cold-blooded warrior who lived only for battles and revenge.","...","The Hydra ran havoc in the cities close to the shore as the monsters from the Underworld butchered humans at will.","Gods said... they would send a warrior to rescue them?","No, the gods were only annoyed by the disturbances of the troublesome fierce beasts in their back garden, so they sent a qualified warrior to clear them. As for rescuing the mortals? It wasn’t their concern.","Kratos, trained by Ares, the God of War, wouldn’t show any mercy to them.","It was why all kinds of human soldiers died in the hand of the monsters when Kratos killed the Hydra.","God of War depicted a world under the gods’ rule. It looked orderly on the surface but was in fact chaotic and gloomy.","...","Therefore, it was natural that someone would try to drag these gods off their shrine.","The deaths of his wife and daughter woke up Kratos, and he decided to seek revenge by slaying the gods. Meanwhile, he hoped that this would compensate for the crimes that he had committed and get rid of the endless curse and nightmares which haunted him for countless days and nights.","He asked Athena and the other gods for help, which led to the scene before them.","After killing the Hydra, the storm on the ocean turned even more violent. Rain poured down like a waterfall!","“I have faithfully served the gods for ten years. When will you relieve me of these nightmares?”","“We request one final task of you, Kratos.” On the gloomy ocean, the statue of Athena looked solemn and grand. “As we speak, Athens is on the verge of destruction. It is the will of Ares, my great city falls, but Zeus has forbidden the gods from waging war on each other.”","“Complete this final task, and the past that consumes you will be forgiven. Have faith Kratos, the gods do not forget those who come to their aid.”","This was Kratos’s new task: slaying a god.","He must kill Ares, the God of War who schemed to overthrow Zeus’s ruling and was attacking Athens.","The storm lessened, and dark clouds gradually dispersed in the sky above the vast ocean, revealing a full moon that looked like a silver plate.","With the goddess’s words still echoing in his ears, Kratos continued forward on his huge battleship. In the past ten years, he had engaged in countless wars while riding this battleship. Perhaps this was the last journey.","His biggest test and the chance to return from the edge of craziness was in the grand City of Athens in front of him.","At this moment, people seemed to see hope in his eyes.","At this moment, all the players remembered the scene at the beginning and thought that perhaps he would obtain the victory in this great battle of slaying a major god, but...","The more they thought of it, the more tragic the story would be in the eyes of the people who were watching or playing the game.","Under the gazes of the gods, the ending that was waiting for this hero wouldn’t be the one that he wanted!","Like the God of War, the legendary life of this man who was struggling on the verge of insanity began.","...","“This game... seems intriguing...” While eating potato chips, Elf Queen Kellybel watched from behind and seemed to be hooked by the story.","“Is it interesting?” nearby, some elves asked.","“Yeah. Warriors can fight the monsters in melee combats, and mages can use magic spells,” Kellybel commented, “I wonder what happens to the man. Will he die?”","Remembering the last scene, she continued watching without thinking","“Really...” Sala said, “Then, let’s activate God of War later. After I level up once, I’ll play it for a while.”","“...” Kellybel’s face darkened as she had the urge to beat these elves. Can’t you let me, your queen, play for a while?","She wished that she could grab the seat from one of the elves.","Of course, as an elegant and noble elf queen, she wouldn’t put her thought into action. After all, she didn’t want to expose her true identity yet. Even if she did, she wouldn’t do such a disgraceful thing.","Therefore, Kellybel could do nothing but to sit behind and watch the elves play with widened eyes. Then, she sometimes glanced at the person sitting across the aisle and playing God of War. She concentrated on being a bystander.","...","“Haya-!” With a loud yell, St. Leidon controlled Kratos to tear a monster into pieces with his bare hands. “Haha! This man is so powerful!”","Boom!","As thunderbolts crashed, the mages activated Poseidon’s Rage and learned the method of using the godly power.","“Oh! If only I could combine one tiny bit of this technique into my magic spells! It would be a huge magic revolution!” Adolf, the white-robed mage, yelled, “It’s hard to imagine. By that time, our magic spells would make a noticeable leap forward!”","At this moment, the City of Athens was full of countless horrifying demons. They were not as giant or as powerful as the Hydra, but there were many of them.","Having served the Olympian gods for countless years, Kratos had fought with many monsters and even gods whose strength far surpassed his own. That was how he obtained lots of battle experience and combat techniques. With abundant experience and skills, he looked like a war machine working with great accuracy!","“We can learn new magic spells?!” Kellybel watched as the players encountered a shadow cast by a new god.","“This god said that we can learn the spell, Medusa’s Gaze, which can turn people to stone, after we kill Medusa?” the players said curiously, “What’s so powerful about Medusa’s Gaze?”","...","Meanwhile, in the Radiant Light Godly Nation, a holy golden light fell from the vast sky.","Princess Isabela was bathed in the holy godly light beam.","“This is... the descent of a heavenly god! It’s the descent of a heavenly god-!”","Countless followers worshipped on their knees below the godly palace. “It’s the descent of a heavenly god!”"]},{"number":877,"title":"Chapter 877 - Kun Hunter Champion!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– Wuwei Daoist Alliance –","The current Wuwei Daoist Alliance was many times grander than before.","Engulfed in pale blue spiritual lights, spiritual ships landed while cultivators poured out. They were either artifact masters from all over the world coming here to study or cultivators from different factions for visits.","As the Cultivator Alliance closest to Jiuhua City, it had gradually developed to a new height.","At this moment, Mr. Fang sat in the conference room with Li Haoran who was now a key figure among the younger generation of artifact masters in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance.","“What do you intend to make?” Li Haoran handed Mr. Fang a brand-new communication jade. When Mr. Fang turned it on, he saw extremely clear spiritual spell visual projection appearing on it.","The size and position of the visual can be adjusted. But if the quality of the communication jade was poor, the visuals would appear fuzzy after they were enlarged.","“This is simple,” Nalan Mingxue said, “It’s like the small and mini-games in Qzone. I plan to ask the artifact masters to make some easy ones to practice on. After we make more products and obtain more experience, we can advance to some more complicated designs.”","“This one is an example...” Nalan Mingxue took out a communication jade. One could see the extremely complex array engravings in the translucent jade body. On the bottom-right corner was a tiny and thin storage jade slip. As spiritual energy circulated in it, pale spiritual lights gathered above the communication jade and then condensed into a simple picture.","On the picture was a round ball that looked like the smirk face emoji. It turned its head and ate a dot beside it.","“Pac-Man.” Obviously, it mimicked the mini-game in Qzone.","“Huh...?” In surprise, Mr. Fang watched the cultivators and warriors play Pac-Man and talk about their experience in the game.","...","– At this moment, in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea –","In the ethereal and vast immortal sea, there stood countless immortal islands and cities.","Although the number of immortals was much lower than the number of mortals, they looked quite prosperous after countless years of management by the major families.","The eight big families each had their own immortal mountains, cave abodes, and immortal islands where immortals from different places gathered.","Many immortal residences and jade buildings stood in a courtyard. At this moment, Wondrous Spell High Holiness stood on this Jade Immortal Platform and looked down on the views below in all directions.","Dao-Hearing Pavilion was where the Gui Family taught Immortal Dao. Right now, a couple of mentors and many disciples sat in here. When the bell rang, disciples from different families walked out in twos and threes.","“Humph! With the great reputation of our immortal families, who dares to not bow to us?! Why should I learn the so-called immortal spells?! It’s just a pile of useless stuff!” One flippant young master walked out of the pavilion while cussing.","“What then?!” Beside him, a pale-faced young master with triangle-shaped eyes said arrogantly, “With my great background, I, Yun Qing, still have to stay here obediently. Pooh! I’m bored to death seeing this stuff! The people in our families are so stupid. As immortals, we enjoy extremely long lives, but we have to do all this boring stuff instead of finding some entertainment to kill time.”","“Brother Yun, should we...” The flippant young master rubbed his hands together as his expression changed. He said, “How about going to the Green Conch Immortal Realm for fun?”","“I’m tired of it! It offers just those few things to do!”","“Then, let’s go to... Immortal Sea Golden Palace...”","“Get out! I don’t want to go! With so many immortal spells and immortal techniques, none of them can provide me with any entertainment! They know nothing but to host immortal exams or battle merit lists. What a pathetic life we’re living!”","...","– The Wuwei Daoist Alliance –","“We plan to make it into the same mode as the King of Fighters first. As the Cultivator Alliance’s exploration plans are carried out, we’ll sell these games to the outer world.” Nalan Mingxue outlined her plans and said, “The first step is not selling these communication jades. The players must come to our shop and buy game tokens. With each token, they can play one game once.”","Although the main plan was mobile games, Nalan Mingxue’s plan also involved an in-game purchase issue and thus couldn’t sell mobile games directly.","“Um...” Mr. Fang thought for a moment. “There’s only one game?”","“Of course not. We have small games such as Knights of Valor, Oriental Legend Super, and Fish Hunter Champion. But they are all in production.” With a document in her hand, Nalan Mingxue said, “Do you want to have a look?”","[TL Note: These are all popular mini-games in China.]","“This...” Mr. Fang took the document from her hand and said, “You can change the names a little bit. The Knights of Valor can be changed to Immortal of Valor, describing the war among the three immortal kingdoms of Wei, Shu, and Wu. As for Fish Hunter Champion...”","Mr. Fang thought for a while and said, “Um... You can change it into Kun Hunter Champion to suit the current situation.”","[TL Note: Kun is an imaginary large fish in Chinese mythology.]","“You can also add a champion point list for Kun Hunter Champion...”","...","Obviously, Mr. Fang didn’t have much time to play God of War, but the players were different, especially the Elf Queen who didn’t have a seat and had to watch it while others played.","She sat down and shared a couch with one elf before watching.","The journey of slaying a god was undoubtedly very difficult. Even the countless monsters existing in the mythological era in Athens were extremely dangerous.","Under the guidance of the gods, Kratos completed the quests that they gave him and increased his strength at the same time.","In a big palace, Medusa with a human head and a snake’s body slithered up silently.","The dual blades in Kratos’s hands emitted hellish flames.","The players had learned the unimaginably powerful strength as well as the techniques and battle skills that could control the godly power from Kratos.","St. Leidon controlled Kratos to bend his back slightly before throwing out the chain blade abruptly at a great speed!","Floating like a ghost, Medusa dodged the attack silently and emitted a wave of blinding light from her eyes!","As everyone knows, light moves extremely fast and is almost impossible to dodge. One can only handle it by prediction.","Even at the Spartan Difficulty Level, which was much easier, he could only manage to put up some slight defense before being turned into stone, even with Kratos’s godly power.","Almost instantly, this saint-level player controlled Kratos to lunge to one side and landed in the blind spot of Medusa’s vision.","Like a shadow, Medusa’s Gaze followed him!","He leaped over her head and dodged the light of Medusa’s Gaze at the same time.","But at this moment, the light swept up.","Crack!","Kratos turned into stone before falling and shattering.","“This magic spell is also powerful!” Kellybel grabbed the arm of the elf sitting beside her and exclaimed.","“Wow-! That mage seems to have mastered this spell! Look! Look! He turned several monsters into stone!”","“Ahh-! My goodness-! Look at that person! Did he encounter the God of War?!” Kellybel shook Elf Girl Rowling’s arm. On the saint-level master’s screen which she was pointing at, there was an extremely giant god whose head touched the endless starry sky while the feet stepped on the vast land and mountains. This god was leading his army into the City of Athens.","Then, Kellybel turned her head and met Rowling’s murderous eyes. On Rowling’s screen, the Kratos that she controlled couldn’t be more dead.","Meanwhile, one of Rowling’s arms was still being shaken by Kellybel. On the screen, Kratos’s arm that was holding a blade was also shaking violently. The chain blade had been thrown to somewhere unknown.","“...”","...","-Meanwhile, in the Radiant Light Godly Nation-","“I hear... that some demonic gods in the mortal world are very good with their battle skills.” The Valkyrie smiled with great self-confidence. “I hope the rumor is true!”","At this moment, even St. Heinz looked respectful. “Everything is ready; when would you like to set off, my lady?”","“I think now is a good time.”","At this moment, St. Dulan knelt and kowtowed while saying, “We’re very pious and hope that we can have the opportunity to witness your godly power!”","“Okay! Come with me!”","“Yes...”"]},{"number":878,"title":"Chapter 878 - Damn It! Sir, Do You Have Other Games in Which We Can Slay Gods?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In God of War 1, the rebellion of Ares, the God of War, shook the authority of the Olympian gods. Now that they had found a man who was set on seeking revenge from Ares, the other gods naturally gave him their full support, urging him on with encouragements.","To show their support, each god gave Kratos great powers.","The powers included spells such as Poseidon’s Rage, Medusa’s Gaze, Army of Hades, and even Zeus’s Fury, which allowed him to summon thunderbolts like that of Zeus, the King of the Gods.","At this moment, the players in the Canglan City Shop were thrilled with the game. The saint-level players said in excitement, “Look what I found!”","“Zeus, the King of the Gods!”","“Wow-!” Others all stood behind him and watched as an extremely huge god face filled the screen.","“Kratos, you grow stronger as your journey continues, but if you are to succeed in your quest, you will need my aid. I offer you the power of the greatest of all the gods, the father of Olympus. I’ll grant you Zeus’ Fury!”","On the screen, Kratos held a holy golden lightning bolt which represented the pinnacle power of the Olympian gods. Bursting out from Kratos’ palm, the lightning bolt contained the ancient pure law of thunder and lightning.","“There’s such a power?!”","“Is this also a magic spell...?”","“Oh-! Can you feel it...? I dare to say that this is the purest ultimate magic spell in the world!” Mage Adolf laughed and said, “Oh! Hahaha! Can you feel it?!”","“This is the origin!” Sitting beside him, Swein opened his mouth and said, “This is the true original power of the father of Olympus. If anyone can understand one trace of this power, his magic skill will instantly rise to a new level!”","“Yes... let’s get into the battles! Ohahahaha!”","“Let’s play it too!” Beside them, Elf Girl Sala and the other elves also clicked on God of War, which they had just bought.","“No...” Having waited for a long time but still not able to get a computer, Kellybel’s face darkened. “Don’t you have work to do in the Elf Forest in a while?","“Rowling, I remember that you’re on duty this afternoon!” Kellybel pointed at one of the elves and said loudly.","“Huh?! How do you know about that?” Surprised, Rowling looked at the elf wanderer who always played games with them.","She said sulkily, “What should I do? I must stop playing soon...”","She mumbled, “Should... I ask for a leave...?”","The moment she said that, she took out her communication jade and wondered, “Huh?! The Captain sent me a message?”","“Why did the Captain send a message at this moment...” While mumbling to herself, she opened the message which said, [Ms. Rowling, I heard that you want to ask for leave because you want to play games this afternoon?!]","Hey-?! I...I haven’t done it yet! I didn’t ask for a leave yet-! I didn’t-! Her beautiful eyes glanced around. What’s happening...!? Who told on me?!","...","At this moment, Kellybel was secretly pleased on the side. Haya! I’ll finally get to play the game!","At this moment, a white-robed and white-bearded figure stood behind her. “Ahem! Ahem!”","“First Elder Hyru...” Kellybel turned around, looking embarrassed.","“Your Majesty,” First Elder Hyru said to her with a voice transmission spell, “May I ask when you’ll return to the Elf Forest and handle the affairs?”","“Ahya–!”","...","Three minutes later, the elves found that the elf wanderer who had been sitting beside them and watching them play was replaced by a white-haired old elf.","They looked surprised. “Huh-?!”","When did they do the switch?!","...","Besides these powerful magic spells and power, the biggest attractions of God of War for the players were the story that was full of twists and dangers and the extremely powerful mythological enemies they encountered.","Even the pinnacle stage saint-level masters felt a sense of destiny and epicness, feeling as if the continuous mythological chapters were waiting for them to unveil.","The players at the East Continent might only feel the novelty and enjoyment of doing swift and victorious battles, but the players at the West Continent felt different.","They felt much more.","The grand and ancient City of Athens, the endless deadly desert...","The gods guiding the way and granting powers, the Titans enslaved and hidden in the desert, the Pandora’s Box with endless power hidden in it...","The world seemed to have just been created from the chaos and was full of horrifying monsters and unknown dangers.","It was also full of countless opportunities.","For the players at the West Continent, this game depicted a world that was closer to the prehistoric mythology in their minds.","Some players controlled Kratos to venture deep into the deadly desert with endless yellow winds and looking like an abyss of sand. After countless battles with monsters, they finally came before the Titan who carried a giant mountain on its back.","Climbing up the sharp cliff and coming to the godly palace on the mountaintop by stepping on countless previous travelers’ corpses, the players felt like they were writing a new mythology chapter in person; it felt wonderful.","But the journey of slaying a god wasn’t so simple.","At this moment, Ares, the God of War, seemed to have sensed this scene from tens of thousands of miles away. He casually pulled up a stone pillar from the City of Athens and threw it out. In the deadly desert far away, Kratos was about to open the Pandora’s Box when the stone pillar pinned him onto the godly palace’s walls! He died instantly!","Then, Kratos crawled back from the Underworld and came before Pandora’s Box again, finally gaining the power inside it.","After receiving the powers granted by the gods and the remaining power in Pandora’s Box, he finally was qualified to battle Ares.","They didn’t know how much time passed and how many dangers they had experienced...","Even at the Spartan Difficulty Level, the players moved forward with great difficulty.","At the end of the story, Kratos killed Ares, the God of War, and saved the Olympian gods from falling, finishing the almost impossible mission.","At this moment, all the players watched as Kratos went to Athena and asked her to fulfill the gods’ promise to him so that he could get rid of the nightmare that had taunted him for many years. In the nightmare, he relived the moment of killing his wife and daughter by mistake.","Looking at the goddess before them, for some reason, the players who had gone through the difficult journey or those who had come to watch this part had an ominous feeling.","“We promised your sins would be forgiven, and so they are,” the voice in the screen said, “But we never promised to take away your nightmares. No man, no god could ever forget the terrible deeds you have done.”","“That’s all?!” All the players stared at the scene dumbfoundedly, not believing what they had heard.","After going through countless hardships and finishing the mission that was impossible for mortals and perhaps gods, he got...","“Such a result?!”","The screen returned to the scene at the beginning of the game. After dumping all the godly powers, Kratos leaped down the abyss. Only at this moment did they realize how desperate this man felt.","“Damn it!” St. Leidon jumped up in a fury. “Are there other tasks of slaying gods?! I’ll slay these sons of b*tches!”","“There are! Buy God of War 2 and God of War 3, and you’ll get to kill all Olympian gods!” At this moment, Mr. Fang passed by their zone and said.","“???” The saint-level masters froze.","“Huh?!”","“Sir, I’ll buy them!”","“Me too!”","“Let’s team up and slay the gods!”","“Let’s go! Damn it! I’ll buy one as well! Today, I’ll slay these sons of b*tches!”","[Ting! The sales of God of War 1, God of War 2, and God of War 3 have all exceeded 5,000. The right to sell God of War 4 is activated.]"]},{"number":879,"title":"Chapter 879 - The God... Has Descended! Come out and Worship Now!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","In God of War 1, the players only needed to face one of the major Olympian gods – the God of War.","But in God of War 2 and God of War 3, the players must face all the major Olympian gods.","At this moment, the players who had finished God of War 1 opened God of War 2 without a pause.","Obviously, Kratos didn’t die.","Since his godly power and strength were granted and nurtured by the gods with great efforts, the Olympian gods didn’t want their efforts to go to waste.","Therefore, Kratos was dragged to the God of War’s throne by the gods to fill the vacancy of this position.","“Lately, it feels like these saint-level masters have been sleeping in the internet café?!” When the elves entered the shop and saw the saint-level masters such as St. Leidon, St. Hematon, and Sword Saint Wilson already sitting before the computers, they began to talk.","“Huh?! Isn’t that First Elder Hyru?!” Elder Sewell of the Elf Clan said in surprise, “How come the First Elder is here so early too?!”","Besides, she saw the famous saint-level masters such as the Dwarf King, Black Dragon Gulth, and the Presidents of Alchemist Union and Magic Union all sitting neatly in one row.","The moment that they entered the shop, they saw that the long row of chairs near the entrance had been taken by saint-level masters. They had never looked so solemn before as if they were not playing a game but doing an extremely holy mission!","“They sat here last night, right?”","“I think so!”","...","At the end of God of War 1, Kratos had irreconcilable conflicts with the gods. Of course, the gods were not stupid. At the beginning of God of War 2, Zeus pretended to loan his Blade of Olympus to Kratos and tricked the latter to put all his godly power into the sword.","In the next moment, Zeus pierced Kratos with the Blade of Olympus!","In the past, the gods had regarded the death of Kratos as a waste of the godly powers that they had granted him. But now, after they retrieved all his powers, they thought it wasn’t a big deal to kill him.","If the previous hatred only turned Kratos cold inside, then being tricked by the gods repeatedly ignited a surging fury inside him and the world that the gods ruled!","Obviously, someone didn’t want Kratos to die, and this someone was one of the Titans that ruled the world before being overthrown by the Olympian gods, Gaia, the Mother of Earth.","So, he was resurrected again and killed his way to Mount Olympus under her guidance!","...","-In the internet café-","“I’ve f*cking killed my way out of the Underworld! How about you guys?!” St. Leidon roared while playing the game.","“Don’t you see me riding a Pegasus?!” St. Hematon yelled as he brandished his chain blade. On his screen, countless monsters flying out of the vast ocean of clouds lunged at him and were butchered one by one.","“This mage can even use the chain blades?!” The elves looked dumbfounded, wondering what these people had experienced in the game.","On their journey, they saw Prometheus who was cursed by the gods. He was the god who had brought fire to mankind in an effort to help the humans.","Zeus had Prometheus chained to a boulder on Caucasus Mountains and let a hungry and fierce eagle feed on his organs each day.","How pathetic it was.","“Today, I haven’t reached Mount Olympus yet! March on!”","...","On the next day, the elves entered the shop and again saw the saint-level masters sitting in a row.","“These people...?!”","“Haya-!”","“Damn it!”","“Die-!”","...","On the third day...","“Pooh-! Damn it!”","“Kill this son of a b*tch!”","“Die-!”","The elves who had just entered the shop wondered, How come they are still playing the game?!","On the fourth day...","On the fifth day...","On the sixth day...","On the...","“Sir, activate God of War 3 for me!","First Elder Hyru looked at his scene where God of War 2 was being played. “Σ(っ°Д°;)っ”","...","– Meanwhile, at the border of the Morning Light Empire where Canglan City was close to –","On a tall watchtower, a mage rubbed his eyes and seemed to see a streak of golden light on the horizon.","Immediately, he cast the Eagle-Eye Spell on himself. But in the next moment, he saw countless warriors dressed in radiant light war armor and godly palaces that were hovering in the air suddenly appearing before the city!","In disbelief, all the people on watchtowers rubbed their eyes. When they looked again, the restriction array outside the city wall had been destroyed. Before they could react, the godly palaces were hovering above their heads!","They looked like a miracle summoned by gods. Perhaps this horrifying sight could only be explained with miracles.","“Judgement Godly Palace, what do you want?!”","Presences guarding the city surged up as a voice resonated in the sky like thunder!","“We’re here to arrest heretics!”","A huge dragon spread its wings and almost covered the entire sky above this border city. St. Heinz sat on the huge dragon with great confidence and pride!","“Morning Light Empire! Elf Kingdom! Orc Kingdom! Dwarf Kingdom! You shelter the heretics and will receive the same punishment as them!”","“Kill!”","Suppression! It was a one-sided massacre! After all, how could ordinary troops resist an army blessed by the gods?!","– In the Royal Palace of the Morning Light Empire –","“Report-! The Radiant Light Legion launched a surprise attack on the west region of our nation, and 13 cities fell!”","“Report-! 19 cities have fallen!”","“Report-!”","As the reports came one after another.","Only about half an hour had passed.","“The Radiant Light Legion has... reached Canglan City!” The voice contained endless horror and fear.","Such military traveling speed went beyond the humans’ scope of knowledge!","At this moment, endless godly light shot into Canglan City as over ten godly palaces and the Radiant Light Legion swarmed up from all directions, surrounding the entire city so tightly that even water couldn’t leak out.","The elites of Radiant Light Legion surrounded the Canglan City Shop like an iron bucket!","“I... finally get to see this day!” Draped in a pure white mage’s robe, St. Dulan hovered in the air as he was supported by an invisible force.","Engulfed in faint godly light, he looked down like a god.","He had endured endless disgrace and shame! He had even executed Luther and some other Judgement Godly Palace officials whom he had promoted personally.","“This time...”","With a trembling old arm, he pushed open the transparent shop door and walked in.","Seeing the prosperous sight in the shop and remembering the desolate sight inside the Judgement Godly Palace right now, he said chillily, “Come out... the god has descended!”","At this moment, the screens in the internet café showed the following scenes.","St. Willy dragged out the soul of Hades, the God of the Underworld.","St. Leidon held the disembodied head of Helios, the Titan God of The Sun ...","Helen saw her father, an old sword saint, piercing the Blade of Olympus into Zeus’ body repeatedly...","Then, they put down their virtual reality headsets and turned around..."]},{"number":880,"title":"Chapter 880 - What Magic Spell Did You Use?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What’s it?”","“What’s happening?!”","In the Canglan City Shop, a large group of people glanced over involuntarily.","“What’s happening?!” The shop clerk, Mage Merlin, also looked out of the shop and saw fully armored warriors and priests surrounding the shop in a tight circle. The presences that they emitted were horrifying!","Let alone the figure who walked in and was flanked by several red-robed senior priests.","“You... aren’t you...!?","“St. Dulan?!” Merlin’s expression changed.","The saint-level masters of the Judgement Godly Palace had much higher combat strength than average saint-level masters.","In the past thousands of years, the warriors resisting the Judgement Godly Palace had received countless bloody lessons. The true strength of the masters of the Holy Church was always greater than their rivals on the same level!","The true masters among them could even communicate with gods and summon the gods’ blessings to the mortal world.","They had the top-level spells and combat techniques that the gods taught them. When they revealed these to the world, they were capable of far greater powers than those of pinnacle stage saint-level masters. With such powers, they were called demi-gods!","It was why the masters of the Judgement Godly Palace always stood over the other masters in the whole West Continent!","Then, the expressions of many people in the shop changed.","Seeing this sight, St. Dulan was very satisfied. While spreading his hands, he seemed to be bathing in pure holy light. “He who knows the situation is a wise man. The gods are gazing at this land; the old era is almost over, and the glory of the new age will soon arrive!”","“Now representing the great and merciful gods, I give you a chance to make the choice again. You...?”","“Wait... what did you say?!” At this moment, Nation-Protecting Sword Saint Wilson interrupted him and asked, “You said... our empire no longer exists?”","“Of course!” While walking out of the shop slowly, St. Dulan’s old face looked extremely arrogant as if he was telling them that a great legend was about to emerge. “From now on, I think all the nations on the continent don’t need to exist anymore. All the people belong to one nation and are the gods’ subjects!”","“After saying so much, you still haven’t told me where the gods are!” Nation-Protecting Sword Saint Wilson said in a cold voice.","St. Dulan froze and then looked at him, bursting into laughter. “You haven’t seen it?!”","“Seen what?!” They stared at him.","“Seen this...” While he spoke, he retreated slowly to the center of the street. In front of everyone, he showed his power by dimming the Heaven and Earth at will. Then, a golden heavenly light shined down from the clouds, and a surge of extremely huge power engulfed him.","An invisible force slowly lifted him up into mid-air as if the overwhelming force turned everything around him restless...","“Hua-!”","“My goodness-!”","“This force is much greater than the pinnacle stage saint-level... Is it possible that...?”","Even St. Heinz who was sitting on the huge dragon in the sky looked down and nodded slightly.","Countless masters in the Radiant Light Legion around them all looked envious and reverent, letting out shouts of surprise and joy.","In the end, the shouts gathered together as their cheering became as loud as a tsunami. “Congratulations to Lord St. Dulan for entering the Demi-God Realm!”","“Do you feel this power?! Now standing before you, I’m a god!” St. Dulan looked down on the players who had just walked out of the shop and said in a loud voice.","Nearby, St. Heinz nodded and said, “Mr. Dulan, our dominance is established. Now...”","He sneered at everyone and said, “The people who want to enjoy the gods’ light for eternity, turn around and burn the shop behind you! As to those who are not willing...”","...","Meanwhile, in the grandest godly palace hovering in the sky, two priestesses dressed in pure white godly palace battle skirts stood on both sides.","Dressed in black-and-red battle armor, Valkyrie Isabela pierced a holy sword that had shiny divine lights flashing on it into the ground before her. She gazed at the scene and said in a cool voice, “Do you think... they will submit to us?”","“He who knows the situation is a wise man, my lady.” The priestess standing next to her had served her for countless years. “In front of the great Valkyrie, these demonic gods that have just descended are as weak as grass. I think they will make the right choice!”","...","Before she could finish, they saw Sword Saint Wilson flying up into the sky.","Following him, a large group of elves, mages, and orcs all slowly flew up into the air, standing before the Radiant Light Legion and the powerful demi-gods like a natural barrier!","“What... are you doing?!” St. Heinz and St. Dulan asked furiously.","St. Dulan instantly gathered shiny godly light in his hand. It turned into a surging force which began to condense in his palm. “You are all seeking death! This is God’s Wrath, a miracle spell that I recently learned from the Valkyrie!”","With intense murderous spirit in his eyes, St. Dulan instantly condensed a horrifying golden lightning snake with the energy in his palm. “Although I’ve only mastered ten percent of the spell, it’s enough to deal with you guys!”","But in the next moment...","He saw the white-robed Adolf of the Magic Union of the Morning Light Empire emitting tremendous presence!","Violent gusts swept over; he even saw an endless ocean that was roaring!","“Don’t make your invasion sound so righteous. After conquering more than 20 cities of our empire and causing countless casualties among troops and civilians, you dare to threaten us! It’s outrageous!” Adolf roared, “This is Poseidon’s Rage, a new magic spell that I just learned! I only understand a tiny part of its wondrous power, but it’s enough to deal with you guys!”","“What a joke! You’re an ant who had just reached the saint-level! What nonsense is Poseidon’s Rage!” St. Dulan laughed mockingly. Then, lightning arcs poured down toward Adolf like furious dragons leaping out of the abyss!","Suddenly, shocking thunderbolts tore through the void! At this moment, everyone seemed to see a horrifying giant god coming out of the distant ocean. Stepping on the ocean with his head touching the starry sky, he unleashed a violent rage!","With thunderbolts shooting out in all directions, a violent lightning force instantly swept out from Adolf like a storm. As the two godly thunderbolts touched...","The two streaks of tremendous energies stood their grounds, but gradually, the golden thunderbolt seemed to falter!","Then, it exploded abruptly!","The radiant golden light poured back with the tsunami-like blue thunderbolts!","St. Dulan was hit directly as if someone had smashed a huge hammer on his chest! His face turned pale instantly, and he almost fell from the sky!","“How... how could it be?!” St. Dulan pointed at Adolf with a trembling finger as horror appeared in his eyes. “What magic spell did you use?!”"]},{"number":881,"title":"Chapter 881 - Are You Devils!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“What magic spell...?!” Adolf glared at him. “Humph! What I just cast was Poseidon’s Rage!”","“What rage?!” With a dark expression, St. Dulan stared at the man before him. He didn’t expect that the miracle spell taught to him by the lofty Valkyrie would lose to a mage who had just reached the saint level!","The fierce godly nation legion looked at the scene in disbelief.","St. Dulan, who had looked magnificent with godly power a moment ago, only lasted a little while using the magic spell taught by a god!","When the force of the tsunami-like blue lightning magic power swept over, they didn’t even have the time to react.","“Im... impossible!” St. Dulan murmured with a pale face, “I’ll try again. It must’ve been a fluke!”","With that said, he condensed the same godly thunderbolt in his palm!","But at this moment, a huge shadow stood before him.","“Mr. Dulan.” St. Heinz looked back and said, “You haven’t fully mastered the magic spell that the Goddess taught you, which is why you failed today. Take some rest; I’ll handle them.”","With a shiver, St. Dulan realized that he had lost his composure, and he said in a hurry, “Yes... I haven’t practiced it enough. Mr. Heinz often listens to lectures from the God of Radiant Light and has cultivated in seclusion for a long time. I think he must have mastered the truly powerful spells and combat techniques.”","St. Dulan immediately bowed and said, “We would have to trouble you, Sir.”","“Roar-!” The huge dragon that St. Heinz sat on flapped its giant wings and soared into the high sky.","St. Heinz no longer restrained his presence. His tremendous aura burst out and was even greater than that of St. Dulan!","“My goodness...!”","“Mr. Heinz became a demi-god long ago!”","“So powerful-!”","Instantly, exclamations came from below.","The huge wings spread out, and gusts whistled across the Heaven and Earth. As the huge dragon soared in the sky, St. Heinz stood on its huge head of the giant dragon with an indifferent expression. With his golden curly hair fluttering in the wind, he looked like a legendary god.","Slowly, he lifted his long golden spear toward the sky,","As if coming from the mountains of the Gods’ Palace, an extremely pure godly thunderbolt crashed down.","Crack!","The thunderous noise resonated in the world!","The booming thunderbolts fell from all directions and gathered on the raised dragon spear. He looked like an ancient god who was holding a golden torch!","Like golden flames, the thunderbolts shook between the Heavens and Earth. Illuminated by the thunderbolts that looked like the judgment from the gods, St. Heinz’s whole body was dyed golden. His voice sounded like thunder, “Today, you have the honor to witness the magic spell, Eternal Psalm, which was granted to me by the God of Radiant Light from the Gods’ Palace. It doesn’t belong to the mortal world and can’t be canceled by average gods. You can die without regrets!”","...","“That’s...!?” At this moment, even the two priestesses who were serving the Valkyrie in the godly palace looked surprised.","Isabela turned grim and then smiled, “I’m surprised that the God of Radiant Light even taught him this spell... Interesting!”","...","“Wow-!”","Having experienced giant emotional ups and downs, all the people in the Radiant Light Legion cheered again.","Who can block such godly power?!","But at this moment, a white-haired old elf flew up into the sky with a wooden magic staff in his hand.","“First Elder?!” Even Kellybel was a bit worried when she saw such godly power in the sky.","“I’ve studied magic spells for thousands of years. Today, I’ll show some of my power!” First Elder Hyru flew up against the violent gusts, and everyone saw a thread of golden lightning energy in his hand!","Compared with the flashing thunderbolt in the sky, this golden lightning energy looked slim and insignificant.","“That’s...!?”","“The ancient miracle, Sunlight Spear?!”","“No... if he can use Sunlight Spear with such proficiency...” World Mage St. Hematon stared at the sky intensely. “That’s right... it looks like Sunlight Spear, but this spell contains a trace of...","“The Godly power of Zeus, the Father of Olympus...”","At this moment, St. Heinz dived down while sitting on the huge dragon as he lifted the giant dragon spear high in the air, looking like an earth-shaking golden meteor falling from the sky!","At this moment, the entire Radiant Light Legion and all the followers of the God of Radiant Light watched the scene in astonishment as the golden meteor tore through the sky.","This is a god! The power that was as great as a godly miracle made them howl in their minds!","But at this moment...","The flashing golden lightning energy in First Elder Hyru’s hand transformed into a golden thunderbolt, and he threw it out when St. Heinz struck down with his dragon spear!","“Zeus’ Fury!”","The thunderbolt’s sharp aura instantly collided with the golden meteor that was crashing down from the sky.","When they crashed into each other in the high sky, the ground shook violently, and many streets cracked open under this strong impact force. Many people fell to the ground while screaming.","Golden thunderbolts spread all over the Heavens and Earth. The violent collision ignited the air, and the blazing flames in the sky spread out in blinding waves, emitting light beams that were tens of thousands of meters long!","Even people in the distant Orc Kingdom and the Gods’ Palace could see this extremely radiant thunderbolt!","Some faint-hearted cultivators and warriors hid in their rooms and buried their heads in their arms, shivering.","Gradually, the lights dispersed and revealed two figures.","St. Heinz stood on the huge head of the giant dragon, the heavy spear in his hands had been reduced to a handle as ugly scorched wounds covered his arms.","As streaks of blood oozed out of his wounds, St. Heinz lost all his arrogance. Half kneeling, he looked at his hands with bone-deep wounds in shock and fury, and he said, “How... can it be? It’s impossible! Where did you learn your magic spells?! Where... did you get your powers?! I learned the godly spells in the Radiant Light Godly Palace and obtained godly power from the Valkyrie. Even a real god would be proud to block this strike.”","“So powerful...?!” Under the sky, the Radiant Light Legion heard his words that were said in astonishment.","Then, they heard St. Heinz say, “My weapon was broken by one strike...”","“Cough! Cough!” He coughed with difficulty and spat out blood.","“This...?!” Instantly, all the warriors and mages in the Radiant Light Legion realized how powerful their enemy’s spells were!","At this moment, First Elder Hyru of the Elf Clan hovered in the air while being supported by a breeze. He stared at St. Heinz and said, “I learned the spell from Zeus, the Father of Olympus. It’s said to be the greatest power of all gods. I learned the methods of using godly power, spells, and powerful combat techniques from the powerful Kratos, the God of War. But this strike only broke your spear...”","“Only-!?”","“Only-!?” Hearing his words, all the warriors and mages of the Radiant Light Legion looked at each other. The two priestesses serving Valkyrie Isabela exchanged a look and then glanced at the Valkyrie beside them.","How strong is this Zeus’ Fury!!??","The warriors and priests of the Radiant Light Legion began to tremble on the inside.","Are you devils!?"]},{"number":882,"title":"Chapter 882 - I’ll Show You How Real Gods Fight!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“They even...?!” On the watchtower of the godly palace, one of the priestesses who was serving Isabela exclaimed, “They even defeated St. Heinz?!”","“This...?!” They watched the scene outside the palace and fell silent.","It must be noted that St. Heinz’s opponent was only a pinnacle stage saint-level master, but St. Heinz’s true power ranked high even among the average gods in the Godly Realm. Few people dared to block the strike that he had launched just now.","Eternal Psalm? It was a powerful godly spell from the noblest royal family of gods!","Who is the Father of Olympus that they mentioned!? A god from nowhere dares to brag about...’the greatest power among the gods’!?","There is also the so-called Kratos, the God of War?! Pooh! This is an insult to our Valkyrie!","Perhaps... they are those evil gods from the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness?! Her eyes turned cold as she punched on the wall. Then, she said with a snort, “Humph! These evil gods have sent their best elites!”","She looked at Isabela beside her and said, “My Lady, what should we do? Should we... show our hands?!”","“You overestimate these mortals.” At this moment, the other priestess said with a laugh, “Even the evil gods from the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness are not powerful. Otherwise, they wouldn’t be living in a place as crappy as the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness.”","She bowed to Isabela and said, “My Lady, Heinz was defeated since he doesn’t have the bloodline of a true god and can’t summon the true power that was granted to him.”","“Such a battle is only a contest of physical strength between two savages. If I were there, I would dodge that attack by increasing my speed a little. It’s a piece of cake to deal with that mortal.”","Valkyrie Isabela looked down. She had intended to strike fear and awe into these people, but with the defeat of Heinz, the morale of their troops was lowering.","The most important thing was that she hadn’t fulfilled her mission in descending to the mortal world.","Of course, she had no interest in lowering herself and battling these mortals. Her purpose in this journey was dealing with those ‘demonic gods’ who had even defeated the Innumerable-Immortal Sea.","“Safana, Sophia, you two can go together.” Standing by the window, Valkyrie Isabela looked through the crystal windowpanes that were engraved with exquisite flower patterns and into the space beyond the Ninth Heaven. She had seen many battles on this level.","It seems like those evil gods had spent lots of time and energy on these mortals, so the latter could possess such powers in a short time.","But these mortals would never understand what true godly power looks like.","Each tiny detail in the godly spells and combat techniques used by the gods contains endless miraculous laws of nature. The humans had just begun learning them; how could they understand that deep?","Besides, these two girls have perfected their combat techniques with countless years of real battle experiences.","“You two are warriors that I personally trained. Don’t disappoint me.” Although she thought that one of them was enough to deal with the mortals, she didn’t want to take any chances! That was why she sent both of them.","Heinz was defeated since he had little experience in using the spell in real battles. After all, no one in the mortal world could force Heinz to use this technique. Besides, all the people in the mortal world were so stupid that they knew nothing but increasing their cultivation strength and the power of battle skills and spells; none of them cared about true techniques.","Staying in this place for a long time would lower one’s standard in battles.","However, the priestesses that she trained personally wouldn’t make the same mistake.","Because their opponents were the evil gods from the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness!","“The real battle skill is the ultimate control of each tiny detail.” Priestess Safana and Sophia pulled off their pure-white priestess’ robes and revealed a suit of body-fitting light armor and a mage’s robe respectively. One of them held a huge sword taller than an average person, and the other had a magnificent magic staff inlaid with sapphire gems. They emitted holy and powerful light, revealing presences much more powerful than that of St. Heinz!","These were presences of the real god-level!","They answered cheerfully, “We’ll show the so-called Kratos, the God of War, the real art of battle!”","...","-Meanwhile, outside the Canglan City Shop-","The Godly Palace Legion surrounding the shop stared at their enemies with fierceness on their faces, but they were a little afraid on the inside.","They had never imagined that even St. Heinz who had godly power would be defeated by these mortals.","However, they were still hopeful, confident that they would never be defeated, because...","Gods had descended!","St. Heinz and St. Dulan were just demi-gods.","But real gods hovered above their heads!","Regardless of how powerful these beings were, could they kill gods?!","At this moment, as if it was an answer to their wish, the main godly palace in the sky suddenly shot out two extremely radiant godly light beams!","The radiant godly light pillars shot out with such a force that they shook the sky and land!","Engulfed by godly light, two figures hovered in the high sky on both sides of the godly palace as if they were guardians. Their huge godly powers gushed out from behind their backs and transformed into dazzling light wings. With holy and pure faces, they stood like ice statues, looking at the world with chilly light in their eyes. They looked like two extremely pure battle angels!","Under the godly palace, the Godly Palace Legion saw the scene, and their faces turned from grim to pleasantly surprised. Lifting their weapons, they cheered and yelled, “See? This is the power of gods!”","Be awed! Roar in shock! Kneel and worship the grand godly power!","This was their ultimate power – the power of true gods!","“Ignorant mortals!” At this moment, Sophia said with the magic staff in her hand, “Today, you’ll witness what a real battle looks like! You’ll witness the skills that can really control the battlefield!”","She pointed her magic staff lightly without chanting any spells or taking any time to channel energy. A light flashed on the sapphire gem, and a white-hot light ball shot out from the top of her magic staff like a huge cannon ball!","In the next moment, it exploded in the crowds!","With a huge noise, lights burst out like a volcanic eruption and almost engulfed the whole street. In screams and yells of shock, the horrifying force sent countless people flying.","The residual energy radiated outward and collapsed many nearby buildings. Many players standing outside the shop were knocked down, lying in the ruins covered in blood.","“Help them! Hurry and help them!”","“Help them?!” Sophia’s lips curved up as a contemptuous smile appeared on her face. With a slight wave of her magic staff, the godly power turned into countless golden needles which then fell like the waterdrops in a golden waterfall! Her exquisite control made each attack look lively and agile!","“Now, you’ll see how a real mage god battle!”","But at this moment, she saw First Elder Hyru, St. Willy of the Mage Union, the white-robed Mage Adolf, and Grand Mage Merlin who was also a shop clerk all taking out their magic staffs, waving them lightly...","??? What are these mortals doing!?"]},{"number":883,"title":"Chapter 883 - Understanding of Spells?! Crushed in All Aspects!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Even though the evil gods behind you taught you some powerful spells...” With the magic staff in her hand, Sophia looked at the mortal mages and said with a sneer, “If I don’t give you the chance to cast them, what can you do?! Are you going to fight me with your obsolete minor spells?!”","Yes, even if they had learned some spells with great power, there are many other spells. In our long lives, we had mastered countless excellent spells with great power.","In contrast, these mortal mages could only manage to study these few powerful spells such as Poseidon’s Rage or Zeus’ Fury. In a short time, they couldn’t master more magic spells.","Even if they could, the spells that they learned can’t be on the same level as my spells! The most that they can cast is the obsolete minor spells circulating in the mortal world.","Therefore, I have tens of thousands of ways to deal with them!","Combining all the factors, such as laws of nature, energy, and timing, the so-called ultimate combat techniques could achieve the best results with the lowest energy consumption, defeating strong opponents with low effort.","Do I need to use powerful spells? If I use them properly, I can easily subdue the mortals with a few minor spells, and they wouldn’t be able to even touch my hair!","She watched the mortal mages cast spells with a mocking expression. These mortals probably can’t even understand my spells and my intentions.","...","But at this moment, she felt a wave of pale lights spreading out from these mortal mages like ripples.","“What?!”","She suddenly felt a strange force spreading out from their spells. At this moment...","Her magic which could subdue everyone and turn them into hedgehogs was out of her control, and they bounced back in all directions!","It must be noted that each of the tens of thousands of needles transformed from godly power was completely under her control. Even when they encountered obstacles, they could either swim past them like fish in water or concentrate and pierce the obstacles with force!","But she found that none of the situations that she prepared for occurred. She didn’t even feel any obstacles when the needles were bounced off for some reason.","“This is...!?”","“This is Twisted Wall of Light!” Elf Girl Sala exclaimed as she protected some priests and paladins who were casting healing spells, “It’s an ancient spell from the land of ancient golden sorceries!”","As mentioned before, there were many ancient spells in Dark Souls.","The gods in Dark Souls might not be as powerful as the 12 major Olympian gods, but their spells were born at the beginning of the world.","“A closely-guarded light manipulation spell that contorts the very fabric of fundamental laws, negating magic by denying its claim to physicality.” These were the words written on the magic scroll of Twisted Wall of Light as the introduction.","“What spell is this?! It could even block my Flood of Godly Punishment!” Sophia’s face turned dark. “I’ll see how many spells you can block!”","“Judgement Light Spear!” It was another instant-cast spell. With a wave of her magic staff, a golden light spear condensed quickly in front of her and shot out with lightning speed as the whistling sounds of wind and thunder piercing the air!","The most horrifying thing was that a long tail containing more than ten light spears followed the first one, turning into a strong current of light spears.","The force in the light spears was so condensed that they could pierce any powerful defense. After all, it was cast with godly power and shot in one direction with full force!","This attack was launched as swiftly as a sudden lightning bolt, giving them no time to cast Poseidon’s Rage or Zeus’ Fury. No attack could block it. Even with Twisted Wall of Light, they couldn’t deflect so many powerful solidified spears condensed from godly power!","It was indeed not an earth-shaking powerful spell, but in front of this spell, everyone felt desperate as nothing could block it.","When the battle wisdom combined with techniques, all defenses were illusions!","However, at this moment, First Elder Hyru waved his magic staff when the light spear was almost upon his head.","Swoosh!","With a flash, he vanished on the spot.","His timing was perfect since it was the moment when Sophia’s spell was at the end of casting. If he had moved a bit earlier, Sophia could have changed the direction of the spell. If he moved a bit slower, he would have been pierced by the light spears.","In the next moment, the ground where First Elder Hyru had stood was pierced as if it was made of tofu, and a bottomless black hole appeared.","“This is...!!?” At this moment, even Black Dragon Gulth exclaimed, “This is... the ultimate use of Flash from League of Legend!”","In League of Legends, some of the spells and ultimates used by champions were auto-locked. Regardless of how someone dodged, they couldn’t escape from being targeted.","This extreme technique was created for such situations!","“My goodness-!?” One elf exclaimed, “He’s indeed an extraordinary master-rank player!”","In the next moment, First Elder Hyru waved his staff lightly, and pale blue magic light condensed before the staff.","“Instant Cast? Crystal Soul Spear!?”","In the exclamations, the blue magic energy condensed so tightly that it transformed from invisible magic energy into a solid magic crystal.","Then, the huge magic spear shot toward Sophia in the sky like a comet attacking the sun!","“What!?” Caught off guard, Sophia was surprised that her opponent could dodge her attack and even counterattack!","“How about now?!” She shook her staff and made a gesture in the air with the other hand. She dodged her opponent’s spell and released spells one after another at the same time with both hands.","“God-level destructive spell – Small Meteorite Shower!”","“God-level targeting spell – Swimming Thunder Lights!”","“God-level targeting spell – Floating Destructive Flames!”","“God-level judgement spell – Star Aurora!”","Several magic spells were cast instantly. All of them were on or above the god-level!","“Meteorite Shower covers a large area, Swimming Thunder Lights and Floating Destructive Flames follow the target, and Star Aurora can’t be blocked. I’ll see how you break this combination of spells!”","The moment she said that, she saw the mages raising their staves again!","“Chaos Pyromancy!”","“Crystal homing sorcery – Homing Crystal Soulmass!”","“Chaos homing pyromancy – Floating Chaos!”","“Soul sorcery —Soul Stream!”","“Miracle...”","At this moment, all the mages below waved their staffs as all kinds of magic lights lit up like stars in the sky.","Boom! Boom! Boom–!","Countless spells gathered in the sky and exploded like radiant fireworks, letting out earth-shaking noises that could be heard thousands of kilometers away. Some of them even pierced that radiant magic light curtain and crashed toward Sophia.","The most important thing was that Sophia hadn’t even heard of spells such as crystal sorceries and chaos pyromancy before. She couldn’t understand them, let alone break them!","She found that they cast spells and dodged her spells as accurately as moves from the textbooks.","More horrifying was that she, a god who excelled in magic, was crushed by a group of mortals in this field!","At this moment, she stared at the scene in a daze, not able to disguise her shock anymore."]},{"number":884,"title":"Chapter 884 - Valkyrie Shows Her Hand!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Despite the surprise on her face, she smiled cunningly with her eyes.","Because when everyone focused on the battle of magic spells, no one noticed that another figure had vanished in the sky.","Suddenly, exclamations came from the crowd.","A figure landed behind some mages abruptly.","“You’re finished!” The other priestess landed among the mages and slashed out her huge sword as if she was cutting a mountain in two.","The horrifying sword energy containing god-level power looked as if it would devour everything around it!","“Are they going to make a move...?” In the godly palace, Valkyrie Isabela seemed to be waiting for something.","Just as the saying goes, “the mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind.” She didn’t want to deal with these mortals who were meaningless to her.","[TL Note: The Chinese Idiom, the mantis stalks the cicada, unaware of the oriole behind, refers to those who are attracted by immediate interests without thinking about the possible dangerous results.]","“It’s time to make a move now...?” She looked cold. “How can you sit back and watch in such a situation?”","“Forget it. If you can keep calm, suit yourself. I don’t believe that no one will show up when the shop is smashed!”","With this thought, she turned her attention from the battleground and returned to the magnificent and noble throne in the palace.","After all, if an existence beyond gods made a move, it was impossible for her not to sense the presence.","However, while she was taking a rest in the palace, something unexpected happened!","These mages took out huge swords, dual blades, and chain blades. Godly powers such as Poseidon’s Rage and Zeus’ Fury lit up on their weapons despite their limited understanding of them.","Boom!","The sword energy left a huge crater in the shape of a new moon, but... no one was hurt!","What was more? These mages charged up with the blades. Some mages even brandished chain blades with magnificence and proficiency.","Then, she saw a group of warriors swarming up with combat techniques so good that it seemed like they had obtained them by battling gods and demons countless times. While the mages still had some flaws in their combat techniques, the warriors exhibited perfect god-slaying skills! The moment that they entered the fray, they forced one of the true gods onto the defense!","“Who taught you these combat techniques?!” The two priestesses combined forces, but regardless if it was magic spells or melee combat, they were totally suppressed by these mortals.","“Impossible... the Valkyrie taught us the combat techniques in person... we accumulated all our battle experience on the battleground by killing demonic gods!” They couldn’t believe and wouldn’t accept the reality. While trying their best to block the attacks, they lost all the previous arrogance and shouted hysterically, “You mortals, how can you be stronger than us?! How can you reach such a level?!”","St. Leidon and the other saint-level masters snorted and said, “We learned our combat techniques from the powerful God of War. We practiced forever on Mount Olympus and mastered all our combat techniques by slaying gods on Mount Olympus!","“You arrogant gods, why should you think that you must be stronger than us?! Why should you think that you can reach our level?!”","“You... you!?” Hearing these words, not only Priestesses Safana and Sophia, but all other people were stupefied.","“You... slaying... gods?!” Everyone pointed at them in horror.","“Yeah.” At this moment, Black Dragon Gulth said proudly, “I pulled off the head of Helios, the God of the Sun, and was surprised that there was only light but no blood in his head.","Word Mage Hematon also laughed and said, “When I battled Hades, the God of the Underworld, I pulled out his soul.”","“I pierced Zeus, the Father of Olympus, with my sword, just like... this!” St. Wilson slashed out his sword swiftly. As if containing a trace of godly power from the Blade of Olympus, the sword flashed with golden thunderbolts and broke through his opponent’s defense, piercing into her belly!","The two priestesses dropped from the sky heavily. With blank minds, their faces were full of shock.","We’ve been battling with such people?! We even thought that we were powerful with complacency!","We... admit defeat!","...","At this moment, Valkyrie Isabela who was sitting in the godly palace opened her eyes slowly. “That’s strange... how come they still haven’t made a move?”","She suddenly had a bad feeling.","Subconsciously, she walked out of the godly palace and looked down.","Suddenly, she saw her two priestesses lying in blood and on the verge of death. One of them even had a sword hole in her belly that completely went through her body!","Safana and Sophia had traces of fear and panic in their eyes","People like the soldiers of the Godly Palace Army and St. Dulan also looked horrified; they had never expected that these people would be so horrifying!","“My Lord, what should we do with them?!” The knights of the Golden Griffin Knight Legion bowed toward Nation-Protecting Sword Saint Wilson and asked.","Severely wounded, people like St. Dulan and St. Heinz were no match for them and were soon captured together.","“These people caused great damage to our nation.” Saint Wilson looked at the ruined city and said, “Execute them.”","“Yes!”","“Stop!” At this moment, a shrill yell came from the sky. Blinding golden light beams filled the sky, the land shook, and the mountains shivered!","A dazzling god floated out from the godly palace and hovered in the sky as if another sun rose!","In front of the vast godly power, everyone instantly felt as small as ants. In front of her flawless figure, everyone felt ashamed of their own imperfections.","“Execute them!” But at this moment, no one obeyed her.","“No! You can’t!” St. Dulan yelled.","The knights under Nation-Protecting Sword Saint Wilson’s command slashed down their swords, and several heads rolled on the ground.","“Good... you are very good!” Fire almost burst out from Valkyrie Isabela’s eyes. She was beside herself with fury. “How could you ants insult such noble lives!”","She pointed her godly sword upward, and a horrifying golden light pillar instantly shot up into the sky.","As her godly sword slashed out, the golden light pillar piercing the sky seemed to become the blade of the godly sword. The golden sword energy looked as if it could hack open the chaos and even divide the whole world!","Before the sword crashed down, all the people bent under the extremely horrifying pressure of the godly power. The people with lower cultivation strength were pressed down onto the ground as the land cracked and sank!","In the next moment, all the people saw the destructive sword energy striking down toward them viciously!","Instantly, the entire Heaven and Earth turned desolate and deadly silent."]},{"number":885,"title":"Chapter 885 - What Power Does This Bald Guy Have? How Dare He Call Himself the God of War?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The sword energy seemed to contain the gods’ endless fury, and it meant... destruction!","The land shook as countless pieces of debris from ruined buildings flew up into the sky, defying the laws of gravity, and then turning into ashes.","The ground continued to sink. No one dared to move under such horrifying godly power.","In the next moment, the godly sword fell as the unrivaled sword energy covered the whole street and extended to the endless distance. The destructive sword energy seemed to reach the end of the world!","Everything below was devoured.","Valkyrie Isabela withdrew her sword slowly and looked at the effect of her sword strike in satisfaction.","Zeus’ Fury? Pyromancies? Sorceries? Everything was a joke in front of this sword strike.","This was the power of a god who was born before the Heavens were formed.","It was a power that humans didn’t even dare to imagine!","“They are only... cowardly turtles.” She snickered. “Demonic gods from the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness are so weak.”","After a long while, the dust finally started to settle down.","At this moment, Isabela was a little surprised.","Her eyes, which could strike fear into people without being angry, pierced through the yellow dust and vaguely saw that all the people in the ruins created by her sword strike were intact. A huge invisible essence shield dispersed gradually in the dust!","A figure stood in front of all people. Dressed in red and golden armor, this man had horns on his forehead while his dark-red long hair fluttered in the winds.","No, he wasn’t a mortal but a... demonic god!","His expression looked so overbearing as if he was the almighty devil lord that dominated the three realms and six paths.","Almighty Demon Lord Chong Lou!","“You... finally dare to show you face?!” Isabela’s lips curved up a bit. Her face rarely showed any expressions, but now satisfaction flashed in her eyes.","At this moment, a faint string of data flashed across Fang Qi’s dark eyes. Dark purple thunderbolts flashed, and Almighty Demon Lord Chong Lou began to dim.","“Is that... the shop owner?!”","“It’s you?!” Isabela was also a little surprised. Her doppelganger in the mortal world had seen Fang Qi in the Spiritual Spell Visual Projection; she had even watched him use Orochi Divine Light.","At that time, he wasn’t even close to this power level.","Through her doppelganger in the mortal world, Isabela knew Fang Qi’s past deeds.","With her views and vision, she seemed to have guessed something. While looking Fang Qi up and down, she said, “My doppelganger hoped to have a battle with you long ago, Human. As a human, you seem to have some talents.”","“Who are you?” Mr. Fang looked baffled. “I don’t remember meeting you before.”","“That’s...!?” At this moment, World Mage Hematon exclaimed, “That’s... Princess Isabela, the pride of the Godly Nation!! Her Highness?! The Princess of the Radiant Light Godly Nation!”","“It’s you?” Valkyrie Isabela said coldly, “He who knows the situation is a wise man. I’m surprised that you chose to stand with my enemy. That’s stupid of you.”","“But today, I have no interest in you.” She looked at Fang Qi coldly and said, “Call out the guardians behind you; they can’t win if they want to battle me with your body.”","“Guardians... is it so?!” the players talked among themselves animatedly. After all, each time when they watched Mr. Fang battle, they saw him taking power from others.","So, the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal, Orochi, and others... are guardians?","After all, it was the only explanation that made sense.","“But... Your Highness,” Hematon said, “The power that you just used isn’t your own power, right?”","“No, she’s not the princess.” Beside him, Swein said with a grim expression, “If I’m right, she is the Valkyrie who, according to the legends, is unrivaled in battlegrounds and is the youngest god of the Original God Clan in the Gods’ Palace.”","“This small monkey of the human clan has sharp eyes.” Isabela nodded slightly, admitting that Swein was right.","“What...!?”","“Valkyrie?!”","“It’s said... that the Judgement Godly Palace worships the God of Radiant Light Judgement, but there are many other gods in the Godly Nation...”","“Then, who’s the most powerful one?”","“They didn’t say...”","While people were talking among themselves animatedly, Isabela grew impatient.","“What?” Valkyrie Isabela stared at Fang Qi with cold eyes and said, “Are the demonic gods behind you absent today?","“If so...” Her eyes were cold as she said, “Then these mortals will die!”","“Of course, they are here,” Mr. Fang said, “I’m thinking whom I should choose. How about...”","Mr. Fang took out a communication jade and revealed four pictures. “How about... you choose one?”","“Huh!!??”","Isabela glanced at the pictures and saw the first visual projection on the communication jade. He was a handsome demonic god with ancient-looking facial features, and he was dressed in a luxurious black robe and wearing a golden headpiece decorated with feathers.","Custom-made for him by Wuwei Daoist Alliance, Fang Qi’s communication jade had top quality, and the visual projection was in 3D. The projection was to scale, looking more life-like.","This figure had his name displayed beside him.","“Qi Tiandi!?”","She looked at the second one. “Almighty Demon Lord Chong Lou?”","The third one was a silver-armored man with a vertical eye on his forehead. “Erlang Immortal Master?”","The fourth one was a monkey wearing shiny golden armor. “The Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal?!”","The fifth one was a brawny and fierce bald man with dual blades. “Kratos, the God of War?”","“Humph! Are they the new-born demonic generals from the Nine-Fold Darkness? How come they look so unfamiliar?!” Valkyrie Isabela waved her huge sword and said heroically, “I don’t want to choose one; tell them to come together!”","Mr. Fang’s face darkened, and he glared at her and said, “No, you must choose one. If they all come, you are not their match. Why would you do that?!”","“You!” Isabela almost passed out in fury, thinking, Do you know how I got the title of ‘Valkyrie’?! I got it by killing the demonic generals from the Nine-Fold Darkness!”","“Okay! They can battle me one by one. Don’t regret your decision when they die under my sword!”","“Tell this Kratos to come out!” A pair of pure white wings slowly spread out on Isabela’s back as her surging godly power shot up and grew exponentially.","With the godly sword in her hand, she pointed at the visual projection of Kratos from the communication jade and said mockingly, “I was given the title ‘Valkyrie’ because of my unrivaled merits in battlegrounds where I killed countless demons. What power does this bald guy have? How dare he call himself the God of War?!”","The moment she said it, a brawny figure dressed in the grand God of War armor appeared and sized her up coldly with the Blades of Chaos in his hands.","His eyes were so cold that it seemed like he was looking at a corpse.","For some reason, Valkyrie Isabela suddenly felt chills running down her spine!"]},{"number":886,"title":"Chapter 886 - God of War Vs. Valkyrie!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","After sizing up the God of War carefully, Valkyrie Isabela wasn’t worried. I thought you were a god, but despite your godly power, you’re still a mortal.","“How could a human mixed-blood become the God of War?” Raising her huge sword high and spreading out her giant wings, Isabela who was dressed in her exquisite red-and-black battle armor looked extremely heroic and valiant as she hovered in the sky. “Let your older sister show you how the gods battle each other!”","The moment she said that, her huge sword, containing strong godly power, hacked down like a shooting star.","Kratos, the God of War, sidestepped and dodged it in a flash. In the next moment, the entire forest outside of the city below them instantly collapsed, and the sword strike left a half-moon-shaped crater on the ground, scorching everything around it.","“Do you see the power of gods? You, a demi-god...”","Before she could finish, a pair of blazing orange flames hacked down!","Kratos didn’t speak, but when Isabela blocked his attack with her huge sword, she instantly felt the horrifying force coming from the blades which seemed to be demonic weapons from Hell.","She even felt the short blades, ridiculously small compared with her own weapon, striking down on her sword with so much force that they felt like two huge primeval axes.","Caught off guard, Isabela’s expression changed as she was sent flying back like a shooting star by this huge force.","In the next moment, she saw her opponent throwing out the blades, and the extremely hot blackish-red chain of a blade pulled her in like hooks as she flew backward.","Meanwhile, the other Blade of Chaos was waiting for her to crash into it.","Pulled by two forces, Isabela felt like a puppet whose movements were controlled by her opponent!","She didn’t doubt that her opponent could pierce her godly armor with one casual stab as she was trapped by the two huge forces!","The huge wings on her back shook and flapped like a black tornado in the sky. At the last moment, her extremely hard wings narrowly knocked back her opponent’s attack, and white feathers flew up in the sky.","But in the next moment, she heard howling blade winds coming from behind!","She felt as if she was deeply trapped in the eye of a storm as the continuous attacks gave her no time to breathe. Besides...","What kind of godly power does my opponent have?!","If felt like a force that had chaotically combining all kinds of godly powers each of which was extremely pure and close to the truth of nature.","For some reason, she seemed to hear countless howls of fury and pathetic screams of gods inside this godly power.","“What god are you?!” Isabela had never seen such godly power before.","“You don’t want to tell me?!” With chilly light in her eyes, she slashed out her sword and parried the two blades with her great godly power. “I’ll find out soon!”","Her wings flapped behind her as godly power surged up in her body. The sky, land, and even the whole space shook under this grand godly power.","They shivered. At this moment, the Heavens and Earth seemed to kneel at her feet!","Instantly, she transformed into a black-and-white light beam which moved faster and faster until it surpassed the limit of human vision and vanished!","Ear-grating thunder seemed to fill the space between the Heaven and Earth, but there was no one under the vast clear sky.","But in the next moment, before anyone could react, they heard...","Boom! Boom! Boom–!","In a series of booming noises, the distant mountains collapsed as Kratos’s whole body was hit by the black-and-white light beam. The horrifying force knocked down several huge mountains.","At this moment, her speed finally slowed down a bit. People vaguely saw Valkyrie Isabela’s huge sword stabbing into Kratos’s belly with vicious force. Although Kratos tried to block it with tremendous godly power, a bone-deep wound appeared in his belly and turned deeper with each second.","At this moment, a huge shadow appeared behind him; it was an extremely grand high mountain.","With a crisp shout, she exerted more force and pushed Kratos’ body toward the huge mountain with her sword as if she was going to kill and pin him into this mountain!","“Gods have absolute control over battles in the sky!” She looked contemptuous. After all, mortals were just mortals.","But suddenly, a pair of huge black wings spread out on Kratos’ back as his arms that had bulging muscles held the huge sword and swung it out the moment he was about to crash into the huge mountain.","Under her shocked gaze, Kratos crashed Isabela into the huge mountain first. The huge momentum instantly shattered her godly armor.","Then, it looked as if the sky and earth cracked.","Half of the 3,000-meter-tall mountain collapsed as countless boulders rolled down and buried the forest and demon beasts at the foot of the mountain!","...","A long while later, boulders shattered, and the land shook as two figures shot out from underground like cannon balls.","“It has been many years since I felt pain.” Isabela gazed at the man before her and said, “I’m surprised that you do possess the power to battle gods.”","“But... you’ll never defeat me!” With a furious shout, the shattered godly armor repaired itself at a visible speed. Even Isabela’s injuries healed, and the noble godly blood oozing out of her wounds flowed back slowly as if time was rewinding.","This was the power of the gods. The Great Valkyrie surpassed all gods in the world; she was immortal and could never be destroyed! No existence could kill her, not demonic gods, let alone mortals!","In the blink of an eye, her injuries completely healed.","If anyone else saw such a scene, they would feel desperate.","Indifferently, she glanced around as if she intended to appreciate the horror and despair on this mortal’s face.","Crossing arms before her chest and curving up her lips with cold arrogance, her valiant up-slanting eyes looked over but didn’t see any injuries on Kratos, not even a scratch! It seemed as if his wounds had been nothing but illusions.","“???” While standing in the sky proudly, Isabela blinked and wondered, What... what is going on?","In the next moment, her eyes suddenly opened wide as she stared at Kratos.","Kratos also took out a giant sword. Numerous thunderbolts coiled around it, and Isabela even sensed the power of the king of gods from it!","Although her opponent didn’t speak, the way that he slowly raised the giant sword seemed to be telling her that it was his turn!"]},{"number":887,"title":"Chapter 887 - This Man Is a Devil!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","The pure golden sword bone seemed to be retelling the story of an ultimate noble deity as bone-chilling lights flashed on its silver-white blade.","The crossguard of the sword looked like a roaring golden god engulfed in bright blue thunderbolts and godly fire, turning the whole sword into the color as blue as the sky.","This was the Blade of Olympus. Like the godly flame on Mount Olympus that never extinguished, it represented the ultimate authority of the Olympian gods. But now, Kratos was holding it.","It was because its owner had died, and its new master was Kratos, the God of War who brought destruction to the gods on Mount Olympus.","For some reason, the sense of danger that Valkyrie Isabela felt grew stronger.","Urged by the strong sense of danger, she condensed even greater godly power. Her body grew swiftly, and she transformed into an extremely huge goddess whose head touched the sky in the blink of an eye!","Unable to bear this force, the land trembled and wept pathetically as it cracked and sank slowly.","The godly sword was lifted like a huge mountain. It tore open the sky and revealed stretches of pitch-black void.","People felt that if she wanted, she could destroy the whole world with one slash of her sword!","Her power had long ago surpassed the limit of the world. If not for her strong control of the power, it wasn’t difficult for her to accidentally destroy the world.","Blazing godly fire burned on the godly sword. Even the people from the distant nations could see a streak of golden-orange flame shooting up into the sky like the gods’ fury!","Without any fancy moves, this attack surpassed all techniques. It was only one strike, but this extremely simple vertical slash represented the highest law of nature and Earth and the supreme Martial Dao between the Heaven and Earth!","If a painter with ultimate talents could draw this scene, even the sheet of paper would contain the godly power of Heaven and Earth!","This was the power of gods who were born before the Heavens. Their acts and words represented the laws of nature! Perhaps they were the laws of nature!","Everything would end after the sword strike landed.","With this slash, she was going to tell the mortals that only gods were eternal.","However, in the next moment, the invincible sword strike was...","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The surging godly power crashed forward in the sky like ocean waves but didn’t do any damage to the ground. Isabela looked at the figure under her sword and saw the extremely tiny figure lifting his sword and perfectly blocking this destructive strike!","When the two vast godly powers clashed with each other, air waves instantly shot up and exploded in the high sky tens of thousands of meters above the ground!","The explosion could be heard anywhere in the world! Even the Gods’ Palace shook violently.","Valkyrie Isabela watched the sword slash in a daze since she had never seen such a horrifying sight in her life even though she had been through numerous battles.","“He...blocked it?!”","Then, Kratos flew up high like a dark-golden arrow with unrivaled godly power. Catching Isabella off guard, he left several horrifying wounds on her body, from her arm to her shoulder!","When the godly blood fell on the land, Isabela’s body didn’t show any sign of healing itself!","At this moment, Isabela finally felt fearful. This sword brought the threat of death to the eternal gods who were born before Heaven was formed!","“What sword is this?!” Isabela watched in horror as the godly sword left huge wounds on her body. Now, her opponent was aiming at the place between her brows.","Her huge form didn’t afflict any injuries to her opponent. Instead, she became a huge target!","With a furious roar, the sword stabbed forward.","Isabela shrunk back to her original form desperately! With a shake of her wings, she appeared in another place as if she teleported.","Blink! Shaking the space with a subtle movement and moving to another place. This wasn’t a magic spell but a powerful combat technique.","But she had never expected that she would use it to dodge attacks.","A drop of cold sweat fell.","“This mortal... is horrifying...”","“No. This godly sword is so horrifying! This mortal must have borrowed power from the godly sword... he must have!” As an experienced fighter who had fought countless battles, Isabela quickly calmed down. After understanding her opponent’s advantage, she thought that she could still win because she had abundant battle experience.","Her sharp and experienced eye told her that the power of the godly sword didn’t come from Kratos, and using this power was quickly consuming his own godly power.","Inside Kratos, only a part of his strength was godly power while the rest was mortal strength. Besides, the godly power, despite its great strength, was mixed and no match for the pure godly power in her body. With her powerful combat techniques and experiences as a goddess, she could certainly defeat her opponent and even... take this powerful godly sword from him!","At this thought, Valkyrie Isabela grew excited. She hadn’t been so excited about a battle for a long time!","“Regardless if you are a god or a mortal, I’ll remember you for forcing me to fight so hard!” Heated light flashed in her eyes, she was feeling the thrill of a real battle after a long time!","But at this moment, she saw the bald guy before her putting away the godly sword!","He is putting it away at this critical moment?! And he... is taking out the dual chain blades again!","What was he thinking?!","Perhaps the consumption is too much for him to continue...?!","No... he obviously has some godly power in him... Isabela hovered in the sky, looking a little confused.","While these thoughts flashed across her mind, she hacked down her sword. Regardless of what her opponent intended to do, she only had her eyes on the victory! She would prove to the Heavens and Earth and all the mortals that she, Valkyrie Isabela, wouldn’t be defeated by a god from nowhere.","Because in this realm, she was the only deity that could represent war!","This battle...","“I must win!”","The huge sword in her hand instantly drew streaks of profound and mysterious sword light in the sky! Each arc seemed to contain ultimate truths. At this moment, an extremely noble flower of the godly sword seemed to bloom in the bright sky!","“Tink!”","A huge noise sounded. Facing the profound and mysterious arcs, Kratos didn’t move or dodge. Instead, he raised his hand that was covered in a golden gauntlet and blocked her attack with accuracy!","Isabela felt that the huge force in her sword was deflected by the small gauntlet with a special method. In addition, the giant sword numbed her hand!","Then, her waist felt cold.","He is using powerful combat techniques against my powerful combat techniques?","Isabela instantly understood the situation, but battle hunger burned hotter in her eyes as she realized that she could finally unleash all the combat techniques that she had accumulated in countless years!","She might be able to enjoy this battle!","Her waist twisted in an impossible angle and narrowly dodged the attack. Then, she slashed backward at her opponent’s head!","“Tink!”","As another huge noise sounded, she saw her opponent react reflexively. She suspected that it was an instinctive move without thinking!","The force in her sword was bounced back with a greater force!","The huge force made her take several steps backward. Her heart sunk a little; she knew from her abundant battle experience that she would have died if her opponent attacked at this moment!","Without thinking, she slashed out a swift sword energy as she retreated.","But her opponent seemed to know her intention and sidestepped at the same moment as she slashed out. He dodged it perfectly when she attacked!","He moved smoothly as if he walked like this every day!","“This...!!??”","In the next moment, she heard the faint crisp sounds of the chains as Kratos swung out the chain blades!","Without thinking, she shook her wings and blinked!","The move almost instantly got her out of the danger.","But in the next moment, she found that the chain blades slashed toward the place she was going to land!","It looked as if she was throwing herself into the chain blades.","“How can... it be?!” With horror in her eyes, she was instantly pulled forward by the chain blades.","Then, she seemed to have stepped into Hell!","The Blades of Chaos pierced into her chest!","“Ahh-!” With a pathetic scream, her entire body was in pain as if it was torn open. Almost instantly, several huge wounds appeared in her body.","The Blades of Chaos pinned her onto the ground. What’s more? She felt tearing pain coming from her back!","In shrill screams, her wings were torn off from her body!","She had never felt such shock and horror in her life before. While struggling wildly and screaming, she crawled forward as her survival instinct urged her, and her golden blood spilled on the ground!","This man is a devil!"]},{"number":888,"title":"Chapter 888 - Top-quality Ingredient; Mr. Fang Cooking the New Orleans Style Wings?!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Wounds continued to expand. Valkyrie Isabela had never been so severely wounded.","Under the support of her tremendous godly power, Isabela’s wounds began to heal, but the excruciating pain almost drove her to insanity.","At this moment, the Blade of Olympus was taken out again. The strength of the Blades of Chaos wasn’t enough to hurt her core, but the following strike would threaten her life!","Yes, if this sword didn’t appear, her opponent wouldn’t have the slightest chance to defeat her. The most that he could do was subduing her temporarily.","But the appearance of this sword could turn every temporary suppression into the fatal blow!","She understood her opponent’s intention; he wanted to slay a goddess, and it was why he saved the strength to launch the last blow.","It seemed like he was very familiar with this process and had calculated how much godly power he needed for this strike.","Facing such a fatal threat, Valkyrie Isabela almost unleashed 200 percent of her strength and potential. She launched an explosive strike with all her godly power.","The unrivaled godly power exploding at this one instant looked like the explosion of a blazing sun or the destruction of a planet. Despite the fact that she had sat on the godly throne in relaxation for a long time, when her eternal and great life was threatened, her desire for survival was countless times stronger than others!","The force that she unleashed was frightening.","When the tremendous godly power surged out, Kratos was sent flying backward and crashed into a collapsed mountain even though the Blade of Olympus blocked most of the force, shattering countless huge boulders!","A shrill scream almost shattered everyone’s eardrums.","Covered in blood, Isabela stood up from the ground. Golden blood flowed back into her body from the ground, and her two wings floated up slowly, instantly returning to their original state.","She knew that she would die in this place if she didn’t kill this mortal. Golden flames engulfed her body like gods’ blazing fury. Before her enemy could gain his footing after crawling out from the ruins, she crashed into him like a shooting light.","She smashed him into the mountain again.","“Haya-!” With a furious roar, countless sword energies hacked down and instantly turned the whole mountain into a valley full of countless gutters left by sword slashes!","With a crisp yell, she flapped her wings and flew up high into the Ninth Heaven before slashing down her sword from beyond the clouds, viciously piercing it into the mountain where Kratos was buried.","Looked down from the high sky, the ground within hundreds of kilometers shattered, collapsed, and sank. It looked as if gods had launched a world-destroying catastrophe, intending to ruin the whole continent!","Under this horrifying godly power, the surrounding mountains collapsed and fell. When the dust settled, the whole mountain range had been turned into a huge crater by this horrifying sword strike.","In this mountain range, all the demon beasts, regardless of how powerful they were, died with their corpses destroyed. From the cracks, lava gushed out like the fury of the land.","There was no sign of life around her.","Finally, Valkyrie calmed down from her shock and horror. “He must be dead now, right?”","Facing the fear of death, she experienced a streak of extreme thrill. She was walking on the verge of death, and this was a new experience for her. It felt...","“Wonderful!” At this moment, she seemed to truly appreciate how beautiful the world was, how glorious and magnificent the Heaven and Earth was, and how grand life was.","It was a pity that the dead people could no longer feel that.","But in the next moment, the land shook violently and almost knocked her to the ground.","Then, a figure flew out like a cannon ball as fury spread out like blazing flames.","“He’s... still alive?!” With her mouth wide-open, Isabela looked at the God of War who seemed to have come back from Hell, wondering how this man wasn’t killed?!","But... I can’t be killed either! At this thought, Valkyrie Isabela calmed down a bit. He must be consuming his godly power to heal his injuries. As his godly power weakens, I can surely kill this mortal if I can last longer!","Then, she charged over again with her sword.","But when she hacked down her sword, she saw godly power as vast as an ocean surged up in Kratos’ body, and horrifying thunderstorm swept out in all directions from him!","Poseidon’s Rage!","“Spell...!? This damn mortal even excels in magic!” The power from the God of Seas knocked Isabela’s sword from her hand. Then, a golden thunderbolt condensed in Kratos’ palm!","Spreading out the wings, he flew up into the high sky as the golden thunderbolt transformed into a huge golden lightning ball around him. In the center of the lightning ball, countless golden thunderbolts danced wildly.","“Ah-!” With a shrill scream, Valkyrie Isabela looked as if she was bombarded by attacks from all 12 major Olympian gods at the same time, including lightning, fire, wind, and ice...","“No... as long as that sword doesn’t touch me, I’m indestructible!” She tried to rally herself. “Again. I will surely kill this mortal-!”","Burned almost to charcoal by fire and lightning, Isabela’s body healed again. Then, she somehow broke through the godly spells and condensed all her strength to stab her sword toward Kratos’ chest viciously.","“Dang!”","“Dang!”","“Dang!”","With ear-deafening metal-colliding noises, she slashed out her sword like a storm.","...","– At this moment, in the Canglan City Shop –","“Huh...? Where’s the shop owner?”","“I just saw Kratos battling that powerful Valkyrie; how come they are gone?”","“They are not back yet...” Some elves looked into the distance while helping the knights guard the city to restore order in the city.","...","– Meanwhile, on the battleground –","“Again-!” With heated light flashing in her eyes, Valkyrie Isabela healed her injuries again.","“Again-!” Again, she was pressed onto the ground by Kratos and punched repeated. With blood all over her body, she struggled and crawled out the pit with great difficulty.","“Again-!” The scene repeated itself!","“I can feel the godly power in your body diminish gradually,” Valkyrie Isabela said, “Do it one more time, and you’re finished!”","At this moment, the string of data in Kratos’ eyes dimmed down and became unstable as his godly power decreased sharply.","“One more sword strike. Last Light of Dawn!” Endless sword light engulfed Isabela’s sword which then hacked down with vicious force!","Boom!","The Blade of Olympus in Kratos’ hand blinked and became vague as if it was going to collapse. The defected godly weapon that was for one-time-use obviously couldn’t last longer!","[Synchronization is going to end! Synchronization is going to end!]","“You’re finished!” Seeing Kratos’ body turning vague, she stabbed forward without hesitation!","They were both covered in blood, but she saw that Kratos seemed to not be able to sustain his form.","She would surely win the battle since the last bit of godly power in her opponent’s body wasn’t enough to sustain the use of that godly sword!","“Ha-!” Kratos almost used up his last bit of strength to push her away. His godly power had indeed reached the limit.","She was going to win for sure!","“You’re indeed powerful.” Isabela also panted heavily as if even her tremendous godly power couldn’t replenish her consumption. “If you had the same amount of strength as me, I’m absolutely not your match. Thank you for teaching me so much.”","Lifting the huge sword high in the air, she looked at Kratos whose form was dimming and blinking, ready to launch the last blow. “Do you have anything to say before you die?”","Although her battle force was a bit weaker than that of Kratos, she lasted to the end of Fang Qi’s synchronization with her tremendous godly power!","When Fang Qi’s synchronization was over, he would be doomed!","“Do you have anything to say before you die?” As his enemy stood before him heroically with the godly sword raised high in the air, Fang Qi only pointed at the space behind her.","“What do you want to say?!”","[System Interface: Carrier Rock is activated.]","Then, Isabela saw another Kratos with the Blade of Olympus appearing behind her. He grabbed her wings and picked her up as if she was a small chick.","Then, he ripped her wings from her body again with vicious force.","She looked back and saw the previous Kratos getting up from the ground.","They walked toward her from back and front at the same time.","“Ah-! Ah-! Ah-!”","As if seeing a ghost, she screamed as horror devoured her like a flood!","As she was lifted, the Blade of Olympus pierced her chest!","“Ahhh-!”","She became silent.","At this moment, Mr. Fang sat heavily on the ground. “You’re finally dead this time?”","This forbidden move was an idea that he got at the last moment. If she could still live after this, Mr. Fang thought that he would die himself.","“It’s really difficult to slay gods...” He wiped the sweat off his forehead. Meanwhile, the Kratos summoned by the Carrier Rock looked around at the battleground indifferently and vanished as if he was saying, “How come the goddess died the moment I came out?!”","Meanwhile, in a valley full of flowers in the distant Heavenly Realm.","Deep and serene, this was the place where a god was born.","As the bell rang, a golden flame lit up in the god pool in the center of the valley. It was silent with no one in sight.","Miraculous golden liquid surged and moved around in the pool, looking like the womb of life.","Godly flames burned more and more aggressive until a flawless body was born in it...","With exquisite curves that were as beautiful as rolling hills, the body was as flawless as the most beautiful white jade.","As a goddess who was born before Heaven was formed, she had accumulated countless ways to resurrect herself in the endless years of her life. It was why her soul could be reborn in this place.","With extreme fatigue on her face, she fell back into the pool. She still mustered her last bit of godly power and looked toward the mortal world.","It was hard to describe her feelings after her first defeat in her life.","She saw Mr. Fang in Canglan City Shop with a pair of wings in his hands.","“Huh!? Sir, what are these?!” A group of elves walked up to watch, followed by a group of saint-level masters and knights.","“They are top quality ingredients. Everyone is tired after such a hard day. I’ll cook New Orleans Style Wings for you!”","Seeing this sight, Isabela’s vision darkened, and she passed out..."]},{"number":889,"title":"Chapter 889 - The Release of God of War 4... the God of War Is Old","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Hu...” He didn’t expect the so-called Valkyrie to be so tough to fight.","Lying on the bed in his room, Mr. Fang heaved a long sigh.","After all, he wasn’t Kratos, and the synchronization time had a limit. Besides, the synchronization rate wasn’t high, and the godly weapon was traded for one-time-use and thus couldn’t last the whole battle.","No one would see the difference if it was an instant kill. But the gap was obvious in extended battles like this one.","After all, Fang Qi had never seen the God of War so tired even when he killed all the Olympian gods.","Lying on the bed, Mr. Fang gazed at the snow-white ceiling with blank eyes. “System, even one deity is so powerful. What if a group of them came and caused trouble in the shop? I can run, but you... can’t get away so easily with the shop here...”","[The System is in the process of upgrading. Please don’t disturb...]","“Hey... System, aren’t you afraid that I’ll just leave you behind?!”","The System showed no response.","“...”","After a long while...","“F*cking...” He gave the System a middle finger and said, “I’ll go and cultivate!”","There were three factors to increasing the synchronization rate with a certain character. First, it was Fang Qi’s own cultivation strength. Second, it was his combat techniques. Third, it was the level of understanding that he had toward and the skills that he learned from the character.","Mr. Fang pulled himself together to begin his training.","...","Anyway, a great god-slaying battle finally came to an end.","The whole world seemed to be cheering and celebrating the victory that the God of War had against the powerful Valkyrie.","After the leaders of the Judgement Godly Palace were executed, the Judgement Godly Palace and Radiant Light Godly Nation still existed but were no different from being destroyed.","As the saying goes, a starving camel is still bigger than a horse.","The Judgement Godly Palace and Radiant Light Godly Nation were still huge in size, and no other forces intended to conquer them for the time being.","Besides, the descent of the Valkyrie was a warning to all mortals that the gods who were worshipped in this world really existed. This time, only one goddess descended, but no one could say if more and stronger gods would descend.","Perhaps because of this uneasiness, they admired Kratos, the God of War who had killed all the Olympian gods, even more.","Obviously, the number of God of War players experienced a tremendous growth.","...","In fact, Kratos, the God of War, was both a god and a mortal.","The players continued with their journey in God of War.","– In the Canglan City Shop –","The elves, knights, and other players stood behind the masters in the shop and watched them clear the last stage in God of War 3.","Standing on the top of Mount Olympus, Kratos faced the chaotic Heaven and Earth. The laws of nature were destroyed as the deities who ruled the world fell one by one.","Poseidon’s death caused huge tsunamis, turning the whole world into a great ocean.","The death of Helios, the God of Sun, plunged the world into darkness.","The death of Hades, the God of the Underworld, destroyed order in the Underworld and turned it into chaos...","As the deities who represented the laws of nature fell, the world was plunged into catastrophes, and it seemed like it was the end of the world.","The cost of killing gods was huge. Any rebellion came with blood-shed and sacrifice.","The fire of revenge spread all over the corrupted Mount Olympus and burned up the whole mortal world.","From Olympian gods to ancient Titans, each deity had given Kratos guidance. However, with each betrayal, Kratos didn’t know who his real enemy was. Athena was one example of his bewilderment.","She had broken the promise on behalf of Mount Olympus but returned from the Underworld after death and guided Kratos to complete the destruction of Olympus.","“You have done well, Kratos. Freed from the bondage of Olympus and cleansed in chaos. Mankind is now ready to hear my message.” The players stared at the screen and saw the Spirit of Athena standing behind Kratos.","Seeing the world which had been destroyed and almost returned to the chaos, Kratos said in fury, “Look around you, Athena. The world stands in ruin. What good is your message?!”","Having completed his revenge, he also saw the price of his revenge. However, Athena thought differently; she only wanted Kratos to return the power named ‘hope’ which had once been inside the Pandora’s Box.","She had once guided Kratos to find this power. But now, she intended to use this power to become the new ruler.","After the war, all humans including the Spartans, whom he had once led as the Ghost of Sparta and had protected after becoming the God of War, had vanished.","Looking into the distance, Kratos seemed to be gazing at that land with longing. In the past, he hadn’t been alone as he was now. He had led an army consisting of the fiercest warriors and grandest militants to travel through the mountains dressed in red battle armor.","Big golden shields and sharp spears reflected shiny lights under the sun.","Standing under an olive tree by the golden flax fields, the mother and daughter in white clothes were watching their husband and father go to the war.","They were Kratos’ wife and daughter.","Then, he seemed to see the playful little princess shaking off her mother’s hand. Then, she ran down the hill and through the troops that were ready to set off, coming to his side. As he lifted her high, she gave him the most beautiful smile in the whole world under the warm pale golden sunlight.","But now, she had been turned into pale ashes covering his body, a nightmare that he could never escape from!","On the road of revenge, he had served Olympian gods and became a chess piece of Titans. And now, he was only a chess piece in Athena’s hand.","The deities in this world were alike. After being betrayed several times, he understood that the deities were all selfish and greedy. He could do nothing and change nothing but seek revenge; he could never get rid of the nightmare that had tortured him for the second part of his life.","He didn’t want to be manipulated by anyone anymore.","Perhaps his life should end when he died for the first time, but deities had dragged him back from the Underworld. Now, no one could stop him from ending it all.","The audience watched as Kratos pieced himself with the Blade of Olympus!","The power of hope gushed out from his body and spread to every corner of this dark world. Instead of handing this power to Athena, he chose to give it to the humans who were in destruction.","Perhaps... these humans would enjoy a brand-new era after receiving this power.","They would create their own order, and they would enjoy freedom and a new civilization, controlling their own destiny.","As he came to the end of the road of revenge, he paid the price for destroying the world after killing the gods. Finally, humans were free from the rule of the gods.","Like war itself, Kratos, the God of War, brought endless catastrophes and destruction. But because of him, the world changed and was reborn.","This was the war that he represented.","And this God of War... died just like this!","At this moment, both the players who had come to this stage and the players who watched them play fell silent with complicated feelings including astonishment, admiration, and gratitude.","Perhaps they didn’t know how to express their feelings.","“But... the God of War is dead...? Then, how come there is God of War 4?” Seeing the new game ‘God of War 4′ that Mr. Fang wrote on the small blackboard, everyone felt puzzled.","At the end of the story, they saw only a puddle of blood left in the grand Olympus Palace, and Kratos had vanished.","Fate had arranged him to become a demon, but he retained a bit of conscience in him, which was why he had to continue to battle with furious roars even in the abyss of despair and pain. This was his destiny.","When the players turned on God of War 4 and looked at Kratos’ aged face after losing his godly power, they felt extremely sad.","Fate pulled Kratos back from the abyss of death again, because the war... was far from over.","After losing his godly power, the God of War became old. Seeing that the aged God of War had to return with his young son to the life of war he still couldn’t avoid despite his efforts all his life, the viewers hoped that he could get rid of his past nightmare and fight for a new hope.","The players in the shop prayed for Kratos silently."]},{"number":890,"title":"Chapter 890 - God of War 4, a New Game That Mr. Fang Has Never Played. the Livestream Begins!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Despite Mr. Fang’s claim that he would cook the Valkyrie’s wings, he couldn’t do it. After all, no one would dare to eat them even if he cooked them.","In the end, they were loaned to people to do research on them since Fang Qi had no use for them other than making them into roasted wings.","At this moment, the Magic Union led by Adolf, the Silver Moon Alchemy Union led by First Elder Hyru, and the Alchemist Union of which Grand Mage Merlin was a member, established a research team to study the wings of the Valkyrie from the Heavenly Realm.","Meanwhile, the Wuwei Daoist Alliance’s plan to explore the void had encountered a bottleneck, so they were happy to study the Valkyrie’s wings. If they could make them into a defensive spiritual treasure, they would probably be able to start the ascendance plan, let alone the void exploration plan.","“Um...” At this moment, Mr. Fang was participating in their discussion. Jun Yangzi of the Wuwei Daoist Alliance said, “The environment in the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness is not fitting for humans to live; we can start this... Heavenly Realm Exploration Plan first.”","“I think the mobile games project headed by Ms. Nalan can speed up. When it’s done, we can go to the Heavenly Realm and sell Ms. Nalan’s mobile games to test the market. Hehehe!”","Nodding, Mr. Fang glanced at the System Interface and saw the system task named ‘Acquire Many Energy Crystals’; it was only 20 percent completed despite the booming sales of the God of War series. There was still a long way from getting the ‘Mysterious gift bag of a mythological TV Series’. To complete the task, he couldn’t rely merely on selling games and gift bags in the shop.","Considering this, he must speed up the opening of branch shops. For example, he could open branch shops in Silver Moon Forest, the Orc Kingdom, and the Lianshan Principality at the West Continent.","Meanwhile, the few shops at the East Continent and the Continent of Immortal Relic with many factions were indeed not enough for the high demand.","As the owner of an internet café, he must do his best to bring the internet to everyone and connect the worlds, creating happiness with all his efforts.","...","In Mr. Fang’s shops, people were playing all kinds of games. But in the Canglan City Shop, the most popular games right now were World of Warcraft, League of Legends, and God of War.","Lately, the God of War series had been the most popular games among the players.","Some players, including the saint-level masters St. Leidon and Wilson, had finished the trilogy and began to play God of War 4.","Of course, some of the elves hadn’t even finished God of War 1, but they watched others play the game each day.","“The difficulty level of God of War 4 isn’t as high as the previous games, right?” After all, the riddle-solving and god-killing in the previous games were very difficult for most of the players even when they played the lowest difficulty level.","But now...","Elf Girl Sala whispered as she bought a bowl of instant noodles at the counter, “The God of War is now old and has less power than before. His opponents can’t be too powerful either.”","After all, Kratos can’t kill all the gods as he had done before. There aren’t any more gods for him to kill anyways, right?","“I agree,” Rowling said, “It must be easier for us to play the new game. Should we try it first?”","“By the way...” Assassin Elina who just entered the shop said, “The shop owner hasn’t done any livestreams lately!”","“Right! The shop owner hasn’t done livestream lately! Does he want to sell the games or not?!” After all, many people had bought games only after watching the shop owner’s livestreams.","But lately, he hadn’t done any livestreams!","At this moment, Mr. Fang had just returned from his meeting in the Wuwei Daoist Alliance. Glancing at the System Interface, he found the task named ‘Challenger’s Tutorial School’ had come close to the end after the release of God of War trilogy. The task was 90 percent completed, which meant that the combat techniques of most of the players in the shop had reached a high level.","He would soon receive the task reward.","At this moment, Mr. Fang saw someone sending him a message on the communication jade. It was from the elves in Canglan City Shop.","Sala asked, [Sir, 😡 how come you didn’t livestream lately?]","As an elf who watched the shop owner clear stage in each game, she was not pleased when the shop owner didn’t do any new livestreams.","[Sir, how come you didn’t livestream the new games?!] As an elder of the Liuyun Daoist Palace, Su Tianji gave a lecture to her disciples each month, so she spent most of her free time livestreaming. As a technical (idle) streamer, she learnt new skills by watching Mr. Fang’s livestream. But lately, she found that the scummy shop owner hadn’t done any livestreams lately.","[Livestream? I’ve been busy lately. I can’t do it!]","Damn it! It would be fine to livestream God of War 1-3, but how can I livestream when I never played God of War 4 before?!","He sounded impatient.","After all...","Before I traveled through space, there was only a trailer for this game. Now that the God of War has become an old man, and his weapon has changed from chain blades to an axe, it’s completely different from the previous games. How can I play it on the livestream?! Mr. Fang thought in frustration.","After all, the God of War who he had played as could kill dozens of gods all by himself.","Having graduated, Song Qingfeng and the other disciples got busy and had less time to play games.","Mr. Fang was also busy with making money, doing promotions, and cultivating, etc. The most important work was handling the troublemakers. This afternoon, he had to go and choose the locations for new shops.","With the expansion of the business, he had more things to do.","At this moment, Jiang Xiaoyue sent him a message, [╭ (′▽`)╭(′▽`)╯Another new game! Boss, how come you aren’t livestreaming?]","[Um... This... Ok.]","“Yeah!” Jiang Xiaoyue immediately sent a victory hand emoji.","In the new shop at the East Continent, Xiaoyue and her friends from Heavenly Faction sat down together and waited for the livestream to begin.","From God of War 1 to God of War 3, time passed from the summer to the winter.","Sitting behind the counter, Xiao Yulv sneezed and rubbed his hands. “Achoo-!”","It was snowing, and the street outside the shop had become white.","“What is it?” Pushing open the door, Nalan Mingxue pulled down the fluffy ferret fur hood and saw Mr. Fang standing at the entrance and scratching his head.","She also came from the Wuwei Daoist Alliance, right after Fang Qi.","“Nothing. I’m going to livestream now.” Mr. Fang opened the livestream platform with great familiarity and entered God of War 4.","Even if I’ve never played it before, today, I’ll show you how the God of War and his son bring the Norse into prominence on the livestream!"]},{"number":891,"title":"Chapter 891 - The Game Was Designed for Me to Show Off?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Huh?! The shop owner is finally doing a livestream?!”","“I only watch the shop owner’s livestream.”","“Grandpa, your favorite stream is finally back on!”","People sent all kinds of bullet comments of surprises and cheers onto the screen.","“Huh-!? This is good!” Su Tianji took a peek and saw that Mr. Fang was indeed doing a livestream. Immediately, she turned on QQ Livestream and began to watch with great enjoyment.","The players of the Canglan City Shop sat together as well. They had finished the previous games of Kratos killing Olympian gods. Hearing that Kratos went to a world called ‘Midgard’, they all stopped what they were doing and came to watch the livestream.","Not everyone had finished the first three games in the God of War series, and not everyone would buy the new God of War 4, but they all wanted to see what sparks this powerful man would make after killing all the Olympian gods.","The most important thing was...","“The shop owner is doing a livestream again! Isn’t it nice?!” In the Canglan City Shop, the elves were thrilled.","“It’s just the shop owner livestreaming...”","As the Queen of the Elf Clan, Kellybel didn’t think that the scummy shop owner had any advantages over her.","She watched the big screen and mumbled in contempt, “One day, I’ll make you guys eager to watch my livestream every day!”","But now...","“Let’s watch the shop owner’s livestream first!”","...","At this moment, Valkyrie Isabela had been lying in the golden pool for a long time.","After slowly opening her eyes, she was greeted by blinding sunshine. She tried to lift her hand to block the sunshine but found...","“??? My hand?!” She found her hand was trembling a bit and refusing to move.","She tried to move her feet and was horrified to find that...","“My feet...!?”","“My body?!” She suddenly found that her whole body had lost sensation, as if it wasn’t her body!","Then, she found that her godly soul, which had been damaged by the Blade of Olympus, was too weak to move her body. Lying in her birthplace in the Godly Realm and nurtured by the godly spring, she would need at least thousands of years to regain control of her body!","It meant...","“I...am paralyzed!?”","How can it be?! She almost went crazy when this fact hit her. She wanted to yell but couldn’t let out a sound. The undefeatable Valkyrie had been beaten into paralysis by someone in the mortal world?!","No! I must see what is happening to the bald guy who placed me into such a state!","She was so furious that she wanted to find the bald guy!","Her godly soul could no longer leave her body, but fortunately, she still had a little godly power left. Therefore, she cast a peeking and eavesdropping spell.","“Livestream...?” A pair of invisible eyes followed some elves as the latter entered the shop.","“Hiss...” She saw a large group of people sitting on couches in a circle while messages jumping out on the screen. Her instinct told her that she had discovered a huge secret of the mortal world!","This secret seems to involve the background of this God of War. It seemed like they are now in the place named ‘Midgard’?","She memorized the name of this location and then began to watch the livestream in high spirits while lying in the pool, paralyzed.","...","At this moment, all the players were watching the livestream.","On the big screen was the brawny God of War who had a thick beard. Fatigue was obvious in his deep-set eyes.","His clothes were worn, and his hands were holding an old ax that looked dirty as if he had just finished some chores.","On his belly was the long scar left by the Blade of Olympus that once pierced him.","This was the current God of War.","“What difficulty level should I choose...? The game even has four levels?” Mr. Fang was in the last step of choosing the difficulty level. On the livestream, he murmured to himself, “Give Me a Story; Give Me a Balanced Experience; Give Me a Challenge; and the highest difficulty level, Give Me God of War.","“There’s no need to consider! Of course, I’ll choose...”","Immediately, Mr. Fang clicked on the blood-red words – [Give Me God of War!]","“The shop owner is indeed an excellent player!” Elf Girl Sala had a good appetite while she watched the livestream. She immediately ate a spicy stick.","“What kind of fancy plays will he show us this time?!” Su Tianji sat in the shop and watched it attentively.","“I’ll learn some profound and complex skills from the shop owner to attract my little elves!” Elf Queen Kellybel had come to the shop in her free time and was watching it, engrossed. As an elf queen, she was distressed that no one showed respect to her when she disguised her identity as the queen.","At this moment, Kratos suddenly became animated on the screen.","People seemed to see the previous God of War in him, but he looked as if he had cut out his past from his life. Like a hunter living in the depths of the mountains, he lifted his ax and hacked at the white birch tree before him strike by strike.","He roared as he hacked as if he was using all his strength to cut down the thick white birch. He looked like a hero who had grown old.","Watching this scene, the players understood that the powerful Kratos, the God of War, was indeed old now.","This was Midgard, one of the nine realms in Norse mythology.","Different from the previous games, at the beginning of God of War 4, Kratos didn’t harbor bone-deep hatred due to the betrayal of the gods. Many years after his battles with the Olympian gods, he had come out of the previous nightmarish world and was living a new life with his son. He was no longer alone.","The man before the players was no longer the God of War but a father who lived with his son in the snow forest. It was a nice and heart-warming scene.","“Ya... Did Kratos’ new wife die as well? He’s cutting wood to cremate her body and bury her?”","“These two guys... the man and the boy don’t know how to communicate with each other. Their conversations are so dry.” Mr. Fang watched the cinematics and commented, “But it’s understandable. He had never had a son before, and his daughter died a long time ago.”","“Is he going to teach his son how to hunt?” When it came to this part, Mr. Fang was eager to try. “I’m good at this...?”","He had been uncertain about the game since the main character was the previous God of War, and there was a new legend. He was afraid there might be some monsters that he couldn’t defeat. He was familiar with all the previous games, but the newly released God of War 4 was a game that he had never played before.","Hearing that they were going to go hunting, he relaxed a bit.","He was surprised that as he taught the son how to hunt, a draugr dashed out from the forest!","“It’s a random enemy, but I can easily handle a group of such low-level draugrs.” Mr. Fang raised his ax. “I think I’m supposed to show off my skills in front of my son. I’ll go and have a try.”","“Huh?! That’s good!” the elves said immediately.","This difficulty level was obviously acceptable to them."]},{"number":892,"title":"Chapter 892 - Wildly Testing on the Verge of Failure","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Let’s read the story. I guess... Kratos, a powerful father, wants to make sure that his son can pass a future challenge. He will try to protect his son by training him.” While he explained, Mr. Fang bent down and moved toward the draugr with the ax in his hand.","“I think we should teach the son some advanced battle skills even though we’re facing the comparatively... weak draugr. We can use some advanced battle concepts to nurture this future flower of the Godly Realm.”","[The shop owner is going to make another kill without receiving any damage!?] The elves sent bullet comments while they watched the livestream.","[Hey, the guy who commented earlier, a kill without being injured is not good enough. I’m sure that he will show some new battle skills, the ones with very high difficulty level!]","[Didn’t you hear shop owner say that he will teach battle concepts this time?]","“So many people are watching him teach his son!?” At this moment, the Valkyrie lay in the pool and mumbled, “I must know my enemy to defeat him. I’ll watch how this guy teaches his son. After studying him thoroughly, I can challenge him again!”","Then, she remembered that she was paralyzed...","While gritting her teeth, she thought, It doesn’t matter. After watching him for thousands of years, I’ll know everything about him and will surely defeat him!","At this thought, she continued to watch with great concentration.","She saw a small window at the bottom of the screen, and the weak-looking shop owner would show his face in the window occasionally. She didn’t understand what it meant for now, but it didn’t affect her from watching the livestream.","At this moment, Mr. Fang said, “Now, I’ll show you a very advanced battle concept. It’s very useful and can be used in any battle. It’s called ‘among the combat techniques in the world, the fastest speed trumps all.’”","He controlled Kratos, the God of War. “If I attack fast enough, the enemy’s attacks can’t hit me.”","His ax hacked down with great swiftness.","But almost at the same time, the draugr launched an extremely swift sword slash!","Two streaks of blood shot up almost at the same time!","They both stumbled. Then, the draugr hacked again!","With cold sweat on his forehead, Mr. Fang rolled on the ground and narrowly dodged the slash!","“Do you see what happens when your attacks are not fast enough?”","“The consequences are so severe when this move fails!?” The elves stared at the screen intently. “Is the shop owner going to teach us some super difficult skills?”","Huh!? Didn’t the shop owner say he will teach us that ‘among the combat techniques in the world, the fastest speed trumps all’? Elf Queen Kellybel stared at the big screen suspiciously. How come he changed his mind at the last second?","She seemed to sense something unusual.","Standing behind Mr. Fang and watching him play, Nalan Mingxue had a sly look in her eyes as she covered her mouth while her shoulders shook uncontrollably.","With a dark expression, Mr. Fang thought, How come a small monster in God of War 4 is so difficult to fight?!","After all, when he played the first three games in God of War series, he had killed monsters as if he was cutting grass and killed gods like killing chickens. It had been a very magnificent experience.","Although the system version of God of War 4 didn’t have specific stats on health, the HP percentage on the bottom of the screen was a good reference. Right now, the HP bar had lost half of the length!","In other words... I will be killed by a small monster with two to three strikes?!","It must be noted that the game had just begun, and this stage was equivalent to a tutorial.","This game is purposefully trying to make me fail!","“It seems like the God of War is indeed old; he can’t even match the speed of a small monster now,” Mr. Fang explained as he snuck up with his ax. “Let’s change strategy and teach the son...”","[Sir, aren’t you going to teach ‘The fastest speed trumps all’? Didn’t you say that it applies to any battle?!]","“...I’ll teach it later!” Glancing at the bullet comment, Mr. Fang’s face turned darker as he thought, I didn’t know that the God of War is old, and his combat strength dropped so much. I haven’t played it before!","This is trying to make me look back! Who sent it?!","Glancing around and not able to find the sender, he finally returned his attention back to the monster before him.","“I realized that the concept ‘among the combat techniques in the world, the fastest speed trumps all’ is too profound and complex for this type of small monsters. Besides, I think our old God of War’s son won’t understand such profound and complex stuff. Let’s start from the simple skills.","“This skill can be used in any battles too. It’s called capitalizing on the enemy’s recovery after attacking!” Mr. Fang controlled Kratos to move forward a few steps and then sidestepped when he was almost within the draugr’s attack range, dodging the latter’s attack perfectly. When this attack of his enemy was about to stop, Mr. Fang struck forward with his ax with force!","“Then, I’ll use the wild-hacking axe technique, severely injuring the monster!” Mr. Fang yelled and brandished his ax as if he had gone mad!","The audience watched as Mr. Fang controlled Kratos to send the monster flying with a series of wild strikes.","“Awesome!”","“But, Sir...” Puzzled, a few saint-level masters sent bullet comments, “We know this move already.”","“Of course, you know it!” Mr. Fang said immediately, “Kratos is teaching his son; how can he teach his son the skills that even you guys can’t do?!”","“Oh...” The words sounded weird to their ears.","“He’s right... he’s teaching his son. What are you mortals doing here!?” At this moment, the paralyzed Valkyrie Isabela agreed while lying in the pool. She knew it was easy to make a successful hit at the end of the enemy’s attack, but this man’s easy and simple explanation made her think higher of him.","At least she instantly understood it after the explanation!","At this moment, the monster got up from the ground silently.","A sharp blade slashed at him from behind!","“Sir, be careful!”","The audience had always felt relaxed and cheerful when they watched the shop owner’s livestream. But this time, they felt uneasy and fearful.","Mr. Fang pretended that he had seen the attack when he didn’t. In fact, he dodged it with a flinch of his head in fear, and he shouted, “Wild-hacking ax technique! Wild-hacking ax technique! Wild...”","While carefully dodging the attacks, he finally killed the monster with about 20 wild ax strikes.","Exhaling in relief, he said to Kratos’ son, Atreus, “Do you understand this, boy!?”","“Of course, he understands it! You explained so clearly.” Lying in the pool, Valkyrie Isabela mumbled to herself.","She continued to watch, wondering if this person would explain some more advanced skills.","At this moment, Mr. Fang said smugly, “See? With my method, except for the injuries that I got when I demonstrated the disadvantage of that skill, I received no injuries!”","Although he had never played this game before, he had years of experience in playing games and fighting battles. “It’s a piece of cake for me!”","“To tell you the truth, I didn’t use my full strength yet!”","The moment he said that, Kratos’ son, Atreus, pointed behind him and yelled, “Father! There are more!”","“More?!” Another draugr? Mr. Fang was delighted inside. Now, it’s time for me to get serious!","This time, I’ll receive no injuries and thus redeem my reputation!","He looked back and saw groups of revenants howling and walking out of the forest.","“...”"]},{"number":893,"title":"Chapter 893 - Sir, Didn’t You Say You’d Stop the Livestream at Noon?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“I must tell you that I can only livestream until noon; I have things to do this afternoon,” Mr. Fang said as he controlled Kratos to dodge attacks.","It was indeed dangerous. Even the small monsters were so hard to fight, and he wished that he could finish the livestream immediately. It was hard to continue the game, and he had to explain to these people while he played it.","Of course, Mr. Fang was a professional and had the basic abilities even though he only livestreamed in his free time. He continued to explain, “It seems like Kratos lost his memories and much of his strength...”","“So, we can’t expect him to unleash his previous godly power and use his old ultimate moves.”","[There are no moves such as Poseidon’s Rage in God of War 4!?] Obviously, many players were still impressed by the powerful spells shown in the previous God of War games.","[Sir, can we use the Blades of Chaos in this game?] The saint-level players such as Elf Queen Kellybel still had fresh memories of the main weapons in the God of War trilogy. Some warriors and knights even created mimics of the two chain blades in real life. The saint-level players were very proficient with these weapons.","Missing the Blades of Chaos from the previous games, more people sent bullet comments, asking the same question.","“Um...” Mr. Fang explained as he battled the monster, “I don’t think so. After all, the chain blades came from Ares, the previous God of War. They had been burning Kratos and represented the slavery and bondage under the Olympian gods. I think it’s time for him to say farewell to his past.”","[Sir, you don’t know it either? You sound so uncertain!] Su Tianji asked immediately.","In the past, the shop owner knew everything about the games and had been just reluctant to tell them. However, this time, he sounded very uncertain.","Of course, Mr. Fang couldn’t tell them that he had played all the previous games but had only watched this game’s trailer.","Now playing this damn God of War 4 on livestream, he felt as if he was walking on thin ice, almost failing before he could get out of the tutorial. He seemed to have sensed a malicious intent in this game.","He even suspected that he had played the fake God of War games before. Compared with the three previous games, God of War 4 had a totally different gaming experience.","...","“Father, behind you!” Another draugr got up from the ground and hacked at him with great speed!","“Dodge!” Fang Qi kept his vital body parts safe at the last moment as the rusty blade left a shallow blood line on his body. “There are too many of them, and I’d better get out of the siege and throw the ax at them!”","In God of War 4, Kratos could throw his ax and summon it back at will.","But Fang Qi obviously didn’t find it easy since he had to divert some of his attention to do explanations while battling.","“Auch!” Everyone saw Mr. Fang receiving several wounds in this messy group battle, and his HP bar was almost at the bottom!","“Left!” Although Atreus couldn’t enter the fray, he had been warning Kratos of the dangers coming from the blind spots. The moment that Fang Qi retreated, several draugr followed him.","Having fought for a long while with the draugr, Fang Qi found that they were not fragile skeletons. Their forms and combat techniques showed that they had experienced countless battles before they died. Even now, they maintained a good level of combat strength!","Comparatively, they were more like...","“Corpse ghosts?”","“So many?!”","If he was playing God of War 1, a Poseidon’s Rage would clear them all. Even if he couldn’t cast Poseidon’s Rage at the beginning of the game, he could knock down a group of them with chain blades.","But now, the old God of War couldn’t kill one small monster without being hit. Clearly, he couldn’t stay unrivaled.","“I feel like I’ll going to fail...” Mr. Fang’s heart sank.","At this moment, all the players had their hearts in their throats as they watched the livestream.","“How can it be...”","“It feels like the shop owner is at a disadvantage fighting the small monsters...”","“What’s happening?” Not only the players in the new shops, but the veteran players were stupefied by the scene.","“What’s wrong with today’s livestream...!?” Su Tianji said, “It seems like the shop owner is not himself today?”","“Huh-!?” In the Heavenly Realm, Valkyrie Isabela watched the scene in puzzlement.","When Atreus warned Kratos of the left side, Fang Qi turned his head and felt a gust of wind sweeping at his face. Subconsciously, he blocked the attack with his left arm.","With a crisp metal-colliding noise, a round shield suddenly sprung out from his gauntlet. Fang Qi had expected his left arm to be wounded with this block, but the round shield blocked this attack!","Holding the Leviathan Axe in his right hand, Kratos had a strange gauntlet on his left arm. Different from most other gauntlets, it concealed extremely hard fan blades that were unnoticeable but could form a middle-sized round shield when they spread out.","However, he was still caught off guard, and he was forced to take two steps back by the huge force from the strike.","At this moment, several draugr took the opportunity to charge at him.","“He’s in danger...” the viewers in the shops yelled in low voices.","“He doesn’t know how to use this weapon?” Valkyrie Isabela squinted her eyes and seemed to see the problem. “What’s wrong... it seems like he’s even weaker than me?!”","If it was her, even if she didn’t have enough strength, she could kill these draugr at the price of a few wounds.","“I have a shield on this arm?” At this moment, Fang Qi blocked again with the shield on his left arm subconsciously.","Ting! The block was done in a hurry. Even if he successfully blocked the attack, he would fall and be surrounded by his enemies.","But everyone saw that Fang Qi’s shield had a subtle force that deflected the attack force perfectly. The shield even pushed back, forcing the two monsters to lose balance and lean back!","“It was a hasty move, but it bounced back the attacks so smoothly?!” At this moment, Valkyrie Isabela in the distant Heavenly Realm stared at the screen of the livestream intently. “What combat technique is this?!”","Obviously, she realized that this wasn’t a force or a magic spell but a powerful combat technique!","“Pa... parry!?” Everyone stared at the sight with widened eyes.","“He even... used parry in God of War?!”","Immediately, Fang Qi controlled Kratos to throw out his axe, sending a monster flying with one strike.","With good control of his force, he could strike several times with his axe when the enemies were in mid-air before. But this time, due to the hasty parry, he sent the draugr too far away for him to continue the attack.","Without thinking, he threw out the Leviathan Axe and then slashed his shield at another draugr’s head.","At this moment, bullet comments flooded the screen.","[Amazing!]","[Look at that monster!]","“Parry with heavy strike and flying axe; he pinned a monster onto the mountain wall with. Instant kill?!”","“Awesome!”","“F*ck?! Awesome play!”","“What?!” Valkyrie Isabela watched the livestream in a daze, stunned by the sight of the corpse being pinned to the mountain side.","She had sensed how thick-skinned the monster was, but now...","It felt as if a different player was playing the game!","...","This game was different from the previous games in God of War series. Previously, Kratos, the God of War, had advanced with great fortitude and godly power. But now, his strength was much weaker than before.","In the current situation, it was impossible to sweep across the battlefield with magic spells or powerful strength.","Different from the previous games which featured on the mastery of strength, the system version of God of War 4 focused on combat techniques.","After fighting for most of his life, the old God of War had a lot of battle experience!","I seem to have some ideas about how to play the game... Suddenly, understanding dawned on Mr. Fang.","Combining his previous battle method and the new combat techniques, he seemed to create a completely new battle system.","Ting! With a loud vibration noise, Fang Qi found the perfect angle and used one draugr to block the other draugr who were attacking from the sides, creating a temporary one vs one situation. Meanwhile, the shield on his left arm moved nimbly and blocked the monster’s sword before slanting and striking forward sideways. Then, he struck down his heavy axe, sending the monster flying. Immediately, he threw out the Leviathan Axe. These moves finished in one breath with great smoothness!","I know how to play this game...!","...","[Sir, didn’t you say you’d stop the livestream at noon?] someone asked in the bullet comment.","“Huh? What did you say?” Mr. Fang tried to pin monsters to walls several times but failed. Then, he turned back to find small monster to practice the pinning technique.","“Hiss... this monster is so big; can it be pinned onto the wall!?”","“Ahh-!” A scream sounded.","“Huh...?” The viewers exchanged a look."]},{"number":894,"title":"Chapter 894 - The Ultimate Duel of Power and Technique at the Top Level in the Mythological World","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Today, I’ll teach you the new parry skill and how to kill small monsters quickly.” Mr. Fang had almost failed despite his best efforts, so he had to talk and explain his way out of embarrassing situations. But now, he regained his confidence.","The legendary Leviathan Axe was forged by the famous Huldra Brothers, Sindri, and Brok, who were dwarfs and weapon masters in Norse Mythology. Unsatisfied with the unwise use of the weapons and godly artifacts that they had created for the Aesir God Clan, which included figures such as Odin and Thor in Norse mythology, the two weapon masters decided to make the Leviathan Ace to balance the powers in the world of the Norse Mythology.","Obviously, the Leviathan Axe wasn’t an ordinary battle axe, and it had its own unique way of being used and combat techniques.","If the players could use it well, they would learn many advanced combat techniques from it and use much more power than the people who did nothing but slash and hack with it.","The players in the East Continent and the Continent of Immortal Relic had learned how to control their weapons from the Legend of Sword and Fairy and the Wind and Cloud. However, the players in the West Continent found it difficult to control their swords since their weapons were mostly heavy and big, and it was hard to change their long-standing habits.","But now, from God of War, they discovered a whole set of skills from parry to ranged and melee attacks.","“I never knew these moves!” Valkyrie Isabela lay in the pool and did the moves in her mind. “Parry! Flying Leviathan Axe!”","“Hehehehe... in a few thousand years, I will learn all this stuff, and my power will improve greatly!”","This so-called livestream is indeed enjoyable!","Of course, she could do nothing but watch the livestream right now.","...","After they returned from hunting, they entered the main storyline of God of War 4.","The story of God of War 4 evolved around the Ragnarok in Norse Mythology.","At this time, the Norse world was in chaos as Ragnarok was coming; everything was desolate.","Strange phenomena appeared in the nine realms, and more and more creatures were turned into things like zombies by erosion. Powerful god tribes remained safe but obviously had sensed the bad signs.","Hearing the word ‘Ragnarok’, people would think of the Olympian gods who were all wiped out and wonder if the bald man would kill the Norse gods during Ragnarok. But obviously, it was not possible.","[TL Note: Ragnarok’s Chinese Translation means the dusk of gods.]","After his failed suicide attempt, Kratos drifted to Midgard and became a hermit. He married a woman and had a son.","The last wish of his wife before she died was for her ashes to be spread at the highest peak of the nine realms.","In God of War 4, the players found that Kratos had withdrawn the fierceness from his eyes and had learned to control his emotions.","Right now, Kratos was only a husband who wanted to fulfill his wife’s last wish and a father who protected his son as the latter grew. He was no longer the God of War who had killed all the gods of the Greek Pantheon.","However, things didn’t go as Kratos wished. As they returned to their home, Fang Qi and the viewers heard booming noises like muffled thunder and then a series of heavy knocking on the door.","With an ominous feeling, Kratos immediately motioned for his son to hide. Then, he opened the door and saw a stranger who was as thin as a rod and covered in tattoos of Norse runes.","The runes looked like those worshipped as gods by primitive people in the ancient times. They seemed to contain endless power and extremely mysterious laws of nature.","Obviously, Kratos didn’t know him, but the visitor sounded provocative.","“You do not want this fight,” Kratos said coldly with threatening eyes.","But the stranger ignored it and said with even more provocation, “Oh... I’m pretty sure I do.”","Then, he punched Kratos in the face!","“F*ck?!”","“My goodness?!”","“This guy is so bold?!”","The viewers froze in shock. After all, even the Olympian gods didn’t dare to fight Kratos head-on, but this person looked as if he wanted Kratos to kill him.","If it was in the past, Kratos would have attacked him. But at this moment, Kratos suppressed his fury and said, “Leave... my... home.”","“You are going to have to kill me for that to happen.” The stranger threw three punches at Kratos face!","Not able to endure any longer, Kratos knocked the stranger to the ground with a punch. He was about to punch again when the stranger got up and hook punched Kratos’ chin, sending the latter flying for over 30 meters.","“How incredibly disappointing.” The man stretched his neck and remained intact after receiving a heavy punch from Kratos, and he said, “Come on then!”","“This guy...!?” The saint-level masters, as well as the elves and knights who had played the God of War trilogy, stared at the scene with widened eyes!","This guys dares to taunt Kratos like this!?","“Who is this guy-!?” At this moment, the Valkyrie who was sitting in the pool also froze at the scene. After all, she had first-hand experience of Kratos’ great power. Otherwise, she wouldn’t be lying here.","Even though Kratos’ strength was much weaker than before, he was still an extremely powerful master. It was obvious that his combat techniques were even better than before!","But this stranger wasn’t beaten to death after taunting Kratos like this. Besides, he even looked as if he had no interest to block Kratos’ strikes with the Leviathan Axe!","“This guy looks very powerful, totally different from the small monsters before now.” Mr. Fang said as he controlled Kratos to attack, “But it’s simple to fight him while he taunts me and doesn’t care to dodge. I wonder how berserk he will get later.”","“But we must be aware of his potential sudden attacks!” The moment Mr. Fang said that, his opponent punched abruptly.","Subconsciously, Fang Qi lifted the shield – parry!","As everyone knew, ever since Dark Souls, almost all opponents couldn’t block the sudden repulsive force from being parried, and they would be shocked into numbness by it.","But this guy used the force from the parry to float back as lightly as a leaf in wind. While turning in mid-air, he deflected all the forces perfectly with spinning.","Swiftly, he punched again as if he just teleported!","“He deflected it-!?” Everyone including Valkyrie looked at the scene in astonishment. After all, the parry was very difficult to use, and the parry in the system version of the games was launched in a very ingenious way, which made it almost impossible to counter!","But the parry which is supposed to be impossible to deflect got deflected with ease!?","Valkyrie Isabela screamed silently because Kratos didn’t even use this complex skill in the battle with her!","Mr. Fang practiced it the whole morning on the livestream and was more familiar with this game now.","Almost at the same time when his opponent attacked, he thrust out his shield at an angle – parry!","This time, his opponent couldn’t deflect it with ease and was sent flying backward by the shield, knocking down two white birch trees as he flew. In the very second when he lost his balance, Fang Qi took the chance and controlled Kratos to throw out the fatal flying Leviathan Axe!","Boom! Boom! Boom!","The godly weapon, Leviathan Axe, couldn’t hack open the stranger’s body, but the whole mountain was shattered by this crash.","However, in the next moment, a figure shot out like a cannonball and threw another punch!","Parry!","When his opponent struck onto the thick shield, Fang Qi felt the shield sink a little as the runes on his opponent’s body lit up in bright blue lights. The huge godly force wasn’t parried. Instead, the parry was suppressed by the great force in the fist!","“This-!?”","At this moment, everyone was enthralled by this battle as they watched it without blinking, finally understanding that the difficulty level ‘Give Me God of War’ meant your enemies were all as powerful as the God of War!","The ultimate duel of power and technique between two figures who stood at the top level in the mythological world was about to happen."]},{"number":895,"title":"Chapter 895 - Learning New Godly Technique from Mr. Fang – Strong Locking Man!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Haya-!” After a series of heavy punches, the stranger picked up Kratos by his legs and swung him out.","No one had seen Kratos be beaten so harshly.","The stranger even pushed Kratos into the house and crashed into it.","“Why are there two beds in there?” The stranger’s mocking tone turned cold as if he had found a clue about the things that he had been looking for.","“Kratos seems to be protecting his son?” Fang Qi had felt that Kratos was too weak for this powerful enemy. But at this moment, he felt a force erupting from the depths of his body.","“I’ll kill the guy first!” Fang Qi had no time to talk during the battle. While turning, he used the momentum to knock his opponent to the ground and then smashed him down from the second floor with a double heavy punch.","But his enemy got up from the ground faster than Kratos. The stranger grabbed Kratos and body-slammed him before kicking him out for dozens of meters like a ball, knocking down countless trees and even half of the mountain!","It must be noted that this was a mountain in the mythical world, and gods lived on it. It wasn’t as fragile as the mountains in the later ages.","“F*ck-!?” At this moment, even Mr. Fang felt dizzy as he got hit. Most importantly, this was a fixed plot event, which meant that Kratos being kicked away for dozens of meters wasn’t a part of his gameplay!","“Slow and old. You should never have come to Midgard.” After the kick, the stranger taunted Kratos. “You won’t talk? Fine. Maybe whoever it is you’ve got stashed in that house will.”","Most importantly, the stranger had received few injuries, and they had all healed by now.","“How come this guy is so strong?!”","“It’s blatant provocation...” St. Wilson and the other saint-level masters murmured.","“It’s horrifying... it’s our first time seeing Kratos getting beat,” Kellybel gasped.","“Is this the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness?! How come these guys are more powerful than the one before?!” Valkyrie Isabela wondered where Midgard ?!","Perhaps...","She had the feeling that Midgard wasn’t in the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness or even... in this world at all!","Suddenly, she wondered if she should learn from the Norse?!","Instantly, she liked this thought a lot since people in this place could even beat Kratos who had defeated her!","When I recover, I’ll change my name to No.1 Valkyrie of the Norse!","This Norse Mythology is indeed powerful!","...","“I’m afraid that he is the first challenger who punched Kratos’ face into a bloody mess instead of being killed by him,” Mr. Fang said.","More importantly, the stranger was so reckless that he even threatened Kratos with the latter’s son as if he wished that Kratos could kill him.","“I feel like the rage in Kratos’ body is about to bust.”","“Here’s Spartan Rage!”","Hellish blazing flames burned around Kratos. The battle in the mountains was lightning fast; the challenger was swift, but Kratos was even faster. The battle axe wasn’t Fang Qi’s strong suit, but he excelled in fist techniques.","When the rage dispersed, Kratos had healed all his injuries. After a series of vicious punches, he picked up a small hill and smashed it down toward his opponent!","Boom!","The moment it crashed down, the mountain cracked, and the forest was turned into a valley!","The viewers seemed to be watching God of War 4, the movie! It was fascinating and stunning!","[I’m watching a mythical anime on the big screen?!] Song Qingfeng, who usually watched Naruto and Re: Zero – Starting Life from Another World on his communication jade, sent a bullet comment.","[Yes. It’s a half-year-long anime show.] Obviously, many people in the shop watched anime. [It seems like the shop owner can’t finish the battle in half a year.]","[He might not be able to finish it in his lifetime 😏]","At this moment, exclamations rose in the shop as the ground shook, and the hill suppressing the stranger slowly rose.","Then, the stranger lifted the huge hill-like boulder and threw it out with force.","The shield sprung out from Fang Qi’s arm! Activate!","An exquisite shock force on the shield combined with an aggressive force. The viewers watched as Kratos lifted his shield and shattered the hill-like huge boulder!","“He’s still alive?!” Mr. Fang was stunned as well. After all, it was the beginning of the game!","Kratos had battled with this boss for almost two hours!","“This son of a b*tch is as hard to battle as that silly-bird Valkyrie?!” Mr. Fang was stupefied.","“Ya-! He mentioned me! He mentioned me!” Watching the livestream in the pool, Valkyrie Isabela was excited when she heard her title, but then her face darkened as she understood his words. “Who is a silly bird!?”","“Should I get the Blade of Olympus to kill this guy?! A killing demanded by the plot?” Of course, Mr. Fang didn’t know that even the Blade of Olympus would afflict zero damage on this stranger.","“How can he kill this guy?!” The viewers couldn’t help but worry for Kratos.","“So strong!”","Kratos had killed many gods on Mount Olympus, but in this game, he encountered such a horrifying opponent even before he could walk out of his door.","“But I feel like he hasn’t grown much stronger.” Fang Qi controlled Kratos and said, “Let’s give him another combo!”","“Parry!” Mr. Fang said as he controlled Kratos, “His attacks are not hard to handle, but his punches are extremely fast, so we must have quick reflexes to parry. But I’ve gradually gotten used to his speed.”","“When I get proficient with the axe, you can’t get up again!”","Fang Qi became even more skillful with the battle axe.","“Heavy strike!”","“Ducked it?!” Almost like a reflex, Fang Qi launched a parry.","Then, the battle axe hacked down viciously!","On the screen, Kratos picked up his enemy by the legs and swung him out!","Then, he locked his arms around the enemy’s throat and pressed the latter down to the ground.","He lay down as well and tightly squeezed his thick arms around his opponent’s neck from behind.","Regardless of how this stranger struggled, he couldn’t get up.","At last, Kratos twisted the elbow of his left arm with force!","Crack!","The whole world turned quiet.","The viewers could only hear the whistling of the north winds and Kratos’ heavy panting.","-At this moment-","“Is he really dead...!?” The audience felt suspicious.","After all, the stranger had remained alive after being smashed so viciously.","“Nonsense. This guy is indeed strong, but I killed him with Strong Locking Man.” Mr. Fang got up, panting breathlessly. “He’s definitely dead!”","[TL Note: Strong Locking Man is a meme in China where a guy wraps his arm around another guy.]","“Strong Locking Man?!”","“Is this the new skill to kill gods?!” The elves stared at the screen with widened eyes. This powerful stranger must be a god!","This so-called Strong Locking Man even took the life of this unkillable god?!","“What new combat technique is this?!” Seeing the new skill, Valkyrie Isabela was surprised. Is there a way to kill enemies who are unkillable with only techniques?","There is such a powerful technique?!","She continued to watch intently and simulated the move in her mind.","It seems like... holding the enemy and body slamming him to the ground before holding him from behind... and...","“Strong Locking Man...?”","This god-killing technique looks easy to use!","She could only watch the parry but couldn’t practice it, which made it difficult for her to learn it. But this one...","“Ay-!” Her eyes lit up as she realized that she could learn this!"]},{"number":896,"title":"Chapter 896 - The God of War and His Illiterate and Humiliating Old Father Who Has No Sense of Direction","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“But... What miraculous skill is involved in this Strong Locking Man? How can it kill gods?” Valkyrie Isabela stared at the scene suspiciously, feeling like something wasn’t right.","The strange god didn’t get up again from the valley after dying. Even if he wasn’t dead, he was severely wounded by this combat technique.","As Valkyrie Isabela mused over this, Kratos in the game walked back exhausted with blood all over him. He even dropped to the snow on the ground due to exhaustion.","Only after a long time did his injuries healed. Obviously, they couldn’t stay here anymore.","Following his wife’s last wish, Kratos took his son and his wife’s ashes, embarking on the journey to the highest peak of the nine realms.","He probably knew what dangers were hiding on the journey; they might be related to an ancient prophecy, and his son might not be ready to face the era mentioned in the prophecy. However, they must embark on the journey since that strange god might resurrect at any moment.","Walking out of the house, they saw that the terrain around them had experienced great changes due to the battle. The forest had turned into a valley, and mountains were razed to the ground.","In the distance were endless rolling mountains with white snow on the peaks and huge forests at the foot. No one knew how many miraculous creatures of the mythological era were hiding in there or how many top-tier gods lived in the mountains.","Their destination was the grandest and highest mountain peak in the mythological era in the farthest part of this mountain range.","The journey wouldn’t be easy. Just the draugr hiding in the forest were hard to handle, let alone other things.","In this era, everything except the powerful gods had turned into such monsters.","Of course, there were benefits in such a situation. When the countless creatures in this corrupted world were turned into draugr, their fortunes had become ownerless.","In this world of the mythological era, there were many awe-inspiring powerful objects. At this moment, Mr. Fang controlled Kratos to dig out a simple-looking rune from a broken chest in the roadside ruins.","The players had witnessed the power of runewords in Diablo 2. In God of War 4, there were also runestones with ancient runes engraved on them.","But different from Diablo 2, this runestone looked simpler and more ancient. According to legends, these letters were the runes created by the Allfather Odin in Norse mythology. They represented the laws of nature of the ancient times, and each letter contained magic power. With good combinations, they could produce miracles. It was probably the original form of magic spells.","“With this rune attached to the axe, it can unleash magic power?” Mr. Fang immediately picked up the battle axe and tried it on.","When he lifted his battle axe, a powerful magic force swept around instantly!","“Wow-!” The mages and alchemists stared at this scene with widened eyes. “This simple letter has such a great power?!”","Besides, the rune had its own power and didn’t consume magic energy!","“Father, here! The mountain is over there! Let’s go!”","As time went on, Mr. Fang practiced his combat techniques and explained them to the viewers on the livestream. Although it was the highest difficulty level, he managed it...","“Thank god that I didn’t fail!” Mr. Fang wiped the non-existent sweat from his face and walked toward the direction Atreus pointed. “This is good! It seems like our son is our guide. We don’t have to consult maps in the game.”","Mr. Fang immediately controlled Kratos to follow his son, Atreus. “Hiss... the creators of the game are very nice!”","Despite the malice that he had felt during the previous battle with the monsters, Mr. Fang now sensed the warmth and consideration of the creators of the game which was different from the lousy games that were full of schemes and didn’t even provide a map.","“This game is totally different from the previous ones. Haha!” By now, Mr. Fang had returned from hunting with Atreus. In God of War 4, Kratos didn’t have godly power, but he had a son who knew the way and warned him of monsters behind him. Kratos could even order his son to join the fight by launching ranged attacks with arrows.","Despite the powerful monsters which had tortured Mr. Fang and almost defeated him at the beginning of the game, the gaming experience right now was much better.","As they walked through the broken cliffs in the mountains, they could see the ruins of this era everywhere. Countless monsters and draugr, collapsed godly palaces, strange wild beasts that they had never seen before... and stone tablets with runes were scattered across the environment.","“Sir... there are many runes!”","“Can we take them?”","Having seen the great power of the rune, Sala and the other elves were excited at the sight of so many runes here.","“It can’t be so easy!” Beside them, St. Hematon and the others dampened their enthusiasm coldly.","“I feel like these runes are trying to tell us something.” Walking to the huge stone tablet, Mr. Fang looked at the words that were emitting faint magic energy.","[Then, do you understand the message on it?] Many people asked with bullet comments.","“...” Mr. Fang’s face darkened, thinking, How could I know?!","But this game had a weird design; do I need to learn the ancient runes to play this game?","What’s wrong with the creators of the God of War 4!?","Controlling Kratos, Mr. Fang was frustrated when he saw this. Then, Kratos’ son, Atheus, walked up and said, “This seems to be a market where the giants trade goods with the gods. I wonder if Odin has been here or not.”","“Ya-! This game...!” Mr. Fang sighed with appreciation, “It’s wonderful to have a son!”","First Elder Hyru who had played God of War series for a long time also said, “Aya! It’s so much more convenient to have a son!”","“I think we can play it later!” Elf Girl Sala said in pleasant surprise.","As a group of clumsy players who enjoyed scenery a lot more, they had been tortured in the game since they always got lost and didn’t know how to solve the riddles, thus having a very negative gaming experience. It would be wonderful for them to have a son to help them fight, solve riddles, and find the way!","“I can do this on livestream!” Su Tianji said in pleasant surprise.","After all, these were Great Elder Su’s weak points while she did her livestream.","After Mr. Fang got off the livestream, Sala and the other elves, the saint-level masters, knights, and assassins all bought this game and began to play.","“Watch my livestream! Watch me!” When Mr. Fang returned to the shop in the evening, he saw Su Tianji doing a livestream. In high spirits, she even invited people like Mr. Fang, Nalan Mingxue, Song Qingfeng, and Xiaoyue to watch it.","Obviously, with the guidance of Kratos’ son, Atreus, she found that God of War 4 was super easy to play.","Due to the recent popularity of God of War 4, even Sala and some other players in Canglan City Shop were watching Su Tianji’s livestream.","[This streamer is super fun! Let’s watch her livestream!] Sala immediately sent a bullet comment.","At this moment, inside Su Tianji’s livestream room.","“Boy! What do these words mean?”","“Boy! Which way shall we go now?!”","“Boy! Hit that monster!”","“Isn’t it awesome?!” She played it smoothly. “The God of War and the son who is about to inherit everything!”","“Huh...” Mr. Fang was stupefied by the scene, and so were the audience in the livestream room!","However, when they hunted after a prey, Kratos and his son got separated.","“...” The livestream room fell silent.","– After a long while –","“Boy! Where are you!? Your father is lost!”","“Boy! Father doesn’t know the words and doesn’t understand the road signs!”","“Boy! Father is no match for this monster-!”","“Come and help me-!”","Mr. Fang’s face darkened as he watched. “It seems like you are playing the game called The God of War and His Illiterate and Humiliating Old Father Who Has No Sense of Direction.”","“Hey-!!!” Su Tianji put down her virtual reality headset and glared at Mr. Fang who was watching her play from behind; she was furious!"]},{"number":897,"title":"Chapter 897 - Two Realms Are Watching in Secret! Taking the Ultimate Treasure by Force!","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– Meanwhile, in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea –","In the vast ocean in Innumerable-Immortal Sea, huge waves surged up on the peaceful surface with howling gusts.","Dark clouds covered the sky as hidden currents surged in the depths of the ocean.","Countless tiny cracks were vaguely visible as thunderbolts from the void left horrifying cracks in the great ocean.","A huge vortex suddenly appeared in the ocean.","The vortex grew larger, surging up higher and higher waves.","The great disturbance alerted Green Sky Immortal, the Heavenly Supervisor of the Innumerable-Immortal Sea.","Sitting opposite to her was a weird-looking Daoist who was dressed in a black-and-white Daoist robe and had two braids dangling from the two sides of his face.","A small stove sat between them with immortal tea simmering in the high-quality Star Sand Pot.","Suddenly, the blue-robed woman’s eyes turned as cold as ice in the prehistoric times.","She looked into the distance.","...","At this moment, the vast ocean calmed down as if the great disturbance had never happened.","But...","Splash!","Hualala-!","With the splashing sounds of water, several heads poked out from the bright blue clear ocean.","A blind man who had his eyes covered said in astonishment, “Is this... the world of the grandmasters?!”","...","They had never seen a world so vast and with such abundant spiritual energy.","“Don’t stall! Old Ghost Zong! Let’s hurry up and get to the shore!” Some of them wore clothes of the East Continent while some were dressed in the style of the Continent of Immortal Relics.","Without exception, they were all draped in weird-looking protection spiritual treasures which looked like bamboo coats with a few snow-white feathers.","The feathers emitted holy presence which seemed to come from an ancient god.","It was these feathers that helped them remain intact as they traveled through the void where endless thunderbolts struck at everything within.","“Let’s go! Find a place to absorb some spiritual energy!”","“This is immortal spiritual energy!”","At this moment, Valkyrie Isabela lay in the pool and mused. When I recover thousands of years later, the first thing that I’ll do is take back my wings! I can’t leave them in the mortal world!","“But now... I loan you mortals borrow them for thousands of years...” After all, she couldn’t move right now!","...","At this moment, a secret report was sent from the Lower Region to the Gui Family in the Innumerable-Immortal Sea. No one knew about it.","In the secret palace, there was a bright mirror hovering in the air.","A vague shadow appeared in the mirror, but the vague outer shape of the figure seemed to reveal an extremely solemn-looking ultimate existence!","The figure was silent as if he was waiting for the people’s reply.","The many immortals in the palace including Wondrous Spell High Holiness all knelt before the mirror.","No one could imagine such a scene. No one could imagine what kind of existence would have the power to place these lofty and extraordinary immortals into submission.","“How does it go?”","Silence.","After a long while, the voice sounded.","“Martial Arts Ban, monitoring the mortal world, and sealing the path to Heaven... After so many years, you have received no information at all?” A streak of chilly light shot out from the mirror as the voice said coldly.","“Don’t worry,” Wondrous Spell High Holiness answered with great respect, “We’re not so useless like the Gods’ Palace that got their home base in the mortal world destroyed!”","With an extremely reverent expression on his face, he didn’t even dare to lift his head. Even with his lofty position, he didn’t dare to show a tiny trace of disrespect.","Then, he looked at the 30-year-old-looking young man beside him. “Li Feng, were they exposed?”","The young man immediately replied, “The Lower Region has many people. I picked several ordinary-looking subordinates, and I’m sure that they won’t cause suspicion.”","“According to my investigation, the shop might be related to the item that you’re looking for,” the young man said cautiously with his head almost lowered to the ground.","“Might be!?” The voice in the mirror suddenly turned cold.","Everyone felt as if they had fallen into an ice cellar!","“No... it must be!” the young man added in a hurry, “I went there and investigated for a long time in secret. I’m sure that the figures behind them are not demonic gods from the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness!”","Quickly, he organized the words in his mind before saying, “I searched those people’s souls. They all think that there are one or more masters or even gods guarding the shop. But according to my analysis, it’s not the case!”","“I even suspect that there’s no one guarding the shop. It’s just a trick that the young man named Fang Qi used to fool others!” he said, “It’s said that he rarely came out the shop from the very beginning. Also, no one has seen the ‘senior’ who is supposed to guard the shop showing his power in any situation outside the shop.”","“Besides, he always shows his power at the last moment. If he indeed has a tremendous force at his back, for example the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness, they could have killed all troublemakers directly. Why did he go to such trouble then?!” the young man analyzed, “The only explanation is that he isn’t as powerful as he looks. He is borrowing those powers and thus can’t make them last, which is why he always waits until the last moment to make a move. Otherwise, people would have seen through his tricks!”","“State your conclusion.” The voice in the mirror seemed to soften a bit but was still a little impatient.","“Yes!” the young man said, “According to my analysis, this human has an extremely powerful supreme treasure! Even if it’s not the item that you need, the two are closely related.”","“As for the inconsistency of timing, I think... the ultimate treasure... has its own spirit and came out earlier!” he concluded, “Besides, I think that its amazing powers will even intrigue you! I’m sure even if it’s not the item that you are looking for, it’s not inferior to any ultimate holy items in legends!”","The moment he said the words, he was sent flying without a warning, and he spat out a mouthful of blood.","“A mere minor immortal doesn’t deserve to use the words ‘ultimate holy’.”","The light on the mirror dimmed as a faint voice sounded, “If so, you go and take the so-called ‘ultimate holy’ item by force, so it won’t be wasted in the mortal world.”","...","-At this moment, in the depths of the Nine-Fold Darkness-","-In the dark abyss at the depths of the darkness-","There were countless prehistoric corpses.","The figures wore ancient immortal robes or... eroded heavy armor.","They knelt with heads lowered like the last members of ancient families.","In the depths of the direction that they were kneeling at, the most ancient king of this dark world hid there. It seemed like a pair of eyes slowly opened at the bottom of the abyss.","The powerful light could no longer be covered. How could an ultimate holy item fall in such a place?","The two realms shook!","Greedy gazes turned toward the mortal world which was stuck in the middle of the two realms and shivering at the moment!"]},{"number":898,"title":"Chapter 898 - The Next TV Series Is... Investiture of the Gods!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","Lately, due to the continual popularity of God of War 4, the revenue of the shops rose sharply and drove the sales of the previous God of War games to another peak.","In fact, the price of the first God of War Trilogy was quite high for most of the players, who had low cultivation strength. God of War 4 cost 318 crystals or magic crystals!","Many players found the previous trilogy quite difficult to play with all the riddle-solving and god-killing quests. The players with low cultivation strength couldn’t understand these godly-level magic spells and only used them to familiarize themselves with battles, which was why the sales hadn’t been high, and many players only watched the livestreams.","However, God of War 4 was different. Many players found that the game wasn’t so difficult with Atreus’ help. Besides, this game featured the use of combat techniques, which were very beneficial to all players.","Furthermore, Mr. Fang’s livestream and others’ livestreams such as major streamer Su Tianji’s livestream had great promotional effects.","Even Valkyrie Isabela loved watching Elder Su’s livestream and enjoyed it very much.","“Let’s buy the game too!” Elf Girl Sala urged her companions in the shop, “Even this streamer can play well in the game; I think we can do it, too!”","So, even the elf girls with poor skills bought the game, let alone others.","Mr. Fang glanced at the task of earning crystals and found that its progress had reached 61 percent, which was quite impressive.","...","Meanwhile, Mr. Fang began to investigate sites for new branch shops and opened them one by one.","For example, a new shop was opened in the area of Phoenix-Cry Mountain, which was north to Jiuhua City and south to the Three Saint Factions in the Continent of Immortal Relics. The Orc Kingdom and Lianshan Principality got their wishes and had branch shops in their nations.","Including the new shops in Xiaoyao Cave Abode at the East Continent and the territory of the Demon Clan at the Continent of Immortal Relic, there were altogether five branch shops in the first group. There were fewer computers in the new shops than in the old ones, but they diverted many players from the bursting old shops.","Soon, Mr. Fang planned to open the next batch of branch shops.","Obviously, as the shops expanded, they no longer nestled in one remote corner or need any promotion in the mortal world.","However, it also caused some problems.","“He grew from an unknown common mortal into an ultimate master with the power to kill immortals and gods...” From a distant place beyond the Heaven, a pair of eyes which seemed to be able to see through the Plane of Nine-Fold Darkness slightly squinted as they coldly stared at the mortal world. “Such effects are quite interesting. Very interesting.”","Then, a deep and cold gaze turned from the depths of the Nine-Fold Darkness to the mortal world. “It’s a real waste to allow this item to fall into the hands of the mortals.”","...","“What if they don’t give it up?”","“Gods’ Palace, Innumerable-Immortal Sea... Immortals and Gods in Heaven!”","“All the evil demons in all abysses at the Nine-Fold Darkness...!”","The two pairs of eyes looked down at the mortal world at the same time with the arrogance of rulers who dominated over three realms and six destinies.","“It’s not their decision to make!”","The moment that their gazes turned to the mortal world, the Heaven and Earth darkened!","“The sky... how come the sky turned dark?!” Countless mortals looked up at the sky in horror. They screamed and howled in panic, and some even knelt on the ground to pray.","The precious stone lands its innocent possessor in jail. They would probably be implicated in the biggest catastrophe in history!","...","– In the Canglan City Shop –","A prompt appeared on the System Interface. [The System’s upgrade progress reached 80%, and the newest system information had been updated.]","“Newest system information?” Fang Qi immediately turned on the System Interface to take a look.","For the last task, the reward of ‘mysterious gift bag of a mythological TV Series’ that had three question marks on it had changed into a row of big characters with shiny golden lights – Investiture of the Gods!","[TL Note: Investiture of the Gods or the Creation of the Gods is a 16th-century Chinese novel and one of the major vernacular Chinese works in the gods-and-demons genre, and it was later turned into a series of movies and TV shows.]","Below it was a line of words. [When the task is 50 percent completed, the Host will obtain the right to reveal the mysterious reward – the trailer of Investiture of the Gods.]","At this moment, Mr. Fang had a bowl of instant noodles in his hands. He had just turned off the livestream and ended today’s stream of God of War 4 when he saw these words. “...”","He almost choked on the noodles!","He glanced at the elves who were screaming in elation after killing a stone ancient in the beginning of God of War 4, the Cowardly Dragon who kept screaming at every turn and twist, and ...","“System... it seems like you want to scare my idle customers to death, right?”","“Sir, what are you mumbling about?” At this moment, Sala looked over.","“Oh. I said that the shop will release the trailer of the new TV Series today.”","“New TV Series!?” Sala said in surprise.","By now, Journey to the West had almost reached the end of the 40-plus episodes with only a few of the 81 ordeals left.","The idle players loved the TV Series the most. Unlike the TV Series, the games had riddles to solve and difficult levels, and people couldn’t learn things if they were poor players.","In the previous TV Series, many people achieved breakthroughs by listening to the Dao lecture given by Patriarch Subodhi. Even the elves of the West Continent who couldn’t learn stuff from the Great Sage had obtained lots of inspiration from the Dao lecture given by the grand master beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","They were surprised that there was a new TV Series!","Besides the elves who had acute hearing, the saint-level masters were also eavesdropping. Hearing his words, they walked over and asked, “Sir... are there Dao lectures in it?!”","“...” Mr. Fang rolled his eyes. “It’s not released yet; how would I know?!”","“Oh. Oh. Okay...” The saint-level masters who wanted to try to get some inside information replied, “Then, we’ll go and watch the trailer; we’ll watch the trailer...”","...","Soon, the Jiuhua City Shop, Yuanyang City Shop, and even the newly opened shops all received the news.","The ancestral masters from the East Continent, Nalan Hongwu, and Gu Tingyun had gone to the Heavenly Realm and didn’t get this information.","“The trailer of the new TV series?!” At this moment, Su Tianji who was livestreaming ‘The God of War and His Illiterate and Humiliating Old Father Who Has No Sense of Direction’ had just killed a boss.","“Hey! I’ll go and watch the trailer of the new TV series! Guys... you can watch the TV Series when you have time. I’ll return in five minutes.”","“TV Series?” Coming to watch Su Tianji’s livestream after watching Mr. Fang’s, Valkyrie Isabela was displeased at the pause. “What’s a TV Series? What’s so good about TV Series?! You’ll waste five minutes of my time!","“Do you think I’m so idle?!” At the second thought, she realized that she indeed had lots of time on her hands.","“...”","Forget it; I will take a look at the so-called TV Series trailer.","...","Su Tianji and the cultivators in different shops immediately turned on the new TV series in the Super Theatre.","[As the poem goes:","Pan Gu separated hundun first, which gave birth to Tai Chi containing Yin and Yang which in turn derived the four symbols.","The Heavens were born at Zi (first) Hour, the Earth was born at Chou(second) Hour, and humans were born in Yin (third) Hour, and the saint named You Chao taught people how to build shelters to hide from beasts.","Sui Ren discovered fire so that people can cook raw food, and Fu Xi drew eight trigrams and created the system of Yin and Yang.","Shen Nong tasted herbs to find medicines, and Xuan Yuan created the system of ceremonies and marriage...]","[TL Note: This poem is describing the events in Chinese Mythology in order.]","On the screen, the Heaven separated from the Earth, the stars moved, and gods stood in rows as a golden list appeared between the Heavens and Earth!","“Immortals, gods, mortals, and ghosts are divided into their respective categories today and will thus not fall to the ground and become ignorant weeds. The Supreme Primeval Lord of Heaven commands gods from all directions to take part in the investiture!” The booming voice seemed to come from Heaven. It resonated in the world that Fang Qi was in like the huge bell ring when the Heaven was separated from the Earth!","Then, they saw four big golden words lighting up as if they were supported by the gods and were bathed in radiant golden lights from prehistoric times – Investiture of the Gods!"]},{"number":899,"title":"Chapter 899 - Mr. Fang’s Task","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","“Investiture... Investiture of the Gods!?” Right now, the players still had no idea what the four words represented, but an indescribable feeling rose in them as they saw the antique characters on the tablet and understood the meaning of the investiture of the gods.","The scene turned to the top of Mount Qi where golden phoenixes sang in harmony. Vaguely, the players could see the extremely ingenious ancient array built by the troops dressed in battle armor. The wind and clouds swept backwards as the Heavens and Earth dimmed!","The vast immortal palaces stood upon the stars and above the Great Dao, immortals bowed to a human dynasty, major demons created catastrophes in the mortal world, and the Gold List of the Gods’ Investiture was born in accordance to the operation of the Heavens and Earth!","The scenes flashed before them like a vast endless mythical scroll.","“Three eyes... is that Erlang Immortal Master!?” Jiang Xiaoyue’s eldest brother, Jiang Xuan, especially liked Erlang Immortal Master. He exclaimed, “How come there’s the Erlang Immortal Master here?!”","“Look! The qin, se, and pipa musical instruments. Are they the Four Great Heavenly Kings!?” Even the elves in the Canglan City Shop recognized some of the gods.","“Ahh-! I seem to see Pagoda Bearer Devaraja Li-!” In the new shop at the East Continent, Jiang Xiaoyue exclaimed as well, “Is this the Heavenly Court?!”","“No. It looks like the mortal world!” Shen Qingqing, a fan of plots, had obviously thoroughly studied the story. “This is a human dynasty named Yin Shang-!”","“How can it be-!?” In Journey to the West, it was these immortals and gods who had built the Immortal Court which even the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal couldn’t destroy!","But now, these powerful immortals and gods were all officials working for a human dynasty; it flipped everything they knew about the world, immortals, gods, and humans in the past 1,000 years upside down!","How powerful is this dynasty?!","What had happened to cause such a huge transformation?!","Does this Investiture of the Gods tell the story about how the Heavenly Court was established and the backgrounds of the gods?!","These people were horrified by this thought! What kind of existences had the ability to establish the absolute order in the world where even the immortals and gods served as officials?!","Does that List of Gods’ Investiture have something to do with all this?!","Greatly stunned and extremely curious, they wanted to continue watching.","“This Investiture of the Gods...” Su Tianji yelled, “It has my highest recommendation!”","“It’s absolutely a miraculous TV Series! It will be at least as good as the Journey to the West!”","“I want to watch it-! I want to watch it-!” Some elves almost jumped up from their seats. “Ya-! Sir! We want to watch it!”","“Aren’t you watching it right now?!” Mr. Fang said immediately.","“What do you mean?!” Elf Queen Kellybel walked over. “It’s just a trailer! How much can you watch?”","“We want to watch Investiture of the Gods!”","“It’s not released yet,” Mr. Fang said, “You can watch the trailer today. When the TV Series is released, you can watch it then.”","With that said, Mr. Fang stood up to do his work.","“Thud!”","Elf Queen Kellybel put a hand on the wall and stopped Mr. Fang with others standing behind her. “Then, when will it be released!?”","At this moment, she saw a group of young elves standing behind her in support.","She was proud that she finally regained some of her queenly dignity.","“I’m not sure; maybe next month,” Mr. Fang said casually.","“Next month-!?” The Elf Queen raised her voice several pitches up.","“Or the month after the next,” Mr. Fang said.","“The month after the next-!?” Kellybel’s voice rose higher, attracting many people’s attention.","“Maybe three months later,” Mr. Fang said.","“Ya-! You-!” Kellybel’s ears turned red with fury. You’re bullying us elves!","Do you think you can do anything you want just because you’re the shop owner?!","Mr. Fang shrugged and walked away.","“Humph! I’m furious!” Kellybel stomped her foot and said, “This scummy shop owner. When Investiture of the Gods comes out, we’ll boycott it! I’ll see what he will say!”","“Um...” Sala looked hesitant. “Sister Kelly, that’s a bit unnecessary...”","Elder Sewell also looked torn as she said, “I think... we’ll still watch it?”","Before Kellybel could reply, an old figure behind her said in a low voice while stroking his silver beard, “This... Your Majesty, if you don’t like it, you can read the important documents in the Elf Royal Palace... I can watch Investiture of the Gods for you. What do you think?”","“...”","...","Of course, Mr. Fang wasn’t sure about the release time since the task wasn’t finished yet. At this moment, all he could think about was making money. For example, Nalan Hongwu and a few others had successful entered Innumerable-Immortal Sea.","At this moment, the Innumerable-Immortal Sea put all the energy into the mortal world and spared no attention to the things happening right under its nose.","“Can we build a teleportation array?”","“It’s impossible to build the array with materials from the mortal world. But we can solve the problem by acquiring materials from this world.” Gu Tingyun looked experienced as they walked through the market dressed in the same clothes as the immortals thronging on the streets.","At this moment, two young masters dressed in luxurious robes walked over from the opposite direction. “The useless servants are really... with so many powerful spiritual spells, they can’t make some fun stuff for me to relieve boredom. Instead, they think of nothing but cultivation. Are they morons?!”","“Our major families enjoy prosperity for endless generations, and our patriarchs will never die. What’s the use of cultivating hundreds and thousands of years? Aren’t they stupid?”","“Go! Find some entertainment for us!”","A servant standing beside them said immediately, “Yes... Young Master!”","...","“According to the legends, the gods living beyond the Heaven obtained ‘Dao’ in the distant past but lost ‘Fortune’.","No one knew what ‘Fortune’ was, but it drew the gods to this place.","This place was... the mortal world.","“Oh, Qingqing, Celestial Warrior has updated again?!” In the Jiuhua City Shop, Xu Zixin saw an exquisitely-made book on Shen Qingqing’s desk. While flipping through it, she said, “The contents in this book are unintelligible. What’s it about?”","“This book is about the previous events. I can’t tell you the specifics since I haven’t read it yet.” Shen Qingqing watched the trailer of Investiture of the Gods again and again and obviously had no time for the book now.","...","Meanwhile, in Innumerable-Immortal Sea, the masters of great powers who were living as hermits in different places were summoned together. All immortals had assembled!","Above the Gods’ Palace, countless ancient gods who had ruled the Heavens and Earth for numerous years also assembled!","If it were only to defend their dignity or the rules that they had made for humans, they wouldn’t need to pay much attention. But the situation had changed...","If that ultimate treasure came out, they would do anything for it, including sending an army from the Godly Court into the mortal world to shatter the whole mortal world into dust!","Such huge forces were impossible for the humans to withstand! Even the most ancient gods would be shattered into dust by the forces from the whole world!","What kind of force could block the gods in the whole world?!","Such force didn’t exist, in fact, it was impossible for it to exist!"]},{"number":900,"title":"Chapter 900 - Arcade hall in Innumerable-Immortal Sea; BBK learning machine!?","paragraphs":["Translator: Noodletown Translations Editor: Noodletown Translations","– In the nameless sea area in Innumerable-Immortal Sea where Nalan Hongwu and the others ascended from the Lower Region –","Green Sky Immortal, the Heavenly Supervisor, gazed at the vast sea with squinted eyes; she seemed to be searching for something for a long time.","“Who are they...? Perhaps...? Some people ascended from the mortal world?”","“It’s not likely.” The old Daoist standing beside Green Sky Immortal said, “Even we have to be cautious with those godly thunderbolts in the void. Without the purgation of the immortal spiritual essence, those mortals can’t pass the vast void, let alone eluding our eyes.”","“It’s a hard journey to travel through the void. They would need to rest nearby for at least one month to recover their strength. But after searching for more than half a month, we haven’t found a clue...”","“Anyway, I’ll report it to the higher-levels before we make any decisions,” Green Sky Immortal said cautiously with an unreadable expression.","“But...” The old Daoist said while feeling awkward, “Those lords are busy with an important issue; I’m afraid that they don’t have time to mind such a trivial matter...”","“...”","...","Of course, they would never have thought that Nalan Hongwu and his companions hadn’t even stayed at this place for half a minute, let alone half a month.","At this moment, the group had come to the Thousand-Lantern Immortal Market under the Saint Emperor Mountain.","All kinds of items were being traded in this market. Since it was close to the major families, many young immortals from these ancient families would slip out and play in this immortal market.","“This thing is quite useful!” At this moment, Gu Tingyun and the others had left that sea area long ago and came to the market full of immortals. They had even bought the shop which was said to be close to one of the eight major families, even though they didn’t know which one. The market before them was extremely prosperous.","“We sold one feather for 5,000 immortal crystals, which was an extremely low price in the black market! For only 2,000 immortal crystals, that shop owner handed us the deed of the shop in joy.”","“...” Nalan Hongwu said, “If sold in the regular market, the price would probably be as high as 100,000 immortal crystals; but they didn’t recognize its value!”","“We’d be finished if they recognized its value!” Gu Tingyun chuckled.","The white feather in his hand was one of the feathers from the Valkyrie’s wings. Things had gone much smoother than they had expected. After selling one feather for a high price on the black market, the money talked, which made the purchase of that shop a piece of cake.","As he put away the feather in his storage spiritual artifact, the others took out things from their storage spiritual artifact and put up the new sign over the shop. Then, they heard people talking outside the door.","“Did you hear? The eight-ancient immortal families are holding a banquet on the Immortal-Investiture Platform to welcome heroes and immortals from all places. They are recruiting immortals to subdue the evil and unorthodox gods who are deluding the mortal world!”","“Anyone with some abilities will be rewarded if they are willing to go down to the Lower Region and kill the demons!”","“Really...?” Coming out of a shop selling immortal treasures, three weirdly dressed immortal cultivators talked among themselves. “Should us, the Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics, go and try our luck?”","One of the three men wore ragged clothes like a beggar, one was tall and thin with vertical eyes, and the last was as brawny as a bull and had two horns on his head.","Nalan Hongwu and Gu Tingyun exchanged a look and walked up calmly before asking, “Daoist Friend, you said something about... the mortal world? Anything big happening lately?”","“You two are new here...?” The three men looked Nalan Hongwu and Gu Tingyun up and down cautiously. They saw that one of them was slightly hunchbacked but looked heroic and extraordinary with white hair and a white robe, and the other looked celestial and grander than an ordinary immortal.","Seeing their suspicion, Nalan Hongwu and Gu Tingyun cupped hands, saying, “We’re from the new shop, the High Immortal Arcade Game Hall, which is next door!”","“What hall?!” Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics thought that they had heard it wrong and gazed at the celestial old men in stupefaction.","Following the direction that the two men pointed, they saw the sign over the shop next door.","[High Immortal Arcade Game Hall]!","??? What is that?!","“Daoist Friend, you haven’t told us about the big events happening in the mortal world,” Gu Tingyun immediately reminded him.","“Oh...! No problem.” Seeing that they were not people of suspicious origins, the tall and thin immortal said, “In fact, it’s not a secret. It’s said that the demons in the mortal world are so outrageous that they occupied the immortal factions and godly nations in the mortal world and even used tricks to defeat the immortals who went to fight them. Therefore, the major immortal families are gathering immortals from different families and places to wage a war against them in the Lower Region.”","“It’s said...” He pointed at the west and said in a low voice, “Those people over there will join this time.”","“What kind of demons are so outrageous?!” Nalan Hongwu said immediately, “It’s a pity that we can’t leave our shop. Otherwise, we can join the army and fight them!”","“We share the same purpose.” Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics was reassured when they found that their new friends shared the same hatred for the demons in the mortal world as them. “By the way...”","Pointing at the shop behind him, the immortal looked at it curiously and asked, “Daoist Friends, what business does your...hall do?”","As he said that, a few people walked over while being led by a white-robed, arrogant young master. Walking before him, the servant-looking young man demanded, “What business does your shop do?”","“Arcade Game Hall? What’s that?!” They looked at the shop with curiosity. The shop hadn’t begun its business yet but was well decorated with two rows of artifacts standing neatly in the small space.","Close to the entrance was a rectangle artifact which showed an environment as colorful as the bottom of the Innumerable-Immortal Sea with all kinds of rare fishes swimming in it.","They even saw a huge weird fish with fins large enough to block the sun flashing by. It revealed a small part of its body in the deep ocean.","In other artifacts beside it, there were small figures casting all kinds of spiritual spells which created powerful thunderbolts or surging ocean waves. There were also all kinds of gods, immortals, and monsters named Marshal Tian Peng and the Great Sage, Heaven’s Equal. The scenes were dizzying to watch.","Several tall artifacts stood in the innermost location of the shop. There were arrows dropping onto a small platform with a three by three grid.","“Is this spiritual platform showing an array?” Cloud Dream Three Eccentrics pointed at the pad and asked.","“Daoist friend, you have sharp eyes. This is called the Nine Palace Array,” Zong Wu introduced with a laugh.","“Nine Palace Array?! What array is that?! We’ve never heard of it before,” the white-robed young master said in disdain.","While stroking his beard, Zong Wu said with a smile, “It divides the Heavenly Palace into nine equal parts which are Qian, Kan, Gen, Zhen, Zhong, Xun, Li, Kun, and Dui. They move according to the movements of the stars in the sky. It’s an array and also a set of movement techniques at the same time.”","Pointing at the arrows falling in the screen of the special ‘spiritual artifact’, he said, “When you step on the Nine Palace Array according to the order of the arrows falling on the screen, you can use the movement technique taught by the spiritual artifact.”","Their eyes instantly lit up. “What’s this spiritual artifact called? Can we try it?”","“This is called... Danc...”","Before Zong Wu could complete the word ‘dance’ and say the next word ‘pad’, Gu Tingyun interrupted and said with great solemnity and presence, “This is called the BBK Learning Machine!”","[TL Note: BBK Learning Machines are iPad like tablets that BBK Company created just for kids and elementary schoolers to learn stuff in China. They ran a ton of ads and became a meme-like company.]"]}]);
